{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": ".40", "line": "It’s not funny if you hear me knock Narcs come and get the money, stop money, switchin’ numbers", "vault_lines": ["It's not funny if you hear me knock", "Narcs come and get the money, stop money, switchin' numbers"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is warning that when he personally knocks at the door it’s serious business. The next line explains its because he’s most likely received a tip that the Feds are trying to hit him with a RICO charge so he’s gonna halt his business and change his number.", "annotation_id": "3429333", "url": "https://genius.com/3429333", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": ".40", "line": "Just poured a half a pint up in this Mountain Dew", "vault_lines": ["Just poured a half a pint up in this Mountain Dew"], "meaning": "Fact: Mountain Dew was actually made to be mixed with vodka as a chaser.\n\nSo Rick Ross could have poured a half of pint maybe Ciroc or some other vodka and chased it with some Mountain Dew because he knows better than drinking a pint straight.", "annotation_id": "3429315", "url": "https://genius.com/3429315", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": ".40", "line": "I keep a pack of bitches like they backwoods", "vault_lines": ["I keep a pack of bitches like they backwoods"], "meaning": "Backwoods are hand rolled cigars and considered the best rolling paper for weed.\n\nIt’s usually sold in groups of five so Rozay is saying that he always has a group of girls with him", "annotation_id": "3429232", "url": "https://genius.com/3429232", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": ".40", "line": "The lambo sat so long I even had it towed", "vault_lines": ["The lambo sat so long I even had it towed"], "meaning": "This could have two meanings:\n\n\nRick Ross had his lambo towed for feds to build a case on him this was explained from Ross that they want to build a charge on him.\nRepossess my Lambo cause they wanna build a charge\nRick Ross bought two new Rolls he doesn’t have time to ride the lambo so he got rid of it.", "annotation_id": "3429191", "url": "https://genius.com/3429191", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": ".40", "line": "First nigga with the wraith with the black wood Spent 400 on another rolls", "vault_lines": ["First nigga with the wraith with the black wood", "Spent 400 on another rolls"], "meaning": "This is a recycled verse from Thug cry\n\nMoney over bitches, first nigga with a Wraith\n\nRozay is reminding everyone that he was the first person to cop the 2014 Rolls Royce Wraith before it was released for everyone to buy.\n\n\n\nAfter buying the Wraith Rick Ross then drops another 400,000 on most likely a 2014 Rolls Royce Phantom\"Ghost\" Most likely to replace the one that was destroyed in the drive by.", "annotation_id": "3429108", "url": "https://genius.com/3429108", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": ".40", "line": "Strapped at the 40/40 with two 40's on me", "vault_lines": ["Strapped at the 40/40 with two 40's on me"], "meaning": "The 40/40 Club is a sports bar in New York owned by Jay Z. Adrien Broner is there, strapped with two 40 Glock pistols.", "annotation_id": "3173525", "url": "https://genius.com/3173525", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": ".40", "line": "You got caught and told 40 stories Before a nigga tell shit, I’m doin’ 40", "vault_lines": ["You got caught and told 40 stories", "Before a nigga tell shit, I'm doin' 40"], "meaning": "When caught by the authorities, the person gave up information (told 40 stories) in exchange for a lighter sentence or perhaps freedom. Adrien Broner would accept a 40 year sentence before he would ever consider snitching to the police.\nAs Chief Keef would say:\n\nA snitch nigga, that’s that shit I don’t like", "annotation_id": "3173483", "url": "https://genius.com/3173483", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
