{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "1.NO ISSUES", "line": "No issues, Trap D wipe a nigga nose clean no tissue", "vault_lines": ["No issues, Trap D wipe a nigga nose clean no tissue"], "meaning": "Trap D is friend and collaborator of LIl Joshi Vrt. With them making a song together around the time this EP was released. The song released months later on Lil Joshi’s TikTok page then soundcloud later on December.", "annotation_id": "38994177", "url": "https://genius.com/38994177", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
