{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "2 Shots", "line": "Got her selfies with Beyonce, this is Destiny Child", "vault_lines": ["Got her selfies with Beyonce, this is Destiny Child"], "meaning": "Getting his girl a picture with Beyonce is nothing for a hustler like Rick Ross because his success was meant to be like ‘destiny’. Referencing a group Beyonce was a part of called ‘Destiny Child’.", "annotation_id": "21921018", "url": "https://genius.com/21921018", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "2 Shots", "line": "She playing games with you, probably cause she with me nigga", "vault_lines": ["She playing games with you, probably cause she with me nigga"], "meaning": "See!! This last verse may be calling back to the 2nd verse where the “other guy” may be trash talking at the guy from the 1st verse? IDK… I’d be happy to see more deep dives into the meaning #pause", "annotation_id": "18324219", "url": "https://genius.com/18324219", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "2 Shots", "line": "Now run home to your nigga, make sure that head is perfected Never seeking acceptance, reaping my blessings Fat mob figure, black Bob Dylan If the pussy good it’s hard to stay at odds with it If she want it, you ain’t got it, get on your job nigga", "vault_lines": ["Now run home to your nigga, make sure that head is perfected", "Never seeking acceptance, reaping my blessings", "Fat mob figure, black Bob Dylan", "If the pussy good it's hard to stay at odds with it", "If she want it, you ain't got it, get on your job nigga"], "meaning": "He’s over it- “it” being a “sucker for love.” He’s jaded now and won’t be played for a sucker again. Instead, he plays his part by never knocking the hustle or catching feelings. He feels he wins by adopting this mindset of indifference- especially because the woman he references is unfaithful to her man. He has plenty of women and he deals with them this way as a defense mechanism that he feels protects his heart and allows him to accept these women as they are.", "annotation_id": "16694488", "url": "https://genius.com/16694488", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
