{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "2011 BET Hip Hop Awards - Maybach Music Group Cypher", "line": "Getting work cheap", "vault_lines": ["Before this rapping, I was trappin', getting work cheap"], "meaning": "Trapping also know as drug dealing and etc. It doesn’t require hard labor and it also got him easy money.", "annotation_id": "1209719", "url": "https://genius.com/1209719", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "2011 BET Hip Hop Awards - Maybach Music Group Cypher", "line": "I’m too young to be doing this, they need to see ID", "vault_lines": ["I'm too young to be doing this, they need to see ID"], "meaning": "He’s still in his early 20s but he still looks younger than that so everywhere he goes they need to see ID to prove he’s at a legal age, also, this could be interpreted as a double entendre.\n\nMeek is saying that he’s young to be killing everyone in the game, so they all want assurance that he’s qualified to be eatin' this well.", "annotation_id": "417784", "url": "https://genius.com/417784", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "2011 BET Hip Hop Awards - Maybach Music Group Cypher", "line": "America’s most wanted like Chi Ali", "vault_lines": ["America's most wanted like Chi Ali"], "meaning": "Chi Ali was famous for his hit, “Age Ain’t Nothin' But A Number”, but went on the run for over a year for killing his girlfriend’s brother.", "annotation_id": "398109", "url": "https://genius.com/398109", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
