{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "50 Plates", "line": "The only niggas breaking Backwoods in the Bentleys, baby (Believe it)", "vault_lines": ["The only niggas breaking Backwoods in the Bentleys, baby (Believe it)"], "meaning": "Unlike your crew (splitting Phillies in a Honda), Rozay’s crew smokes Backwoods in Bentleys.", "annotation_id": "2003487", "url": "https://genius.com/2003487", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "50 Plates", "line": "Trying to flip these 50 plates It’s time to flip these 50 plates", "vault_lines": ["Trying to flip these 50 plates", "It's time to flip these 50 plates"], "meaning": "A lot of rappers use the wordplay-on with Mils' as in Millions, and Meals as in Meals. Seeing that with Money, you and your team can eat, just as if you had a home cooked Meal, you could eat too. Millions = Meals. So, Ross is in the process/trying of flipping, 50 million.", "annotation_id": "1997508", "url": "https://genius.com/1997508", "state": "accepted", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
