{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "50 Plates", "line": "But that phone bill just can’t be late (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["But that phone bill just can't be late (Woo)"], "meaning": "Ross says “he selling dope, straight off the iPhone”, since an iPhone requires a phone bill, he needs to keep that payed so he can get in contact with his dealers so he can make money.", "annotation_id": "1996086", "url": "https://genius.com/1996086", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
