{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "9 Piece", "line": "Why you snorting that, that shit stepped on", "vault_lines": ["Why you snorting that, that shit stepped on"], "meaning": "Drugs that have other additives to falsify the weight are stepped on, this results in the drug weighing more. A sneaky drug dealer tricks the buyer into purchasing that rather than the actual drug.\n\nYou got tricked into buying it, and Rick can just tell that it isn’t pure coke right off the bat. Earlier in the song he said:\n\nI’m smoking dope, I’m on my cell phone\nI’m selling dope, straight off the iPhone\n\nHe sells it, and he smokes it. Clearly he has some serious experience with the drug.\n\nRick Ross truly is a boss, and he is worth a big amount at 28 million. Obviously Rick isn’t snorting, or messing with any coke that’s not that A1 perico (as said in the intro).", "annotation_id": "2116885", "url": "https://genius.com/2116885", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "9 Piece", "line": "Suave House, still independent", "vault_lines": ["Suave House, still independent"], "meaning": "Rozay was signed to Suave House Records when he originally started rapping. Years later, he is still being his own boss.", "annotation_id": "1607877", "url": "https://genius.com/1607877", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "9 Piece", "line": "Bitch I’m blowing up like napalm", "vault_lines": ["Bitch I'm blowing up like napalm"], "meaning": "Napalm is an incendiary device that explodes (blows up), if you’ve ever played Call of Duty Black Ops, you may remember this kill streak.\n\n\n\nRick Ross is blowing up in the rap game with his monstorous 2010 year and quite possibly a bigger 2011 with all the moves his MMG label has made.", "annotation_id": "390507", "url": "https://genius.com/390507", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "9 Piece", "line": "Fuck outta here, your shit water whipped", "vault_lines": ["Fuck outta here, your shit water whipped"], "meaning": "“Water whipped” dope is watered down/cut/stomped/impure. This makes the product last longer, but it’s less potent.", "annotation_id": "359352", "url": "https://genius.com/359352", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "9 Piece", "line": "I put that pistol to his head and tell the nigga to have a blast", "vault_lines": ["I put that pistol to his head and tell the nigga to have a blast"], "meaning": "He is using a clever pun with the word blast…suggesting that he is placing the gun to his head and shooting him but also wishing him to have a great time or “have a blast”!", "annotation_id": "349425", "url": "https://genius.com/349425", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "9 Piece", "line": "You got that tan dope, look like a Florida bitch", "vault_lines": ["You got that tan dope, look like a Florida bitch"], "meaning": "Dope as tan as a Florida bitch. That shit is TAN!\n\n\n\n“Water whipped” crack (water added to cocaine base to bulk up the crack) will deteriorate and turn brownish.", "annotation_id": "176083", "url": "https://genius.com/176083", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "9 Piece", "line": "Rack ’em up, pool table full of 8 balls", "vault_lines": ["Rack 'em up, pool table full of 8 balls"], "meaning": "Another 8-ball pun. 8 balls are small amounts of bagged cocaine. He’s referring to having a whole pool table full of cocaine. .", "annotation_id": "161572", "url": "https://genius.com/161572", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
