{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "9-24-7000", "line": "Wisdom from the old heads, you ain’t gettin’ no head", "vault_lines": ["Wisdom from the old heads, you ain't gettin' no head"], "meaning": "Action Bronson learns from the experienced, knowledgeable people he meets around the world. Unlike him, you don’t get that knowledge.\n\nHe also refers to “head” to mean oral sex. Action Bronson receives plenty of oral sex, unlike you.", "annotation_id": "15346456", "url": "https://genius.com/15346456", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
