{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "A GEOMETRY’S DASH", "line": "When you log onto Geometry Dash To get your free rewards", "vault_lines": ["So don’t forget, when you log onto Geometry Dash"], "meaning": "Upon entering the home screen of Geometry Dash, the first thing players typically do is to check the chests for rewards.", "annotation_id": "41352594", "url": "https://genius.com/41352594", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "A GEOMETRY’S DASH", "line": "See what’s in store", "vault_lines": ["Why don’t you take them to the treasure room and see what’s in store?"], "meaning": "Next to the treasure room are four stores where you can buy icons and other collectibles:\n- The Secret Shop, owned by Scratch\n- The Community Shop, owned by Potbor\n- The Diamond Shop, owned by The Diamond Shopkeeper\n- The Mechanic’s Shop, owned by The Mechanic", "annotation_id": "41352571", "url": "https://genius.com/41352571", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
