{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "A GEOMETRY’S DASH", "line": "= Chorus = - GeoBlitzy Geometry Dash. That’s the game We got tons of freaking levels, from Easy to Insane We got blocks we got orbs we got everything you like But you better watch out for that triple spike! Stereo Madness, Back on Track! All of these songs will make you come back for more So you better keep playing and if you do You might wanna meet our crew", "vault_lines": ["But you better watch out for that triple spike"], "meaning": "After an absurd amount of repetition, this is the final chorus. Thank God.", "annotation_id": "35202160", "url": "https://genius.com/35202160", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
