{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "A GEOMETRY’S DASH", "line": "Coming soon, yeah right that’s funny Let’s be for real you’re just too desperate Updates drop like once a decade Robtop is laughing while you are crying Checking the page, it’s still the same Coming soon, what a joke You can wait for it’s release But face it, it ain’t coming anytime soon", "vault_lines": ["Coming soon, yeah right that's funny", "Let's be for real you're just too desperate", "Updates drop like once a decade", "Robtop is laughing while you are crying", "Checking the page, it's still the same", "Coming soon, what a joke", "You can wait for it's release"], "meaning": "For 7 years in Geometry Dash, this Coming Soon screen displayed at the end of the main levels sequence. It was not, in fact, soon.\n\nHowever, it gets even worse in the 3 spinoff games Geometry Dash Meltdown, World, and Subzero. These 3 games all have this message at the end of their level sequences as well and they are likely never getting content again.", "annotation_id": "35202150", "url": "https://genius.com/35202150", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "A GEOMETRY’S DASH", "line": "I’m like Jigglypuff I put your crew to rest", "vault_lines": ["I'm like Jigglypuff I put your crew to rest"], "meaning": "The Pokemon Jigglypuff is famous for learning the move Sing, which puts any other Pokemon who hear it to sleep.", "annotation_id": "35202148", "url": "https://genius.com/35202148", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "A GEOMETRY’S DASH", "line": "If you disagree I put Nine Circles on your head with my Congregation", "vault_lines": ["If you disagree I put Nine Circles on your head with my Congregation"], "meaning": "Nine Circles and Congregation are popular Geometry Dash demons. He’s also saying that if you don’t think he’s the best rapper, his gang (or Congregation) will give you 9 bruises in the shape of a circle.", "annotation_id": "35202147", "url": "https://genius.com/35202147", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "A GEOMETRY’S DASH", "line": "Revolution won’t be televised, it won’t need a confirmation", "vault_lines": ["Revolution won't be televised, it won't need a confirmation"], "meaning": "Funnygame references Gil Scott-Heron’s “The Revolution Will Not Be Televised.” In this famous protest song, Scott-Heron argues that those interested in revolution will not be successful at achieving their goals by just sitting around and doing nothing.\n\nHowever, it’s possible that this may also be a reference to Kendrick Lamar’s “tv off”, a recent and quite popular song which includes the line “This revolution been televised, I fell through with the knick-knacks.” Could be either.", "annotation_id": "35202143", "url": "https://genius.com/35202143", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
