{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "A GEOMETRY’S DASH", "line": "But every time I see you I seem to start to blush At this rate they’ll think we’re a couple If you keep letting me hold your hand this much", "vault_lines": ["At this rate they'll think we're a couple", "If you keep letting me hold your hand this much"], "meaning": "A common criticism of jump indicators in Geometry Dash levels is that they make the level too easy, or in gaming terms, “hold the players hand”. Couples of two people in a relationship can also be seen holding hands frequently, hence the wordplay here.", "annotation_id": "35202107", "url": "https://genius.com/35202107", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
