{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "About That Life", "line": "Pound of purple green", "vault_lines": ["Pound of purple green"], "meaning": "‘Purple green’ or, as it’s commonly referred to, purp', is a strain of marijuana that displays purple and green hairs.", "annotation_id": "1753225", "url": "https://genius.com/1753225", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "About That Life", "line": "2 liter of pink Sprite", "vault_lines": [", 2 liter of pink Sprite"], "meaning": "‘Pink Sprite’, more commonly known as ‘purple drank’ or ‘lean’, is a recreational drug popular in the hip hop community.\n\nIt consists of a combination of prescription strength cough syrup (which contains codeine and promethazine) mixed with a soft drink such as Sprite.\n\nThe fact that Rozay has 2 litres of lean, added to the pound of weed shows you that he is certainly about that rapper life!", "annotation_id": "1753204", "url": "https://genius.com/1753204", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "About That Life", "line": "I’m high fashion, so my Gucci reeks of marijuana", "vault_lines": ["I'm high fashion, so my Gucci reeks of marijuana"], "meaning": "A clever metaphor here by Fab. He compares the “high end” fashionable brand Gucci to to the “high” feeling one reaches from smoking marijuana.\n\nIt alludes to two of the most popular themes in rap music – designer clothing and drugs. Both of which Fab possesses.", "annotation_id": "1488348", "url": "https://genius.com/1488348", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "About That Life", "line": "Look, I terminate a bitch, like her name was Sarah Connor", "vault_lines": ["Look, I terminate a bitch, like her name was Sarah Connor"], "meaning": "Sarah Connor is a fictional character from the Terminator film series.\n\nIn the first film, Sarah is hunted down by the Terminator himself Arnold Schwarzenegger who attempts to kill her.\n\nFab however is referring to a different type of termination, one which involves him and this girl being in the bedroom…", "annotation_id": "1488337", "url": "https://genius.com/1488337", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
