{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Accident Murderers", "line": "Live forever; that’s Insh’Allah", "vault_lines": ["Snatch a TEC off the shelf, live forever; that's Insh'Allah"], "meaning": "Arabic for god willing. The character Ross is narrating is hoping to be forgiven (live forever)  in case he doesn’t make it.", "annotation_id": "34880850", "url": "https://genius.com/34880850", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Accident Murderers", "line": "Tight with him, why was he in the way? Why was he standing next to the enemy that specific day?", "vault_lines": ["Tight with him, why was he in the way?"], "meaning": "Nas brings in the thought that his friends were hustling with his enemies. Would it have been alright to kill his friend if he had known that he was a snake behind his back?", "annotation_id": "33307742", "url": "https://genius.com/33307742", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
