{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Act a Fool", "line": "Ross told me homie is chess then he made checkers the move", "vault_lines": ["Ross told me homie is chess then he made checkers the move"], "meaning": "“This is Chess not Checkers” is a phrase which implies the level of difficulty in Chess is vastly superior to the level of difficulty in Checkers. In the film Training Day actor Denzel Washington emphatically says the phrase to fellow actor and officer Ethan Hawke. The scene can be viewed here.\n\nWale pays homage to Rick Ross who purchased a Checkers franchise in 2017 in Carol City, Florida.", "annotation_id": "17761084", "url": "https://genius.com/17761084", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Act a Fool", "line": "You see this watch, you raise your eyes, it’s Rocky Maivia (Hahaha)", "vault_lines": ["You see this watch, you raise your eyes, it's Rocky Maivia (Hahaha)"], "meaning": "Prior to being known as The Rock in WWE, Dwayne Johnson went by the name of Rocky Maivia. Maivia debuted in the then WWF in November of 1996 at Madison Square Garden as part of the Survivor Series PPV. Johnson reacting to his first match can be seen here.\n\nDuring his time as The Rock, Johnson was renown for raising his eyebrow and even nicknamed it “The People’s Eyebrow''.\n\nWale is rocking a watch which is particularly icy to the point it’s making spectators raise their eyes like Johnson would raise his eyebrow.", "annotation_id": "17761046", "url": "https://genius.com/17761046", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Act a Fool", "line": "Or pink boxes on my condoms And my closet, boy", "vault_lines": ["or pink boxes on my condoms", "And my closet, boy"], "meaning": "“Pink Boxes On My Condoms.”\nBox is slang for vagina. So he got that pink wet wet on his condom. Condoms are used for sexual intercourse, of course (heh).\n\n“And [Pink Boxes In] My Closet, Boy.”\nHe’s talking about SB Dunks being in his closet. “Pink Box” Nike SB Series are the rarer of the Nike Dunk SBs that are out there. We know Wale is a sneaker head and you strive to have the rarest kicks in your collection. Pink Box SBs Dunks are what fill his closet\n\nALSO this is referring back to his line about “Hundred SBs” in the intro of his verse.", "annotation_id": "17443392", "url": "https://genius.com/17443392", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Act a Fool", "line": "I’m printin’ paper, boy, I even wrote a book (Biggie)", "vault_lines": ["I'm printin' paper, boy, I even wrote a book (Biggie)"], "meaning": "Here, Ross is referring to his upcoming autobiography, Hurricanes: A Memoir, set to release on September 3, 2019.", "annotation_id": "17436886", "url": "https://genius.com/17436886", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Act a Fool", "line": "And I just called up Travis, for the cactuses you coppin’ Pink laces on my Jordans", "vault_lines": ["And I just called up Travis, for the cactuses you coppin'", "Pink laces on my Jordans"], "meaning": "Wale is speaking on the Jordan 1 Retro High Travis Scott, created by fellow rapper Travis Scott. The shoes came with an alternate pair of pink laces to switch out with the standard black ones:\n\n\n\nWale again flexes his connections for sneakers, as he can simply make one call and get a highly coveted pair of sneakers that many other people will miss out on.", "annotation_id": "17435999", "url": "https://genius.com/17435999", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Act a Fool", "line": "Least before like March I had them Cactus Plant Flea Markets", "vault_lines": ["Least before like March", "I had them Cactus Plant Flea Markets"], "meaning": "Cactus Plant Flea Market, or CPFM is an American streetwear fashion brand created by Pharrell prodigy Cynthia Lu.\n\nIn May 2019, CPFM released a highly-coveted sneaker collaboration with Nike on the Air Vapormax model, as seen below:\n\n\n\nWale is flexing his status by stating that he got the shoe early, in March, and was plugged with it, instead of missing out the sneaker who sold out, like many of the people who wanted it.", "annotation_id": "17435981", "url": "https://genius.com/17435981", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
