{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Addicted", "line": "My nigga Nut so slick, they ain’t pat him down", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "His nigga Nut (Peanut – Raymond Adderly) is too smooth to get knocked down by the boys.\nEventually this did happen in 2010, his best friend was killed in front of his house and family. Rest In Peace.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/rickyrozay/status/15267195739176960", "annotation_id": "931880", "url": "https://genius.com/931880", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
