{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Albert Pujols", "line": "They just way too Canseco", "vault_lines": ["They just hating on the game, they just way too Canseco"], "meaning": "Haters mad at the way he’s dominating, and getting recognition…they then turn into Jose Canseco, whom is known for ‘snitching’ on ALOT of fellow baseball players from his era, basically tring to destroy their legacies SIMPLY off of hate.", "annotation_id": "567799", "url": "https://genius.com/567799", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
