{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Albert Pujols", "line": "Bet I be like Fenway out in Boston, my green is a monster", "vault_lines": ["Bet I be like Fenway out in Boston, my green is a monster"], "meaning": "Wale can assure you he stays super high because his weed is a “monster”. He could alternatively be speaking of his money. This is also an allusion to The Green Monster at Fenway Park, which is thirty-seven feet, two-inches high. The highest wall in the MLB.", "annotation_id": "567294", "url": "https://genius.com/567294", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
