{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "All Birds", "line": "Bastard child but I got a fleet of cars", "vault_lines": ["Bastard child but I got a fleet of cars"], "meaning": "Ross' father remains somewhat of a mystery.  The rapper has been tight-lipped about the subject, and his birth certificate, unearthed by The Smoking Gun, offers no clues either.  We know his mother is Tommie Robert, but no information on a male parent was forthcoming", "annotation_id": "861029", "url": "https://genius.com/861029", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
