{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "All I Really Want", "line": "Might let her sit it on my mustache But maybe not, but then again, it make her bust fast", "vault_lines": ["Might let her sit it on my mustache", "But maybe not, but then again, it make her bust fast"], "meaning": "Rozay is known for his luscious beard and mustache. Continuing with the theme of his incredible talents in bed, the Boss is apparently a very skilled performer of cunnilingus.", "annotation_id": "31705378", "url": "https://genius.com/31705378", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "All I Really Want", "line": "Every time I call, she just come ’Cause every time I call, she get to cum", "vault_lines": ["'Cause every time I call, she get to cum"], "meaning": "Rozay is so good in bed that women are eager to answer his booty-calls, because hooking up with him means that an orgasm is guaranteed.\n\nhttps://gifdb.com/images/high/rick-ross-drink-juice-c34u6l94pmjru9nu.webp", "annotation_id": "31705341", "url": "https://genius.com/31705341", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "All I Really Want", "line": "I see no competition, baby girl a must have", "vault_lines": ["I see no competition, baby girl a must have"], "meaning": "Since this girl’s boyfriend us no longer in the picture, Ross sees nothing in his way between him and her. Also possible double entendre for next line:\n\n1.Baby girl (referring to the girl in this song) is a like a commodity to him, he must have her.\n\n2.Baby girl could also be referring to Rick Ross having a child with her. And if they do, The Bawse wants a daughter.", "annotation_id": "2924039", "url": "https://genius.com/2924039", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "All I Really Want", "line": "She my Josephine Baker", "vault_lines": ["She my Josephine Baker"], "meaning": "Renowned American born French dancer/actress/singer. She became a citizen of France in 1937. Her infamous “Banana Dance” was a part of Beyoncé’s Live @ Fashion Rocks 2006 performance, as a tribute to her style and grace on and off the camera.", "annotation_id": "2053627", "url": "https://genius.com/2053627", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "All I Really Want", "line": "I’m on her heels like I’m Jonathan Kelsey", "vault_lines": ["I'm on her heels like I'm Jonathan Kelsey"], "meaning": "Referring to the UK shoe designer:\n\n\n\nHe has launched his own collection since Rick Ross came out with this song.", "annotation_id": "1829420", "url": "https://genius.com/1829420", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
