{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Day", "line": "Listenin’ to Stevie, “Ribbon in the Sky”", "vault_lines": ["Listenin' to Stevie, \"Ribbon in the Sky\""], "meaning": "Reference to Stevie Wonder’s song “Ribbon in the sky” https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FWR13xfdDS0", "annotation_id": "14797964", "url": "https://genius.com/14797964", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Day", "line": "Cause Joe crack cares, even if no one else cares", "vault_lines": ["Cause Joe crack cares, even if no one else cares"], "meaning": "Joe is paying homage here to a line from 2pac’s song “Keep Ya Head Up”\n\nI give a holla to my sisters on welfare\n2Pac cares, if don’t nobody else care", "annotation_id": "7690722", "url": "https://genius.com/7690722", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Day", "line": "Five gold joints and still gets no love", "vault_lines": ["Five gold joints and still gets no love"], "meaning": "From Port of Miami to GFID, Rozay’s 5 albums have each went Gold but he still encounters some haters & people who still focus on irrelevant things other his hit-making ability", "annotation_id": "3215506", "url": "https://genius.com/3215506", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Day", "line": "[Chorus: Tiara Thomas & French Montana]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "The melody of the singing and part of the lyrics are borrowed from “Just Another Day” by another New York rapper, Lloyd Banks.\n\nhttp://rapgenius.com/Lloyd-banks-just-another-day-lyrics", "annotation_id": "3123192", "url": "https://genius.com/3123192", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Day", "line": "They thought I’d never see outside of 5V", "vault_lines": ["They thought I'd never see outside of 5V"], "meaning": "5V is the apartment that Joe lived in as a youth located in Forest Projects in the South Bronx.\nAll the naysayers that were around Joe when he was young thought he would never get out the hood but through his hard work and dedication he proved them wrong.", "annotation_id": "3048676", "url": "https://genius.com/3048676", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Day", "line": "Welcome home my nigga Joe Crack", "vault_lines": ["Welcome home my nigga Joe Crack"], "meaning": "Joey Crack went to prison last year for tax charges. He was optimistic though!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/fatjoe/statuses/372008079363420160", "annotation_id": "3042389", "url": "https://genius.com/3042389", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Day", "line": "Just another day livin’ in the hood Just another day in the hood Didn’t have to use the K today Made it through another day", "vault_lines": ["Just another day in the hood", "Didn't have to use the K today", "Made it through another day"], "meaning": "French made it through the day without pulling out his AK so today was a good day.\n\n\n\nAs Ice Cube previously mentioned:\n\nToday I didn’t even have to use my AK,\nI got to say it was a good day", "annotation_id": "3040775", "url": "https://genius.com/3040775", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Day", "line": "New Wraith with soft plates", "vault_lines": ["New Wraith with soft plates"], "meaning": "Rozay’s got a brand new Rolls Royce Wraith. These top-of-the-line luxury vehicles go for around $300,000.\n\n\n\nRick Ross mentions his Wraith in many of his latest songs:\n\nMoney over bitches, first nigga with a Wraith\n\nAlso:\n\nBaby seen me in that Wraith, wanna have my baby", "annotation_id": "3040741", "url": "https://genius.com/3040741", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Day", "line": "Joe Crack, Dope Boy, nigga Don Cartegena", "vault_lines": ["Joe Crack, Dope Boy, nigga Don Cartegena"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is referring to Fat Joe in three ways:\n1) Joe Crack – Fat Joe’s nickname.\n\n2) Dope Boy – referring to Joe’s time before rap selling drugs\n\n3) Don Cartagena – Another of Fat Joe’s nicknames (mostly used in the 90’s) and is the name of his third album and the single that goes by the same name which features Diddy.", "annotation_id": "3040725", "url": "https://genius.com/3040725", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Day", "status": "done", "targets": 9, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Fat-joe-another-day-lyrics", "genius_title": "Another Day", "genius_id": 398191, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another One", "line": "P. Diddy run the city", "vault_lines": ["P. Diddy run the city"], "meaning": "Diddy literally ran the city when he completed the New York City marathon to raise money for charity. Rick Ross didn’t join him, shockingly", "annotation_id": "534279", "url": "https://genius.com/534279", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another One", "line": "The cologne bitch", "vault_lines": ["I’m feeling myself, bitch you do the same"], "meaning": "Unforgivable, which had a notoriously racy commercial. More recently, he promoted his new cologne I Am King with a 4.5 minute ad. Diddy’s never been one for modesty", "annotation_id": "534261", "url": "https://genius.com/534261", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another One", "line": "Stack up all the cases of Ciroc up on the 8th floor", "vault_lines": ["Stack up all the cases of Ciroc up on the 8th floor"], "meaning": "Diddy entered into a 50/50 profit split with Ciroc parent company Diageo when he signed on as brand ambassador, meaning he’s made a ton of profit and likely gets a bunch of free Ciroc to promote the vodka", "annotation_id": "534257", "url": "https://genius.com/534257", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another One", "line": "We talking about new money, nigga. What you know about it?", "vault_lines": ["(Rick Ross) We talking about new money, nigga. What you know about it?"], "meaning": "Rick Ross came up fast in a new generation of rappers along with Kanye and Lil' Wayne; now they’re rich superstars\n\nAmazing that Diddy can be considered new money because he’s been in the game so long, but he’s reinvented himself so many times by coming out with a successful cologne line, breaking new artists, and marketing Ciroc vodka", "annotation_id": "534249", "url": "https://genius.com/534249", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another One", "line": "Jewels like I’m Slick Rick Bally shoes ladi-dadi", "vault_lines": ["Jewels like I’m Slick Rick"], "meaning": "The now classic song by Slick Rick called “La Di Da Di” represented the peak of the storytelling rapper. In the song, he describes his process of getting dressed and ready for the day, which famously included Bally brand shoes", "annotation_id": "104670", "url": "https://genius.com/104670", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another One", "status": "done", "targets": 5, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Rick-ross-another-one-lyrics", "genius_title": "Another One", "genius_id": 3716, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Round (Remix)", "line": "It’s A.P on my wrist", "vault_lines": ["Shout out to Joe and Chris, It's A.P on my wrist"], "meaning": "Audemars Piguet or AP is a manufacturer of Swiss watches. Like many other brands of luxury watches, Audemars Piguet has a number of ambassadors, including Novak Djokovic, Sachin Tendulkar, Michael Schumacher, Lionel Messi and Sebastien Buemi.", "annotation_id": "2182222", "url": "https://genius.com/2182222", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Round (Remix)", "line": "They calling me the hottest in the game", "vault_lines": ["They calling me the hottest in the game"], "meaning": "A reference to the MTV-compiled list of hip-hop stars deemed to be the “hottest” of that year. The Maybach Music Group founder became featured from 2008 to 2012. Although, MTV has stressed that this doesn’t represent the greatest hip hop artists of all time.", "annotation_id": "2182163", "url": "https://genius.com/2182163", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Round (Remix)", "line": "She self made, I’m self made", "vault_lines": ["She self made, I'm self made"], "meaning": "‘Self Made’ has become a motto for MMG, and they’ve incorporated it through the titles of their collaborative tapes. This is a lifestyle that boasts attaining high status all on ones own.", "annotation_id": "1275055", "url": "https://genius.com/1275055", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Round (Remix)", "line": "[Chorus: Chris Brown]", "vault_lines": ["A MMG remix of the Fat Joe song “Another Round” with singer Chris Brown."], "meaning": "From the original version with Another Round by Fat Joe:", "annotation_id": "1049917", "url": "https://genius.com/1049917", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Round (Remix)", "line": "And we got history, let’s repeat it the right way", "vault_lines": ["And we got history, let's repeat it the right way"], "meaning": "Like the saying “history repeats itself”, he wants to make the history repeat the right way this time. He wants it to be worth repeating.", "annotation_id": "895585", "url": "https://genius.com/895585", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Round (Remix)", "line": "Let’s have a toast for this new love I scoop you up at like 2 somethin’ Truthfully don’t do much, but with you trying do something", "vault_lines": ["Let's have a toast for this new love", "I scoop you up at like 2 somethin'", "Truthfully don't do much, but with you trying do something"], "meaning": "Wale is going to pick the girl up around two, because he wants to take this girl out to celebrate them being together. He usually doesn’t go all out for girls like this, but its different with her. He actually wants to take her out.", "annotation_id": "889001", "url": "https://genius.com/889001", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Round (Remix)", "line": "Listen, uno papi chulo bout to show you what you been missing", "vault_lines": ["Listen, uno papi chulo bout to show you what you been missing"], "meaning": "Papi Chulo is a Spanish saying for like a pretty boy, or a hot/sexy guy. Basically Wale is going to give the girl something she’s never had before sexually.\n\nReference to Wale and Rick Ross song “Albert Pujols”,\n\nOye mami, ven aca, come here for papi chulo", "annotation_id": "888982", "url": "https://genius.com/888982", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Round (Remix)", "status": "done", "targets": 7, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Rick-ross-another-round-remix-lyrics", "genius_title": "Another Round (Remix)", "genius_id": 68272, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Summer", "line": "Out in Denver, having dinner with the Elways", "vault_lines": ["Out in Denver, having dinner with the Elways"], "meaning": "John Elway, general manager and former quarterback for the Denver Broncos, has a steakhouse in Denver.", "annotation_id": "10540566", "url": "https://genius.com/10540566", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Another Summer", "line": "Look me in my eyes and tell me what you see (You feel me?) You watch the homie come up from a mustard seed (Ahh) Ain’t looking for no problems, just a chance to eat And I make mama a promise I’m gon’ plant my feet", "vault_lines": ["Ain't looking for no problems, just a chance to eat", "And I make mama a promise I'm gon' plant my feet"], "meaning": "Ross is saying he watched the homie come up from a mustard seed. Nipsey called me about it and told me. He explained it to me and I really looked up what it meant.\n\nI can’t say it word for word. But a mustard seed, it’s something real powerful in that message.", "annotation_id": "10532515", "url": "https://genius.com/10532515", "state": "verified", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
