{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Audio Meth", "line": "When the tree spark (Bow)", "vault_lines": ["Scare snakes out the grass when the tree spark (Bow)"], "meaning": "Reference to the consumption of cannabis, colloquially reffered to as ‘trees’.", "annotation_id": "1309754", "url": "https://genius.com/1309754", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Audio Meth", "line": "Keep it on the up and up; just like Khaled, we the best, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Keep it on the up and up; just like Khaled, we the best, nigga"], "meaning": "A reference to DJ Khaled who is infamous for his “We the best!” shout over his songs.\n\n\n\nRaekwon is basically saying him and his crew will always strive to be the best and will evolve stay on the top.", "annotation_id": "1049891", "url": "https://genius.com/1049891", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Audio Meth", "line": "I’m addicted, canary yellow diamonds (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["I'm addicted, canary yellow diamonds (Woo)"], "meaning": "Ross is so addicted, in fact, that he named a song “Yellow Diamonds”.", "annotation_id": "429717", "url": "https://genius.com/429717", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
