{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "BRRRR", "line": "Ambition ain’t just a song", "vault_lines": ["Double M that been my clique and Ambition ain't just a song"], "meaning": "“Ambition” is the title of a song that was created by Wale in 2011. The  song is named after the full length album Wale dropped that year. Fat Trel is saying ambition is more than a song title, it’s a strong desire to achieve more.", "annotation_id": "7186457", "url": "https://genius.com/7186457", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
