{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Back From Abu Dhabi", "line": "[Verse 4: French Montana]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Abu Dhabi is one of the seven Emirates that make up the United Arab Emirates.\n\nThe others are Sharjah, Ajman, Umm al Quwain, Ras al Khaimah, Fujairah, and Dubai.\n\nFrench Montana is recently engaged to the princess of Dubai, Sheikha Mahra al Maktoum, who is the daughter of the ruler of Dubai.", "annotation_id": "36974492", "url": "https://genius.com/36974492", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
