{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bad Bitch (Remix)", "line": "See me looking square, it’ll be G class nigga", "vault_lines": ["See me looking square, it’ll be G class nigga"], "meaning": "Fabolous is referring to the Mercedes G Wagon, a high-end SUV produced by the German marque, which is known for its square-like styling. It is driven by many prominent figures, including the Ruler of Dubai, Sheikh Mohammed bin Rashed Al Maktoum.\n\nTo look'square' is to look conventional and boring however when you see Fabolous looking ‘square’, it will be in his G Wagon.", "annotation_id": "5148521", "url": "https://genius.com/5148521", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bad Bitch (Remix)", "line": "I’m a road runner, had to beep beep past", "vault_lines": ["I’m a road runner, had to beep beep past"], "meaning": "Road Runner is a popular Looney Tunes character who is enemies with Wile E. Coyote.\n\nBeep Beep is Road Runner’s signature phrase, used when he runs really fast.\n\nFabolous is so busy putting in work on the road that he is comparable to Road Runner.", "annotation_id": "5132462", "url": "https://genius.com/5132462", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bad Bitch (Remix)", "line": "Fucking all night, now we call it Ross fit", "vault_lines": ["Fucking all night, now we call it Ross fit"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is known for being a big guy who could stand to lose a few pounds.\n\nThe only exercise he gets is when he has sex with a girl all night long. This is his way of getting Ross Fit.", "annotation_id": "5132389", "url": "https://genius.com/5132389", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bad Bitch (Remix)", "line": "I want the 2016, that new prezi", "vault_lines": ["I want the 2016, that new prezi"], "meaning": "In the year 2016, President Obama will have completed his second term as president and the USA will elect a new president.\n\nFab doesn’t necessarily want a new leader, just a new Rolex President, which is a very expensive watch.", "annotation_id": "5132348", "url": "https://genius.com/5132348", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
