{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bait (Remix)", "line": "Bait baby, wait baby Why don’t you just get a little taste baby", "vault_lines": ["Bait baby, wait baby", "Why don't you just get a little taste baby"], "meaning": "Bait is a luring mechanism used to catch the attention of something, in this case Trey is referring himself as bait to catch fish on a hook.\n\nThe usual bait on a hook is a worm, sometimes the fish fall for it, sometime they dont, so Trey tries to persuade the fish (girl with the big ass) to swim over and get a taste of his “worm”", "annotation_id": "576190", "url": "https://genius.com/576190", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bait (Remix)", "line": "That remix flow, Mocco bread, PG though", "vault_lines": ["That remix flow, Mocco bread, PG though"], "meaning": "MoCo Bread represents Montgomery County, MD, one of the Richest counties in America. PG County, aka Prince Georges County, is continuously one of a lower socio-economic status. Ergo, Wale is saying even though he got that paper, he still keep it Gutta!", "annotation_id": "501742", "url": "https://genius.com/501742", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
