{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bait (Remix)", "line": "So much Promethazine I’m VIP at CVS", "vault_lines": ["So much Promethazine I'm VIP at CVS"], "meaning": "Promethazine is a prescription drug, with CVS being one place that prescribes this drug. However, 2 Chainz is addicted to it without a prescription, and probably buys it so much that his dealers (such as CVS) regard him as a Very Important Person.", "annotation_id": "483701", "url": "https://genius.com/483701", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bait (Remix)", "line": "One eye open like CBS", "vault_lines": ["One eye open like CBS"], "meaning": "2 Chainz is so blown right now that he can barely keep one eye open, similar to CBS’s logo\n\n\n\nThis also alludes to the old Jay-Z that he’s listening to. Jay used this line on “Can I Live” from his debut album, Reasonable Doubt.", "annotation_id": "483700", "url": "https://genius.com/483700", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bait (Remix)", "line": "Touching on that ass, tryna get a feel I just had to ask, tell me if it’s real I ain’t tryna diss you, it’s really not an issue If it’s fake or if it’s real I’mma keep you on my reel, still", "vault_lines": ["Touching on that ass, tryna get a feel", "I just had to ask, tell me if it's real", "I ain't tryna diss you, it's really not an issue", "If it's fake or if it's real I'mma keep you on my reel, still"], "meaning": "Much like Wale’s viewpoint in “Fairy Tale”, Trigga wants to know if this girl has had butt enlargements or not. If not, he’s cool with it, he’s still gonna feel all up on it.\n\nThe last line in this segment, mentioning the “reel”, keeps with the theme of this song, and it’s title, “Bait”.", "annotation_id": "483673", "url": "https://genius.com/483673", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
