{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Ball (Remix)", "line": "It’s a full-time job not to trigger you up", "vault_lines": ["It’s a full-time job not to trigger you up"], "meaning": "A recycled line said by many like Jay-Z, Game, and Meek Mill – it’s hard for a true street nigga like Gunplay to not kill his haters. He already took an L by getting arrested for armed robbery, so Gunplay knows he can’t afford to get arrested once again.", "annotation_id": "1406916", "url": "https://genius.com/1406916", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
