{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Baller Alert", "line": "Dream chasing, I might fly this bitch to Philly", "vault_lines": ["Popping pussy, dream chasing, I might fly this bitch to Philly"], "meaning": "Here’s a reference to fellow rapper and member of MMG Meek Mill.\nMeek Mill famous serie of mixtapes are called Dreamchasers. Dreamchasers 4 is set to drop early 2016.\nMeek is from Philadelphia ; so here is why Rozay wants to take his girlfriend (the so-called “bitch”) to Philly.", "annotation_id": "8587818", "url": "https://genius.com/8587818", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Baller Alert", "line": "Tity 2 necklace, you gon’ respect this", "vault_lines": ["Tity 2 necklace, you gon' respect this"], "meaning": "Tity 2 necklace is a reference to his old rap name. Indeed before he went fully mainstream, 2 Chainz was known as “Tity Boi”. Therefore, this formulation is a mix between “Tity Boi” and “2 Chainz” : Tity 2 necklace.\nIt’s not the first time he uses this formulation : on the song https://genius.com/2-chainz-riot-lyrics , from his mixtape T.R.U. REALigion, 2 Chainz raps : “And if you don’t know I go by Tity 2 Necklace”.", "annotation_id": "8587766", "url": "https://genius.com/8587766", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Baller Alert", "line": "Last time I checked nigga you was in last place Last Kings Records, I’mma scream it ’till my last day", "vault_lines": ["Last time I checked nigga you was in last place", "Last Kings Records, I'mma scream it 'till my last day"], "meaning": "Following various disputes with his label and label-mates, Tyga is slowly stepping away from Young Money. Last Kings Records is his own record label.", "annotation_id": "8424070", "url": "https://genius.com/8424070", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Baller Alert", "line": "Baller alert, it’s baller alert Work for them dollars, yeah Baller alert, it’s baller alert Work for them dollars, yeah Baller alert, it’s baller alert Work for them dollars, yeah Ballin’ every year, I’m the baller of the year, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Ballin' every year, I'm the baller of the year, yeah"], "meaning": "Not to be confused with his basketball talent, Tyga’s balling skills are off the charts when it comes to making money. His net worth is over $6 million, and occasionally he’ll flash a $320,000 presents for loved ones – surely a baller trait.\n\nPerhaps unexpectedly, the backing for these claims came from Pusha T, who’s known to have a rocky relationship with anyone associated with YMCMB. On the track “More Famous Than Rich,” King Push praised Tyga for his decision to leave the label in order to profit from his music.\n\nThe illusion of money we don’t believe in\nYou ask me, Tyga looking like a genius\n\nhttps://instagram.com/p/-YIAmXqesl/", "annotation_id": "8372680", "url": "https://genius.com/8372680", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Baller Alert", "line": "Brand new Rari, did I lease it? Did I buy it? Why the fuck it matter bitch? You will never drive it", "vault_lines": ["Brand new Rari, did I lease it? Did I buy it?", "Why the fuck it matter bitch? You will never drive it"], "meaning": "Referring to the Ferrari he bought Kylie for her 18 birthday. The media attacked Tyga after he gave it to Kylie making claims they he leased it and that he couldn’t afford it due to his “Net Worth” being 5 Mill.\n\nTyga Claps back to haters with this line saying “Why the fuck it matter bitch” aiming it at the people that talk shit about him giving the luxury car away.", "annotation_id": "8357706", "url": "https://genius.com/8357706", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Baller Alert", "line": "Hmm oh my God, why the fuck you lying?", "vault_lines": ["Hmm oh my God, why the fuck you lying?"], "meaning": "Tyga pays homage to the well known vine and internet meme “Why You Lying” with this line.\n\nhttps://vine.co/v/iZ6Ob9nPEng", "annotation_id": "8357683", "url": "https://genius.com/8357683", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
