{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Beautiful", "line": "Pockets full of Rondos", "vault_lines": ["Sick condos, pockets full of Rondos"], "meaning": "A reference to NBA player Rajon Rondo who plays for the Boston Celtics.\n\nHe uses the color of the Celtic’s uniform (green) as a metaphor for money.\n\nFun fact :\nRondo also plays with the number “9”, so it could also be a reference to the 9mm Glock Pistol, which due to its size could probably fit in Game’s pocket.", "annotation_id": "3920101", "url": "https://genius.com/3920101", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Beautiful", "line": "We set examples for rich niggas in Maseratis (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["We set examples for rich niggas in Maseratis (Woo)"], "meaning": "Maserati is quite possibly one of the greatest and most exclusive luxury cars of all time. If you want an eye-catching whip that sets you apart and ensures your ability to smoke nearly everyone else on the road, buy one – if you can afford it.\n\nRick Ross clearly sets examples of rich niggas as him and his crew riding in a luxury sport coupe cars.", "annotation_id": "3916621", "url": "https://genius.com/3916621", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Beautiful", "line": "Snowman, tell these niggas that we livin’ it", "vault_lines": ["Snowman, tell these niggas that we livin' it"], "meaning": "Snowman is a word used in reference to a coke dealer that you do not personally know, and makes a living by selling cocaine.\n\nSnowman is also another name for the Atlanta rapper Jeezy. He explains the symbolism of it here.", "annotation_id": "3916603", "url": "https://genius.com/3916603", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Beautiful", "line": "Choppers wit’ extended clips long as El Segundo", "vault_lines": ["Choppers wit' extended clips long as El Segundo"], "meaning": "Game references El Segundo Boulevard, a 12 mile long major street that runs through several cities in the county of Los Angeles. He is saying that his extended clips are the same length.", "annotation_id": "3915236", "url": "https://genius.com/3915236", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
