{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Beautiful", "line": "FNH with the drum", "vault_lines": ["FNH with the drum"], "meaning": "Fabrique Nationale or it’s official name FN Herstal, it’s a Belgian firearms company, they manufacture handguns, rifles, shotguns.\n\n\n\nJeezy loves FNH guns; this isn’t the first time he’s mentioned it in a song this year.\n\nIn War Ready also with Rozay he rhymes like:\n\nYeah, I got that FNH with that mothafuckin' Fendi holster", "annotation_id": "3914915", "url": "https://genius.com/3914915", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
