{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Beautiful", "line": "First nigga with the Wraith, underneath the stars (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["First nigga with the Wraith, underneath the stars (Woo)"], "meaning": "Last year Ross was the first one to purchase the 2014 Rolls-Royce Wraith, which costs more than $284,900.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lrds0ju1qNM\n\nThe second par alludes to the fact that the Rolls Royce Wraith has a celestial ceiling which he speaks of.", "annotation_id": "3910274", "url": "https://genius.com/3910274", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Beautiful", "line": "Got me livin’ like I box Sugar Ray Leonard", "vault_lines": ["Fuck her like a champ, got me livin' like I box"], "meaning": "Ross is living like a champion getting the girls, having the fame, & counting the money.\n\n\n\nSugar Ray Leonard is a retired boxer who was one of the greatest in the ring retiring at 36 wins, 25 knockouts, 1 draw, and only 3 losses.\n\nRoss is also referring to his new mansion in Atlanta, that used to be owned by Evander Holyfield.", "annotation_id": "3910261", "url": "https://genius.com/3910261", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Beautiful", "line": "We squashed the beef to get the money (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["We squashed the beef to get the money (Huh)"], "meaning": "Ross and Jeezy had an altercation between each other at the 2012 BET Awards where Ross said “I tried to choke Jeezy”\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BUuqbFww_sM\n\nAfter some time went by the two manged to end whatever problems they had together and do what they both love to do.. Make money; when they collaborated on Ross' “War Ready”", "annotation_id": "3910244", "url": "https://genius.com/3910244", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
