{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Beautiful Lie", "line": "Huh? Where the fuck am I at? Hey, yeah, where the fuck am I at? Ay, what the fuck did we do? Shoulda told your friend to come through Mmm, uh, where the fuck am I at? (Lie) Where the fuck am I at? (Beautiful lie) What the fuck did we do? (Beautiful lie)", "vault_lines": ["Huh? Where the fuck am I at?", "Hey, yeah, where the fuck am I at?"], "meaning": "Wale is still trying to figure where he is at what he did the night before, in doing so he asks multiple people around him what’s going on.", "annotation_id": "7776497", "url": "https://genius.com/7776497", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
