{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Been", "line": "Man, they see my crockpot I’m in the kitchen I mean that literal, cook it up like Emeril", "vault_lines": ["Man, they see my crockpot I'm in the kitchen", "I mean that literal, cook it up like Emeril"], "meaning": "Here Jiggolo compares his cooking skills to those of legendary TV chef, Emeril Lagasse. Except in Jiggolo’s case, he isn’t cooking up fine cuisine in his kitchen, but rather, he is cooking up the best cocaine product in the country.", "annotation_id": "3128124", "url": "https://genius.com/3128124", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
