{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Been That", "line": "But my H-town pouring drink up", "vault_lines": ["But my H-town pouring drink up"], "meaning": "“Pouring drink” in this case is referring to a mixture of codeine and promethazine commonly known as “purple drank” or just “drank.”\n\n It was created and made popular in Houston, Texas or “H-town.”", "annotation_id": "7394804", "url": "https://genius.com/7394804", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
