{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Been That", "line": "Coke white, sour creme, butter all in my coupe", "vault_lines": ["Coke white, sour creme, butter all in my coupe"], "meaning": "Ross only peddles the whitest cocaine, indicating purity, the same colour as sour cream.\n\nCompleting the decadent food reference, despite his RossFit weightloss, is the golden beauty of butter, which is a rich, luscious colour and prompts thoughts of wealth and opulence.", "annotation_id": "7188664", "url": "https://genius.com/7188664", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
