{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Been That", "line": "Condoms all in my condo", "vault_lines": ["Condoms all in my condo"], "meaning": "Meek Has condoms in his condominium.\n\nHe is paying homage to his friend & long time collaborator Fabolous.\n\nAlso paying homage to this line, from Jay Z’s “Nigga What, Nigga Who”.\n\n\nGot a condo with nothin' but condoms in it― Fabolous – Rap & Sex", "annotation_id": "7187818", "url": "https://genius.com/7187818", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
