{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Been That", "line": "I been that nigga on the corner, nappy braids and selling hard Now I pull up on ’em bitches, got them texting “Oh my God”", "vault_lines": ["I been that nigga on the corner, nappy braids and selling hard"], "meaning": "Meek Mill use to be the average bum with dreads on the corner selling drugs. People viewed him as a loser that would get nowhere. Despite what people thought, Meek kept grinding and became a famous rapper. He went from a bum to someone that everyone knows, and someone the women love.", "annotation_id": "7187788", "url": "https://genius.com/7187788", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
