{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Believe It", "line": "Art of war, common law", "vault_lines": ["Art of war, common law"], "meaning": "The Art of War is a military treatise by Sun Tzu that teaches the student to best apply their and a groups focus and control to the task at hand.\n\nThis is standard for Rozay, because that is the strategy he used to build his Maybach Music Empire\n\nThere are only 5 notes, but their permutations are more than ever could be heard.\n-Sun Tzu\n\n\n\nFun Fact: The Art of War is required reading for officers of the US Military.\n\nSee http://suntzusaid.com/ for the text.", "annotation_id": "1358979", "url": "https://genius.com/1358979", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
