{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Benediction", "line": "So I gave you my testimony", "vault_lines": ["So I gave you my testimony"], "meaning": "August gave us his story through his past albums, including this song – growing up, his brother, his friends and family. This also ties in with the album that was coming out during the time the song was made, Testimony, now out. He Testifies in the first track of the album.", "annotation_id": "2971440", "url": "https://genius.com/2971440", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
