{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Business (Remix)", "line": "Niggas actin’ like a bitch and I’ma eat one", "vault_lines": ["Niggas actin' like a bitch and I'ma eat one"], "meaning": "This line could possibly be a reference to Ross' May 2022 Instagram clip, in which he explains why boxers make noises during fights. The final part of this clip, in which Ross says, “I'ma eat it”, followed by a scream, turned into a [widespread meme all across the internet including a TikTok challenge, in which users took the clip out of context and applied it to a different situation.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DrucdUHOnco", "annotation_id": "26468674", "url": "https://genius.com/26468674", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
