{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "I make my bitches traffic dope, that’s my profession She swallow dope and looking pregnant, time for C-section", "vault_lines": ["I make my bitches traffic dope, that's my profession", "She swallow dope and looking pregnant, time for C-section"], "meaning": "A mule is someone who smuggles something across a borderfor a smuggling organization. Watch Meet The Millers for an indept look on the subject.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMethods of smuggling include hiding the goods in a vehicle, luggage or clothes, strapping them to one’s body, or using the body as a container.Watch HBO’s The Wire for the various methods.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDiddy prefers the swallow method which is the most secure,but it’s also the most dangerous because they can break inside the carrier.", "annotation_id": "3037341", "url": "https://genius.com/3037341", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "And Giuseppe", "vault_lines": [", nigga, and Giuseppe"], "meaning": "Giuseppe Zanotti is an Italian shoe designer\n\n\n\nHe sells EXTREMELY EXPENSIVE SHOES.", "annotation_id": "3015117", "url": "https://genius.com/3015117", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "My Rolls Royce spray cologne, the fragrance money", "vault_lines": ["My Rolls Royce spray cologne, the fragrance money"], "meaning": "New Luxury cars have the ability to automatically spray perfume in the interior.\nWe don’t need long to guess which fragrance Diddy prefers.", "annotation_id": "3007817", "url": "https://genius.com/3007817", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "My bitches get the Birkin, nigga, they hold the weapons", "vault_lines": ["My bitches get the Birkin, nigga, they hold the weapons"], "meaning": "Ross continues the theme of materialism described in the previous line by adding that, as well as designer shoes, he also gifts his women luxury Birkin handbags.\n\nThey are a line of leather bags made by Hermès, named after English actress-singer Jane Birkin. The bags are considered a symbol of wealth due to their high price and usage by celebrities.\n\n\n\nSome come in relatively large sizes, particularly given that they are “handbags” (i.e., this one carried by Kim Kardashian in 2014) and thus are able to conceal guns (“hold the weapons”).", "annotation_id": "3001135", "url": "https://genius.com/3001135", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "These ratchet bitches love a nigga so cuff your chick in", "vault_lines": ["These ratchet bitches love a nigga so cuff your chick in"], "meaning": "Should be “cuff your chick in”\n\nReference to R. Kelly’s song “I’m A Flirt” and Kid Ink or Bow Wow’s “Cuff Yo Chick”\n\nHe is warning other men that “ratchet bitches” love him, so you better keep an eye/leash on them.", "annotation_id": "3001040", "url": "https://genius.com/3001040", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "More ’80s than the ’80s, nigga, I’m Money Mitchin", "vault_lines": ["More '80s than the '80s, nigga, I'm Money Mitchin"], "meaning": "Paid In Full was a 2002 about some drug dealers in 80s Harlem that built an empire. One of the characters is named Mitch.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Z-jIoSEyb4#t=27\n\nAlso this is the first single off Diddy’s new album, MMM: Money Makin Mitch", "annotation_id": "2988287", "url": "https://genius.com/2988287", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
