{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "I be calling all the shots, I’m big homie Big homie, big homie, big homie, big homie Boy, you’se a little nigga; Gary Coleman I be calling all the shots, I’m big homie", "vault_lines": ["Boy, you'se a little nigga; Gary Coleman", "I be calling all the shots, I'm big homie", "Big homie, big homie, big homie, big homie"], "meaning": "P. Diddy is the Big Homie meaning he is the leader, adviser, boss etc. that everyone goes to for advice and help. He calls the shots as in what he and his clique will do. Nothing will ever happen without P. Diddy’s permission.\n\n\n\n Gary Coleman is an actor who is well known for being on the short-side at 4 foot 8 inches, its hard to consider him a “Big Homie.”", "annotation_id": "2987775", "url": "https://genius.com/2987775", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "It’s Bad Boy Records, bitch, you know I run it", "vault_lines": ["It's Bad Boy Records, bitch, you know I run it"], "meaning": "Bad Boy Records is Sean’s record label founded in 1993, their label’s first release was “Flava in Ya' Ear”.\n\n\n\nHere is the original Bad Boy Family.", "annotation_id": "2986300", "url": "https://genius.com/2986300", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "That pussy got a paper tag and it’s a hundred", "vault_lines": ["That pussy got a paper tag and it's a hundred"], "meaning": "This bitch ain’t cheap. You better not try to get with her unless you stacking. I ain’t sayin' she a gold digger.", "annotation_id": "2854999", "url": "https://genius.com/2854999", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "Boy, you’se a little nigga; Gary Coleman", "vault_lines": ["Boy, you'se a little nigga; Gary Coleman"], "meaning": "Gary Coleman was an actor who made a name as a child in the 70s and 80s show Diff'rent Strokes. Gary played Arnold Jackson\n\nhttp://youtu.be/jZ9LWSUEeEw\n\nThe dude was also really short. At his tallest, he was only 4'8\"", "annotation_id": "2854975", "url": "https://genius.com/2854975", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
