{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "See us out here racing yachts like ‘’Fuck the police’’ Bugatti swerving lane to lane, we gettin’ money", "vault_lines": ["See us out here racing yachts like ''Fuck the police''", "Bugatti swerving lane to lane, we gettin' money"], "meaning": "People think Jigga loves luxury raps.. Diddy takes it to a whole new level!\n\nRacing Yachts? Maybe he’s inspired by 2 Chainz and wanted to be a little different…", "annotation_id": "2854787", "url": "https://genius.com/2854787", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Homie", "line": "The only one that’s topping Forbes, I’m gettin’ lonely", "vault_lines": ["The only one that's topping Forbes, I'm gettin' lonely"], "meaning": "With a net worth of whopping $700 Million Diddy tops the list of the richest rappers – and he been topping it!\n\n\nForbes Hip-Hop’s Wealthiest Artists – 2011\nForbes Hip-Hop’s Wealthiest Artists – 2012\nForbes Hip-Hop’s Wealthiest Artists – 2013\n\n\n\nYO, DIDDY EATIN'!", "annotation_id": "2854684", "url": "https://genius.com/2854684", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
