{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Talk", "line": "And for this life, I’mma give thanks and pray they never gon’ burn a witch at the stake", "vault_lines": ["And for this life, I'ma give thanks and pray they never gon' burn a witch at the stake"], "meaning": "Azealia feels thankful about her life and all of her personal blessings. But she is aware that maybe people are going to feel like they have to burn her, like people did in the past with witches or any other woman someone didn’t like.", "annotation_id": "9282686", "url": "https://genius.com/9282686", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
