{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Talk", "line": "Got a double M on that pendant", "vault_lines": [", got a double M on that pendant"], "meaning": "Rick Ross’s signature look is his extravagent pendants on his chains, one of them being two ’M’s\n\n\n\nThe two ’M’s stand for Mayback Music, which is a record label founded by Rick Ross. It is also referenced in the beginning of the song.", "annotation_id": "8918818", "url": "https://genius.com/8918818", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Talk", "line": "Ice box for my princess", "vault_lines": ["Ice box for my princess"], "meaning": "A reference to Azealia Banks’s song “Ice Princess” from her debut album Broke With Expensive Taste. The song was released as the fourth single, and it was critically acclaimed.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/xGox2wVCLuw\n\nIn this line, Rick Ross is calling Azealia Banks his princess.", "annotation_id": "8918738", "url": "https://genius.com/8918738", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Big Talk", "line": "Y’all know y’all seen that Playboy cover", "vault_lines": ["Y'all know y'all seen that Playboy cover"], "meaning": "Azealia Banks was on the cover of Playboy’s April 2015 issue.\n\n\n\nPlayboy is an American pornographic magazine that has a main audience of straight men. As expected of all cover-models, Azealia Banks had a few nude photos of her own in the cat-themed photoshoot. The hot-pink sets included a large ball of yarn, a swimming pool full of milk, and two black cats as props.\n\n\n\nRick Ross assumes that the listener has seen more than the cover of Playboy, because who wouldn’t want to see a nude Azealia Banks?\n\nExplicit photos not included", "annotation_id": "8918669", "url": "https://genius.com/8918669", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
