{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Biggest Freak", "line": "White tees, no bra (Ugh)", "vault_lines": ["Got the fattest box, white tees, no bra (Ugh)"], "meaning": "She rocks white tee-shirts, not wearing a bra.\n\n\n\nThe most relevant picture of Nicki I can find.\n\nThe look of a white T-shirt with no bra is popular with women (and men…)\n\nModelled by Christina Aguilera\n\n\n\nModelled by Miley Cyrus\n\n\n\nModelled by Emma Watson", "annotation_id": "1113969", "url": "https://genius.com/1113969", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
