{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bill Gates", "line": "Bond out my dogs, quarter million on a new appeal", "vault_lines": ["Bond out my dogs, quarter million on a new appeal"], "meaning": "On June 10, 2015 Rick Ross was arrested in Georgia for possesion of marijuana after being pulled over due to illegal window tints. After posting a $2,400 bond, he was free to leave the next day. In true boss fashion, he also paid the bond for a couple of inmates he met during his overnight stay.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/rickyrozay/status/609016985398038528", "annotation_id": "11264525", "url": "https://genius.com/11264525", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
