{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Birthday", "line": "Yeah I’m still havin’ those", "vault_lines": ["yeah I'm still havin' those"], "meaning": "Rozay is referring to two things here :\n\n\nMeek Mill’s album, Dreams and Nightmares\nHe is still having dreams and nightmares – He is still alive.\n\n\n\nWhich is quite surprising due to his recent seizures which had him in hospital.\n\n\n\nHad a couple seizures, call it minor setbacks\nEverybody prayin' for me, I respect that\nWoke up in the hospital, where my checks at", "annotation_id": "1982399", "url": "https://genius.com/1982399", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Birthday", "line": "Psalm 27, can I spit a verse", "vault_lines": ["Psalm 27, can I spit a verse"], "meaning": "Of David. The LORD is my light and my salvation– whom shall I fear? The LORD is the stronghold of my life– of whom shall I be afraid\n\n\n\nA great play on the word verse from Rozay here.", "annotation_id": "1982385", "url": "https://genius.com/1982385", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Birthday", "line": "Laguna Beach (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["Heavy jewelry, swimmin' trunks on Laguna Beach (Huh)"], "meaning": "Laguna Beach is a seaside resort city and artist community located in southern Orange County, California, United States, approximately 19 miles (31 km) southeast of the county seat of Santa Ana. Its population was 22,723 at the 2010 census.", "annotation_id": "1128919", "url": "https://genius.com/1128919", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Birthday", "line": "Time to get the money Steve Forbes got I’m slowly climbin’ up to Lyor spot (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["Time to get the money Steve Forbes got"], "meaning": "Steve Forbes owns the business magazine Forbes and Ross is increasing his wealth and getting to the level of Lyor Cohen who is the CEO of Warner Music Group.", "annotation_id": "1125156", "url": "https://genius.com/1125156", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
