{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Birthday Cake (Remix)", "line": "Had a house party, white girl’s sniffin’ paint (Paint)", "vault_lines": ["Had a house party, white girl's sniffin' paint (Paint)"], "meaning": "Paint is an inhalant and you can get high off of it. It blocks oxygen from getting to your brain, thus giving you the sensation of being high.\n\n\n\nThese white girls could care less about the consequences and are enjoying the time by sniffing paint.", "annotation_id": "4362011", "url": "https://genius.com/4362011", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Birthday Cake (Remix)", "line": "Twenty thousand in attendance while I’m smokin’ on the sage (Uh)", "vault_lines": ["Twenty thousand in attendance while I'm smokin' on the sage (Uh)"], "meaning": "The O2 arena holds exactly 20,000 people maximum. Rick Ross happened to achieve the maximum attendance from his fans for a show he was doing in London. On top of that he’s smoking on stage where in the U.K. its illegal and a felony to be caught smoking weed. Rick Ross stays bossing up!", "annotation_id": "4361987", "url": "https://genius.com/4361987", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
