{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Black Magic", "line": "Could you cop that? Not that", "vault_lines": ["Could you cop that? Not that"], "meaning": "Meek could be referencing rocks to cocaine in the line above instead of diamonds in a watch. Hence this line saying “stop that, could you cop that? not that” meaning could you stop, like a cop, the drug trafficing, but also has a double meaning of ‘copping’ or buying the icy watch mentioned above.", "annotation_id": "908841", "url": "https://genius.com/908841", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
