{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Black Magic", "line": "(Poof!) There go the car (Poof!) There go the crib (Poof!) A hundred mil (Whoop!) David Copperfield", "vault_lines": ["(Poof!) A hundred mil (Whoop!) David Copperfield"], "meaning": "David Copperfield is a famous illusionist who is best-known for making objects (up to and including the Statue of Liberty) seem to disappear.  Here, Ross compares his ability to make (and spend) money rapidly to these tricks", "annotation_id": "862013", "url": "https://genius.com/862013", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Black Magic", "line": "Did everything that she ’posed I pulled my camera out and she posed", "vault_lines": ["Did everything that she 'posed", "I pulled my camera out and she posed"], "meaning": "A rare bit of wordplay here – Meek uses the homophone here of “posed” and “‘posed”, as in the last syllable of “supposed”", "annotation_id": "862001", "url": "https://genius.com/862001", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Black Magic", "line": "Nigga, you hating on me, she chose And I ain’t fuck your girl, she rode", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, you hating on me, she chose", "And I ain't fuck your girl, she rode"], "meaning": "The “your bitch chose me” meme was most memorably expressed in this scene from the 1973 movie The Mack:\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rkgz1FR9TO4#t=1m19s", "annotation_id": "861985", "url": "https://genius.com/861985", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
