{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Blood Stain 2", "line": "They keep fighting with me like Blueface girl", "vault_lines": ["They keep fighting with me like Blueface girl"], "meaning": "Makes a nod to Chrisean Rock the ex-girlfriend of Blueface. The two have been known to fight with each other constantly which is seemingly why they split up in October of 2022.", "annotation_id": "28049467", "url": "https://genius.com/28049467", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Blood Stain 2", "line": "My parents had bricks like Terrence in Virginia", "vault_lines": ["My parents had bricks like Terrence in Virginia"], "meaning": "Pusha T, whose real name is Terrence Thornton comes from Virginia Beach, Virginia where he was known for pushing bricks of cocaine – the most common topic rapped about in his and Clipse’s records.\n\nThe line also references how Pusha has a son named Nigel Brixx Thornton with his wife Virginia Williams.\n\n\n[Pusha T with his wife Virginia and son Nigel]", "annotation_id": "28049440", "url": "https://genius.com/28049440", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Blood Stain 2", "status": "done", "targets": 3, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Consequence-blood-stain-2-lyrics", "genius_title": "Blood Stain 2", "genius_id": 8883326, "source": "api"}
