{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Body to Body (Remix)", "line": "Ayo, baby (Woah) Tell your friends (Woah, oh) To get with my friends (Woah, oh) And we can be friends (Uh) (J.U.S.T.I.C.E. League, J.U.S.T.I.C.E. League) This the remix", "vault_lines": ["And we can be friends (Uh)"], "meaning": "DJ Khaled throwing back to Diddy’s (then “Puffy”) outro on Big Poppa:\n\nHoney, check it\nTell your friends to get with my friends\nAnd we can be friends\nShit, we can do this every weekend, aight?\nIs that aight with you?\nYeah….keep bangin'", "annotation_id": "3202057", "url": "https://genius.com/3202057", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Body to Body (Remix)", "line": "If Heaven had a height, then you would be that tall, but", "vault_lines": ["If Heaven had a height, then you would be that tall, but"], "meaning": "From Common’s “The Light”:\n\nIf heaven had a height, you would be that tall\nGhetto to coffee shop, through you I see that all", "annotation_id": "1079347", "url": "https://genius.com/1079347", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Body to Body (Remix)", "line": "My Penn Stated, I ain’t lyin’ Shout out Mr. Paterno", "vault_lines": ["My Penn Stated, I ain't lyin'", "Shout out Mr. Paterno"], "meaning": "He references the Penn State scandal in which, the late, Joe Paterno, who was the head football coach of Penn State was involved in. He assures us that like Joe Pa he is not lying.", "annotation_id": "554508", "url": "https://genius.com/554508", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
