{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bottles", "line": "All the bottles of gold, 2-3 cases a week", "vault_lines": ["All the bottles of gold, 2-3 cases a week"], "meaning": "The Boss only drink the gold champagne Ace Of Spade – a sign of the lavish lifestyle – he can even afford 2-3 cases a week!\nAlso a connection to the previous line, since the golden bottles are one of Jay Z’s favorites too:", "annotation_id": "2268105", "url": "https://genius.com/2268105", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bottles", "line": "Might bump into Hov, she speaking to B", "vault_lines": ["Might bump into Hov, she speaking to B"], "meaning": "Royaz lives the lavish style with all the big stars like Jay Z (hov) and his wife Beyoncé.\n\n\n\nRick Ross and Hov have collaborated on a couple of songs to get:\n“Hustlin' Remix”\n“Maybach Music”\n“Free Mason,”\n“3 Kings”\nand lately on Hov’s “FuckWithMeYouKnowIGotIt”", "annotation_id": "2268087", "url": "https://genius.com/2268087", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Bottles", "line": "I fit the description, baby, just look at my car", "vault_lines": ["I fit the description, baby, just look at my car"], "meaning": "Rozay, the big boss, is indeed a baller – and if you have doubts, just look a his car, or should we say cars:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIt’s not for nothing his record label is called Maybach Music…", "annotation_id": "2268073", "url": "https://genius.com/2268073", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
