{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "Pussy nigga wanna see you fall", "vault_lines": ["Pussy nigga wanna see you fall"], "meaning": "Not everyone is happy for your success and fortune. Some envy and some outright want to see you lose. In the words of the Notorious B.I.G. and DMC, they ‘pray on my downfall’. https://genius.com/82905", "annotation_id": "19363575", "url": "https://genius.com/19363575", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "J-Ville I went and bought a condo", "vault_lines": ["J-Ville I went and bought a condo"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is referring to Jacksonville, Fl where he has a condo. The music video was filmed in Jacksonville.", "annotation_id": "17222889", "url": "https://genius.com/17222889", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "Back to the crib where I get it by the car load", "vault_lines": ["Back to the crib where I get it by the car load"], "meaning": "Rozay Re-Ups at his stash spots – check his apperance on MTV CRIBS for more on Boss Housing.\n\n\n\nThere might not be millions in the ceiling, but Rozay has a closet full of snacks.", "annotation_id": "1537791", "url": "https://genius.com/1537791", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "I made a killing milkin Okeechobee", "vault_lines": ["I made a killing milkin Okeechobee"], "meaning": "This refers to a region of Florida known as Lake Okeechobee. Ross is reiterating the point that his coke is distributed throughout Florida. Apparently he made alot of money in the Lake Okeechobee region. He could also be referencing the casinos out on Okechobee.", "annotation_id": "1459489", "url": "https://genius.com/1459489", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "I took a quarter Key to Polk county All my central Florida nigga straight ’bout it Broke down the brick I’m back in Bartow Belle Glade box Chevy on my car phone", "vault_lines": ["I took a quarter Key to Polk county", "All my central Florida nigga straight 'bout it", "Broke down the brick I'm back in Bartow", "Belle Glade box Chevy on my car phone"], "meaning": "Polk County is located right in the middle of Florida, Bartow is it’s county seat. Ross' coke is apparently everywhere!\n\nBelle Glade is a city in Palm Beach County, Florida on the southeastern shore of Lake Okeechobee. Belle Glade (and the surrounding area) is sometimes referred to as “Muck City” due to the large quantity of muck. Despite being located in the South Florida region of the state, Belle Glade is culturally more associated with the Florida Heartland.\n\nThis refers back to the fact that Ross' cocaine is distrbuted throughout Florida – from the South (Miami), to the Middle (Belle Glade), to the North (Jacksonville).\n\nAlso note the great alliteration in the last couple lines with the letter B.", "annotation_id": "1447886", "url": "https://genius.com/1447886", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "Pop a molly now that bitch sweatin’", "vault_lines": ["Pop a molly now that bitch sweatin'"], "meaning": "A reference to Trinidad James' ultra catchy line.\n\n\n\nTrindad James was also a featured guest during the MMG Tour.", "annotation_id": "1444910", "url": "https://genius.com/1444910", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "I heard the same pussy niggas hatin’", "vault_lines": ["I heard the same pussy niggas hatin'"], "meaning": "Perhaps a diss to 50 Cent, Ross' rival since 2009. Fif and Rozay’s right hand man GUNPLAY got into a scuffle at the BET Awards, in which 50 stole Gunplay’s chain. 50 would later feature that same chain in a music video, something he denies.\n\n\n\nThis might also be a reference to Young Jeezy, another one of Ross' rivals. They’ve beefed since 2010, and also got into a shoving match at the BET Awards, in which Ross claims he tried to choke Jeezy. Jeezy has recently taken shots at Ross.\n\n\n\nThis could also be a reference to hip-hop fans who dislike him, period. It’s all the same people that him him – pussies!", "annotation_id": "1444893", "url": "https://genius.com/1444893", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "I went and got my bitch her very own salon Get her hair do everyday do the fuck she want", "vault_lines": ["I went and got my bitch her very own salon", "Get her hair do everyday do the fuck she want"], "meaning": "Ross bought Shateria a salon in order for to be able to do her hair whenever she wants. This also could be a reference to Shateria’s clothing line, Front Row Couture.", "annotation_id": "1444882", "url": "https://genius.com/1444882", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "My bitch stay down with me So now she got the new Lexus", "vault_lines": ["My bitch stay down with me", "So now she got the new Lexus"], "meaning": "Shateria Morange-El, Ross' girlfriend, has stuck with him through the good and bad times, so Ross has rewarded her by buying her a Lexus.", "annotation_id": "1444872", "url": "https://genius.com/1444872", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "I started with a box Chevy Then I got the blue Lexus", "vault_lines": ["Then I got the blue Lexus"], "meaning": "Rozay started off driving a Chevy Caprice, which isn’t very expensive.\n\n\n\nAfter getting paid, Ross upgraded to a blue Lexus, which is a lot more expensive.\n\n\n\nThis is Ross' way of saying “started from the bottom now I’m here”. https://twitter.com/rickyrozay/status/294898519582576641", "annotation_id": "1444864", "url": "https://genius.com/1444864", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "I smell a pussy from a block away", "vault_lines": ["I smell a pussy from a block away"], "meaning": "This could be a shot at rival 50 Cent, as his group G-Unit once had a song titled “I Smell Pussy”.", "annotation_id": "1444837", "url": "https://genius.com/1444837", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Box Chevy", "line": "[Skit] Go on jump No I don’t wanna jump Yes you do. You smoke crack don’t you? You smoke crack don’t you? Look at me boy, don’t you smoke crack? Yes, sir You know what that does to you? Huh? No, sir It kills your brain cells son, it kills your brain cells! Now when you’re destroying your brain cells you are doing the same thing as killing yourself, you are just doing it slower. I say if you wanna kill yourself don’t fuck around with it, do it expeditiously. Now go on and jump! Jump!", "vault_lines": ["You know what that does to you? Huh?"], "meaning": "A skit in which Joe Clark talks about crack with Thomas Sams, from the 1989 film Lean on Me. http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uJ1hKtYOx_c#t=03s", "annotation_id": "1444819", "url": "https://genius.com/1444819", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
