{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Boy Outta Here", "line": "Got a Benz and you’re staying with your mama (Boy outta here)", "vault_lines": ["Got a Benz and you're staying with your mama (Boy outta here)"], "meaning": "Ciara has noted that you own a Mercedes Benz but you live with your Mother. She presumes that this means you have your life priorities all out of wack.", "annotation_id": "2025290", "url": "https://genius.com/2025290", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
