{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Boy Outta Here", "line": "I’m looking for someone that ain’t afraid to be a man I’m talking full grown, it ain’t all about them pockets I need someone that can steal my heart and lock it", "vault_lines": ["I'm looking for someone that ain't afraid to be a man", "I'm talking full grown, it ain't all about them pockets", "I need someone that can steal my heart and lock it"], "meaning": "Ciara is not interested in men who act like children\nCiara is not interested in men who only talk about all the money they have\nCiara is interested in men who are romantic and appeal to her heart", "annotation_id": "2025284", "url": "https://genius.com/2025284", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
