{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Brand New", "line": "I’m in the ’08 Escalade, with brand new Gucci shades", "vault_lines": ["I'm in the '08 Escalade, with brand new Gucci shades"], "meaning": "At the time this song was recorded (2007), the 2008 Cadillac Escalade was the new vehicle that everybody would love to have.\n\n\n\nSnoop also has on Gucci Shades. They are usually valued at around $300-$500.", "annotation_id": "3253319", "url": "https://genius.com/3253319", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
