{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Brimstone", "line": "Age fifteen, so the caged bird sings", "vault_lines": ["Age fifteen, so the caged bird sings"], "meaning": "Ross can have 3 meanings to this verse:\n1- He can be talking about at the age of 15 it was his first time seeing or chasing a brick of cocaine (birds)\n2- It can be his first time feeling the power of God by his side and the Angels are singing to him\n3- This can be his first time being locked up in jail or penitentiary and he can here the inmates scream and fuss over freedom", "annotation_id": "4475339", "url": "https://genius.com/4475339", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Brimstone", "line": "I remember hard times, always found a way to smile It was quiet, Christmas time, no pretty lights around the house", "vault_lines": ["I remember hard times, always found a way to smile", "It was quiet, Christmas time, no pretty lights around the house"], "meaning": "From when he was young, Rick never had it easy. Christmas time is something he remembers because he expected to receive gifts and have bright and pretty lights decorated around his house, but his parents never made that happen, because they couldn’t afford that, but that didn’t stop Rick from being happy.", "annotation_id": "4395480", "url": "https://genius.com/4395480", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Brimstone", "line": "I say Lord, Lord, Lord, Lord, Lord I pray I don’t be here (Uh) When it all goes down When it all goes down (God is so good) I say Lord, Lord, Lord, Lord, Lord (This shit gets so real) I pray I don’t be here When it all goes down When it all goes down There’ll be hard times, and then some Fire (Huh) and brimstone Devil world from which you came I pray that God will know my name There’ll be hard times, and then some Fire, and brimstone (Huh) Devil world from which you came (From which you came) I pray that God will know my name I say Lord, Lord, Lord, Lord, Lord Lord, Lord, Lord, Lord", "vault_lines": ["I pray I don't be here (Uh)", "When it all goes down", "There'll be hard times, and then some", "Fire (Huh) and brimstone", "Devil world from which you came", "I pray that God will know my name", "Lord, Lord, Lord, Lord"], "meaning": "Krit prays he  doesn’t see the end of times; when hell breaks loose on earth. The concept is explored in the Book of Revelations:\n\nBut the fearful, and unbelieving, and the abominable, and murderers, and whoremongers, and sorcerers, and idolaters, and all liars, shall have their part in the lake which burneth with fire and brimstone: which is the second death.", "annotation_id": "4394610", "url": "https://genius.com/4394610", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Brimstone", "line": "Mama need a spouse, Daddy always in and out", "vault_lines": ["Mama need a spouse, Daddy always in and out"], "meaning": "Rozay’s father was always going in and out of jail making it difficult for his mother to have a significant other by her side. Rozay is implying that his mother needs someone other than himself that is going to love and care for her so she can finally be in a settled relationship.", "annotation_id": "4394439", "url": "https://genius.com/4394439", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
