{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Brown Paper Bag", "line": "Just got a hundred of that brown paper bag money", "vault_lines": ["Just got a hundred of that brown paper bag money"], "meaning": "“Brown paper bag money” is another way of saying money acquired via selling drugs. The cash one gets from selling cocaine can’t be deposited into a bank account, so it gets kept in cash until it’s spent, presumably in brown paper bags. Jeezy’s got $100,000 of it.", "annotation_id": "11232265", "url": "https://genius.com/11232265", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Brown Paper Bag", "line": "And understand I been in that water like I was snorklin’ Understand I been in that water like I’m a dolphin", "vault_lines": ["And understand I been in that water like I was snorklin'", "Understand I been in that water like I'm a dolphin"], "meaning": "Referring to when his city of New Orleans went under water (after Hurricane Katrina).\n\n\n\nYes, those are houses.\n\nAlso refuting claims that Weezy’s a poser and wasn’t really ‘bout that life before becoming famous. He’s dismissing the haters who think he didn’t really have hardships in the 17th ward of N.O. and those who call into question his gang affiliation.", "annotation_id": "1015207", "url": "https://genius.com/1015207", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Brown Paper Bag", "line": "Philly blunt cigar scent", "vault_lines": ["Lamborghini dark tint, Philly blunt cigar scent"], "meaning": "Phillies is a brand of American-made cigars. These inexpensive cigars are known for their tough wrappers… so several people empty and re-roll them with other smoking mixtures (i.e. marajuana)", "annotation_id": "141971", "url": "https://genius.com/141971", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Brown Paper Bag", "line": "It feels good to be Young Money, Cash Money", "vault_lines": ["It feels good to be Young Money, Cash Money"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne is shouting out his collective, Young Money Entertainment, and also promoting the record label to which he and his collective are signed, Cash Money Records.", "annotation_id": "100213", "url": "https://genius.com/100213", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
