{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Burn (Remix)", "line": "[Verse 2: Lil Wayne] Hammer on the dresser, work on the stove I’m sitting on the counter blowing purp out my nose Red bone naked, in the bed flexin’ I say bitch I ain’t impressed you must of got the wrong impression I ain’t with the BS, I’m flyer than PF Man, we living in hell like a deep breath Real niggas with real money, real bitches with fake asses If she don’t wanna fuck I get on my skateboard and I skate passed her Money on the table, guns on the table Bitch I’m on that syrup tell that ho leggo my Eggo And my girlfriend is a choppa, I finger fuck that ho Hello I am Tunechi: you had me at hello Drop top Maybach, clean like Ajax Man I don’t fuck with none of you niggas like rednecks We got that work so come and get if we don’t know you, you pay tax I put a hole in your apple what that is apple jacks, uh Pussy nigga I’ll murder you then dance at your funeral Blood I’ll have a nigga drinking his own blood communion Wake up like Bone Thugs I’ll call your bluff pick the phone up Her titties fake but they look real cubic: zirconia’s Run up in your house spare the kids and kill the grown ups Your bitch call me when she hot: Krispy Kreme donuts Shoutout to my new hoes, shoutout to my old hoes I still wear that ass out like a wardrobe Bitch, what they gonna say? Still eating rappers on my fucking lunch break Bad yellow bitch with a tongue like a snake I let her suck my dick then I fuck her to some Drake And then I let that kush burn let that kush burn Yeah I let that kush burn Smoking gasoline bitch", "vault_lines": ["Hammer on the dresser, work on the stove", "I'm sitting on the counter blowing purp out my nose", "Red bone naked, in the bed flexin'", "I say bitch I ain't impressed you must of got the wrong impression", "I ain't with the BS, I'm flyer than PF", "Man, we living in hell like a deep breath", "Real niggas with real money, real bitches with fake asses", "If she don't wanna fuck I get on my skateboard and I skate passed her"], "meaning": "This is identical to the first verse of Lil Wayne’s take on Burn found on his Dedication 4 mixtape.", "annotation_id": "1131058", "url": "https://genius.com/1131058", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Burn (Remix)", "line": "Chain all V.S. I ain’t with the B.S Catch me in your city riding hard through the B.X Skinny nigga but I do it Large like a 3X The last nigga try it...", "vault_lines": ["Chain all V.S. I ain't with the B.S", "Catch me in your city riding hard through the B.X", "Skinny nigga but I do it Large like a 3X", "The last nigga try it..."], "meaning": "The beginning of Meek’s verse from the original.", "annotation_id": "1131042", "url": "https://genius.com/1131042", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Burn (Remix)", "line": "Every night is a feast, niggas be having beef I teach me a young boy, call him my Chief Keef", "vault_lines": ["Every night is a feast, niggas be having beef", "I teach me a young boy, call him my Chief Keef"], "meaning": "Reference to the Chief Keef twitter beef with Lupe Fiasco. Ross uses a double entendre here with the word “beef”. He uses “beef” to explain that when you are as wealthy as he is, you eat a feast of beef every night. His use of “beef” also represents the beef between Chief Keef and the rap genius himself.", "annotation_id": "1129785", "url": "https://genius.com/1129785", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Burn (Remix)", "line": "Bumping Maze in the Porsche", "vault_lines": ["Amazed by mama boy, bumping Maze in the Porsche"], "meaning": "Frankie Beverly and Maze was a popular r&b/quiet storm band who released their debut album in 1977\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UxLHZZRnB10", "annotation_id": "1129751", "url": "https://genius.com/1129751", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
