{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Can A Drummer Get Some", "line": "Back from the dead but they never found my killer So I jumped up out the grave like Michael Jackson in Thriller", "vault_lines": ["So I jumped up out the grave like Michael Jackson in Thriller"], "meaning": "In Michael Jackson’s classic music video “Thriller” Michael is a zombie\n\n\n\nAlso referring to how Michael, sadly, died.", "annotation_id": "102325", "url": "https://genius.com/102325", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
