{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Can’t Say No", "line": "Never run from your past still photobombing your selfie", "vault_lines": ["Never run from your past still photobombing your selfie"], "meaning": "Rick gives life advice by saying “never run from your past”. This may be a reference to his confession of actually being a correctional officer, despite his previous denial of the accusation. Photobombing a selfie is the act of spoiling a photograph by unexpectedly appearing in the camera’s field of view as the picture is taken, typically as a prank or practical joke. Rick metaphorically references this to solidify his life advice.", "annotation_id": "8370956", "url": "https://genius.com/8370956", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Can’t Say No", "line": "Even though I try, I can’t let go Thoughts of you and I still kill me slow And every night I feel you in my dreams You’re all I know, I can’t let go", "vault_lines": ["Even though I try", "You're all I know, I can't let go"], "meaning": "The hook directly samples the chorus of Mariah Carey’s classic hit, Can’t Let Go, from 1991.", "annotation_id": "8369238", "url": "https://genius.com/8369238", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
