{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cash Flow", "line": "You untouchable", "vault_lines": ["You M.O.B, now, nigga, you untouchable"], "meaning": "MMG (Rick Ross' label, Maybach Music Group) refer to themselves as untouchable because of their elite status in the rap world. He’s extending this title to Ace Hood.", "annotation_id": "2294419", "url": "https://genius.com/2294419", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cash Flow", "line": "Cartel, so she gotta suck four dicks", "vault_lines": ["Cartel, so she gotta suck four dicks"], "meaning": "The girl has to ‘service’ all four men Rick’s rap group the Carol City Cartel better known as the Triple C’s. Consisting of:\n\nRicky Ross\nGunplay\nTorch\nYoung Breed", "annotation_id": "357474", "url": "https://genius.com/357474", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cash Flow", "line": "I’ma make them come and hit me with the RICO", "vault_lines": ["I'ma make them come and hit me with the RICO"], "meaning": "His parents are not able to make money so he goes out and gets money the illegal way. So if the FBI wants to stop him, they have to arrest him and charge him according to the RICO law. A method often used against the mafia and drug kingpins.\n\nRICO stands for: Racketeer Influenced and Corrupt Organizations Act", "annotation_id": "75153", "url": "https://genius.com/75153", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cash Flow", "line": "Hey, we go by The Runners... just in case you forgot We did it again...", "vault_lines": ["Hey, we go by The Runners... just in case you forgot", "We did it again..."], "meaning": "The Runners are a production duo from Orlando, Florida, that produced this song, as well as many other DJ Khaled and Rick Ross hits like “Hustlin” “Speedin” “I’m So Hood” “Out Here Grinding” “Fed Up” and the Ace Hood single “Overtime”", "annotation_id": "72876", "url": "https://genius.com/72876", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cash Flow", "line": "We the best Def Jam", "vault_lines": ["We the best Def Jam"], "meaning": "We The Best and Def Jam are both Ace Hood’s labels.\n\nThis song is his debut single of his first album since his affiliation so he is joined by label-mate and president, Rick Ross and DJ Khaled respictively.", "annotation_id": "71903", "url": "https://genius.com/71903", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
