{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cassette Deck", "line": "Ain’t got a pimp cup but I got a sip cup Doubled up muddy, full of that purple stuff", "vault_lines": ["Doubled up muddy, full of that purple stuff"], "meaning": "Everybody knows that Houston rappers are loving the purple drank in a styrofoam double cup to keep the drink cold.", "annotation_id": "4241982", "url": "https://genius.com/4241982", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cassette Deck", "line": "But jazzy yella boppers that you just met", "vault_lines": ["But jazzy yella boppers that you just met"], "meaning": "The word “yella” refers to yellow bones.\nA Yellow Bone is the lightest type of light skinned black female. They can often be very rare to see in comparison to other blacks because there are not as many of them in the general black population. They are usually mixed with white, something similar, of multiple races including black, or may just have another race mixed into their family tree which causes them to be very very light. Their skin usually has a yellow-tan, yellowish-red, or yellowish(almost Caucasian- white) look to it.They usually have hair texture ranging from the typical black female hair texture to natural tight curls, loose curls, wavy, or even Caucasion-white looking hair textures. They are can many times have lighter hair and eyes. Many mixed, multiracial, and bi-racial females are often called Yellow Boned in the black community due to them fitting this description. Many times a light skinned black can be considered to be both Yellow Boned and Red Boned if she is light enough to be Yellow Boned but still can fall into a tan or reddish complexion category. So a lot of Yellow Bones can also be considered to be Red Bones but not many Red Bones can be considered Yellow Boned. ( yes this can sound complicated if your not familiar to it) They can often even look some what like Spanish females but they ARE black.\n\nAlso, “boppers” are hoes that like to suck a lot of cock. So there are nice yellow bones sucking on his dick.", "annotation_id": "2088214", "url": "https://genius.com/2088214", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cassette Deck", "line": "I ain’t..it’s something real Someone feel the.. Pimp C in my cassette deck I ain’t..that’s something real Pimp C in my cassette deck Someone feel..", "vault_lines": ["I ain't..it's something real", "I ain't..that's something real", "Pimp C in my cassette deck"], "meaning": "Trillness is a universal concept:\n\nTrill living is a state of mind more than anything else. A McDonalds employee can live a trill life – you don’t have to pour up and grip wood grains (even though that stuff is quite trill).\n\nTrill is confidence, trill is realness, BE TRUE TO YOURSELF AND REAL WITH ALL.\n\nBumping Pimp C in a cassette deck is a great place to start on the path to trillness…\n\n\n\nTrill Guru Pimp C", "annotation_id": "1681985", "url": "https://genius.com/1681985", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cassette Deck", "line": "Bumpin a “Pocket Full of Stones” And you know I’m smoking strong You know my partners put me on", "vault_lines": ["Bumpin a \"Pocket Full of Stones\"", "And you know I'm smoking strong", "You know my partners put me on"], "meaning": "By referencing the UGK song “Pocket Full of Stones,” Rozay lets listeners know that UGK “put him on” as in influenced his music. Rappers can mentor one another without ever having met–music transcends all boundaries.", "annotation_id": "1681956", "url": "https://genius.com/1681956", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cassette Deck", "line": "See, I can’t believe that my nigga Pimp gone", "vault_lines": ["See, I can't believe that my nigga Pimp gone"], "meaning": "Pimp C was found dead in his hotel room in Los Angeles in 2007. According to the Los Angeles County Coroner, he suffered respiratory depression due to an overdose of promethazine and codeine coupled with a preexisting sleep apnea condition.", "annotation_id": "1654442", "url": "https://genius.com/1654442", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cassette Deck", "line": "Better know PA is the town", "vault_lines": ["Better know PA is the town"], "meaning": "Port Arthur is a city in Jefferson County within the Beaumont−Port Arthur Metropolitan Statistical Area of Texas. It was founded by Arthur Stilwell in 1895 and incorporated in 1898. The population was 53,818 at the 2010 census.", "annotation_id": "1654437", "url": "https://genius.com/1654437", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cassette Deck", "line": "This is the life of a jet set", "vault_lines": ["This is the life of a jet set"], "meaning": "Jet set is a term for an international social group of wealthy people who traveled the world to participate in social activities unavailable to ordinary people. It came from the lifestyle of traveling from one stylish or exotic place to another via jet plane.", "annotation_id": "1654426", "url": "https://genius.com/1654426", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cassette Deck", "line": "Hundred thou’ on my neck, pay cash, no check", "vault_lines": ["Hundred thou' on my neck, pay cash, no check"], "meaning": "Slim Thug isn’t a stranger to having jewelry worth hundred thousand dollar on his neck, but he’s also letting us know he paid for it cash.\n\nTwo possible scenarios why:\n\n\nHe got his money in the streets and that’s the only way he can pay it\nOr he just does it because he have it and can do it", "annotation_id": "1404477", "url": "https://genius.com/1404477", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cassette Deck", "line": "That Big Moe, that Pimp C, that DJ Screw", "vault_lines": ["That Big Moe, that Pimp C, that DJ Screw"], "meaning": "All three artists passed away at an early age. Big More and Screw were from Huston and Pimp C is from Port Arthur, Texas.", "annotation_id": "1193496", "url": "https://genius.com/1193496", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
