{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Champagne", "line": "I fuck with E-40, that nigga been bout his business We going million for million, OG giving me game", "vault_lines": ["I fuck with E-40, that nigga been bout his business", "We going million for million, OG giving me game"], "meaning": "E-40 is a real OG, he has been in the game for a long time. Matter of fact since the late 80’s and he is 21 studio albums in…\n\nAnd there is no doubt that 40 has been about his business – he  is an entrepreneur and investor who has ventured into other business and investment opportunities. He also own his own record label, his own energy drink label “40 waters”, his own Landy cognac, his own win, ect. etc.\n\nE-40 is a business man earning millions…", "annotation_id": "2537884", "url": "https://genius.com/2537884", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Champagne", "line": "Used to sell drugs like a pharmaceutical Pharmaceutical, pharmace", "vault_lines": ["Used to sell drugs like a pharmaceutical"], "meaning": "Pharmacy is the science and technique of preparing as well as dispensing prescription drugs and medicines.\n\n\n\nE-40 was on the streets of Atlanta selling illegal drugs. It isn’t legal like a pharmacy is, but he sold the same quantity that a pharmacy sells.\n\nIn case you didn’t hear him, he lets you know another 3 times.", "annotation_id": "2537745", "url": "https://genius.com/2537745", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Champagne", "line": "Big firetruck full of them Get that D like Gary Payton", "vault_lines": ["Big firetruck full of them", "Get that D like Gary Payton"], "meaning": "Gary Payton is a Hall of Fame basketball player who played most of his years with the Seattle Supersonics.\n\nHis nickname was Gary “the glove” because of his great hands on defense. He is known as one of the greatest defensive point guards of all time.\n\n\n\nBut, in this case French is talking about the women in the firetruck getting the D.", "annotation_id": "2537721", "url": "https://genius.com/2537721", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Champagne", "line": "My jacket expensive, it’s made out of lizard", "vault_lines": ["My jacket expensive, it’s made out of lizard"], "meaning": "How many lizards do you think would have to be skinned to make Rick Ross a jacket?\n\n\n\nLizards aren’t typically made for clothing, but judging by alligator skin prices..\n\nYOU BEST BELIEVE IT’S EXPENSIVE", "annotation_id": "2537611", "url": "https://genius.com/2537611", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
