{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Champion", "line": "“My Ambitionz Az a Rider” blasting out a niggas whip", "vault_lines": ["\"My Ambitionz Az a Rider\" blasting out a niggas whip"], "meaning": "Ace, a huge 2Pac fan, is listening to 2Pac’s famous hit Ambitionz Az A Rida in his car.", "annotation_id": "1504842", "url": "https://genius.com/1504842", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Champion", "line": "Keep running to The Runners when its time to make a (uhh)", "vault_lines": ["Keep running to The Runners when its time to make a (uhh)"], "meaning": "Anytime Ace needs a beat, he goes to The Runners for one. The Runners is a hip hop production duo from Orlando, Florida, consisting of Andrew “Dru Brett” Harr and Jermaine “Mayne Zayne” Jackson. Instead of finishing this line, The Runners' signature is played instead. Their trade mark includes a bass pattern followed by the sound of “AHHH” signifying a “breath of fresh air.”", "annotation_id": "818441", "url": "https://genius.com/818441", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
