{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Chevy Ridin’ High", "line": "My partner D. Wade, keep a heat jersey on ’em I just tote heat from haters that try to hurt me, homie", "vault_lines": ["My partner D. Wade, keep a heat jersey on 'em", "I just tote heat from haters that try to hurt me, homie"], "meaning": "In streat lingo, heat is a gun, which Dre wears all the time for protection against haters. Dwyane Wade plays for the Miami Heat hence the jersey reference.", "annotation_id": "4357286", "url": "https://genius.com/4357286", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Chevy Ridin’ High", "line": "No black and milds, the blunt filled up", "vault_lines": ["No black and milds, the blunt filled up"], "meaning": "Black & Milds are often used to roll blunts by opening the cigar and taking all of the tobacco out and putting cannabis in it place. Rick Ross isn’t smoking a black & mild he’s smoking a blunt.", "annotation_id": "824811", "url": "https://genius.com/824811", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
