{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Choices (Yup) [Remix]", "line": "Everybody got choices I choose to get money, I’m stuck to this bread Everybody got choices These bitches is choosin’, I’m all in they head Everybody got choices Keep it one-thou’ ’bout the life that I chose Everybody got choices These niggas be hatin’, I already know But I never go broke, no (No, no, no) I’mma stay gettin’ money, yeah (Yeah, yeah, yeah) And I ain’t gotta sell my soul, no (No, no, no) I’mma stay gettin’ money, yeah (Yeah, yeah, yeah) If you broke, you ain’t like me, no (No, no, no) I’mma stay gettin’ money, yeah (Yeah, yeah, yeah) I give a fuck if you don’t like me, no (No, no, no) I’mma stay gettin’ money, yeah (Yeah, yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I choose to get money, I'm stuck to this bread", "These bitches is choosin', I'm all in they head", "Keep it one-thou' 'bout the life that I chose"], "meaning": "This is sampled from the original, check out the annotation from that page here!", "annotation_id": "8081764", "url": "https://genius.com/8081764", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
