{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Choppa Choppa Down (Rick Ross Remix)", "line": "My dawgs rich off white My jewels drip like Ice Now suck my dick all night", "vault_lines": ["My dawgs rich off white", "My jewels drip like Ice", "Now suck my dick all night"], "meaning": "There is a huge demand for this stuff.Rozay and his boys are cashing in.\n\n\n\nNow thats icy.\n\nI think the last line is pretty self-explanatory. Plus, I don’t think I am allowed to put a picture of that.", "annotation_id": "643135", "url": "https://genius.com/643135", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
