{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Clappers (Remix)", "line": "Like we movin’ in, we came with bags", "vault_lines": ["We ain’t throwin' up no ones like we movin' in, we came with bags"], "meaning": "This is quite the double entendre, as it could mean one of two things:\n\nA) Hit-Boy and his other MMG artists came into the strip club with bags of money to spend.\n\nOR\n\nB) He is insisting that the rest of the people in the rap game need to get the fuck out, because him and his crew are here to stay. Thats why they brought “bags”.", "annotation_id": "4224223", "url": "https://genius.com/4224223", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Clappers (Remix)", "line": "Now clap it clap it clap it clap it let’s grab it", "vault_lines": ["Now clap it clap it clap it clap it let’s grab it"], "meaning": "Animated dramatization of what Thug’s looking for:", "annotation_id": "3273718", "url": "https://genius.com/3273718", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Clappers (Remix)", "line": "Gucci bag, Louis trap King of diamonds, DOA", "vault_lines": ["Gucci bag, Louis trap", "King of diamonds, DOA"], "meaning": "Fat Trel has a Gucci Bag with bunch of money. Fat trel is going to throw it at the strippers thus explaining why he mentions King of Diamonds and DOA (Diamonds Of Atlanta); these are arguably the most popular strip clubs in the United States.", "annotation_id": "3160614", "url": "https://genius.com/3160614", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Clappers (Remix)", "line": "Walkin’ round my new estate like I’m the king of Zaire", "vault_lines": ["Walkin' round my new estate like I’m the king of Zaire"], "meaning": "Walking around his house like he is the King of Zaire, a country in central Africa.", "annotation_id": "2976706", "url": "https://genius.com/2976706", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Clappers (Remix)", "line": "[Verse 3: Fat Trel]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Fat Trel, recently signed to Rick Ross' Maybach Music Group, is a local to the D.C. metropolitan area, much like Wale.\n\nTrel recorded his verse at Full Sail University in Orlando, Florida, which is home to countless budding hip-hop producers from the D.C. area.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E2Zp7NI4ing", "annotation_id": "2784776", "url": "https://genius.com/2784776", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Clappers (Remix)", "line": "Wale want you to do it Thugger want you to do it Hit Boy want you to do it Fat Trel want you to do it Ricky want you to do it", "vault_lines": ["Wale want you to do it", "Thugger want you to do it", "Hit Boy want you to do it", "Fat Trel want you to do it", "Ricky want you to do it"], "meaning": "A la the classic outro to “Yeah!”, everybody on the song is named in a roll call to command the girls to, you know…", "annotation_id": "2777910", "url": "https://genius.com/2777910", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
