{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Clappers (Remix)", "line": "Folarin said no hands, let me see you clap!", "vault_lines": ["Folarin said no hands, let me see you clap!"], "meaning": "Lest you forget, this is a reference to the Big Homie Flock’s break out hit No Hands, which featured “local rapper” Wale and Roscoe Dash.\n\nFor the unitiated think about a body part you can use to clap with, other than your hands.\n\nThank you twerk team", "annotation_id": "2762129", "url": "https://genius.com/2762129", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Clappers (Remix)", "line": "Hit-Boy on the beat", "vault_lines": ["Hit-Boy on the beat"], "meaning": "Hit-Boy is a rapper/producer from Fontana, California. He’s worked with a range of artists from Kendrick Lamar to Mary J. Blige, to Kanye West & Beyonce.\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4U6TEqhxnuo\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ar-sduhNbi4\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EZW7et3tPuQ\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3xUfCUFPL-8", "annotation_id": "2760532", "url": "https://genius.com/2760532", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
