{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Clique", "line": "Maybach Music", "vault_lines": ["As I look around they don't do it like my clique (Maybach Music)"], "meaning": "This song courtesy of Maybach Music Group\n\nRick Ross also has a series of songs named Maybach Music – I, II, III, IV", "annotation_id": "1507650", "url": "https://genius.com/1507650", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
