{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "Uh the bitch, been good to me Been bad to my homies, keep it cool with me I played it by the rules, and the regulations", "vault_lines": ["Uh the bitch, been good to me", "Been bad to my homies, keep it cool with me", "I played it by the rules, and the regulations"], "meaning": "PROPOSED SUGGESTION:\n\nCocaine has been good to Pimp C because he’s made a lot of money off of it. Its been bad to his friends because they use it and get locked up for it. Pimp C has stayed true to the drug game and has stayed humble through the process.", "annotation_id": "626463", "url": "https://genius.com/626463", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "Transported by the best, to the ghettos to straight killers The power of the powder pimping, you don’t understand", "vault_lines": ["Transported by the best, to the ghettos to straight killers", "The power of the powder pimping, you don't understand"], "meaning": "The Government of the United States and the CIA is often times credited with spreading and distributing cocaine into the ghettos of America, in turn the government was pimping out its own citizens", "annotation_id": "1127926", "url": "https://genius.com/1127926", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "After the deal was done, I make my girl pussy squirt Cause after the deal, we would all celebrate", "vault_lines": ["After the deal was done, I make my girl pussy squirt", "Cause after the deal, we would all celebrate"], "meaning": "After making a drug transaction, Pimp would have great sex with his girl in order to celebrate, often making her squirt", "annotation_id": "1127924", "url": "https://genius.com/1127924", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "Paper plates on convertables", "vault_lines": ["Getting paper, paper plates on convertables"], "meaning": "Ross is saying he has so much money that he’s buying convertible cars straight from a car dealer. When you buy a car from a dealer, they usually give you a 30, 45, or 60 day temporary tag that’s printed on paper. Normal license plates are made of aluminum and are either embossed (see/look up Maryland’s plates) or digitally printed onto the reflection base (see/look up DC’s plates).\n\nMost/all of his convertibles are fresh out the lot with the dealer tags/temporary registration/paper plates.", "annotation_id": "949221", "url": "https://genius.com/949221", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "Pimping style, but they yayo got me wearing linen now", "vault_lines": ["Pimping style, but they yayo got me wearing linen now"], "meaning": "He’s been puttin' in work so long that he’s sportin' the finest linens", "annotation_id": "949219", "url": "https://genius.com/949219", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "Got a pocket full of hard, it’s hotter than a (mo’fucker)", "vault_lines": ["Got a pocket full of hard, it's hotter than a (mo'fucker)"], "meaning": "He’s got crack in his pocket, and it’s “burning a hole in his pocket”, he wants to push it as fast as possible.", "annotation_id": "949209", "url": "https://genius.com/949209", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
