{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "Happy cause it wasn’t no jacking, and the product was straight", "vault_lines": ["Happy cause it wasn't no jacking, and the product was straight"], "meaning": "Pimp C was happy because the business deal went smooth, he didnt get robbed and the cocaine was of good quality.", "annotation_id": "751536", "url": "https://genius.com/751536", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "Ask W man, he’s a dealer and a fan of cocaine", "vault_lines": ["Ask W man, he's a dealer and a fan of cocaine"], "meaning": "This refers to 43rd U.S. President George W. Bush who was known to have used cocaine when he was younger and many secret government operations have been speculated to involve a government influence in the black market of cocaine distribution.", "annotation_id": "751533", "url": "https://genius.com/751533", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "Extracted from the coca leaf, but see that shit ain’t new It’s been around for hundreds of years, exploited by the rich", "vault_lines": ["Extracted from the coca leaf, but see that shit ain't new", "It's been around for hundreds of years, exploited by the rich"], "meaning": "Cocaine use is not a new phenomenon. It’s been used by the rich to make themselves richer at the expense of others for centuries.", "annotation_id": "751528", "url": "https://genius.com/751528", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "Everything was cool, I was ice cold Till I let that bitch, get up in my nose", "vault_lines": ["Everything was cool, I was ice cold", "Till I let that bitch, get up in my nose"], "meaning": "It was always business first and he had his mind straight until he started using what he was selling. Scarface’s rule: Never get high off your own supply.\"", "annotation_id": "751525", "url": "https://genius.com/751525", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "I’m a shark with the fork, microwave or pot I’mma hit it with the Sprite, and make that butter lock", "vault_lines": ["I'm a shark with the fork, microwave or pot", "I'mma hit it with the Sprite, and make that butter lock"], "meaning": "He goes into detail regarding how he makes crack giving him rapport as he really knows how its made. Butter lock means how the liquid crack turns into a solid crystal after he applies a chemical(Sprite) to the mixture.", "annotation_id": "751523", "url": "https://genius.com/751523", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "Some niggas let the city eat em up I was just coming up, whipping my pyrex steady beating it up", "vault_lines": ["Some niggas let the city eat em up", "I was just coming up, whipping my pyrex steady beating it up"], "meaning": "Some people lose hope in the hood but he chose to sell drugs in order to make it out. He is stirring his pyrex pot over the stove in order to make crack cocaine.", "annotation_id": "751522", "url": "https://genius.com/751522", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "I never came with the funny business That’s why we steady playing in Jags and Benzes", "vault_lines": ["I never came with the funny business", "That's why we steady playing in Jags and Benzes"], "meaning": "He never tried to be shiesty or double cross his business partners so the drug business has been steadily profitable for him.", "annotation_id": "751518", "url": "https://genius.com/751518", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cocaine", "line": "A privileged possession, for dozens of centuries Helped a few wars, legal and illegal industries", "vault_lines": ["A privileged possession, for dozens of centuries", "Helped a few wars, legal and illegal industries"], "meaning": "Cocaine shipping was involved in many wars such as Afghanistan or Vietnam wars.", "annotation_id": "626470", "url": "https://genius.com/626470", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
