{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Colombia (Remix)", "line": "I got 99 bricks and I still won’t front you one", "vault_lines": ["I got 99 bricks and I still won't front you one"], "meaning": "Years in the game taught him don’t trust a soul. Gucci uses a play on Jay-Z’s 3rd single, 99 Problems.\n\nI got 99 problems but a bitch ain’t one", "annotation_id": "1611535", "url": "https://genius.com/1611535", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Colombia (Remix)", "line": "And I ain’t never told a soul, I don’t need a snitch foe", "vault_lines": ["And I ain’t never told a soul, I don’t need a snitch foe"], "meaning": "This is a reference to Nino Brown in New Jack City, who snitches on the CMB towards the end of the flim. Guwap doesn’t put his business out there, he doesn’t need any possible informants snitchin.", "annotation_id": "1522595", "url": "https://genius.com/1522595", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
