{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Colombia (Remix)", "line": "Nigga tried to kill me but I had the thing cocked They think I know the voodoo How they keep showing my Ghost on that channel 2", "vault_lines": ["Nigga tried to kill me but I had the thing cocked", "They think I know the voodoo", "How they keep showing my Ghost on that channel 2"], "meaning": "On January 27th 2013 while celebrating his birthday Rick Ross and a female friend were the target of multiple shots by a drive-by shooter, aiming at his Rolls Royce.\n\n\n\nIn the song, Ross implies that his foes think he has voodoo magic, because all of the bullets missed him.", "annotation_id": "1519817", "url": "https://genius.com/1519817", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
