{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Currency", "line": "Man all I got is hundreds, I ain’t even stuntin’ Stuck on the Benjis like Benjamin Button", "vault_lines": ["Man all I got is hundreds, I ain't even stuntin'", "Stuck on the Benjis like Benjamin Button"], "meaning": "As the president of Young Money, this man just rakes in the dough.\n\n\n\nThe Curious Case of Benjamin Button is a movie where the protagonist (Benjamin) reaches an age, gets stuck and begins aging backwards; From an old man, back down to a baby.", "annotation_id": "2765357", "url": "https://genius.com/2765357", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Currency", "line": "Dade County nigga, diamonds come from Tiffany’s", "vault_lines": ["Dade County nigga, diamonds come from Tiffany's"], "meaning": "Tiffany & Company or Tiffany’s is a luxury American multinational jewellery and silverware corporation, with headquarters in New York. The brand sells jewellery, sterling silver, china, crystal, stationery, fragrances, personal accessories, as well as some leather goods.", "annotation_id": "2182315", "url": "https://genius.com/2182315", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Currency", "line": "Weezy F Baby and the ‘F’ is for free (me)", "vault_lines": ["Weezy F Baby and the 'F' is for free (me)"], "meaning": "Oh, the ‘F’ is for free now…what about all those other things?\n\nIf you listen closely you can hear him say “me” as the song ends on the hook. Around the time this song came out Weezy was locked up for 8 months. He just wanted to be free!", "annotation_id": "2157818", "url": "https://genius.com/2157818", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
