{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "Transfers and wires, that happen under the mattress", "vault_lines": ["Transfers and wires, that happen under the mattress"], "meaning": "This is an oxymoron. Transfers and wires are at least legal transactions although the money may not be legal. “Under the mattress” is referring to the fact that people who participate in an illegal hustle don’t want their money in the bank and keep it under their mattress(this might sound familiar). Hens this is an oxymoron because Transfers and wires happen in a bank and under the mattress is saying it’s dirty money which isn’t officially transferred or wired.", "annotation_id": "3038003", "url": "https://genius.com/3038003", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "Niggas shoot for the stars, pray a larger amount", "vault_lines": ["Niggas shoot for the stars, pray a larger amount"], "meaning": "Shoot for the stars is an expression used to encourage someone  to set their goals at a challenging level. In other words, pray for a larger amount of white bricks or money.", "annotation_id": "3036425", "url": "https://genius.com/3036425", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "I blew a brick out in Reno, Uncle Paulie casino", "vault_lines": ["I blew a brick out in Reno, Uncle Paulie casino"], "meaning": "Rick Ross smoked a pound of marijuana in Reno, which is the biggest little city in the world; the place you go to gamble if you don’t go to Vegas.", "annotation_id": "3036413", "url": "https://genius.com/3036413", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "Hoes thinking I’m boojie, when I’m smoking on gucci", "vault_lines": ["Hoes thinking I'm boojie, when I'm smoking on gucci"], "meaning": "Wordplay\n\nWomen think he’s boojie (fancy, which derived from French word, bourgeoisie) when he’s smoking on good Kush, or Gucci  (a fancy Italian fashion brand).", "annotation_id": "3036356", "url": "https://genius.com/3036356", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "Percocets for myself, I feel a hundred degrees", "vault_lines": ["Percocets for myself, I feel a hundred degrees"], "meaning": "Percocets are a prescription painkiller pill that contain the combination of oxycodone and paracetamol. It gets you geeked up very fast.\n\nRozay’s probably doing the same as his label-mate, Meek Mill:\n\nI pop a perk, I fuck yo bitch", "annotation_id": "3035141", "url": "https://genius.com/3035141", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "Niggas shot up my car, walk away like Benzino", "vault_lines": ["Niggas shot up my car, walk away like Benzino"], "meaning": "On January 28th, 2013, Rick Ross was out celebrating his 37th birthday at a diner in Fort Lauderdale, Florida, early in the morning when he and his girlfriend became the alleged target of a drive-by shooting. 18 bullet casings were found at the scene of the accident, alongside Rick Ross' Rolls Royce smashed into the side of a near-by apartment building. Rozay walked away unharmed and nobody was injured in the shooting and subsequent crash.\n\n\n\nPictured above is Rozay’s Rolls Royce after the incident.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_I3-rO587nc\n\nBenzino is a hip hop media executive and record producer. Since 2012, he has appeared on VH1 TV series Love & Hip Hop: Atlanta. Benzino was shot on March 29th, 2014, en route to his mother’s funeral procession, by his own nephew. Unlike Rozay, Benzino was hit by a bullet and rushed to the hospital. But much like Rozay, they both walked away alive.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5D32XGrpjE4\n\nAlso,\n\nAfter Rozay’s accident, rapper 50 Cent took to Twitter to throw around his two cents about the incident.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/50cent/status/295922644975505408\nhttps://twitter.com/50cent/status/295980920773672960", "annotation_id": "3034168", "url": "https://genius.com/3034168", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "Rolling dice with my niggas, a half a ticket, the pot", "vault_lines": ["Rolling dice with my niggas, a half a ticket, the pot"], "meaning": "The “center pot” or “pot” is the amount of money each person put into the game as their bet when playing any dice game. Rozay and all of his niggas have plenty of money. So when they roll dice the pot is half a ticket. Ticket is a slang word for a million dollars, so half a ticket is round $500,000.", "annotation_id": "3034123", "url": "https://genius.com/3034123", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "I got a mill for Lil Boosie", "vault_lines": ["All my shoes be Gucci, I got a mill for Lil Boosie"], "meaning": "Lil Boosie served time in the Louisiana State Penitentiary from 2009-2014, being sentenced to eight years after pleading guilty to drug charges. He was released early on March 5, 2014.\n\nBoosie was featured on MMG’s latest album, Self Made 3, on the track, Lay It Down. After the song was released, Rozay called into the HOT 104.1 STL radio station to promote the album, and while on the phone Rick Ross' announced that he had a million dollar deal on the table waiting for Lil Boosie to be released from prison.", "annotation_id": "3034069", "url": "https://genius.com/3034069", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "[Chorus: K Camp] It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off So what you saying ho? You Know I’m the man ho? [Post-Chorus: K Camp] Nothing but a bird, I’ma leave you where you stand, ho Heard you got a man ho Hope he understand though You ain’t nothing but a creeper baby, I’m just saying, though Saying, though It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off [Verse 1: K Camp] Creeping on the low, hope your man don’t see She will bust it down for some damn Lime-A-Ritas Chew me like some bubblegum, something like Rasheeda Gotta get my partner some, she on me like Adidas Baby, you can’t hold back, better stop flexing like you not Your man tryna patrol then I guess he is a cop But he really can’t cuff if he busting at my spot But I done had enough cause you making my shit hot Blowing up a nigga phone, what I tell yo ass ’bout that? Tryna hold something, hold my nuts, can you do that? Can you play around with that mouth while he hit it from the back? You can’t say nothing now cause we all been through that, through that [Chorus: K Camp] It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off So what you saying ho? You know I’m the man ho? [Verse 2: 2 Chainz] You know that ain’t a real bag bitch, that’s a knock off When I get that work I get to juggin’ like hot sauce All swimmin pool lakefront Hit it from the back, rearrange her lace front Stuntin’, tattoos on my neck and on my kidney If I don’t like that ho I turn her ass into a frisbee If I dont like your disc I turn that ho into a frisbee I throw it out on Old Nat right by the Wendy’s Three cellphones and all of ‘em jumpin’ I can see your hoes and all em’ nothing Yeah I’m a don don’, Don Cheadle, Don Cornelius Watch the Dom spill Pockets fat as Don Carter Jeter, nigga, done deal! [Chorus: K Camp] It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off So what you saying ho? You know I’m the man ho? [Verse 3: K Camp] Baby I’m ashamed, why you acting this way? Heard she ’bout that action, you can bring her this way Hit her on yo mattress, make you feel some type of way Pass her to my migos, they gonna bust it, ¡Andale! Please don’t play no games cause I know thats what you like Knock it out the frame, baby girl, it’s alright Yeah that pussy bomb, I just call it dynamite You ready? Here I come, I can do this shit all night [Chorus: K Camp] It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off So what you saying ho? You know I’m the man ho? [Post-Chorus: K Camp] Nothing but a bird, I’ma leave you where you stand, ho Heard you got a man ho Hope he understand though You ain’t nothing but a creeper baby, I’m just saying, though Saying, though It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off It ain’t nothing to cut that bitch off", "vault_lines": ["It ain't nothing to cut that bitch off", "So what you saying ho?", "You Know I'm the man ho?", "Nothing but a bird, I'ma leave you where you stand, ho", "Heard you got a man ho", "Hope he understand though"], "meaning": "Same lyrics as the original version, check out the annotations here!", "annotation_id": "3031712", "url": "https://genius.com/3031712", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "Duct tape on my pistol", "vault_lines": ["Double M on the rise, duct tape on my pistol"], "meaning": "Wrapping the handle of a fire-arm with duct tape is a common practice for people who don’t have the money or access to get equipment in order to improve the grip on the weapon and/or to be able to use it without a trace of fingerprints.", "annotation_id": "3031670", "url": "https://genius.com/3031670", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Cut Her Off (Remix)", "line": "Bitches dropping like, swish, Ricky Pitino", "vault_lines": ["Bitches dropping like, swish, Ricky Pitino"], "meaning": "A swish in basketball is when the ball drops straight through the net. Rozay’s saying bitches (or maybe bitch niggas included) are dropping or dying all the time.\n\n\n\nRick Pitino is the head coach of the Louisville Cardinals men’s basketball team, and coached the Cardinals to the 2013 NCAA Men’s Division I Basketball Championship. Rick is also 6th on the Forbes list for Highest-Paid College Basketball Coaches.", "annotation_id": "3031627", "url": "https://genius.com/3031627", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
