{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dead Last", "line": "Comin’ short, that ain’t no joke and you can’t Kevin Hart me", "vault_lines": ["Comin' short, that ain't no joke and you can't Kevin Hart me"], "meaning": "Kevin Hart is a comedian who tells jokes. This is significant because Fabulous, in turn, considers coming up short to be no laughing matter, whether that be “balling,” like the previous line suggests, or in various other aspects of his life, it remains unclear. Just like the word “joke” was a purposeful allusion to Kevin Hart’s profession, “Comin' short” is an intentional reference to Kevin Hart’s height, as the comedian stands at 5' 2\".\n\nFabolous is a good friend of Hart, having performed at his wedding reception in 2016:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pRgpSmcVwCs", "annotation_id": "30787992", "url": "https://genius.com/30787992", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dead Last", "line": "I may have let you beat me to a watch (Huh) But I’ll never let you beat me to the top", "vault_lines": ["I may have let you beat me to a watch (Huh)", "But I'll never let you beat me to the top"], "meaning": "Rick Ross touched on meterials like he will let you have it, beat him to a watch but all he wants is the top spot", "annotation_id": "30051017", "url": "https://genius.com/30051017", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dead Last", "line": "Middle finger up like a Tupac picture", "vault_lines": ["Middle finger up like a Tupac picture"], "meaning": "The late Tupac Shakur would often pose with his middle finger up at the camera when his picture was taken. Indeed, one of the most memorable photos of Shakur features him pointing a middle finger at the camera as he was lying on a hospital bed after being shot five times by Dexter Isaac in 1994.", "annotation_id": "30043583", "url": "https://genius.com/30043583", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
