{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dead Presidents", "line": "Meanwhile, the kids smokin’ like it’s Amsterdam", "vault_lines": ["Meanwhile, the kids smokin' like it's Amsterdam"], "meaning": "Not the first time Ross has referenced Amsterdam as a smoke city.\n\nAdditionally, a thematic connection to Europe since the original Legoland is located in Denmark.", "annotation_id": "30548962", "url": "https://genius.com/30548962", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dead Presidents", "line": "Build a empire, yeah, that was my state of mind", "vault_lines": ["Build a empire, yeah, that was my state of mind"], "meaning": "Likely a reference to the Untouchable Maybach Empire.\n\nAlso a play on Jay Z’s Empire State of Mind and the building itself.", "annotation_id": "30548201", "url": "https://genius.com/30548201", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
