{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Deep in the Game", "line": "Ridin’ with that chopper, that’s my white bitch from Minnesota", "vault_lines": ["Ridin' with that chopper, that’s my white bitch from Minnesota"], "meaning": "Pretty cut and dry line, Fat Trel’s girl from Minnesota uses a chopper (slang for assault rifle). It’s worth noting that Trel refers to her as “my White bitch”, as Minnesota is known for having a large white population, although it has gotten more diverse in recent years.", "annotation_id": "4971911", "url": "https://genius.com/4971911", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Deep in the Game", "line": "Them O’s on the stove have my bitch on swole", "vault_lines": ["Them O's on the stove have my bitch on swole"], "meaning": "By selling ounces of crack cocaine – a derivative of powder cocaine that is “cooked” – Fat Trell is able to keep his main bitch draped in the finest wears.", "annotation_id": "1832842", "url": "https://genius.com/1832842", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Deep in the Game", "line": "Deep in the game, I dun perfected my moves", "vault_lines": ["Deep in the game, I dun perfected my moves"], "meaning": "With experience comes confidence and skill – the deeper Rozay gets into the Rap and Trap games, the better at them he becomes.\n\nThis hook is sampled from Rozay’s verse from French Montana’s Choppa Choppa Down Remix.", "annotation_id": "1672188", "url": "https://genius.com/1672188", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
