{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Diced Pineapples", "line": "May your love come down so my mind might have you", "vault_lines": ["May your love come down so my mind might have you"], "meaning": "Wale cleverly implores his lover to perform oral sex on him with a pun on the head of his penis. If she brings her love down to his “head,” his “mind” will enjoy her presence.\n\nSimultaneously, this also reads as a heartfelt desire on Wale’s part to get to know the object of his affections.", "annotation_id": "38762589", "url": "https://genius.com/38762589", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Diced Pineapples", "line": "Baby listen, this position is a blessing And with your permission, hopefully you’ll learn a lesson (ugh)", "vault_lines": ["Baby listen, this position is a blessing", "And with your permission, hopefully you'll learn a lesson (ugh)"], "meaning": "Rick Ross expresses an intention to show his lover the high life and to please her sexually–but only with her consent.\n\nA surprising and refreshing sentiment from Ricky Rozay, particularly considering his infamous promotion of drugging and raping women on the track “UOENO:”\n\n\nPut Molly all in her champagne, she ain’t even know it I took her home and I enjoyed that, she ain't even know it― Rocko (Ft. Future & Rick Ross) – U.O.E.N.O", "annotation_id": "38762455", "url": "https://genius.com/38762455", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Diced Pineapples", "line": "Sex all night, couple shots of CÎROC", "vault_lines": ["Sex all night, couple shots of CÎROC"], "meaning": "Rick Ross engages in some forthright product placement for CÎROC, a premium vodka brand formerly associated with Sean “Diddy” Combs of later notoriety.\n\nThe music video prominently centers a bottle of peach CÎROC in the shot when Ross raps this lyric.", "annotation_id": "38762337", "url": "https://genius.com/38762337", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Diced Pineapples", "line": "Like to go deep, but I hate to get too deeply involved", "vault_lines": ["Like to go deep, but I hate to get too deeply involved"], "meaning": "Wale is not here for the long haul. He is only here to please his girl and leave–or, more charitably, to be solely a source of pleasure for her as opposed to emotionally challenging.", "annotation_id": "38718797", "url": "https://genius.com/38718797", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Diced Pineapples", "line": "To get on a higher tree, gonna have to climb a sequoia", "vault_lines": ["To get on a higher tree, gonna have to climb a sequoia"], "meaning": "Wale’s clever double entendre alludes to both his ability to provide high-grade weed for his lover and his sexual prowess.\n\nHe can provide a “higher tree–” that is, better weed–but his lover will have to “climb a sequoia” to earn this. Sequoias are some of the largest and tallest trees around, and Wale is likening his penis to one.", "annotation_id": "38718767", "url": "https://genius.com/38718767", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Diced Pineapples", "line": "She so fine, she ain’t even gotta talk", "vault_lines": ["She so fine, she ain't even gotta talk"], "meaning": "Ross' lover is so attractive that she need not have any personality or way with words to win him over. Her presence and attractiveness are enough to enshrine her as his “diced pineapple” that gets him through the day.", "annotation_id": "38718761", "url": "https://genius.com/38718761", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Diced Pineapples", "line": "Diced pineapples, I just bought my girl a set", "vault_lines": ["Diced pineapples, I just bought my girl a set"], "meaning": "Not only is Ross articulating the track’s central conceit–a lover as “diced pineapples,” a daily pleasure who supports him through hard times–but he is also making a pun on the appearance of diced pineapples. Yellow diamonds are also cubic in shape, and he’s just bought his girl some of them.", "annotation_id": "38718752", "url": "https://genius.com/38718752", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Diced Pineapples", "line": "Then we fuck all night ’til things get right Then we fuck all night ’til things get right, aww yeah", "vault_lines": ["Then we fuck all night 'til things get right", "Then we fuck all night 'til things get right, aww yeah"], "meaning": "Drake and his lover have makeup sex after a heated argument. While an understandable urge due to passions running high–positive and negative–this is probably not healthy for the relationship. Drake hints at this through the refrain, generally.", "annotation_id": "38718743", "url": "https://genius.com/38718743", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Diced Pineapples", "line": "Bitch so bad, got me wishing I could sing", "vault_lines": ["Bitch so bad, got me wishing I could sing"], "meaning": "Rick Ross' lover is so appealing that he wishes he was not a rapper, but a singer. He is likely alluding to the popular image of R&B singers as more sexually daring and explicit, or at least more forthright in signalling interest in women, than rappers in their lyrics.", "annotation_id": "38718732", "url": "https://genius.com/38718732", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
