{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dis Ain’t What You Want (Remix)", "line": "Gave your bitch a new purse, new V12 It is trickin’ if you’re worth more than Sprewell", "vault_lines": ["It is trickin' if you're worth more than Sprewell"], "meaning": "Cars with V12 engines are always very sporty and top of the line. Former NBA Player Latrell Sprewell was huge on automobiles & was a man with a huge net worth.\n\nThis is probably a reference to Sprewell’s infamous “I’ve got a family to feed” quote – in which he rejected a $20 million dollar contract, insinuating it wasn’t enough.", "annotation_id": "2589956", "url": "https://genius.com/2589956", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dis Ain’t What You Want (Remix)", "line": "I got cuban links, Santa Ria", "vault_lines": ["I got cuban links, Santa Ria"], "meaning": "Ross' necklace is made of Cuban Links, a stylized chain pattern. His “links” is also a double meaning, he has connections to Cubans, drug dealers, probably in the Miami area where he is usually found.\n\nSantería, also known as La Religión, is a type of religion in West Africa and the Caribbean.", "annotation_id": "2526882", "url": "https://genius.com/2526882", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dis Ain’t What You Want (Remix)", "line": "I got Piguet’s on the wrist, flex on your bitch", "vault_lines": ["I got Piguet’s on the wrist, flex on your bitch"], "meaning": "Meek has a highly expensive Audemars Piguet time piece on his wrist, you know he’s flexing!\n()\n\nNot the first time he mentioned his Audemar either, in “I’m A Boss” he says:\n\nAudemar on my wrist, bustdown\nWe poppin bottles like I scored the winning touchdown", "annotation_id": "2492591", "url": "https://genius.com/2492591", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dis Ain’t What You Want (Remix)", "line": "In my own city they hate on me, put weight on me Try and snatch my chain, that’s breaking news on NBC Fuck a famous ho, I wake up, be on TMZ", "vault_lines": ["Try and snatch my chain, that's breaking news on NBC", "Fuck a famous ho, I wake up, be on TMZ"], "meaning": "Everything Meek does is filmed by paparazzi, major news casts follow him around. He even has TMZ peeking in his windows.\n\n\n\nThis is also a direct reference to Lil Durk’s line in this song:\n\nIn my own city they hate on me, put weight on me\nFuck TMZ, fuck Breaking News and ABC", "annotation_id": "2488482", "url": "https://genius.com/2488482", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dis Ain’t What You Want (Remix)", "line": "LeBron James, I ain’t Trinidad, nigga", "vault_lines": ["LeBron James, I ain't Trinidad, nigga"], "meaning": "French puts himself on a high level comparing himself to the king himself, LeBron James. A little bit of a diss here, he makes it very clear that he’s not on on the other “James” level.", "annotation_id": "2488464", "url": "https://genius.com/2488464", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dis Ain’t What You Want (Remix)", "line": "Chi-Town niggas put you on a shirt", "vault_lines": ["Chi-Town niggas put you on a shirt"], "meaning": "Kanye West is from Chicago, and he calls it the “murder capital”. He even goes on to state a gruesome statistic:\n\n314 soldiers died in Iraq, 509 died in Chicago\n\nIt’s the sad truth, Chicago niggas will put you on a shirt.", "annotation_id": "2488452", "url": "https://genius.com/2488452", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dis Ain’t What You Want (Remix)", "line": "Aaron Hernandez with a verse, no plea deals", "vault_lines": ["Aaron Hernandez with a verse, no plea deals"], "meaning": "Aaron Hernandez is an ex NFL tight end for the New England Patriots. He was extremely succesful at his position, but no longer is in the NFL.\n\n\n\nHernandez is awaiting trial for the murder of Odin Lloyd, he did not take a plea deal, or bargain. That would mean he would plead guilty, in return for some concession from the prosecutor.\n\nLike Hernandez, Ricky Ross also does not take plea deals.\n\n#HE MURDERS EVERY TRACK AND GETS AWAY WITH IT", "annotation_id": "2488422", "url": "https://genius.com/2488422", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dis Ain’t What You Want (Remix)", "line": "[Hook: Lil Durk] Tell me what’s it gon’ be, this ain’t what you want I call it how I see it, so this ain’t what you want I’m on the road doing shows so well, this ain’t what you want I’m on the road you can’t go I know, this ain’t what you want I hear them niggas after me, but this ain’t what you want And I guarantee this ain’t what you want I’m from the land where ain’t no lackin’ at, this ain’t what you want I wrap ’em up, we get ’em done cause, this ain’t what you want", "vault_lines": ["Tell me what's it gon' be, this ain't what you want", "I call it how I see it, so this ain't what you want", "I'm on the road doing shows so well, this ain't what you want", "I'm on the road you can't go I know, this ain't what you want", "I hear them niggas after me, but this ain't what you want", "And I guarantee this ain't what you want"], "meaning": "#Peep Lil Durk’s annotations on the orignal song.", "annotation_id": "2488398", "url": "https://genius.com/2488398", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
