{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Do Sumthing Strange", "line": "She super sexy so I treat her to my wing stop", "vault_lines": ["She super sexy so I treat her to my wing stop"], "meaning": "Rick Ross loves wings so much that he now owns a few Wingstop franchises, including one in Miami and at least two in Memphis. He would be generous enough to treat a woman to some fine dining at one of these franchises.", "annotation_id": "1892703", "url": "https://genius.com/1892703", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
