{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Do What I Do", "line": "I am ghetto, boy,", "vault_lines": ["I am ghetto, boy,"], "meaning": "The Geto Boys were a rap group made up of Scarface, Willie D and Bushwick Bill from Houston, Texas.", "annotation_id": "7757382", "url": "https://genius.com/7757382", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Do What I Do", "line": "The past the past, yo, to my vatos out in the East Los Nietas on the east coast, shouts to Puerto Rico Dominican Republic people, rep I Brown and black, we must get it together", "vault_lines": ["The past the past, yo, to my vatos out in the East Los", "Nietas on the east coast, shouts to Puerto Rico", "Dominican Republic people, rep I", "Brown and black, we must get it together"], "meaning": "Nas shows love to all the immigrants from the South, who are being attacked from multiple sides these days.\nWether its the Tea Party, or Republican Candidate Donald Trump, willing to build a huge wall at the border, to stop people from getting into the U.S.\n\n\n\nNas says that Mexicans and Afro-Americans should stand together, since both communities have been discriminated and opressed by white racists for decades.", "annotation_id": "7732088", "url": "https://genius.com/7732088", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Do What I Do", "line": "Time sure flies, look how many years went by My young niggas already need hair dye", "vault_lines": ["Time sure flies, look how many years went by", "My young niggas already need hair dye"], "meaning": "Where them niggas I shouted out on my first shit?\n\n\nAll the guys Nas used to hang out with when he was young are now in their middle age like him, hence why they need dye to cover up their grey hair.", "annotation_id": "7732041", "url": "https://genius.com/7732041", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
