{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Don’t Be Scared", "line": "So what you think, have a long conversation? What’s on your mind? Tell me what you been thinking", "vault_lines": ["So what you think, have a long conversation?", "What's on your mind? Tell me what you been thinking"], "meaning": "Usually before you get serious with someone you sit down and have a long (sometimes intimate) conversation to see if that’s the person you want to do stuff with. It’s usually best to know a person’s motives before you get serious.", "annotation_id": "4085840", "url": "https://genius.com/4085840", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
