{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Dueces", "line": "I’m chucking my deuces up to her (Deuces)", "vault_lines": ["I'm chucking my deuces up to her (Deuces)"], "meaning": "Throwing or chucking up deuces is a gesture where you raise your middle finger first and add the index finger and is a combination of “fuck you” and “peace out.” Chris is metaphorically throwing up the deuces as he walks out on his girl.", "annotation_id": "20290228", "url": "https://genius.com/20290228", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
