{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "DunnHill", "line": "Bella in the glass", "vault_lines": ["Heavy on the ice (Huh), Bella in the glass"], "meaning": "Correction: Bella = Belaire.\nRick Ross is a major ambassador for the champagne brand Luc Belaire. He promotes Belaire extensively in his music, social media, and public appearances, making it a signature part of his image. This partnership has helped boost Belaire’s popularity, especially in the hip-hop community, linking the brand with luxury and celebration..", "annotation_id": "31947441", "url": "https://genius.com/31947441", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "DunnHill", "line": "Sippin’ 99 fried rice with some prawns (Ah)", "vault_lines": ["Sippin' 99 fried rice with some prawns (Ah)"], "meaning": "99 is a brand of liqueur known for its high percentage of alcohol. Westside is drinking it casually while eating his meal.", "annotation_id": "30718950", "url": "https://genius.com/30718950", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
