{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Eastern Conference Final", "line": "Uh, marijuana, simple therapy", "vault_lines": ["Uh, marijuana, simple therapy"], "meaning": "Bud has always been thought to be very therapeutic and science can prove this. Sometimes the best way to fix your stress is to kick back and light up a blunt.", "annotation_id": "7164647", "url": "https://genius.com/7164647", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Eastern Conference Final", "line": "I8, he’s in the BM and he’s clutchin’", "vault_lines": ["I8, he's in the BM and he's clutchin'"], "meaning": "High performance BMW’s are usually standards, which consist of driving with a “clutch” and stick shift.\n\n\n\nJada could also be referencing the term “cluchin” to mean that he’s falling through for others, usually relating to selling drugs.", "annotation_id": "7164581", "url": "https://genius.com/7164581", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Eastern Conference Final", "line": "Lookin’ at the yachts, he ain’t able to pick and choose", "vault_lines": ["Lookin' at the yachts, he ain't able to pick and choose"], "meaning": "Jada has so many yachts, it’s not easy to just choose one. One could imagine the struggle.", "annotation_id": "7164577", "url": "https://genius.com/7164577", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Eastern Conference Final", "line": "My niggas did concrete up and down Wall Street (uhh)", "vault_lines": ["My niggas did concrete up and down Wall Street (uhh)"], "meaning": "Concrete is slang for crack cocaine, a freebase form of cocaine that can be inhaled or smoked. Friends of his sold it along Wall Street in Downtown Manhattan, presumably during the crack epidemic of 1980 and 1990.\n\nIn major cities, such as New York, one dosage unit of crack cocaine could be bought for as low as $2.50 (equivalent to $5.68 in 2015).", "annotation_id": "6714124", "url": "https://genius.com/6714124", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Eastern Conference Final", "line": "May the young king Chinx Drugz rest heavenly, uh, uh, salute", "vault_lines": ["May the young king Chinx Drugz rest heavenly, uh, uh, salute"], "meaning": "Chinx Drugz, a member of Coke Boys, French Montana’s crew, was slain on May 17th 2015.\n\n\n\nJadakiss is paying homage to a fallen soldier.", "annotation_id": "6544318", "url": "https://genius.com/6544318", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Eastern Conference Final", "line": "You pricks are harmless, the clips are arm-length (umm) Right after you dab, do a couple of bong hits Razor work mean, buck-fifty the long rips At any moment it could get funky as armpits (ha!)", "vault_lines": ["You pricks are harmless, the clips are arm-length (umm)", "Right after you dab, do a couple of bong hits", "Razor work mean, buck-fifty the long rips", "At any moment it could get funky as armpits (ha!)"], "meaning": "Jada is in a state of war here and he is not backing down from the competition. He is strong enough to see the competition is weak, and no match for him.\n\nHe’s got an extended clip on deck to take out more than your average number of foes.\n\n\n\nA “buck 50” refers to a razor cut from one end of your mouth to another that has you looking like Heath Ledger.\n\n\n\nHe is thus simply warning you watch out when dealing with him wrongly for he can get it funky, compraing the sound of guns to the sound of music.\n\nJada completes the Biggie/Pac references here by shouting out a 2pac sentiment and a Biggie song.", "annotation_id": "6544253", "url": "https://genius.com/6544253", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Eastern Conference Final", "line": "You’re dealin’ with the beast of the Eastern Conference (Jada)", "vault_lines": ["You're dealin' with the beast of the Eastern Conference (Jada)"], "meaning": "Jadakiss is a proud New York resident, a true “beast in the east”. He recently went over the top of Jay Z’s classic “Where I’m From”, dropping shuddering bars about his local city.", "annotation_id": "6544243", "url": "https://genius.com/6544243", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Eastern Conference Final", "line": "All the hate do is just increase the Don’s strength", "vault_lines": ["All the hate do is just increase the Don's strength"], "meaning": "Hating on Jadakiss when you are in a contest with him you are bound to lose. Hate is the source of his strength, and he has no problem calling a hater out.", "annotation_id": "6544230", "url": "https://genius.com/6544230", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Eastern Conference Final", "line": "We the flyest, do most shoppin’ in France", "vault_lines": ["We the flyest, do most shoppin' in France"], "meaning": "France is a leading country in the fashion industry, with Paris acting as the center of its industry. It is home to companies such as Chanel, Givenchy, Dior, Hermès, Yves Saint Laurent, and Louis Vuitton.", "annotation_id": "6542488", "url": "https://genius.com/6542488", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
