{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Everything A Dope Boy Ever Wanted", "line": "Rozay got me out that basement, for him I’ll lay that ass down", "vault_lines": ["Rozay got me out that basement, for him I'll lay that ass down"], "meaning": "Before signing with MMG, Stalley was another underground rapper that no one cared about. He was making music in his basement. Rick Ross signed him and his life changed. Because of that he will kill someone for Rozay.", "annotation_id": "4295670", "url": "https://genius.com/4295670", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Everything A Dope Boy Ever Wanted", "line": "This the crown in Ohio, I sit on that throne And welcome back Lebron, but Stalley been home", "vault_lines": ["This the crown in Ohio, I sit on that throne", "And welcome back Lebron, but Stalley been home"], "meaning": "Stalley is saying he is the king of Ohio, not Lebron James, who recently signed with the Cleveland Cavaliers after leaving the team earlier in his career.", "annotation_id": "4220873", "url": "https://genius.com/4220873", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
