{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Everything A Dope Boy Ever Wanted", "line": "It’s Double M to the grave, free Meek Milly", "vault_lines": ["It's Double M to the grave, free Meek Milly"], "meaning": "The label he’s signed to is called\n“Maybach Music Group” and as a sign of loyalty to this he’s shouting out his ,to the time of the release incarcerated, label mate Meek Mill.\nThe punishment sparked also a petition to Free Meek Mill.", "annotation_id": "4189155", "url": "https://genius.com/4189155", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
