{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Everything A Dope Boy Ever Wanted", "line": "And I ain’t hollerin’, just smooth talk over Beat Billi", "vault_lines": ["And I ain't hollerin', just smooth talk over Beat Billi"], "meaning": "Beat Billionaire is an in-house producer of MMG, and the producer of this track, he was involved in Stalley’s last mixtape, “Honest Cowboy”.\n\n\n\nWhen it comes to delivery, Stalley would rather spit smoothly in contrast to label mate Meek Mill.", "annotation_id": "4184174", "url": "https://genius.com/4184174", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
