{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Face Down", "line": "This one for Magic City (Magic City) Walkin’ in Booby Trap, and I wanna see some ass and titties", "vault_lines": ["This one for Magic City (Magic City)", "Walkin' in Booby Trap, and I wanna see some ass and titties"], "meaning": "Rich The Kid starts his verse by shouting out the iconic hometown strip clubs for both himself and Rozay. Magic City is located in Rich’s hometown of Atlanta, Georgia. On the other hand, Booby Trap is located in Rick Ross' hometown of Miami, Florida.", "annotation_id": "40696832", "url": "https://genius.com/40696832", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
