{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Famous (Remix)", "line": "Malcom X in his head say my name and here come to troops", "vault_lines": ["Malcom X in his head say my name and here come to troops"], "meaning": "Malcom X was was an American Muslim minister and human rights activist. To his admirers he was a courageous advocate for the rights of blacks, but detractors accused him of preaching racism and violence.", "annotation_id": "8945227", "url": "https://genius.com/8945227", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Famous (Remix)", "line": "For the ye I’ve been known to be Karmaloop", "vault_lines": ["For the ye I've been known to be Karmaloop"], "meaning": "Karmaloop is a multi-platform web retailer, community style and media company specializing in streetwear ecommerce. Rozay is well known for his lavish style, but Karmaloop also had some major finansial problem last year, so Rozay better watch what you wish for…", "annotation_id": "8945221", "url": "https://genius.com/8945221", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
