{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fascinated", "line": "I be cryin’ in my car, nigga Nightmares of dyin’ in my car, nigga (I ain’t lyin’)", "vault_lines": ["I be cryin' in my car, nigga", "Nightmares of dyin' in my car, nigga (I ain't lyin')"], "meaning": "In 2013 in Florida, Rick Ross crashed into a building after being a victim of a drive by shooting. This being a near death experience in his life he his bound to have PTSD from these events", "annotation_id": "17791986", "url": "https://genius.com/17791986", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fascinated", "line": "They wanna give you five (Five), wanna give you ten (Ten) Fifteen (Fifteen), send you back again (Damn) Gave my dog life, said he was a killa (Killa)", "vault_lines": ["They wanna give you five (Five), wanna give you ten (Ten)", "Fifteen (Fifteen), send you back again (Damn)", "Gave my dog life, said he was a killa (Killa)"], "meaning": "In a American and according the multiple studies in many states, African Americans are proven to get lengthier sentences for the same EXACT crimes as white men. Truly speaking jail/prison should be a place for rehabilitation but when black men and other minorities receive these lengthy sentences they end up coming out worse than before and have adjusted to the prison life and disconnected with the civilian world. Ross saying “send you back again” possibly hinting at these facts.", "annotation_id": "17791972", "url": "https://genius.com/17791972", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fascinated", "line": "Tattooed names on a nigga back (Black) Rest in peace, nigga, to my lil’ niggas (’Nut) Rest in peace, dyin’ as a lil’ nigga (P-Nut) Buried like a soldier, he’s a true nigga (P-Nut) Throw the flag on his casket, he’s a true nigga (P-Nut) You pussy niggas talkin’ like you knew niggas", "vault_lines": ["Tattooed names on a nigga back (Black)", "Rest in peace, nigga, to my lil' niggas ('Nut)", "Rest in peace, dyin' as a lil' nigga (P-Nut)", "Buried like a soldier, he's a true nigga (P-Nut)", "Throw the flag on his casket, he's a true nigga (P-Nut)", "You pussy niggas talkin' like you knew niggas"], "meaning": "These lyrics shoutout two of Ross' fallen comrades – Black Bo & P-Nut.\n\nNadrian Lateef “Black Bo” James, Ross' longtime manager, died from atherosclerotic cardiovascular disease in December 2017. Black Bo is honored on the Port 2 album cover, memorialized in Ross' pendant.\n\nRaymond “P-Nut” Adderly was Ross' childhood friend who was murdered in a 2010 home invasion.", "annotation_id": "17778076", "url": "https://genius.com/17778076", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fascinated", "status": "done", "targets": 3, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Rick-ross-fascinated-lyrics", "genius_title": "Fascinated", "genius_id": 4747331, "source": "api"}
