{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Finals 2", "line": "My blanket Morocco, my carpet is Cuban", "vault_lines": ["My blanket Morocco, my carpet is Cuban"], "meaning": "Morocco is a North African country known for exporting blankets, carpets, and the sort. Carpet is also slang for cigar, and Cuba is known for its expensive brands. Fat Trel is already balling out, buying all sorts of expensive stuff with his newly earned cash.", "annotation_id": "8427132", "url": "https://genius.com/8427132", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Finals 2", "line": "Beat your ass like a buzzer", "vault_lines": ["Spazz on a busta, beat your ass like a buzzer"], "meaning": "Buzzer beating is a play on the entire theme of “Finals” (sports), just how in basketball one has the chance to beat the buzzer – score right before the clock runs out and the buzzer rings.\n\nGunplay also has that wordplay, he will beat your ass pretty much.", "annotation_id": "4197609", "url": "https://genius.com/4197609", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Finals 2", "line": "Top down, I got your bitch’s hair in a ponytail", "vault_lines": ["Top down, I got your bitch's hair in a ponytail"], "meaning": "Double entendre\n\n\nRoss got someone’s girl in his vehicle with the top down (drop top) , and her hair in a pony tail while there driving , most likely so it doesn’t fly every where from the breeze\nAlso , he’s receiving oral sex , therefore, her top (head) being faced down and her is hair tied so it doesn’t get in the way", "annotation_id": "3406175", "url": "https://genius.com/3406175", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
