{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Finals 2", "line": "She study for finals, I study the game", "vault_lines": ["She study for finals, I study the game"], "meaning": "Finals 2 is the title song and is referring to the NBA finals. Rockie in this lines refer to finals as in Final Examination and says that his bitch studies for finals to get the best grade and Rockie studies the game to know who to beat, who to collab with and etc.", "annotation_id": "3306486", "url": "https://genius.com/3306486", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Finals 2", "line": "Nigga gettin’ bucks off of tellin’ my story", "vault_lines": ["Nigga gettin' bucks off of tellin' my story"], "meaning": "People he never fucked with back in the day are making money by simply telling the media how he came up. Some of it could be false but the main point here is people are making money out of his success. That says something if you can’t get it yourself.", "annotation_id": "3306473", "url": "https://genius.com/3306473", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
