{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fine Lines", "line": "Us", "vault_lines": ["Lot of killers amongst us, I won't speak on the worst"], "meaning": "The proper lyric is “dust” not “us.” Here Ross is eluding to the fact that if he never had a successful rap career he would still be in the streets hustling – selling dust (short for Angel Dust or PCP) a hallucinogen developed in the 1950’s often sold as a white powder.", "annotation_id": "30102151", "url": "https://genius.com/30102151", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
