{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire", "line": "Insane in the membrane", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Mr. Chainz makes a reference to Cypress Hill song “Insane In the Membrane”.\n\n\n\n…INSANE IN THE BRAIN!\n\nI think Nicki Minaj made note of his mental state before on their song I Luv Them Strippers.\n\n“2 Chainz, you fucking crazy”", "annotation_id": "2224667", "url": "https://genius.com/2224667", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
