{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire", "line": "Who want to test this? Titty 2 necklace", "vault_lines": ["Who want to test this? Titty 2 necklace"], "meaning": "2 Chainz has a tall stature standing around 6'4\" so try coming at him.\n\nTitty 2 Necklace, he’s put together his first rap name and his current. It’s also mentioned here", "annotation_id": "2202356", "url": "https://genius.com/2202356", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire", "line": "Jim Carrey, Mariah Carey, you get carried off", "vault_lines": ["Jim Carrey, Mariah Carey, you get carried off"], "meaning": "Here 2 Chainz uses the names of popular comedian/Actor Jim Carrey\n\n\n\nand Singer/Actress/TV Host Mariah Carey\n\n\n\nTo set up a homophone rhyme with the verb “carry,” which is used to imply that someone’s body is being carried away after injury or death.", "annotation_id": "2201533", "url": "https://genius.com/2201533", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire", "line": "Thinking they boss like the Triple C’s CEO", "vault_lines": ["Thinking they boss like the Triple C's CEO"], "meaning": "Triple C’s (Carol City Cartel) is a hip hop group founded by Rick Ross in 2005 which consists of himself, Gunplay, Torch and Young Breed.\n\nNot only is Rick Ross the boss of Triple C’s, he’s a boss all around!\n\n\n\nBun B also feautured on of their songs called ‘’Break It Down‘’.", "annotation_id": "2200847", "url": "https://genius.com/2200847", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire", "line": "Take his motherfucking head from His shoulders, this is Bedlam - mayhem, chaos", "vault_lines": ["His shoulders, this is Bedlam - mayhem, chaos"], "meaning": "Bedlam is a popular name for the Bethlem Royal Hospital which historically served as a lunatic asylum, but is today a  modern psychiatric facility for the treatment of the mentally ill. The word ‘'bedlam’‘ describes madness or chaos.\n\nBasically Bun B is completely insane and will rip your head off.", "annotation_id": "2200815", "url": "https://genius.com/2200815", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire", "line": "Balling like the ESPY’s", "vault_lines": ["Balling like the ESPY's"], "meaning": "2 Chainz be ballin' so hard he ..\n\nThe ESPY award is given every year to the best sport-related performance: they are truly ballers in the literal sense of the word.", "annotation_id": "2199181", "url": "https://genius.com/2199181", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
