{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire Hazard", "line": "Ric Flair", "vault_lines": ["Ricky Ross, Ric Flair"], "meaning": "Ross is comparing himself to wrestler Ric Flair, a.k.a. The Black Scorpion, the National Wrestling Alliance’s World Heavyweight Champion from 1981 to 1986.\n\nFlair was known for his witty smacktalk, ostentatious jewelry, designer suits, and elaborate custom wrestling robes, so it could be that Ross is comparing his own gaudy style and wordplay to Ric’s.  Of course, there’s also the “heavyweight” pun to consider, since Ross claims to push “heavy weight” himself (large amounts of cocaine).", "annotation_id": "341315", "url": "https://genius.com/341315", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire Hazard", "line": "Quarter milli in the Louis,", "vault_lines": ["Quarter milli in the Louis,"], "meaning": "Rozay perpetuates another hip-hop cliche by filling his Louis Vuitton carry-on bag with money, in this case $250,000. By doing this (going by the current cost of a Louis Vuitton Keepall 55cm, arguably the French luxury house’s most popular duffel), he is filling his Louis Vuitton bag with 168.350165 other Louis Vuitton bags.\n\n\n\nBut hey, you gotta put something in there, right?", "annotation_id": "273499", "url": "https://genius.com/273499", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire Hazard", "line": "Trips to Hawaii with Diddy on Concordes", "vault_lines": ["Trips to Hawaii with Diddy on Concordes"], "meaning": "Even though the Concorde, a famous French supersonic jet, is now retired from flight, Rick and Diddy pay tribute by maintaining their respective roles as the Adipose Airman and the Atmospheric Ad-Libber.", "annotation_id": "273497", "url": "https://genius.com/273497", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire Hazard", "line": "Bitch pretty as Apollonia", "vault_lines": ["bitch pretty as Apollonia"], "meaning": "referring to Apollonia 6’s (and Prince’s Purple Rain) lead singer , actress , and former model , the beautiful Patricia “Apollonia” Kotero .", "annotation_id": "169515", "url": "https://genius.com/169515", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fire Hazard", "line": "Who ever knew I would afford cologne by Tom Ford", "vault_lines": ["Who ever knew I would afford cologne by Tom Ford"], "meaning": "TOM FORD is a leading fashion designer best known for his designs in luxury clothing, accessories, fragrance and cosmetics.\n\n\n\nA small bottle of his cologne prices out to be $465 per bottle.", "annotation_id": "169353", "url": "https://genius.com/169353", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
