{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Flashy Cars Movie Stars", "line": "In other games, when you live, you learn In this game of life nigga, when you fail, you burn", "vault_lines": ["In other games, when you live, you learn", "In this game of life nigga, when you fail, you burn"], "meaning": "People say you learn from your mistakes as you grow older, however Rozay is saying that in reality mistakes lead to your failure/doom, therefore there is no room for error in life.", "annotation_id": "2241560", "url": "https://genius.com/2241560", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Flashy Cars Movie Stars", "line": "So much stress on your mama, daddy been gone", "vault_lines": ["So much stress on your mama, daddy been gone"], "meaning": "Refers to a common domestic problem many families face. In families where the father is dead/never around for his family, the single mother is under heavy pressure to care for her children, which relates to rick ross' childhood whereby he had no father for the majority of his life.\n\n“Bastard child but I got a fleet of cars” All Birds ft French Montana", "annotation_id": "2241547", "url": "https://genius.com/2241547", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
