{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fly Together", "line": "Mayweather flow, look, zero losses", "vault_lines": ["Mayweather flow, look, zero losses"], "meaning": "His flow is powerful, undefeated, similar to Floyd Mayweather Jr., a professional boxer who is 42-0 with 26 KO’s.\n\n\n\nToo bad he’s afraid to fight Manny Pacquiao…", "annotation_id": "399660", "url": "https://genius.com/399660", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
