{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "For Da Low", "line": "M-I-Yayo on the map, now it’s my city", "vault_lines": ["M-I-Yayo on the map, now it's my city"], "meaning": "He calls Miami Miyayo because of the city’s and his connection to yayo (drugs) and his connection to the city. Rozay put his town on the map in the rap game, and thus he runs it.", "annotation_id": "888699", "url": "https://genius.com/888699", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
