{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "I could Western Union some money, get your passport and then come", "vault_lines": ["I could Western Union some money, get your passport and then come"], "meaning": "Refrence back to “The Calm” off SFG where Drake tries to Western Union some money to his friends but he doesn’t know if it will work. Now, at the top, he can do it for a random girl.", "annotation_id": "40571736", "url": "https://genius.com/40571736", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
