{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "This is my town, if you need something, just ask for it, it’s yours Yeah, ask for it, it’s yours, if you ask for it, it’s done", "vault_lines": ["This is my town, if you need something, just ask for it, it's yours", "Yeah, ask for it, it's yours, if you ask for it, it's done"], "meaning": "Drake runs Toronto, if she needs anything, she can go to him.", "annotation_id": "40571716", "url": "https://genius.com/40571716", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
