{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "[Chorus: Drake]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "A hypnotic and alluring chorus alluding to the fact said woman will always be Drakes whether he’s around or not but most importantly even when they’re broken up!", "annotation_id": "28892832", "url": "https://genius.com/28892832", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "Puffing purple hash, welcome to my power circle", "vault_lines": ["Puffing purple hash, welcome to my power circle"], "meaning": "Purple hash, also known as purple haze, is a hybrid flavored cannabis strain that has a purple color.\n\nRoss' “power circle” is MMG or Maybach Music Group, his record label, who consists of notable artists such as Wale, Meek Mill, Gunplay and Ross himself. It would also the title of a popular song by Ross released the following year in June 2012.", "annotation_id": "18559865", "url": "https://genius.com/18559865", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "My momma still praying for her Rubberband Man", "vault_lines": ["My momma still praying for her Rubberband Man"], "meaning": "A “rubberband man” is someone who can get money with ease. They’re given this name as rubber bands are used to hold large wads of cash together. Ross may also be alluding to T.I’s December 2003 hit, “Rubber Band Man.” Both are good friends and have collaborated many times together.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s5bjt4ySI7M", "annotation_id": "18559785", "url": "https://genius.com/18559785", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "I fondle the money, fornicate with a fortune", "vault_lines": ["I fondle the money, fornicate with a fortune"], "meaning": "Fornication is the act of two unmarried people who have sexual intercourse. On Drake’s November 2011 track, “Lord Knows,” Ross also mentions fornication:\n\nMink coats make your woman wanna fornicate (fornicate)", "annotation_id": "18559765", "url": "https://genius.com/18559765", "state": "accepted", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "When them wheels land, Travis Barker, drums playing Tap-dance to my drum roll", "vault_lines": ["When them wheels land, Travis Barker, drums playing", "Tap-dance to my drum roll"], "meaning": "Rozay wants a real-life drum roll played by Blink-182 drummer Travis Barker.  Lest you think Ross is secretly headbanging to “What’s My Age Again”, Barker also works with tons of rappers, and in fact toured with Ross in 2011.  However, the “wheels land” language here is rather thoughtless, as Barker was involved in a 2008 plane crash that left him with serious burns, and killed four others", "annotation_id": "359762", "url": "https://genius.com/359762", "state": "accepted", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "Pimp flows and Screw flows, my shit is sounding like grey tapes Now, let me gon’ hit that cup, one time ’fore a nigga hit that road These days keep going by too fast, so give me anything to make shit go slow", "vault_lines": ["Pimp flows and Screw flows, my shit is sounding like grey tapes", "Now, let me gon' hit that cup, one time 'fore a nigga hit that road", "These days keep going by too fast, so give me anything to make shit go slow"], "meaning": "This section serves as a tribute to deceased Texas rap figures.  Chad “Pimp C” Butler was a member of the legendary Texas rap group UGK.  The group’s remaining member, Bernard “Bun B” Freeman, has taken to championing Drake\n\n\n\nRobert “DJ Screw” Davis, Jr. was another seminal Texas rap figure, associated with the Houston scene.  The DJ’s claim to fame was making mixtapes where he slowed down the music, using a technique that would come to bear his name.  Screw made almost 250 mixtapes before his 2000 passing, and some of the earlier ones were referred to as grey tapes because they were recorded on a Maxell tape similar to the one shown below:\n\n\n\nThe “chopped and screwed” sound, and most of the Houston rap scene, would come to be associated with purple drank, a drink containing codeine and promethazine, whose woozy buzz perfectly matched the slowed-down feel of Screw’s tapes.  The final two lines mention the drank and its buzz as a means Drake has taken to slow down his fast-paced life.", "annotation_id": "359753", "url": "https://genius.com/359753", "state": "accepted", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "Fuck with my young niggas, XO Gang", "vault_lines": ["Fuck with my young niggas, XO Gang"], "meaning": "Drake shouting out the XO team, The Weeknd.", "annotation_id": "358045", "url": "https://genius.com/358045", "state": "accepted", "votes": 35, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "Voodoo Child to my new hoes", "vault_lines": ["Voodoo Child to my new hoes"], "meaning": "Drake has been, by his own admission, obsessed with Jimi Hendrix in recent years, even leaving a note on the great guitarist’s grave – his pilgrimage there is pictured below. “Voodoo Chile” and, especially, its reprise “Voodoo Child (Slight Return)”, are well-known Hendrix songs.\n\n\n\nDrake visiting Jimi Hendrix’s gravesite circa September 2010 via October Very Own’s blogspot", "annotation_id": "357985", "url": "https://genius.com/357985", "state": "accepted", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
