{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Fuck Em", "line": "Put the remix on my kilo", "vault_lines": ["put the remix on my kilo"], "meaning": "Kilo is referencing to one kilo gram of weed that he remixes by putting some cocaine in it to have more effect when smoked. It’s referencing the previous verse C-note by using the C as Cocaine.", "annotation_id": "2071844", "url": "https://genius.com/2071844", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
