{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Geetchi Liberachi", "line": "Patek Philippe", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Patek Philippe is ultra luxury Swiss watch that can easily run into 6 figures and that’s without diamonds. Historically Rick Ross periodically introduced us to new brand of watches that we never heard of or seldom heard of. Notably Vacheron Constantin on Teflon Don album, and he’s known to mispronounce “Audemar”. Nonetheless it’s nice of him to keep us cultured.", "annotation_id": "6904049", "url": "https://genius.com/6904049", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Geetchi Liberachi", "line": "My bitch resemble Pinky", "vault_lines": ["Smoking in a benzo, my bitch resemble Pinky"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is here refering to Pinky XXX, a porn star that’s very popular in hiphop/urban community mostly because of her rather large buttocks & a lively personality. What Rick Ross is getting at here is that the girl he’s with has a big booty.", "annotation_id": "6903777", "url": "https://genius.com/6903777", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
