{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Go Get the Money", "line": "Zaytoven", "vault_lines": ["King Push and Zaytoven, it’s whatever niggas, yuugh!"], "meaning": "San Francisco-based producer Zaytoven’s tag is shouted on the track. Zay has worked with a wide range of notable Atlanta artists such as Soulja Boy, Future, Young Jeezy, and Usher. However, he is mainly known for his production work alongside Gucci Mane, contributing to the majority of the rapper’s solo projects.", "annotation_id": "18408079", "url": "https://genius.com/18408079", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Go Get the Money", "line": "And all my niggas shooters, so honestly I don’t know who shot him", "vault_lines": ["And all my niggas shooters, so honestly I don't know who shot him"], "meaning": "LAPD named Yo Gotti as a “person of interest” in the shooting of Young Dolph in September 2017. Gotti is saying he rolls with so many shooters it could have been any one of them and he wouldn’t know.", "annotation_id": "14568948", "url": "https://genius.com/14568948", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Go Get the Money", "line": "I’m in first class with two-fifty (two-fifty), I’m in first class Meek Milly (yeah) Fuck JFK airport, lost my nigga’s grip over Customs (Customs)", "vault_lines": ["I'm in first class with two-fifty (two-fifty), I'm in first class Meek Milly (yeah)"], "meaning": "Upon release from, Meek Mill did not need to go through Customs. He flew first class in a chopper. Yo Gotti likens himself to Meek Mill.\n\n\n\nMeek Mill was spotted boarding Michael Rubin’s chopper heading to Philadelphia 76ers playoff game.\n\nMichael Rubin is the co-owner of the 76ers. The prison, where Meek was held in, is about 12 miles from the arena (where the 76ers were taking on the Miami Heat in Game 5 of their NBA playoff series)", "annotation_id": "14566776", "url": "https://genius.com/14566776", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Go Get the Money", "line": "Maybach Music", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Maybach Music Group or MMG is the record label founded by Rick Ross.  Other popular artists like Meek Mill, Wale and Omarion all are signed to this record label.\n\n“Maybach Music” is a regular ad-lib used by Rick Ross, the line is voiced by Australian model Jessica Gomes.", "annotation_id": "14542854", "url": "https://genius.com/14542854", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Go Get the Money", "status": "done", "targets": 4, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Zaytoven-go-get-the-money-lyrics", "genius_title": "Go Get the Money", "genius_id": 3706849, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Go Mode", "line": "60 cars in my yard, I’m tryna touch 100", "vault_lines": ["60 cars in my yard, I'm tryna touch 100"], "meaning": "Anyone who follows Ross' Snapchat won’t doubt his ability to achieve this. He’s got a massive lineup of vehicles that he displays daily to his fans. GQ collated some of his most “Baller” rides, but it doesn’t even begin to scratch the surface of his vehicular arsenal.", "annotation_id": "10129852", "url": "https://genius.com/10129852", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Go Mode", "line": "Rolling Stone, time to grace another issue", "vault_lines": ["Rolling Stone, time to grace another issue"], "meaning": "Ross graced the August 2012 cover of Rolling Stone, which was a piece on his “gangster” and his standing in the game.\n\n\n\nThat was the last time he was featured on the cover, he seems to suggest there’s another one in the not too distant future.", "annotation_id": "10129847", "url": "https://genius.com/10129847", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Go Mode", "line": "Club jumpin’ once again, hydraulics", "vault_lines": ["Club jumpin' once again, hydraulics"], "meaning": "He’s got the club jumping like hyrdaulics make a car go up and down", "annotation_id": "10070195", "url": "https://genius.com/10070195", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
