{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Gold Wrappers", "line": "I’m leaving gold wrappers on the nightstand, she my one night fan I’m leaving gold wrappers on the nightstand, oh", "vault_lines": ["I'm leaving gold wrappers on the nightstand, she my one night fan", "I'm leaving gold wrappers on the nightstand, oh"], "meaning": "Gold wrappers refers to the wrappers of Trojan Magnum condoms. B isn’t looking for any form of commitment with this girl, it’s strictly a one night stand in which, he’ll give his all to her for one night one.", "annotation_id": "9098260", "url": "https://genius.com/9098260", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
