{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Gone to the Moon", "line": "I bought my bitch from Perfections, you know I buy my affection Ain’t no love for me, nigga, and I accept my direction On my road to perfection, so many hours invested", "vault_lines": ["I bought my bitch from Perfections, you know I buy my affection", "Ain't no love for me, nigga, and I accept my direction", "On my road to perfection, so many hours invested"], "meaning": "He Buys his Girl “Perfections” That means Nice things and maybe Body Parts. He dont fucks with these Nigga’s Like in the Track Us\nHe puts alot of work in the rap game to be the best.", "annotation_id": "1164503", "url": "https://genius.com/1164503", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
