{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Gunplay", "line": "Oh, what a feelin’, hundred rounds in the drum", "vault_lines": ["Oh, what a feelin', hundred rounds in the drum"], "meaning": "Ross is likely making a reference to classic gangster weapon of the 20th century; the Thompson M1928A1 sub-machine gun is famous for its use by 1940s mobsters (and in the films about them).\n\n\n\nHe makes a similar reference on “Magic” and “All Birds”.", "annotation_id": "2651656", "url": "https://genius.com/2651656", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Gunplay", "line": "They envy my success", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, they want a nigga dead, they envy my success"], "meaning": "People are witnessing Rick Ross' uprising/success and are wishing that they could share the same fortune he is currently bathing in.", "annotation_id": "2241572", "url": "https://genius.com/2241572", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Gunplay", "line": "Who that behind the curtain? I’ll murk ’em Wizard-of-Oz-ass niggas, hidin’ behind money Hidin’ behind luxury", "vault_lines": ["Who that behind the curtain? I'll murk 'em", "Wizard-of-Oz-ass niggas, hidin' behind money"], "meaning": "A lot of people will talk shit and think they’re safe since they’re rich. Gunplay respectfully disagrees. He’ll kill anyone if they give him a reason.\n\nThis references the classic film The Wizard of Oz, where the all-powerful wizard turns out to just be a lame hiding behind a curtain.\n\n\n\nThe curtain line is also a reference to rappers who hide behind the curtain of Maybach’s", "annotation_id": "1422919", "url": "https://genius.com/1422919", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Gunplay", "line": "Beat the case like Gotti, we the trill Murder Inc", "vault_lines": ["Beat the case like Gotti, we the trill Murder Inc"], "meaning": "He compares himself to John Gotti (also not the first time), a professional mafioso hitman who skipped out on murder charges. He also says that he and his homies are the Black Murder Inc which was a mafioso professional hit man organisation led by Meyer Lansky.", "annotation_id": "1062911", "url": "https://genius.com/1062911", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
