{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Hard in the Paint (Freestyle)", "line": "Order twenty bottles of the Rozay", "vault_lines": ["Order twenty bottles of the Rozay"], "meaning": "Ross ordered 20 bottles of Rozay wine. This also goes with his rapping name RICKY ROZAY which is why the adlift is screamed after he says rozay. He is known for always purchasing bottles of Rozay when he makes special appearances to clubs.", "annotation_id": "1926450", "url": "https://genius.com/1926450", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Hard in the Paint (Freestyle)", "line": "Just last night, I had a dream I shot me a... Pop my trunk, I’mma pop me a... Just last night, I had a dream I shot me a nigga", "vault_lines": ["Just last night, I had a dream I shot me a...", "Pop my trunk, I'mma pop me a..."], "meaning": "Ross had a dream that he shot a nigga himself without paying for a hitman.\n\nThis line is one of the most troubling Ross lines for Ross fans – he plays on a phrase uttered by many a Klan and White Supremacist member, “Let’s go shoot a nigger”.\n\nWhat does Rozay mean by this? Has he “made it” to the point of transcending his race? Is he looking down on poor and hating blacks?", "annotation_id": "710374", "url": "https://genius.com/710374", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Hard in the Paint (Freestyle)", "line": "You think I give a fuck what other niggas think? Make another million every time a nigga blink", "vault_lines": ["You think I give a fuck what other niggas think?", "Make another million every time a nigga blink"], "meaning": "He doesn’t care what nobody else thinks about him. He’s still getting millions of dollars.", "annotation_id": "709007", "url": "https://genius.com/709007", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
