{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Hard in the Paint (Freestyle)", "line": "Pop one pill, make a nigga spend a grand Pop two pills, make a nigga wanna dance Pop my trunk, pop me a nigga", "vault_lines": ["Pop one pill, make a nigga spend a grand", "Pop two pills, make a nigga wanna dance", "Pop my trunk, pop me a nigga"], "meaning": "He’s poppin a shitload of pills so he spends money and dances like crazy.\n\nWe all know he keeps a choppa in the car, so he grabs it out the trunk and he shoots a “nigga”.", "annotation_id": "613692", "url": "https://genius.com/613692", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
