{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Heavyweight", "line": "I’m the Thrilla in Manila Belaire, my Ciroc vanilla", "vault_lines": ["I'm the Thrilla in Manila", "Belaire, my Ciroc vanilla"], "meaning": "The Thrilla in Manila was the third and final meeting between Muhammad Ali and Joe Frazier in Quezon City, Metro Manila, Philippines on October 1, 1975.\n\n\n\nRick Ross is endorsed by Belaire Rosé.", "annotation_id": "4395592", "url": "https://genius.com/4395592", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Heavyweight", "line": "Out there with that CrossFit shit Nigga think he a boxer, workin’ out and shit", "vault_lines": ["Nigga think he a boxer, workin' out and shit"], "meaning": "Rick Ross started doing Crossfit, or as he referred to it, ‘Rossfit’, causing him to lose over 100 pounds.", "annotation_id": "4395573", "url": "https://genius.com/4395573", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Heavyweight", "line": "Nigga done bought Holyfield crib, nigga Five hundred acres, a thousand rooms, nigga This nigga think he the champ Holyfield must have left a belt in that bitch for him Ya dig?", "vault_lines": ["Nigga done bought Holyfield crib, nigga", "Five hundred acres, a thousand rooms, nigga", "This nigga think he the champ", "Holyfield must have left a belt in that bitch for him"], "meaning": "Ross purchased a Fayette, Georgia mansion that was previously owned by famous boxer Evander Holyfield for $5.8 million after it had been in foreclosure.\n\nIt features 235 acres of land and has a 350,000 gallon pool, a movie theater, and a boxing gym.", "annotation_id": "4395551", "url": "https://genius.com/4395551", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
