{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Hell’s Angels (American Heathens)", "line": "And they all educated, it’s still niggas stuck on stupid", "vault_lines": ["And they all educated, it's still niggas stuck on stupid"], "meaning": "The lyric is: ‘and they well educated..“ When Ross says \"niggas stuck on stupid”, its referencing all the haters that still hate on him for the past – the CO allegations. These niggas are stupid for still hating on his past, and its the only argument a Ross hater can bring up. The previous bar “they all educated” is showing how the women who love him are the opposite of the dumb haters, the women are smart to like Ross.", "annotation_id": "742828", "url": "https://genius.com/742828", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
