{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Hell’s Angels (American Heathens)", "line": "Beard longer than Castro’s Put fear up in these assholes,", "vault_lines": ["Put fear up in these assholes,"], "meaning": "Stalley’s beard is longer (and cooler) than that of Fidel Castro’s. He also plants fear in his enemies the same fashion Castro did during his reign as the dictator of Cuba. .", "annotation_id": "674660", "url": "https://genius.com/674660", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Hell’s Angels (American Heathens)", "line": "Don’t keep too many in my ride Learned that from T.I.", "vault_lines": ["don't keep too many in my ride", "Learned that from T.I."], "meaning": "In this case, Stalley learned from T.I.’s mistakes. .\n\nTip was caught riding dirty with three guns in his vehicle, not to mention another collection stashed at home, back in 2007. .", "annotation_id": "674638", "url": "https://genius.com/674638", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
