{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Here I Am", "line": "She from the north and still can’t believe the weather", "vault_lines": ["She from the north and still can't believe the weather"], "meaning": "Miami is known for having some of the nicest/warmest weather. Even in the winters, Miami’s weather is still in the 70’s. Ross' girl is from the northern part of the US, where it can get quite cold, so she can’t believe how warm it stays even during the coldest time of the year.", "annotation_id": "1406812", "url": "https://genius.com/1406812", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Here I Am", "line": "Cookin’ like Home EC for financial aid", "vault_lines": ["Cookin' like Home EC for financial aid"], "meaning": "Perhaps she is cooking cocaine, to sell in order to help for her tuition as college educations are expensive. FAMU isn’t too bad, if she has a scholarship though.\n\nEven Rozay’s bitches hustle.", "annotation_id": "1406793", "url": "https://genius.com/1406793", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
