{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Holla at Me", "line": "Leave a bitch back all nutty like Almond Joy", "vault_lines": ["Leave a bitch back all nutty like Almond Joy"], "meaning": "Almond Joy is a candy bar that has an almond on top. Nut is a slang term for semen. Paul is saying he will nut (ejaculate) on a womans back leaving it “nutty” similar to how Almond Joy candy bars are topped with a nut.", "annotation_id": "23722914", "url": "https://genius.com/23722914", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
