{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Homey N Hoes", "line": "I’m not an astronaut baby I just get high in the day", "vault_lines": ["I'm not an astronaut baby", "I just get high in the day"], "meaning": "Astronaut’s go to space, space is the atmosphere surrounding earth, associating with the previous line.\n\nGetting high in the day is because Ross stays smoking weed", "annotation_id": "2206513", "url": "https://genius.com/2206513", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
