{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Hottest in the Hood (Remix 1)", "line": "Rap King James, I’ma put it on the chain", "vault_lines": ["Rap King James, I'ma put it on the chain"], "meaning": "When asked about this lyric by Genius for their Inside the Lines series, Red Cafe explained:\n\nI felt like I was the hottest in the hood, and at the time LeBron James was the hottest in the NBA, so I was the Rap LeBron James at that time.\n\nHe also explained that when he said “I'ma put it on the chain”, he was saying he was going to get a chain with a crown on the chain.", "annotation_id": "14915911", "url": "https://genius.com/14915911", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
