{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "How We Do It", "line": "I’m on my paper chase racing where the paper at WOO! Money bags stacked on top my money bags", "vault_lines": ["I'm on my paper chase racing where the paper at", "WOO! Money bags stacked on top my money bags"], "meaning": "It’s a cat and mouse game for Ross, with the cat winning every time. He’s running out of ways to describe how much money he’s stacking up.", "annotation_id": "8735217", "url": "https://genius.com/8735217", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "How We Do It", "line": "Got a connect he keep me straight I think he’s Mexican", "vault_lines": ["Got a connect he keep me straight", "I think he's Mexican"], "meaning": "Drug dealing is a norm with Mexicans, and they’re quite impeccable at it. Read more here…\n\n\n\nIt only makes sense that Ross' supplier is one of them.", "annotation_id": "8735139", "url": "https://genius.com/8735139", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "How We Do It", "line": "It’s time to show these niggas how we do it HUH! It’s time to show these niggas how we do it HUH! I’m counting paper and I’m running through it HUH! I’m counting paper and I’m running through it", "vault_lines": ["It's time to show these niggas how we do it", "HUH! It's time to show these niggas how we do it", "HUH! I'm counting paper and I'm running through it"], "meaning": "There’s no one to show you better than the one who’s been through it all. Ross has been living a “boss life” for a while now, almost wanting for nothing. Money is more of a hobby than a necessity to him, and he’s still stacking up, like a boss…", "annotation_id": "8735107", "url": "https://genius.com/8735107", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
