{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "How We Do It", "line": "Stacks tall on my wall stand about my height", "vault_lines": ["Stacks tall on my wall stand about my height"], "meaning": "An average $100 bill is 0.00826772 inches thick, Slim Thug’s height is 6 feet 6 inches. That means each one of those stacks is worth $870,856.  Thug has multiple money stacks, each worth more than $870,856, laying around in his apartment.\n\n\n\nThat’s a lot of cash!", "annotation_id": "6258951", "url": "https://genius.com/6258951", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "How We Do It", "line": "I said the only way we fucking is if she to bring a friend.HA!", "vault_lines": ["I said the only way we fucking is if she to bring a friend.HA!"], "meaning": "You must bring a friend if you plan on smashing, Slim is so irresistible that he can demand women engage in group sex with him.", "annotation_id": "686379", "url": "https://genius.com/686379", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
