{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "How We Do It", "line": "I got a Chevy, got a Benz", "vault_lines": ["I got a Chevy, got a Benz"], "meaning": "Ross hasn’t made it a secret he loves Maybachs, which is a luxury car brand of Mercedes-Benz. We already know Slim Thug owns a chrome Camaro:\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UW9xqMIHFm8", "annotation_id": "679162", "url": "https://genius.com/679162", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
