{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "How to Minimize Politics in Your Company", "line": "Who the f@#k you think you f$&kin’ with I’m the f%*kin’ boss —Rick Ross, Hustlin’", "vault_lines": ["I’m the f%*kin’ boss"], "meaning": "I can sit here all day and explain how to handle politics as CEO: how to spot it, how deal with it, how to keep executives from spreading it. But, I really didn’t think that the readers would know how to do it unless they internalized Rick Ross’s classic line.", "annotation_id": "737765", "url": "https://genius.com/737765", "state": "verified", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
