{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Hungry", "line": "Hungry, starving, mhm", "vault_lines": ["Mhm, not thirsty, m-m-mm, just hungry"], "meaning": "PROPOSED SUGGESTION:\n\nFergie is saying she’s hungry and starving for ambition, which means she wants to be on top again and continue on with what she does which is right but she says she’s hungry for more fame and to be more strive for success.", "annotation_id": "9280334", "url": "https://genius.com/9280334", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
