{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Came I Saw", "line": "I-TV e next door S’ngena fokol", "vault_lines": ["I-TV e next door"], "meaning": "They had no TV at home, they watched it nextdoor.\n\n“Fokol” is a township slang for “nothing”, “sngena fokol” means “we had nothing”", "annotation_id": "20859258", "url": "https://genius.com/20859258", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
