{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Dip if you tryna kill a nigga vibe, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Dip if you tryna kill a nigga vibe, yeah"], "meaning": "XXXTENTACION was beginning to embrace love and happiness in the last period of his life. He was able to change his mindset in positive. With his music X goals was to make people feel less alone and more relaxed. On A Ghetto Christmas Carol, he sings:\n\nIt’s a vibe, yeah, feeling right, yeah\nKeep it quiet, thought a nigga told you, you", "annotation_id": "21768481", "url": "https://genius.com/21768481", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Niggas wanna kill me ‘cause I’m rockin’ stones (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["Niggas wanna kill me 'cause I'm rockin' stones (Huh)"], "meaning": "Rick Ross implies that for many he may be a target because of his success and wealth. By this he is also referring to XXXTENTACION’s fate. X was shot to death during a robbery while out shopping for motorcycles.", "annotation_id": "20292970", "url": "https://genius.com/20292970", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Dip if you tryna kill a nigga vibe, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Dip if you tryna kill a nigga vibe, yeah"], "meaning": "XXXTENTACION was beginning to embrace love and happiness in the last period of his life. He was able to change his mindset in positive. With his music X goals was to make people feel less alone and more relaxed. On A Ghetto Christmas Carol, he sings:\n\nIt’s a vibe, yeah, feeling right, yeah\nKeep it quiet, thought a nigga told you, you", "annotation_id": "20292887", "url": "https://genius.com/20292887", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Jealousy is obvious, no, I don’t need a lens", "vault_lines": ["Jealousy is obvious, no, I don't need a lens"], "meaning": "Ross’ reference to jealousy, while it could be a general statement, seems more directed to X. On June 18th, 2018, X was shot and killed outside KIVA motorsports. Ross could be referring to the jealousy that Michael Boatwright and Trayvon Newsome, the alleged shooters, held. Ross is saying that he does not need a lens to zoom in and help him see the jealousy that others have towards others simply because of fame.", "annotation_id": "18608853", "url": "https://genius.com/18608853", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Dip if you tryna kill a nigga vibe, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Dip if you tryna kill a nigga vibe, yeah"], "meaning": "XXXTENTACION was beginning to embrace love and happiness in the last period of his life. He was able to change his mindset in positive. With his music X goals was to make people feel less alone and more relaxed. On A Ghetto Christmas Carol, he sings:\n\nIt’s a vibe, yeah, feeling right, yeah\nKeep it quiet, thought a nigga told you, you", "annotation_id": "18608088", "url": "https://genius.com/18608088", "state": "pending", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Wings on my whip, I pray we meet again", "vault_lines": ["Wings on my whip, I pray we meet again"], "meaning": "“Wings” Refers to the iconic angel on the car brand Rolls Royce. On some of the models, there is a small angel that sticks out of the edge of the hood.", "annotation_id": "18598651", "url": "https://genius.com/18598651", "state": "pending", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Your name will never die, lil’ homie Woah", "vault_lines": ["Your name will never die, lil' homie"], "meaning": "Rick Ross pays his respects to the late XXXTENTACION, just as he did shortly after X was shot to death while out shopping for motorcycles. On June 21st, Rozay posted a video of him expressing his condolences.\n\nI want to send a big rest in peace to the homie XXXTENTACION. Young nigga with a gift.  I know the little homie, he was a talent. That’s all I know.\n\nAdditionally, Ross also sent out a tweet a day after X’s murder, expressing condolences:\n\nhttps://twitter.com/RickRoss/status/1009055101275770880", "annotation_id": "18593231", "url": "https://genius.com/18593231", "state": "accepted", "votes": 45, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Murals of Nipsey (Huh), reppin’ for X (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["Murals of Nipsey (Huh), reppin’ for X (Woo)"], "meaning": "Ross mentions two late rappers, XXXTENTACION and Nipsey Hussle, who were both murdered in the late 2010s whose deaths greatly impacted both the music industry and world.\n\nRozay and Nipsey had a very extensive music career together before the latter’s passing in March of 2019. On tracks like October 2013’s “The Weather,” October 2016’s “Mark My Words,” March 2017’s “Buy Back The Block (Refinance Version),” and more, the two formed a tight relationship. Ross even got a tattoo of Hussle in light of his death.\n\nThe murals which Ross mentions are a new movement in Hussle’s hometown in Los Angeles, as artists and fans alike flock to unpainted walls to commemorate and celebrate the life of Nipsey in art form.\n\n\n\nAlthough Ross and XXXTENTACION have only collaborated on this song, he insists that he will represent the late rapper following his death. Ross also mourned for X directly after his murder on Twitter:\nhttps://twitter.com/rickross/status/1009055101275770880?lang=en", "annotation_id": "18592982", "url": "https://genius.com/18592982", "state": "accepted", "votes": 52, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "They wanna wet William, Russian roulette", "vault_lines": ["They wanna wet William, Russian roulette"], "meaning": "Russian roulette is the dangerous and potentially suicidal game where a bullet is loaded into the chamber of a revolver gun, which is then spun around and shot. With a one in six chance of death, the game is extremely deadly.\n\n\n\nThe game originated in Tsarist Russia as a means for gambling.", "annotation_id": "18519600", "url": "https://genius.com/18519600", "state": "accepted", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Got my homie’s name tatted all over my flesh", "vault_lines": ["Got my homie's name tatted all over my flesh"], "meaning": "Ross has well over 100 tattoos that cover almost the full surface of his body. In a 2014 Buzzfeed interview, Rozay said:\n\nI have a ‘Rest In Peace’ to my dad. ‘Rest In Peace’ to three or four of my friends.\n\n\n\nOther interesting tattoos from Ross include 50 different dollar signs sprawled across him, Darth Vader from Star Wars on his thigh, his childhood nickname “Chill Will” on his stomach, and his parents' birth dates along his knuckles.", "annotation_id": "18512707", "url": "https://genius.com/18512707", "state": "accepted", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Slid to the crib, I’m in her insides, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Slid to the crib, I'm in her insides, yeah"], "meaning": "X owned and resided in a 6,000 square foot Parkland, Florida mansion with 4 bedrooms, 5 bathrooms and a pool, which costed him a hefty $1.4 million.\n\n\n\nIf X took an ordinary female to his house, there’s no doubt she would be awe-struck by his wealth, and if he decided to take her on as his bride, he would most definitely change her life with his estimated $5 million net worth.\n\nThis could also be a reference to his 2018 song, “going down!,” as the two songs have similar themes:\n\nGoing down, it’s going down\nOh my God, shawty thick she-\nOh my God, yeah, yeah\nOh my God, shawty thick she-\nOh my God\n\nThis would hint that it would be more of a sexual reference, “in her insides” thus describing X going in his girl’s private parts.", "annotation_id": "18512649", "url": "https://genius.com/18512649", "state": "accepted", "votes": 44, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "line": "Whip with the peanut butter insides, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Whip with the peanut butter insides, yeah"], "meaning": "Leather interior in cars is often referred to as “peanut butter.” X implies that his car, the BMW i8, got leather interior.\n\nX has also previously referenced “peanut butter and jelly” in relation to his car in his XXL Freshmen 2017 Cypher outtakes:\n\nNo DM, I’m her MCM on Instagram\nMy skin peanut butter color, inside whip is really jelly", "annotation_id": "18069103", "url": "https://genius.com/18069103", "state": "accepted", "votes": 46, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Changed Her Life", "status": "done", "targets": 12, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Xxxtentacion-i-changed-her-life-lyrics", "genius_title": "I Changed Her Life", "genius_id": 4847314, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Did It for My Dawgz", "line": "Hundred in the mula got more diamonds than a jeweler", "vault_lines": ["Hundred in the mula got more diamonds than a jeweler"], "meaning": "Franck Muller is a Swiss watch manufacturer in the luxury segment.\nRoss claims to have set his “Muller” with more diamonds than a normal jeweler has in his inventory\n\nhttp://splashysplash.com/2014/07/french-montana-iced-out-franck-muller-king-conquistador-cortez-diamond-watch-splash/", "annotation_id": "24041542", "url": "https://genius.com/24041542", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
