{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Love My Bitches", "line": "Bottles, Beamers, Brand New Benz’s Barbies, ballerina’s and Britney’s", "vault_lines": ["Barbies, ballerina's and Britney's"], "meaning": "Ross denotes the perks of being the Boss:\n\n\nUnlimited bottles of his favorite champagne Belaire Rose.\nLuxurious cars like BMWs and Mercedes Benzes.\nAll the baddest bitches in the world, like popstar Britney Spears.\n\n\n\nThese lines begin the tremendous alliteration within the verse.", "annotation_id": "2037917", "url": "https://genius.com/2037917", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
