{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "We took over the projects while you did the dishes", "vault_lines": ["We took over the projects while you did the dishes"], "meaning": "While his enemies were working minimum wage jobs washing dishes, Rozay took over the game, controlling the project buildings and streets of his city. Some real boss stuff right there!", "annotation_id": "3383688", "url": "https://genius.com/3383688", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "All these different jets we like to land now", "vault_lines": ["All these different jets we like to land now"], "meaning": "Ross is so rich he can pick from any Gulf stream, “G4, G5, G6”, private Jets", "annotation_id": "3383680", "url": "https://genius.com/3383680", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "See me at the Super Bowl, still with the killers", "vault_lines": ["See me at the Super Bowl, still with the killers"], "meaning": "Rick Ross threw an amazing pre-Super Bowl party with Lebron James. He then won a 100,000 dollar bet on the super bowl. Of course he went with his posse.", "annotation_id": "3381390", "url": "https://genius.com/3381390", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "Her Spanish friend with her, time to double up", "vault_lines": ["Her Spanish friend with her, time to double up"], "meaning": "Rick Ross has his girl’s spanish friend come along so they can have double up on him and have a threesome.", "annotation_id": "3381330", "url": "https://genius.com/3381330", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "Riding out in Paris with my ceiling off", "vault_lines": ["Riding out in Paris with my ceiling off"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is always in Europe, cruising around in cars that cost the same amount as homes and blowing thousands on luxurious brands.", "annotation_id": "3381318", "url": "https://genius.com/3381318", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "I’m at the poker table like I’m Donald Trump", "vault_lines": ["I'm at the poker table like I'm Donald Trump"], "meaning": "Rick Ross who is known for gambling says he’s at the poker table like Donald Trump meaning he is playing like a pro. Donald Trump is extremely good at poker and plays it often.", "annotation_id": "3381297", "url": "https://genius.com/3381297", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "On my side it’s authentic, you try to stunt but it’s all rented", "vault_lines": ["On my side it's authentic, you try to stunt but it's all rented"], "meaning": "G’s own play on the common rapper theme that the items they own are just so expensive that for anyone else to own them, the only possible way is that they had the item rented.\n\nHe asked me about my Maybach, think he had the same\nExcept mine tinted and his might have been rented", "annotation_id": "3381290", "url": "https://genius.com/3381290", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "“G’s dope, he might blow up,” think I know, I’ve got a hunch", "vault_lines": ["\"G's dope, he might blow up,\" think I know, I've got a hunch"], "meaning": "People are just now starting to notice the raw talent that is coming out of the bay rapper and they are starting to say he’s on the brink of fame, while, he and his dedicated fans, have known he’s dope for the longest, and know that he will blow up.", "annotation_id": "3381289", "url": "https://genius.com/3381289", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "And I’m more like whiskey neat, and you’re more like vodka punch", "vault_lines": ["And I'm more like whiskey neat, and you're more like vodka punch"], "meaning": "G has a well established taste for Jack Daniels Whiskey, which he enjoys neat. This could also imply that G is well- established and beyond his years, while you’re fairly sloppy.\n\nOk you know it’s whiskey straight no chases\n\nHe is also using whiskey as a metaphor to describe himself as straight up, and strong, while you talk a lot but don’t look like what you really are, which is symbolized with the vodka punch.", "annotation_id": "3381284", "url": "https://genius.com/3381284", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "Weak rappers tryna bite the sound, but my style is a lot to munch", "vault_lines": ["Weak rappers tryna bite the sound, but my style is a lot to munch"], "meaning": "G uses clever wordplay to out-smart his enemies. A sound bite is a piece of a recording of audio that someone takes from a full length piece.\n\nIn this case he is referring to rappers that steal his production and sound, but they rarely are able to become successful off of it, because his style is full of emotion and passion, something his enemies lack and they can never rap their head around G.", "annotation_id": "3381283", "url": "https://genius.com/3381283", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "Stress me out, I chop a dutch", "vault_lines": [", stress me out, I chop a dutch"], "meaning": "When G gets stressed out, he takes time to breaks down some weed and roll a blunt, also known as a dutch. G is a well documented smoker as can be seen in his “Been On” Music Video.", "annotation_id": "3381282", "url": "https://genius.com/3381282", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "You rappers just talk a bunch", "vault_lines": ["You rappers just talk a bunch"], "meaning": "Rappers are known for calling people out, dissing them and being outspoken. Sometimes they’ve got no talent or relevance back themselves up, and are just talk.\n\n\n\nG expresses all his emotions and love for the music through the music itself, and he means everything he says, while his opposition of fake rappers go on about claims of girls they don’t get, confidence that they don’t have, and violence that they don’t participate in. They truly don’t “Keep It Real.”", "annotation_id": "3381279", "url": "https://genius.com/3381279", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "You people wonder who’s next up That conversation really ends here", "vault_lines": ["You people wonder who's next up", "That conversation really ends here"], "meaning": "Who’s next up? -\n\nGetting listed on iTunes single of the week, making a hit with bay area godfather E-40, and getting a spotlight shone on him by Spotify.\n\n- Obviously G-Eazy\n\n\n\nSimilar to Drakes line in “All Me”:\n\nY'all keep talking ‘bout who next\nBut I’m about as big as it gets, I swear y'all just wasting y'all breath", "annotation_id": "3381238", "url": "https://genius.com/3381238", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "Meanwhile your end’s near, I’ve got a lane and I’m in gear", "vault_lines": ["Meanwhile your end's near, I've got a lane and I'm in gear"], "meaning": "G is speeding into the mainstream rap game, and he’s in gear (ready). He has already shown the industry that he can sell and compete on their level, even without a major label.\n\n\n\nSince he’s about to zoooom into the mainstream rap game, the other rapper’s end is near when G shwoops all their girls and fans.", "annotation_id": "3381236", "url": "https://genius.com/3381236", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "Signed Gerald, I’m sincere", "vault_lines": ["Signed Gerald, I'm sincere"], "meaning": "G-Eazy’s full name is Gerald Earl Gillum. G is opening this verse by signing it like a formal letter, to let you know that he is being super serious.\n\nEverything he is saying right now, HE MEANS IT!", "annotation_id": "3381203", "url": "https://genius.com/3381203", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "If I ever said I’m never scared Just know I mean it If I ever said I fucked your bitch Just know I mean it And if I ever said I’m gettin’ money Just know I mean it And, oh Lord, oh Lord knows He knows I mean it Yeah, you know I mean it You know I mean it Just know I mean it Just know I mean it Oh yeah, oh yeah, oh yeah", "vault_lines": ["You know I mean it", "Oh yeah, oh yeah, oh yeah"], "meaning": "G is promoting how real he is. He is not like most rappers that talk a lot of shit, but don’t live the lifestyles they preach.\n\nRappers try to swear they’re cool\nReally? I’m like “hardly, pal”\n\nHe is fearless towards the game, while sometimes contemplative, he is confident that if he keeps doing what he loves, he’ll be making money.\n\nAsk about plan B that’s a tough one\n\nEverybody says they get girls in rap, but he isn’t just saying he fucked your girlfriend, he means it, he’s got crazy game.", "annotation_id": "3381193", "url": "https://genius.com/3381193", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "You know if I say something I mean it These things happen Yeah", "vault_lines": ["You know if I say something I mean it"], "meaning": "Dropping this as a single of course he is pushing the idea of These Things Happen. G’s mom taught him the concept which is a culmination of all he has worked for coming together into a few crazy moments.\n\nhttp://youtu.be/UrircniDkV4?t=4m39s", "annotation_id": "3381184", "url": "https://genius.com/3381184", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "Black Bottle Boys, and I been a boss", "vault_lines": ["Black Bottle Boys, and I been a boss"], "meaning": "Referring to Luc Belaire Rare Rose (sparkling wine), in which Ross and the Black Bottles love. I mean he’s literally the face of the brand.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jfsr_yN8ylE", "annotation_id": "3379021", "url": "https://genius.com/3379021", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "Hate to see you gossip ’cause that’s for the bitches", "vault_lines": ["Hate to see you gossip 'cause that's for the bitches"], "meaning": "Gossiping is a term that is usually associated with what girls talk about, the rumor mill. Things one girl has heard or thinks is spread around while not known for certain.\n\n\n\nThe Bawse notices that lately lots of rappers and haters have been talking about him. Ricky just feels bad that you have subjugated yourself to gossiping like little girls do, instead of going out and getting your dreams.", "annotation_id": "3379014", "url": "https://genius.com/3379014", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Mean It (Remix)", "line": "All my bitches loyal freaks All my niggas rich, I’m talking oil sheiks", "vault_lines": ["All my bitches loyal freaks", "All my niggas rich, I'm talking oil sheiks"], "meaning": "Ricky Rozay likes to make sure those he associates with are the right type of people for him. While other rappers talk about hoes that aren’t loyal Rozay is only messing with women who stay true to him.\n\nFurthermore, due to his immense wealth, Rozay only hangs with those who can keep up with him. We’re not talking thousands or millions, we mean billions. Here is a list of the richest sheiks, at the top is Prince Sultan bin Mohammed bin Saud Al Kabeer, reportedly worth a cool 3.8 Billion dollars in 2014.", "annotation_id": "3377753", "url": "https://genius.com/3377753", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
