{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Ride", "line": "And so I bought the Wraith on ’em (Wraith boys)", "vault_lines": ["And so I bought the Wraith on 'em (Wraith boys)"], "meaning": "A Wraith is a type of Rolls-Royce Luxury vehicle. It currently sits at a hefty, $327,925 price tag.\n\nI had to grab the Wraith, I had to grab the Wraith", "annotation_id": "8023224", "url": "https://genius.com/8023224", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
