{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Swear to God", "line": "My tax bracket on some other shit", "vault_lines": ["My tax bracket on some other shit"], "meaning": "A tax bracket is the division at which the tax rate is charged, from say, 10% to 20% to 30%. Since the rate depends on your income, he is claiming here that he makes so damn much his tax bracket is hella huge. Strange that a highly decorated gangster would pay taxes in the first place but whatever.", "annotation_id": "532919", "url": "https://genius.com/532919", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
