{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "I’m the flyest nigga on his bassline", "vault_lines": ["I'm the flyest nigga on his bassline"], "meaning": "Contrary to popular belief, Khaled has some production chops. Mostly when he produced under the DJ Novocaine moniker in the early 00s. Ross has been a frequent collaborator of his from the start.", "annotation_id": "30561554", "url": "https://genius.com/30561554", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "Santorini, Greece, sex in the swimmin’ pool", "vault_lines": ["Santorini, Greece, sex in the swimmin' pool"], "meaning": "The Greek island used to name song number 2 on this album. The island is known for its beautiful landscapes and architecture, a usual spot for luxury tourism (“sex in the swimming pool”).", "annotation_id": "30561524", "url": "https://genius.com/30561524", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "Diddy, Jigga only two niggas comin’ for me", "vault_lines": ["Diddy, Jigga only two niggas comin' for me"], "meaning": "Ross views these two as his competition, artists turned moguls and not your everyday rapper.", "annotation_id": "30551237", "url": "https://genius.com/30551237", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "If her pussy dry, call her Beetlejuice", "vault_lines": ["If her pussy dry, call her Beetlejuice"], "meaning": "As the Beetlejuice character is a deceased ghost portrayed in the Beetlejuice (1988) movie, naturally he has a dehydrated look on his face. Renzel here, compares the dried up female genitalia to Beetlejuice’s desiccated face.", "annotation_id": "13910875", "url": "https://genius.com/13910875", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "Who else could flip a chorus into forty million?", "vault_lines": ["Who else could flip a chorus into forty million?"], "meaning": "Rick Ross may be referring to the chorus from his song “Hustlin,” which is frequently used in movies and in TV shows and commercials. It appears he is claiming to have made 40 million dollars from that songs chorus.", "annotation_id": "12287030", "url": "https://genius.com/12287030", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "Geechi", "vault_lines": ["Or be a Geechi"], "meaning": "A favoured slang term of the MMG, referring to those of Gullah origin, African-Americans who have arguably preserved their traditional African roots more than any other African-American group.\n\nRoss also has a song titled “Geechi Liberance” from his “Black Dollar” mixtape.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YizlxszswBw", "annotation_id": "11644077", "url": "https://genius.com/11644077", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "She stop me for a selfie, I just want the knowledge", "vault_lines": ["She stop me for a selfie, I just want the knowledge"], "meaning": "There could be two meanings to this line.\n\n1) The first one could be that Rick Ross, is only taking the picture with the fan just in order to get more popular. However, since Rick Ross is already popular it wouldn’t make much sense.\n\n2) The second meaning which it could have, and the one I believe makes more sense is that, although the female fan is stopping Rick Ross for a picture, what he really wants is for her to have oral sex with him.\n\nThis is because the knowledge is based in the brain, which is situated in the head. In many English speaking countries such as the United Kingdom. Brain and head are non offensive words unless used in a vulgar sentences such as ‘Give Head’ or ‘Give Brain’ which would then change the meaning to giving oral sex.\n\nTherefore when Rick Ross says that he ‘Just wants that knowledge’, the only way he could get it is if someone gives it to him.", "annotation_id": "11548495", "url": "https://genius.com/11548495", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "(It’s Billi!)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "“Billi” is DJ Khaled’s new nickname. It signifies his journey to become a billionare.\n\nOn the song “Ima Be Alright” off his album Major Key, he asks that you call him “Billi” when you see him.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/DnuC7_Z-gbw?t=204\n\nIn September, Khaled confirmed the spelling of “Billi” on his name tag when he went undercover as a Lyft driver.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/hYblIn7B_Bo", "annotation_id": "11517787", "url": "https://genius.com/11517787", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "This that Rich Forever part two", "vault_lines": ["This that Rich Forever part two"], "meaning": "Rich Forever was a mixtape by Rick Ross that was released on January 6, 2012. It became an instant hit, becoming one of the most downloaded hip hop mixtapes of all time. It included features from Diddy, 2 Chainz, Wale, John Legend, Nas, Kelly Rowland, Styles P, Birdman, Meek Mill, French Montana, Pharrell, Future, Stalley and Drake.\n\n\n\nThe mixtape also included a single called “Stay Schemin'” which features Drake & French Montana.\n\nRoss is likely stating that his upcoming album Rather You Than Me will be as successful as Rich Forever if not more.", "annotation_id": "11429625", "url": "https://genius.com/11429625", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "I may name my daughter Hermès Get Margiela to decorate the new birds nest", "vault_lines": ["I may name my daughter Hermès", "Get Margiela to decorate the new birds nest"], "meaning": "Hermès International S.A. is a Parisian luxury goods manufacturer specializing in leather, jewelry, and furnishings. Maison Margiela is a French fashion house founded by Belgian fashion designer Martin Margiela. The house specializes in haute couture inspired collections of clothing for men and women, and is known for deconstructive and avant-garde designs with unconventional materials.\n\nRick Ross is a big fan of designer brands. Not only does he frequently reference them in songs like “Diced Pineapple,” he has also thought about starting his own specialty brand for larger men. In a 2009 interview with RapUp, he said:\n\nI would just love to target a big and tall audience. A lot of times, big dudes can’t walk in these stores and get these sizes of the fly shit, so I’d love to put something together just for the big guys.", "annotation_id": "11423511", "url": "https://genius.com/11423511", "state": "accepted", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "I’m Rayful Edmonds mixed with young Wale Folarin (M-M-M) Starin’ in my safe, I’m rather safe than sorry", "vault_lines": ["I'm Rayful Edmonds mixed with young Wale Folarin (M-M-M)", "Starin' in my safe, I'm rather safe than sorry"], "meaning": "Not surprisingly, Rozay compares himself to yet another famous former Drug kingpin. Rayful Edmund, who at the time of his arrest in 1989, age 24,  was reported to have introduced crack cocaine to the District of Washington.\n\nEdmund is said to have controlled 20 percent of the city’s cocaine trade and booked up to $1 million in profits a week.\n\nWale of course is signed to Rozay’s label and is too a DC native.", "annotation_id": "11255926", "url": "https://genius.com/11255926", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "Put up all the yachts, pulled out the jetskis", "vault_lines": ["Put up all the yachts, pulled out the jetskis"], "meaning": "Ross' excessively luxurious life doesn’t stop with his cars or his $5.8 million mansion; actually, it includes jet skis and his yacht named Rich Forever after his 2012 album. Luckily, Ross says he is in the Maldives in the previous line, which would be a perfect place for his aquatic vehicles. Let’s just hope Ross learned his lesson and stays on his yacht this time instead of almost drowning.", "annotation_id": "11253332", "url": "https://genius.com/11253332", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "I’m baby-makin’ in them Maldives", "vault_lines": ["I'm baby-makin' in them Maldives"], "meaning": "The Maldives is an island country in the Indian Ocean that is notorious for romantic getaways. Rozay finds himself fornicating in the beautiful island country off of South Asia.", "annotation_id": "11253311", "url": "https://genius.com/11253311", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "I park the Caddy in my livin’ room", "vault_lines": ["I park the Caddy in my livin' room"], "meaning": "Ross loves cars so much that he named his record label Maybach Music after one of his favorite rides, the Mercedes Maybach.\n\n\n\nAs documented on Rozay’s snapchat, he has enough cars to fill his garage and the length of his driveway. Because The Boss is running out of room for his cars, he has to start putting some in his living room.\n\nThis lyric could also mean that he wants to showcase the new caddy he just bought by putting it indoors, or Ross could be bragging that his mansion is so big that he can fit cars into his living room.", "annotation_id": "11253244", "url": "https://genius.com/11253244", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "I’m sexin’ women out on Fisher Isle", "vault_lines": ["I'm sexin' women out on Fisher Isle"], "meaning": "Fisher Island, Florida, is named for Carl G. Fisher, the automotive parts pioneer and beach real estate developer who once owned it. The island is located three miles off the coast of mainland South Florida. No road or causeway connects to the island. You need a private boat or ferry to get there.", "annotation_id": "11251624", "url": "https://genius.com/11251624", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "Out in Cannes with Leonardo DiCaprio While out on bond, pray I go to trial rapido", "vault_lines": ["Out in Cannes with Leonardo DiCaprio", "While out on bond, pray I go to trial rapido"], "meaning": "Leonardo DiCaprio is a well known hip-hop fan & also big on partying with models in Cannes, one of the finest locations on the famous French Riviera.\n\n“Rapido” means “quick” in spanish, portuguese and Italian so Rozay who had his fair share of trouble with the law in the past, prays it all goes away soon while partying with Leo.", "annotation_id": "11251564", "url": "https://genius.com/11251564", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "Khaled hit me on the FaceTime", "vault_lines": ["Khaled hit me on the FaceTime"], "meaning": "DJ Khaled and Rick Ross live close together in their beachside Miami homes. In multiple instances, DJ Khaled’s famous snapchat has documented times where the two have shared meals and quality time together. Their friendship has also provided plenty of collaborations.\nhttps://youtu.be/POyIRViAgK8", "annotation_id": "11241989", "url": "https://genius.com/11241989", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "I said I was The Boss, nobody made a sound", "vault_lines": ["I said I was The Boss, nobody made a sound"], "meaning": "Rick Ross has referred to himself as “The Boss” throughout his rap career, and did so immediately coming into the rap game.\n\nMost famously, Rozay’s song “The Boss” off Trilla solidifies Ross' title.\n\nRoss knew that nobody ever disagreed that Rozay is indeed The Boss.", "annotation_id": "11241883", "url": "https://genius.com/11241883", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I Think She Like Me", "line": "Ricky Ronaldo, really when I’m in Portugal", "vault_lines": ["Ricky Ronaldo, really when I'm in Portugal"], "meaning": "Rozay uses alliteration to compare himself to Cristiano Ronaldo, arguably the most famous footballer today.\n\nHaving Won almost every award there’s to win individually and with his national and Real Madrid team, Ronaldo is also the World’s Highest-Paid Athlete, according to Forbes magazine.", "annotation_id": "11239580", "url": "https://genius.com/11239580", "state": "accepted", "votes": 30, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
