{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I.D.F.W.U. (MMG Mix)", "line": "Kevin Gates on the ass, quick lunch", "vault_lines": ["Kevin Gates on the ass, quick lunch"], "meaning": "Kevin Gates (a rapper from Baton Rogue) is well known for eating booty. Rick Ross is claiming he’s with that same shit.\nhttp://revolt.tv/video/kevin-gates-yeah-i-eat-booty/6C24370B-2164-4F5A-9C77-C073BD726B9E", "annotation_id": "4847329", "url": "https://genius.com/4847329", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I.D.F.W.U. (MMG Mix)", "line": "Flow’s cashmere and the voice thick", "vault_lines": ["Flow's cashmere and the voice thick"], "meaning": "Rick Ross' has a flow similar to cashmere, which is a flow that is well worth it’s buck. Cashmere is a fiber obtained from Cashmere goats and other types of goat. Cashmere  is fine in texture, strong, light, and soft. Garments made from it provide excellent insulation. The following is a cashmere sweater\n\n\n\nA thick voice you know is meant to turn who on… the ladies ofcourse", "annotation_id": "4830070", "url": "https://genius.com/4830070", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I.D.F.W.U. (MMG Mix)", "line": "Lookin’ better than her friends, body like a Benz", "vault_lines": ["Lookin' better than her friends, body like a Benz"], "meaning": "As a lover of the Mercedes Benz brand Rick Ross has found it befitting to bring similarity between the woman he likes and an AMG automotive in the statement.", "annotation_id": "4830029", "url": "https://genius.com/4830029", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I.D.F.W.U. (MMG Mix)", "line": "Chronic smoke off the corner clears my conscience", "vault_lines": ["Chronic smoke off the corner clears my conscience"], "meaning": "Rick Ross as a man of many things needs some time to unwind off all the troubles and the fast life he lives in. What better way to unwind than with some dank weed?", "annotation_id": "4830016", "url": "https://genius.com/4830016", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I.D.F.W.U. (MMG Mix)", "line": "On the beach, I’m a beast, Marshawn Lynch", "vault_lines": ["On the beach, I'm a beast, Marshawn Lynch"], "meaning": "These lyrics refer to Super Bowl XLIX.\n\nRoss calls himself a beast, comparing himself to RB Marshawn Lynch nicknamed “Beast Mode” for his impressive feats in football.", "annotation_id": "4827992", "url": "https://genius.com/4827992", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I.D.F.W.U. (MMG Mix)", "line": "Pacman - Mayweather, Ross ringside", "vault_lines": ["Pacman - Mayweather, Ross ringside"], "meaning": "Floyd Mayweather Vs. Manny Pacquiao was a highly – anticipated boxing match that took place on May 2nd.\n\nBeing ringside to one of the most anticipated boxing match in decades, if not all – time, shows your status and your money.\n\nIn fact, Ross later escorted Mayweather to the ring and even hosted the after – party. Ballin' !", "annotation_id": "4827357", "url": "https://genius.com/4827357", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I.D.F.W.U. (MMG Mix)", "line": "Suge Knight with a bitch, hit and run", "vault_lines": ["Suge Knight with a bitch, hit and run"], "meaning": "Referring to the recent events when Suge Knight was involved in a hit and run.\n\nOn January 29, 2015 the LAPD arrested Suge on suspicion of murder. Suge was believed to have been involved in a hit-and-run that left one dead and another hospitalized in Compton, California.\n\nTerry Carter was killed. The second victim, Cle Sloan, had minor injuries. It is believed that Knight tracked some men he had a problem with at the Straight Outta Compton film set to a burger stand parking lot, the incident is believed to be intentional and not an accident.", "annotation_id": "4827346", "url": "https://genius.com/4827346", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I.D.F.W.U. (MMG Mix)", "line": "[Pre-Hook: Big Sean] I don’t fuck with you You lil stupid ass bitch, I ain’t fuckin’ with you You lil, you lil dumb ass bitch, I ain’t fuckin’ with you I got a million trillion things I’d rather fuckin’ do Than to be fuckin’ with you, lil stupid ass [Hook: Big Sean] I don’t give a fuck, I don’t give a fuck I don’t, I don’t, I don’t give a fuck Bitch, I don’t give a fuck about you, or anything that you do Don’t give a fuck about you, or anything that you do [Verse 2: Big Sean] I heard you got a new man, I see you takin’ a pic Then you post it up, thinkin’ that its makin’ me sick I see you calling, I be makin’ it quick I’mma answer that shit like: “I don’t fuck with you” Bitch I got no feelings to go I swear I had it up to here, I got no ceilings to go I mean for real, fuck how you feel Fuck your two cents if it ain’t goin’ towards the bill, yeah And everyday I wake up celebratin’ shit, why? Cause I just dodged a bullet from a crazy bitch I stuck to my guns, that’s what made me rich That’s what put me on, that’s what got me here That’s what made me this And everything that I do is my first name (B-I-G) These hoes chase bread, aw damn, she got a bird brain Ain’t nothin’ but trill in me, aw man, silly me I just bought a crib, three stories, that bitch a trilogy And you know I’m rollin’ weed that’s fuckin’ up the ozone I got a bitch that text me, she ain’t got no clothes on And then another one text, then your ass next And I’m gonna text your ass back like [Pre-Hook] + [Hook x2] [Verse 3: E-40] Got a million things on my mind, executive deals online Limited amount of time, chasin’ these dollar signs and you ain’t on your grind You liable to find me up in the MGM casino in the D Fuckin’ off fetti I coulda put on property From the Bay to the Murder Mitten, my niggas put murder missions She choosin’, that’s her decision, free my niggas in prison On the phone with a bitch who can’t do shit For a pimp but make a nigga hella rich Got a blunt in my dental, blowin’ hemp in a rental On my way, to Sacramento, late night, Arsenio I’m never sentimental, go hard or go homeless Barely Harley, I’m chromeless, you might end up domeless I bet you she into me, her cheddar, she givin’ me I’ll make a bitch stand outside forever like the Statue of Liberty Rest in pimp, Pimp C, underground king of the South I raise my Styrofoam up, and pour some drank in my mouth Why you always coming around with bad news? Say you want me to win, but hope I lose Askin’ if I rock with other niggas in the crew But them niggas cool, it’s just that [Pre-Hook] + [Hook x2] [Verse 4: Big Sean] I got a new chick that I gotta thank God for I got a new whip that I gotta thank the lot for Yeah I got a lot but want a lot more Yeah we in the buildin’ but I’m tryna take it to the top floor I swear I hear some new bullshit every day I’m wakin’ up It seems like nowadays everybody breakin’ up That shit can break you down if you lose a good girl I guess you need a bad bitch to come around and make it up I guess drama makes for the best content Everything got a bad side, even a conscience Now you’re drinkin’ ’til you’re unconscious Feel me when you get a fine bitch Just don’t forget to read the fine print Life got me meditatin’ like I’m in the Himalayas Keep it G with the L lit on me like the elevator Yeah I know that karma’s too real so I hope you doin’ cool But still stupid ass bitch I ain’t fuckin’ with you Little stupid ass I ain’t fuckin with I ain’t fuckin’, I ain’t, I ain’t fuckin’ with you I ain’t fuckin’ with you (Straight up)", "vault_lines": ["I don't fuck with you", "You lil stupid ass bitch, I ain't fuckin' with you", "You lil, you lil dumb ass bitch, I ain't fuckin' with you", "I got a million trillion things I'd rather fuckin' do", "Than to be fuckin' with you, lil stupid ass", "I don't give a fuck, I don't give a fuck"], "meaning": "These lyrics appear on the original version of “I Don’t Fuck With You”.", "annotation_id": "4827310", "url": "https://genius.com/4827310", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
