{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Ice Cold", "line": "Livin’ next to bitches, out on Fisher Isle Down from Oprah, Don King, and Sosa", "vault_lines": ["Livin' next to bitches, out on Fisher Isle", "Down from Oprah, Don King, and Sosa"], "meaning": "Fisher Island is a neighborhood (on its own barrier island) of greater metropolitan Miami.  It has the highest per capita income of any place in the United States.  The several hundred souls who live there have indeed included Oprah and Jim Carrey, though Don King, Sammy Sosa, and Ross don’t appear to be residents\n\n\n\nHowever, hip-hoppers have made an appearance on the island from time to time:\nhttps://twitter.com/myfabolouslife/statuses/8974850525757440", "annotation_id": "958017", "url": "https://genius.com/958017", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Ice Cold", "line": "She can tell you by the Greyhound She can show you how to stay down I can tell you ’bout to break down", "vault_lines": ["She can tell you by the Greyhound", "She can show you how to stay down", "I can tell you 'bout to break down"], "meaning": "Ross is referring to his girl’s role with him\n\n\n“Tell you by the Greyhound”(Drug Trafficking): She could narrow down where the drugs were coming in from by the Greyhound bus\n“Show you how to stay down” (Lay-Low): She keeps a eye out and lets him know when he catching heat. Could also mean she can show you how to stay down:  She can should you how to have your man’s back 100%.  Show you how to ride like a real woman would.\n“Tell you bout to break down”: This is a personal glimpse into Ricky’s past. A memory of her about to break down back when things weren’t good.", "annotation_id": "947301", "url": "https://genius.com/947301", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Ice Cold", "line": "VS1's all in my bitch watch face now", "vault_lines": ["VS1's all in my bitch watch face now"], "meaning": "VS stands for “very slight” which means the diamonds are nearly flawless. You’d need to magnify it 10x to see flaws. That thing look purrrrrty.", "annotation_id": "944942", "url": "https://genius.com/944942", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Ice Cold", "line": "Lear jets to the fights now Belagio crap table with the dice out Floor seats at the Heat game Her bag 20 grand, nigga, peep game", "vault_lines": ["Belagio crap table with the dice out", "Floor seats at the Heat game", "Her bag 20 grand, nigga, peep game"], "meaning": "Now – instead of simply spending like a normal person to indulge in consumerism, Ross and his companion spend like dirt to show up in style, probably even more lavish than the stars of the events he goes to attend.", "annotation_id": "936449", "url": "https://genius.com/936449", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Ice Cold", "line": "Miami’s mine like I’m Pat Riley", "vault_lines": ["Miami's mine like I'm Pat Riley"], "meaning": "Pat Riley coached the Miami Heat to a championship in 2006 & is also president and GM.", "annotation_id": "932879", "url": "https://genius.com/932879", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
