{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Ice Cream", "line": "All night servin’ hard white, nigga, P Miller in a Dickies suit (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["All night servin' hard white, nigga, P Miller in a Dickies suit (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Adressing his heavy use of cocaine, Gibbs references Master P, who in 1996 released the single “Mr. Ice Cream Man.” In the cassette artwork for the album and in the single’s music video, Miller can be seen wearing an all-white Dickies suit.", "annotation_id": "25509242", "url": "https://genius.com/25509242", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
