{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Imma Get Me Sum", "line": "And money’s everything, got my ride sitting clean Boy, if you ain’t seen a half a million you ain’t seen shit", "vault_lines": ["And money’s everything, got my ride sitting clean", "Boy, if you ain't seen a half a million you ain't seen shit"], "meaning": "Project is known for ridin' clean in his past discography and this hasn’t changed, thanks to his  income.\n\n\n\nWith a reference to the song “I Ain’t Seen Shit”, he makes it known that he has likely seen more money on the table than the haters he addresses.", "annotation_id": "4611940", "url": "https://genius.com/4611940", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Imma Get Me Sum", "line": "A lot of y’all broads pillow talking with these bros And telling all your business, pussy nigga, naw I never tell my business to a ratchet ho", "vault_lines": ["A lot of y’all broads pillow talking with these bros", "And telling all your business, pussy nigga, naw", "I never tell my business to a ratchet ho"], "meaning": "Pat gives us some advice on how to handle a relationship with an prostitute or a woman with prostitutional tendencies.\nHe is taking the phrase “these hoes ain’t loyal” to a new defintion, where the “ho” is not only unreliable in terms of an sexual relationship, but also tends to snitch in the case of an investigation.\nSo don’t talk to a “ho” about your illegal activities.", "annotation_id": "4595976", "url": "https://genius.com/4595976", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Imma Get Me Sum", "line": "A round of applause the way these nines get to clapping", "vault_lines": ["A round of applause the way these nines get to clapping"], "meaning": "“Clapping” refers to the sound of gun shots. During applause multiple persons are clapping their hands, the same thing is happening with multiple guns.\n\n\n\nHe was talking shit we put a clap into that boy\"", "annotation_id": "4508325", "url": "https://genius.com/4508325", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Imma Get Me Sum", "line": "I’ma do whatever I got to to pay these bills, ho These niggas say I’m rapping, but I could be trapping", "vault_lines": ["I'ma do whatever I got to to pay these bills, ho", "These niggas say I’m rapping, but I could be trapping"], "meaning": "Together with his brother Juicy J, he is living an expensive, lavish lifestyle.\n\n\n\nIf rap isn’t working Patta will get back to drug dealing or robbing people to pay the bills. But he never stopped hustling so it ain’t a big deal for him.", "annotation_id": "4508322", "url": "https://genius.com/4508322", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Imma Get Me Sum", "line": "I’m the man moving that boy, Camero my new toy", "vault_lines": ["I'm the man moving that boy, Camero my new toy"], "meaning": "In this line Rozay is stating that he is selling/dealing (moving) heroin.\nBoy is a term used on the streets for Heroin.\n\n\n\nHe is also stating that he got a new car, in this case a Camaro. A lot of us fellas call new things such as cars, gadgets, and women “new toys”.", "annotation_id": "4274401", "url": "https://genius.com/4274401", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Imma Get Me Sum", "line": "Fuck her while she snorts salt, my dick hard as a brick", "vault_lines": ["Fuck her while she snorts salt, my dick hard as a brick"], "meaning": "Ross will have sex with a woman as she snorts on salt which is a slang for either Cocaine or Heroin.\n\nRoss states that his dick is hard or erected as big as a brick which is a slang for a pound or kilogram of a drug.\n\nHard could also mean the intensity of the drug, so the addiction is potential.", "annotation_id": "4238821", "url": "https://genius.com/4238821", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
