{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "In Luv With The Money", "line": "I consistently post, goin’ live from my sofa", "vault_lines": ["I consistently post, goin' live from my sofa"], "meaning": "Unlike broke rappers, Rozay consistently posts about his lavish lifestyle. He doesn’t post once in a while about a fancy dinner or car, he does it all the time because he actually lives the lifestyle he raps about.\n\nRozay also says he often goes live on social media while chillin' on his home sofa, displaying his luxury lifestyle.", "annotation_id": "30263120", "url": "https://genius.com/30263120", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
