{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Insomniak", "line": "Fearless, Jet Li,", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Fearless (2006) is a martial arts film starring Jet Li as Chinese folk hero Huo Yuanjia, a master of Wushu who rises to fame but suffers personal tragedy due to his pride.", "annotation_id": "40311606", "url": "https://genius.com/40311606", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Insomniak", "line": "Take your bitch, Joe Pesci, don’t test me", "vault_lines": ["Take your bitch, Joe Pesci, don't test me"], "meaning": "SPOILER for the movie Casino!!!\n\nIn Casino, Joe Pesci’s character, Nicky Santoro, gets head from Ginger (played by sharon stone), who’s married to Nicky’s friend, Ace Rothstein (Robert De Niro). I’m not fully sure about this, but I don’t know what else it could refer to.", "annotation_id": "36742497", "url": "https://genius.com/36742497", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Insomniak", "line": "G-G-G-Gettin’ money so complicated, I’m the shit, I’m constipated", "vault_lines": ["G-G-G-Gettin' money so complicated, I'm the shit, I'm constipated"], "meaning": "An absolute lyrical spiritual miracle from Rozay.\n\nHe compares the act of trying to shit while constipated to getting easy money as both are equally difficult… although this is incredibly ironic as he has a net worth of $150 million. This could still be relatable to the average listener however 🔥.", "annotation_id": "33787549", "url": "https://genius.com/33787549", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Insomniak", "line": "Think I might need a cage in fact Chain reactions happen when I make a pact", "vault_lines": ["Chain reactions happen when I make a pact"], "meaning": "Mac starts to think he’s way too out of control and need some control to make him do less drugs.\n\na chemical reaction or other process in which the products themselves promote or spread the reaction, which under certain conditions may accelerate dramatically\n\nMac uses the term “chain reactions” to say:\n\n\nHe does a lot of drugs that spread fast in his system\nHim doing drugs is the chain reaction of being in the show business.\nSlaves were known to have chains, maybe he’s implying to be a slave of the music business.", "annotation_id": "33578328", "url": "https://genius.com/33578328", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Insomniak", "line": "She only speak French Said, “Bitch look, don’t try and speak around me”", "vault_lines": ["She only speak French", "Said, \"Bitch look, don't try and speak around me\""], "meaning": "This is a double entedre and a really funny one at that ,  Mac says “Bitch look, don’t try to speak around me” in a way that makes the “look” muffled, making it sound like the french article le", "annotation_id": "32473986", "url": "https://genius.com/32473986", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Insomniak", "line": "[Intro: Mac Miller]", "vault_lines": ["He's self made, Mac Miller my real nigga"], "meaning": "A line in the intro of the mixtape/original version of “Insomniak” was removed for Faces‘ October 2021 streaming re-release, with Mac’s estate citing “various legal reasons.” Originally, it included the following excerpt from an unknown woman:\n\nThink for yourself and you’ll find out that a lot of those so-called authorities are bullshit\n\nA similar line appeared at the end of the preceding track, “Colors and Shapes,” but was also removed.", "annotation_id": "24234673", "url": "https://genius.com/24234673", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Insomniak", "line": "Muh’fucker, we ain’t even got a logo, uh", "vault_lines": ["Muh'fucker, we ain't even got a logo, uh"], "meaning": "Most Dope did end up getting a logo.", "annotation_id": "24194000", "url": "https://genius.com/24194000", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
