{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I’m Da Man (Remix)", "line": "They from the red clay, I’m from that brown dirt", "vault_lines": ["They from the red clay, I'm from that brown durt"], "meaning": "In this line, Lil Wayne is referencing where Shawty Lo and himself is from.  Red clay is famously found in Georgia. I want to say only but I’m not sure. Anyways, Georgia is known by it. So “They from the Red clay”= Georgia = Shawty Lo. The next is himself “Brown dirt”. Most likely the swamp in Louisiana where he’s (Lil Wayne) from.", "annotation_id": "10477610", "url": "https://genius.com/10477610", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
