{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I’m Just Doing My Thing", "line": "Them cartel boys down to pull them 9s out From Boobie to Walk my dog gotta climb out", "vault_lines": ["Them cartel boys down to pull them 9s out", "From Boobie to Walk my dog gotta climb out"], "meaning": "Him and his clique are quick to pull out 9MM handguns. Kenneth “Boobie” Williams, the overlord of the Boobie Boys clique, claims to have taken Rick Ross under his wing, lending some credibility to his streetwise claims\n\nUnsure who Walk is, help us out with a comment", "annotation_id": "493957", "url": "https://genius.com/493957", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I’m Just Doing My Thing", "line": "You tryna be somebody else homie, time out", "vault_lines": ["You tryna be somebody else homie, time out"], "meaning": "Hmmm Rick Ross took the name of legendary drug dealer “Freeway” Rick Ross and started talking about dealing coke when he used to be a correctional officer. Who’s pretending?", "annotation_id": "493954", "url": "https://genius.com/493954", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
