{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I’m a Boss", "line": "Audemar on my wrist, bust down (Bling)", "vault_lines": ["Audemar on my wrist, bust down (Bling)"], "meaning": "Audemars-Piguet – a very expensive timepeice. A bust- down watch means diamonds have been added to it by a jeweler.", "annotation_id": "215817", "url": "https://genius.com/215817", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I’m a Boss", "line": "Got so many shades, they thought I had a lazy eye (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["Got so many shades, they thought I had a lazy eye (Huh)"], "meaning": "It has been documented that Rick Ross has over 2,000 pairs of sunglasses. With how often he wears them, you figure he has a lazy eye to cover up. This also could be a reference to The Notorious B.I.G. who also had a lazy eye and often wore sunglasses to cover them up.", "annotation_id": "215747", "url": "https://genius.com/215747", "state": "accepted", "votes": 29, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
