{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I’m a G", "line": "Standin’ in the blue house, chopper in my right hand", "vault_lines": ["Standin' in the blue house, chopper in my right hand"], "meaning": "the “blue house” could refer to one of two things: the House Of Blues, a popular music venue that many rappers often perform in, or it could be in reference to a Blue House, an office and place of residence for the South Korean Head of state, an allegory for Brisco’s intense power and influence.\n\nAnd to top it off he’s got a chopper, or machine gun, in his hand. Clearly this fella means business and he is not afraid to take the life of a fellow human being should the circumstances necessitate it.", "annotation_id": "957875", "url": "https://genius.com/957875", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I’m a G", "line": "“Vroom” it must be the coupe or somethin’", "vault_lines": ["\"Vroom\" it must be the coupe or somethin'"], "meaning": "Coupe is french word meaning a “closed car”", "annotation_id": "659796", "url": "https://genius.com/659796", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I’m a G", "line": "More guns than The Matrix Neo, reload get your face twist", "vault_lines": ["More guns than The Matrix", "Neo, reload get your face twist"], "meaning": "“Guns. Lots more guns” – Neo, in The Matrix\nOther references to The Matrix films include the sequel being titled Matrix Reloaded, and the ‘face twist’ could be a reference to how Agent Smith’s face twists when he regenerates.", "annotation_id": "617279", "url": "https://genius.com/617279", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I’m a G", "line": "Uh I wear a gun like a girdle", "vault_lines": ["Uh I wear a gun like a girdle"], "meaning": "A girdle is a garment that encircles the lower torso, perhaps extending below the hips, and worn often for support. The word girdle originally meant a belt. Basically Wayne is saying he’s always strapped.", "annotation_id": "401241", "url": "https://genius.com/401241", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "I’m a G", "line": "Fuck with it get the laser tag", "vault_lines": ["Fuck with it get the laser tag"], "meaning": "He’s referring to the red dot on the gun used to improve accuracy.\n\n\n\nLaser tag is a game where you go into a dark room with laser sensors on, and try to “Shoot” one another with small beams of light.", "annotation_id": "346768", "url": "https://genius.com/346768", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
