{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Jam On It", "line": "Two seven figure Dade County boys Not even John Lennon could imagine that", "vault_lines": ["Two seven figure Dade County boys", "Not even John Lennon could imagine that"], "meaning": "Pitbull is making millions of dollars. That’s a lot of money. Dade county has many poor areas and to see such wealth come from there is out of the ordinary.\n\nThis is a reference to John Lennon’s hit, “Imagine.”", "annotation_id": "2903144", "url": "https://genius.com/2903144", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
