{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "John Doe", "line": "Wanna know my name bitch, John Doe", "vault_lines": ["Wanna know my name bitch, John Doe"], "meaning": "Ross mockingly asks the random guy from the previous two lines if he wants to know his name.\nOf course he answers with John Doe, he’s not about to let anyone undermine his hustle by putting his real name out there.", "annotation_id": "1000327", "url": "https://genius.com/1000327", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "John Doe", "line": "24s, John Doe All gold, John Doe", "vault_lines": ["All gold, John Doe"], "meaning": "When Rozay buys his 24’s (24 inch rims) and jewelry he pays for it in all cash and doesn’t give his real name – aka John Doe.\nHe does it to avoid the feds, not pay taxes on it etc.", "annotation_id": "624044", "url": "https://genius.com/624044", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "John Doe", "line": "Night work for the load, that’s John Doe", "vault_lines": ["Night work for the load, that's John Doe"], "meaning": "John Doe is a name that was given for a male that the feds will not classify. So He is really not a real person. Ross is really just explaining how lowkey he is with everything. So night work for the load is pushing drugs that the feds will never know about", "annotation_id": "419811", "url": "https://genius.com/419811", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "John Doe", "line": "Aye ho you know I got that A-1", "vault_lines": ["Aye ho you know I got that A-1"], "meaning": "A-1 is club soda, but in Rick Ross' case he is referring to cocaine. Ross cocaine is of the best quality (A1).", "annotation_id": "254702", "url": "https://genius.com/254702", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "John Doe", "line": "Jumping niggas like a chess piece", "vault_lines": ["Ugh, Jumping niggas like a chess piece"], "meaning": "Ross confuses chess with checkers. Checkers has pieces that “jump” one another, but not chess.\n\nRoss then revises this line in a later song.", "annotation_id": "142167", "url": "https://genius.com/142167", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
