{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Justice", "line": "Maybach music in the maybach bumping", "vault_lines": ["Maybach music in the maybach bumping"], "meaning": "“Maybach Music” is a series of songs by Rick Ross, featuring artists such as Jay-Z, Kanye, and T.I. It’s also the name of his label.\n\n\n\nMaybachs are very high-end luxury vehicles that aren’t produced anymore, but are still pretty boss (no pun intended).", "annotation_id": "4640914", "url": "https://genius.com/4640914", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
