{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Justice", "line": "Cash is a heavy, monkey on my back", "vault_lines": ["Cash is a heavy, monkey on my back"], "meaning": "A “monkey on your back” is a heavy burden that you have to deal with (usually refers to an addiction). For Rozay, that means lots and lots of money.\n\n\n\nMoney is a hell of a drug…", "annotation_id": "4640901", "url": "https://genius.com/4640901", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Justice", "line": "You could fuck my bitch, let me fuck your bitch", "vault_lines": ["You could fuck my bitch, let me fuck your bitch"], "meaning": "He is showing brotherly love by saying between his homies he would not mind sharing his women as long as they also share theirs.", "annotation_id": "2241592", "url": "https://genius.com/2241592", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Justice", "line": "The fam so trill, we just so rich", "vault_lines": ["The fam so trill, we just so rich"], "meaning": "His family is blessed and always keeps it 1 hunna. And also, him, his friends and family are all very wealthy people.", "annotation_id": "2241586", "url": "https://genius.com/2241586", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Justice", "line": "Sometimes when I’m smoking that shit, right bird Man you ever just pray my nigga", "vault_lines": ["Man you ever just pray my nigga"], "meaning": "He is directly talking to birdman, saying that whilst they’re smoking weed and are high, does he not also just stop and pray to God like Rick Ross does.\n\nIn a small vlog, birdman and rick ross stated that they smoked a lot when making the “H” album in order for inspiration for their lyrics. This lyric implies they were intoxicated at the time.", "annotation_id": "2241579", "url": "https://genius.com/2241579", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Justice", "line": "So I’m riding with my dog, with the chicken on my lap", "vault_lines": ["So I'm riding with my dog, with the chicken on my lap"], "meaning": "Dog – a term used for friends.\n\nChicken – a term used for ho’s\n\nSo basically Ross is riding with his friend with a ho on his knee.\n\n\n\nJust how rappers live!", "annotation_id": "2206468", "url": "https://genius.com/2206468", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Justice", "line": "Knots in the pockets, baleys, no socks", "vault_lines": ["Knots in the pockets, baleys, no socks"], "meaning": "Knots means a lot of cash. Knots are also associated with sailing.  They’re tied in ropes to help sail.\n\nBalleys are a brand of Swiss shoes.", "annotation_id": "2206449", "url": "https://genius.com/2206449", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Justice", "line": "Sacks in the attic, ciroc on the yachts", "vault_lines": ["Sacks in the attic, ciroc on the yachts"], "meaning": "They keep their cash in the attic [prob hiding it from the Feds]\n\n\n\nCiroc is a premium brand of Vodka that Diddy is an Ambassador for.", "annotation_id": "2206433", "url": "https://genius.com/2206433", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
