{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "I be feastin’ on Tinder, she taste just like peaches", "vault_lines": ["I be feastin' on Tinder, she taste just like peaches"], "meaning": "Tinder is a popular dating app most often used by professionals who’s lives are dictated by their careers.\n\n\n\nKelly might mean that he’s booked himself a nice date with a fresh “Georgia grown peach”.", "annotation_id": "4386856", "url": "https://genius.com/4386856", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "Yeah, I’m a spend up all this money (facts, facts, facts) Girl, you doin’ somethin’ to me (facts, facts) Hell yeah, keep doin’ that, doin’ that Keep doin’ that, doin’ that, ohh, oh yeah Keep doin’ that, doin’ that, keep doin’ that, doin’ that", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm a spend up all this money (facts, facts, facts)", "Girl, you doin' somethin' to me (facts, facts)", "Hell yeah, keep doin' that, doin' that", "Keep doin' that, doin' that, ohh, oh yeah", "Keep doin' that, doin' that, keep doin' that, doin' that"], "meaning": "What she does is having an such an effect on R. Kelly that he cant help but spend money on her. Could it be the good sex? The way she lets him do whatever he wants? Only he knows, just like in the ‘Black Eyed Peas’ My Humps:\n\n(She got me spending)\nOh, spending all your money on me\nAnd spending time on me\n(She got me spending)", "annotation_id": "4386840", "url": "https://genius.com/4386840", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "Diamond-studded La Perla, that pussy’s prestigious", "vault_lines": ["Diamond-studded La Perla, that pussy's prestigious"], "meaning": "La Perla – Italian lingerie brand. I haven’t seen any of it with diamond studs before but I am sure that shit’s expensive.", "annotation_id": "4376926", "url": "https://genius.com/4376926", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
