{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "We goin’ bottle for bottle, Belaire Rose to the Brut", "vault_lines": ["We goin' bottle for bottle, Belaire Rose to the Brut"], "meaning": "Rick and this chick are matching each other with the good stuff, from Belaire Rose, sparkling wine he likes so much he’s taken it for a nickname (“Rick Rozay”) to brut (French for “raw”) champagne, a type of dry champagne with very little sugar.\n\n“Belaire Rose…”\n\n\n\n“…to the Brut”", "annotation_id": "4376650", "url": "https://genius.com/4376650", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
