{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "She be movin’ that dough, quarter mil on her wrist", "vault_lines": ["She be movin' that dough, quarter mil on her wrist"], "meaning": "She has a $250,000 watch on! The clever part of this line is that she’s literally moving the dough (the 250k on her wrist) because he’s probably got her whippin' product for him.", "annotation_id": "4254603", "url": "https://genius.com/4254603", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
