{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "Yeah, she remind me of somethin’ but that shit ain’t my Jeep", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, she remind me of somethin' but that shit ain't my Jeep"], "meaning": "A throwback to Kells' classic You Remind Me Of Something, except the line has been flipped so that now he isn’t talking about a Jeep. Maybe he’s decided that the girl reminds him of a bimmer instead.", "annotation_id": "4251652", "url": "https://genius.com/4251652", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "Let’s go shoppin’ at Boca", "vault_lines": ["Let's go shoppin' at Boca"], "meaning": "Boca Raton, Florida, is a city with expensive shops. It’s famous for the rich clients it welcomes.", "annotation_id": "4246895", "url": "https://genius.com/4246895", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "Uh, I be droppin’ so much, nigga My bitch shoppin’ so much, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Uh, I be droppin' so much, nigga", "My bitch shoppin' so much, nigga"], "meaning": "It’s no question that Ross has a lot of money. He’s cashing out his girl with jewelry and clothes because he feels she deserves it. But it is also a drag for Ross because even though he is rich, he is still spending a lot of money on his girl.", "annotation_id": "4214357", "url": "https://genius.com/4214357", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "She on the phone makin’ deals, we gettin’ them checks My Penelope Cruz, I let her meet my connects", "vault_lines": ["She on the phone makin' deals, we gettin' them checks", "My Penelope Cruz, I let her meet my connects"], "meaning": "R. Kelly is saying this girl is on his team, helping him do business and making money for both of them. This line is a reference to the movie “Blow”, in which Penelope Cruz plays the wife of notorious drug dealer George Jung.", "annotation_id": "4178679", "url": "https://genius.com/4178679", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
