{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "Never party with locals, niggas with them Boost Mobiles", "vault_lines": ["Never party with locals, niggas with them Boost Mobiles"], "meaning": "With wealth most of the times comes a rise of your social status.\nHowever even back in the day when he didn’t have money, Rozay wasn’t partying with the local home girls, he was still popping bottles with VIP’s from the music business.", "annotation_id": "4133808", "url": "https://genius.com/4133808", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "Rich bitch is her name and she Chanel to the boot", "vault_lines": ["Rich bitch is her name and she Chanel to the boot"], "meaning": "As forementioned his bitch is no stranger to money, so she is just wearing the finest designer clothes from the famous french company Chanel.", "annotation_id": "4133767", "url": "https://genius.com/4133767", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "Get the Lexus to flip, purple Texas to sip", "vault_lines": ["Get the Lexus to flip, purple Texas to sip"], "meaning": "Rozay’s bitch is driving an expensive Lexus, making the car flip i.e. go at insane high speeds, this is probably the effect of the purple drank that she is sipping on.\n\n\n\nThere is also some homage payed to the Doggfather, with this line from his song “Tha Shiznit”:\n\n“I’m servin ‘em, swervin in the Coupe\nThe Lexus, flexes, from Long Beach to Texas”", "annotation_id": "4133756", "url": "https://genius.com/4133756", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keep Doin’ That (Rich Bitch)", "line": "Let her fuck Meek Mill, told her keep chasin’ her dreams", "vault_lines": ["Let her fuck Meek Mill, told her keep chasin' her dreams"], "meaning": "Meek Mill is signed to Rozay’s Maybach Music label, and Ross doesn’t mind passing chicks around to his record mates. Also, Meek Mill has a mixtape series called Dreamchasers, alluding that maybe he can grant her dreams so long as she works it right.\n\nRoss jokes that Meek’s a second best to him, and to be with him is her dream!", "annotation_id": "4132728", "url": "https://genius.com/4132728", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
