{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Keys to the Crib", "line": "Boobie got a life sentence on his last appeal That’s one of few names that’ll last for real", "vault_lines": ["Boobie got a life sentence on his last appeal", "That's one of few names that'll last for real"], "meaning": "Ross continues his long-running infatuation with his mentor Kenneth “Boobie” Williams, the now-incarcerated former head of a “savage drug gang” called The Boobie Boys.  See here for an in-depth look at the gang and here for an examination of all of Ross' lyrical shout-outs to big-time drug dealers.  Ross in a “Boobie Boys” t-shirt, below:", "annotation_id": "531489", "url": "https://genius.com/531489", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
