{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Knight of the Templar", "line": "I can see it right now, G’s up", "vault_lines": ["I can see it right now, G's up"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is a Freemason. Freemasons often refer to themselves as “G’s” (Gods). G also is the 7th letter in the alphabet.", "annotation_id": "7897142", "url": "https://genius.com/7897142", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Knight of the Templar", "line": "I spoke about a pill, now they wanna boycott", "vault_lines": ["I spoke about a pill, now they wanna boycott"], "meaning": "Ross came under fire in 2013 for the “U.O.E.N.O.”\nlyrics, “Put molly all in her champagne/ She ain’t even know\nit / I took her home and I enjoyed that/ She ain’t even know it.”\nHe repeatedly tried to apologize, but called the lyrics a “misunderstanding” and a “misinterpretation.” The lines were\nthen removed from the song , and Reebok dropped him from their endorsement deal. I think Ross is talking about rebook' boycotting him here.", "annotation_id": "7835507", "url": "https://genius.com/7835507", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Knight of the Templar", "line": "Put you in the Sleeper Jake The Snake Roberts, nigga Fuck it with Mr. Roberts My last name is Roberts, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Put you in the Sleeper", "Jake The Snake Roberts, nigga", "Fuck it with Mr. Roberts", "My last name is Roberts, nigga"], "meaning": "Some lovely wrestling references by Rozay, Sleeper being the sleeper hold submission maneuver used in professional and amateur wrestling in the catch variant, originating from   Judo and JJ, where it is known as a naked chokehold.\n\nJake The Snake Roberts, a frequently name dropped wrestling hall of famer, used to use this move.\n\nRick Ross' surname is Roberts, just in case you didn’t know.", "annotation_id": "7771769", "url": "https://genius.com/7771769", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Knight of the Templar", "line": "No ”Behind the Music”, saving it for Oprah", "vault_lines": ["No \"Behind the Music\", saving it for Oprah"], "meaning": "This should be “No behind the music, I’m saving ti for Oprah”\n\nExplanation: Rick Ross won’t do a Behind the Music, a popular VH1 show. Instead, he prefers to save his story for Oprah, another powerful person in Black American culture.", "annotation_id": "7746822", "url": "https://genius.com/7746822", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
