{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Knotty Head", "line": "Pussy niggas, you can see it on his timeline Hatin’ on his dog, shit, I’m tryna find mine (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["Pussy niggas, you can see it on his timeline", "Hatin' on his dog, shit, I'm tryna find mine (Woo)"], "meaning": "Rick Ross mentions someone’s timeline, hating on his friend.\n\nHe mentions his own friend, and how he’s “still tryna find mine”, meaning he’s probably dead and that the pussy shouldn’t take his friend for granted, since he could also pass away", "annotation_id": "40352932", "url": "https://genius.com/40352932", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
