{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kush", "line": "Harry Hoover Hussein, kickass weed,", "vault_lines": ["Harry Hoover Hussein, kickass weed,"], "meaning": "Like Dirty Harry, Gangster Disciple leader Larry Hoover and Saddam Hussein, Gunplay’s weed is powerful and mean and will definitely kick your ass.\n\nDirty Harry\n\n\n\nLarry Hoover\n\n\n\nSaddam Hussein\n\n\n\nHarry Hoover Hussein – that’s alliteration son!", "annotation_id": "2651650", "url": "https://genius.com/2651650", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kush", "line": "When we started out with Reggie we were barely gettin’ dimes", "vault_lines": ["When we started out with Reggie we were barely gettin' dimes"], "meaning": "When Ross and his crew started out, they were smoking regular low quality weed by the $10 bag, also known as a “dimebag”", "annotation_id": "2435565", "url": "https://genius.com/2435565", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kush", "line": "And this anthrax wax give you asthma attacks", "vault_lines": ["And this anthrax wax give you asthma attacks"], "meaning": "Wax is a form of concentrated THC. Anthrax is another word for high grade marijuana. Commonly know in the hood as “Thrax”. Gunplay is smoking on some potent wax created from this high quality weed.", "annotation_id": "2433041", "url": "https://genius.com/2433041", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
