{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kush", "line": "Black bottle for boss,", "vault_lines": ["Black bottle for boss,"], "meaning": "Block Bottles are bottles of Luc Belaire Rose, Ross' own sparkling wine brand", "annotation_id": "2432998", "url": "https://genius.com/2432998", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kush", "line": "And why you babysitting a blunt That’s that shit I don’t like", "vault_lines": ["And why you babysitting a blunt", "That's that shit I don't like"], "meaning": "A play on Chief Keef hit “I Don’t Like”.\n\n“Babysitting” is used to describe a person who holding the weed, often even without smoking, too long in a group smoking session and doesn’t send it in rotation.\n\nAnd since Lil Wayne likes to smoke, he doesn’t like when you hold on to the kush – smoke and then pass it…", "annotation_id": "2415887", "url": "https://genius.com/2415887", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kush", "line": "B’s for big on the Bentley, can’t squeeze through lanes", "vault_lines": ["B's for big on the Bentley, can't squeeze through lanes"], "meaning": "Double play on the words, The B is actually talkin about Gunplays' label  Bilderberg Group and Bently car which is large enough to make it difficult to drive through narrow lanes.", "annotation_id": "2407544", "url": "https://genius.com/2407544", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kush", "line": "Big bubba bouquet", "vault_lines": ["Belaire bottle, big bubba bouquet"], "meaning": "Gunplay has a big bouquet of Bubblegum Kush, or as it’s also called, Bubba Kush. It’s a very good weed strain, and it just so happens that he has a lot of it.", "annotation_id": "2406643", "url": "https://genius.com/2406643", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kush", "line": "I don’t smoke no reggie I don’t smoke no mid", "vault_lines": ["I don't smoke no reggie", "I don't smoke no mid"], "meaning": "Reggie is known as regular weed, or the lowest grade. Mid is middle-level weed…but neither applies to Weezy, as he only smokes the best bud.\n\n\n\nACCEPTED COMMENT: Also could refer to Reggie Bush; bush is common slang for low-grade herd.", "annotation_id": "2404130", "url": "https://genius.com/2404130", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kush", "line": "I am smoking on that gas Life should be on Cinemax", "vault_lines": ["Life should be on Cinemax"], "meaning": "Reference to the first line of 2 Chainz’s No Lie.\n\nI am smoking on that gas, life should be on Cinemax\n\nWayne’s life has so much explicit content that it can only be shown on cable television channels such as Cinemax.", "annotation_id": "2403591", "url": "https://genius.com/2403591", "state": "accepted", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kush", "line": "Mary Jane’s flowers, Mary-Mary Jane’s flowers Mary Jane’s flowers, M-M-Mary Jane’s flowers That kush, that kush, that kush That kush, that kush, that kush I’m on that kush, that kush, that kush That kush, that kush Mary Jane’s flowers", "vault_lines": ["Mary Jane's flowers, Mary Jane's flowers", "That kush, that kush, that kush"], "meaning": "Sample of a few lines off of Wayne’s 2009 verse on Money to Blow with Birdman and Drake.\n\nAnd I got a big bouquet of Mary Jane’s flowers\nThat kush", "annotation_id": "2403584", "url": "https://genius.com/2403584", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
