{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kyrie", "line": "Dave Grutman in the building, toast like the Goodfellas", "vault_lines": ["Dave Grutman in the building, toast like the Goodfellas"], "meaning": "David Grutman is the “king of Miami nightlife” owner of the South Florida nightclubs LIV and STORY. (LIV on Sunday, hip-hop night, makes numerous hip-hop lyric cameos)\n\nWhenever Grutman is invoked, images come to mind of toasting the finest liquors with the lucrative nightlife mafia à la Goodfellas\n\nDave and the Boss himself:\n\n\n\nDave is friends with loads of rappers and gets frequent shoutouts in rap songs:\nhttps://genius.com/1856400", "annotation_id": "10826190", "url": "https://genius.com/10826190", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kyrie", "line": "My city one big hospice, I could pull the plug", "vault_lines": ["My city one big hospice, I could pull the plug"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is from Miami. Miami, and the state of Florida is known to be a retirement destination for newly retirees.\n\nSo, when he says he’s city is one big hospice, he is pointing out that fact. But since they these folks are nearing their deaths because of age; Ross is saying he could pull the plug on them making them die an early death.", "annotation_id": "10826098", "url": "https://genius.com/10826098", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kyrie", "line": "I wanna build a mansion in Port-Au-Prince", "vault_lines": ["I wanna build a mansion in Port-Au-Prince"], "meaning": "Port-au-Prince is the capital and most populous city of Haiti.", "annotation_id": "10824352", "url": "https://genius.com/10824352", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Kyrie", "line": "Keep it gangster, 20 bottles of Bel-Air", "vault_lines": ["Keep it gangster, 20 bottles of Bel-Air"], "meaning": "Belaire Rosé is a French sparkling wine produced in the Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur region of the South of France .\n\nThe brand’s packaging is noteworthy for its opaque black bottles. Hip-hop artists including Rick Ross and DJ Khaled have been linked to the brand", "annotation_id": "10824342", "url": "https://genius.com/10824342", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
