{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Last Forever", "line": "Maybach Music", "vault_lines": ["Bricks and baguettes, ain't nothing above this (Maybach Music)"], "meaning": "Rick Ross created Maybach Music Group the label under Atlantic Records in 2009. They have a roster of Wale, Meek Mill, Omarion, and many more.\nhttp://img2-ak.lst.fm/i/u/arO/46c39c3742df462dbc9750637f9b2a73\nRick Ross also has a series of tracks with the name of “Maybach Music” spread across his discography.\n\nIn 2008, “Maybach Music”, featuring Jay-Z, was released marking the first ever song of the series. As of 2018, five “Maybach Music” tracks have been released, all of which have features.", "annotation_id": "15331781", "url": "https://genius.com/15331781", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
