{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Lay It Down", "line": "We have these niggas running like Jackie Joyner-Kersee", "vault_lines": ["We have these niggas running like Jackie Joyner-Kersee"], "meaning": "Jackie Joyner-Kersee is a retired American track and field runner who won three gold, one silver and two bronze medals in the Olympics. Her events were the heptathon and long jump", "annotation_id": "2224747", "url": "https://genius.com/2224747", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Lay It Down", "line": "Whip ya head like cee-lo, slap ya like Deebo", "vault_lines": ["Whip ya head like cee-lo, slap ya like Deebo"], "meaning": "Cee-lo is a gambling game you play with three six sided dice. It is also called “four-five-six”, “three dice game” and other names. Debo is played by Tommy “Tiny” Lister, Jr and was one of the main villains in the first Friday film and downgraded into a minor character in the Next Friday.", "annotation_id": "2217906", "url": "https://genius.com/2217906", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Lay It Down", "line": "Put a hundred grand, on Trayvon Martin’s killer", "vault_lines": ["Put a hundred grand, on Trayvon Martin's killer"], "meaning": "The African-American community largely felt as if Trayvon Martin was murdered, as Ross does. Here he says he’ll give $100,000 to whichever hitman kills George Zimmerman.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/rickyrozay/statuses/356234768020549632\n\nAlso, Ross made a song as tribute to the death of Trayvon Martin.", "annotation_id": "2207513", "url": "https://genius.com/2207513", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
