{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Like Them", "line": "Maybach Music", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Ross’s popular Maybach Music adlib he frequently uses at the start of his verses.\n\nMaybach Music is Ross’s record label that many rappers are signed to. The most notable of the roster being Himself, Meek Mill and Wale.\n\nThe adlib is voiced by Australian model Jessica Gomes and since its creation it has been an iconic part of Ross’s music for several years.", "annotation_id": "13277590", "url": "https://genius.com/13277590", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
