{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Look Me In My Eyes", "line": "Pull a Bentley to the block, ribbon on the hood Just to let you niggas know who winning in the hood", "vault_lines": ["Pull a Bentley to the block, ribbon on the hood", "Just to let you niggas know who winning in the hood"], "meaning": "A ribbon is usually awarded to someone in recognition of achievement. Although Ross would only just be stunting, a ribbon on the ‘hood’ would be symbolizing his success in the hood.", "annotation_id": "3131853", "url": "https://genius.com/3131853", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Look Me In My Eyes", "line": "Drummer hold a hundred, now you fuckbois running", "vault_lines": ["Drummer hold a hundred, now you fuckbois running"], "meaning": "“Drum hold a hundred , now you fuckboys running ”\n\nA drum is a magazine on a gun that can shoot rapidly . The one French has holds a hundred bullets . Once his enemies saw it they stared to run away .", "annotation_id": "2955439", "url": "https://genius.com/2955439", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Look Me In My Eyes", "line": "High dub, like sittin’ in the nose bleeds", "vault_lines": ["High dub, like sittin' in the nose bleeds"], "meaning": "Dubs are rims , his own has the car up so high that if feels like your in nose bleed seats .\n\n\n\nNosebleed seats are seats at usually a sports event that is so high you will get a nosebleed due to the elevation .", "annotation_id": "2955415", "url": "https://genius.com/2955415", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Look Me In My Eyes", "line": "Like the Tin Man, steel on me without a heart", "vault_lines": ["Like the Tin Man, steel on me without a heart"], "meaning": "Vado is making a reference to the original Wizard of Oz movie where the Tin Man (stitched together out of various tin and steel pieces) was going to visit Oz in hopes of getting a heart so he can have feelings.\n\n\n\nVado is intending that he has no heart therefore he has no emotion along with the fact that he is made of steel, therefore bulletproof.", "annotation_id": "2647691", "url": "https://genius.com/2647691", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Look Me In My Eyes", "line": "Swear to God I had the SK in the clearport", "vault_lines": ["Swear to God I had the SK in the clearport"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is saying that he has the “SK” aka “SKS,” a semi-automatic rifle that is easy to convert to fully automatic.", "annotation_id": "2647687", "url": "https://genius.com/2647687", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
