{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Look Me In My Eyes", "line": "Posted in front of corner stores like bag ice", "vault_lines": ["Posted in front of corner stores like bag ice"], "meaning": "Typically, bag ice is stored in a freezer in the front of the store to let people driving by know that the store sells it. Also, typically Ganstas post up outside variety stores cause it’s where they sell drugs from\n\n\n\nhttp://www.pennlive.com/midstate/index.ssf/2009/09/harrisburg_mayor_drug_deal_and.html", "annotation_id": "2548345", "url": "https://genius.com/2548345", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Look Me In My Eyes", "line": "Shooters jumping out of their mask like we Daft Punk", "vault_lines": ["Shooters jumping out of their mask like we Daft Punk"], "meaning": "Daft Punk is a French electronic music duo. They wear masks over their faces when they perform, much like the band KISS did in the 70’s.\n\nIn this case, Rick Ross’s homies gonna be poppin' caps and you aren’t even gonna know the face of your killer.\n\n\n\nGood simile by the boss to compare his shooters wearing masks, to Daft Punk wearing masks.", "annotation_id": "2547367", "url": "https://genius.com/2547367", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
