{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Love Come Down (Bad Boy Remix)", "status": "done", "targets": 0, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Diddy-dirty-money-love-come-down-bad-boy-remix-lyrics", "genius_title": "Love Come Down (Bad Boy Remix)", "genius_id": 38117, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Love Lies (Rick Ross Remix)", "line": "She’s my Van Gogh, such a work of art This where my love lies in this sensitive heart (Uh)", "vault_lines": ["She's my Van Gogh, such a work of art", "This where my love lies in this sensitive heart (Uh)"], "meaning": "Vincent van Gogh was an influential Dutch painter, whose work was notable for its beauty, emotion, and color. Though he completed more than 2,100 drawings and paintings, his most famous work is The Starry Night, an oil-on-canvas that depicts an abstract landscape of a night sky.\n\n\n\n“Work of art” is something that’s beautiful. Ross answers the question in the chorus by showing his appreciation for his girl’s beauty.", "annotation_id": "14818923", "url": "https://genius.com/14818923", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Love Lies (Rick Ross Remix)", "line": "I see no flaws, so let’s face it (Huh) No Roseanne Barr, despite the ratings (Woo) She’s independent (Huh), I’m willing to spend it", "vault_lines": ["I see no flaws, so let's face it (Huh)", "No Roseanne Barr, despite the ratings (Woo)", "She's independent (Huh), I'm willing to spend it"], "meaning": "On May 29, 2018, actress Roseanne Barr was under fire after posting a racist Twitter comment about Valerie Jarrett—an African-American woman who was a senior adviser to Barack Obama throughout his presidency.\n\n\n\nThe comment resulted in Barr’s sitcom Roseanne being canceled by ABC. The show had one of the highest ratings of a new TV series in years, attracting a whopping 25 million viewers on the show’s two-episode premiere.\n\nRoss notes here that his girl is perfect and isn’t full of negativity. He’s willing to go all out for her.", "annotation_id": "14818611", "url": "https://genius.com/14818611", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Love Lies (Rick Ross Remix)", "status": "done", "targets": 2, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Khalid-and-normani-love-lies-rick-ross-remix-lyrics", "genius_title": "Love Lies (Rick Ross Remix)", "genius_id": 3780609, "source": "api"}
