{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Love Sosa (Remix)", "line": "I say, I’m ridin’ on Forges – call them my skaters", "vault_lines": ["I say, I’m ridin’ on Forges – call them my skaters"], "meaning": "Ross has Forgiato rims and tires on his car, a luxury many cannot afford in today’s age. He could possible be calling them skaters because they ride smoother than you’re average tire", "annotation_id": "2694032", "url": "https://genius.com/2694032", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Love Sosa (Remix)", "line": "New whips with no mileage New cribs by Cold Harbor", "vault_lines": ["New whips with no mileage", "New cribs by Cold Harbor"], "meaning": "Stalley has brand new cars, without any miles on them.\n\nHe also claims to have bought a mansion in Cold Harbor, VA one of the sites of the final battles of the Civil War.", "annotation_id": "1451128", "url": "https://genius.com/1451128", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Love Sosa (Remix)", "line": "But I’m doin’ me, a million last year Even after doin’ that Music Matters Tour for free", "vault_lines": ["But I’m doin’ me, a million last year", "Even after doin’ that Music Matters Tour for free"], "meaning": "Stalley joined Kendrick Lamar on the Fall 2012 BET Music Matters Tour, a free tour. Despite doing shows for free, Stalley still had an income of over $1 million.", "annotation_id": "1451109", "url": "https://genius.com/1451109", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
