{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Love Sosa (Remix)", "line": "I just redid the deal, another 20 and change", "vault_lines": ["I just redid the deal, another 20 and change"], "meaning": "Rozay revealed at the end of 2012 that his Maybach Music Group imprint has moved from Warner Brother records to Atlantic Records, which is what he is perhaps alluding to here when he says he “redid the deal”.", "annotation_id": "1420963", "url": "https://genius.com/1420963", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
