{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Lyrical Eazy", "line": "Rose gold Richie’ (Richie’), I don’t even rock it (Never)", "vault_lines": ["Rose gold Richie' (Richie'), I don't even rock it (Never)"], "meaning": "Like on the “God Did” freestyle he said there was an AP watch in his pocket and gave it to Tierra, friend of his, because her hair matched the watch. This time here Meek is showing that he got too many watches he is not wearing anymore because owning a lot of them by being keeping his money up all these years he is been in the game.", "annotation_id": "29884477", "url": "https://genius.com/29884477", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
