{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "M.I.A. (Remix)", "line": "Don’t make me bomb on your ass like Flex nigga", "vault_lines": ["Don't make me bomb on your ass like Flex nigga"], "meaning": "Aston George Taylor, Jr. (born August 5, 1968) better known as Funkmaster Flex is an American hip hop DJ, rapper, musician and producer on New York City’s Hot 97 radio station. Whenever he premiers a new song on the radio he always fucks the whole song up with the sounds of bombs dropping. If the bitch French Montana is talking about isn’t careful, he’ll fuck her up in a similar way", "annotation_id": "1624828", "url": "https://genius.com/1624828", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "M.I.A. (Remix)", "line": "She hope I don’t go and get infected by the fame If she heard Electric Highway, she know I stayed the same", "vault_lines": ["She hope I don't go and get infected by the fame", "If she heard Electric Highway, she know I stayed the same"], "meaning": "Rockie stayed real throughout his career, from AC Green mixtapes to Electric Highway. Fame didn’t affect him.", "annotation_id": "1624821", "url": "https://genius.com/1624821", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
