{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "MC Hammer", "line": "I’m about cream", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Cream is slang for Cash Rules Everything Around Me. It originates from the rap group The Wu-Tang Clan. The term was first featured on their song “C.R.E.A.M” which was featured on their 1993 album Enter the Wu-Tang (36 Chambers).", "annotation_id": "12885555", "url": "https://genius.com/12885555", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
