{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "MC Hammer", "line": "I’ll let you borrow mine, I think I’m MC Hammer", "vault_lines": ["I'll let you borrow mine, I think I'm MC Hammer"], "meaning": "Hammer was infamously loose when it came to lending money, and that eventually led to his bankruptcy, so Gucci may be sarcastically alluding to that here with “you can borrow mine”, and following immediately with “I think I’m MC Hammer”.", "annotation_id": "2745449", "url": "https://genius.com/2745449", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
