{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mafia Music", "line": "I open up her mind by openin’ bank accounts Deposit a hundred stacks, break up, won’t take it out Baby that’s a gift, maybe you could live I knew it wouldn’t work but, I just like to give", "vault_lines": ["I open up her mind by openin' bank accounts", "Deposit a hundred stacks, break up, won't take it out", "Baby that's a gift, maybe you could live", "I knew it wouldn't work but, I just like to give"], "meaning": "Ross opens a bank account for his new chick and makes a Boss deposit of a 100 racks. He knows the chick and him will not work but he has so much money that he isnt worried about the lost when they split apart", "annotation_id": "40350488", "url": "https://genius.com/40350488", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
