{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mahogany Caskets", "line": "Shoot up all your shit, fuck 50 Cent It ain’t ever walk away, that go for many men", "vault_lines": ["Shoot up all your shit, fuck 50 Cent", "It ain't ever walk away, that go for many men"], "meaning": "Ross takes another shot at longtime rival 50 Cent, continuing a feud that has stretched back to 2009.\n\nNotably, T.I. and 50 Cent were also engaged in a public feud in early 2026, making his feature on this track noteworthy.\n\nRoss also references 50’s song “Many Men (Wish Death)”", "annotation_id": "40193320", "url": "https://genius.com/40193320", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
