{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mastermind Unfolds Like A True Crime: The Album’s Top Lyrics", "line": "Rozay’s best lyrics is complete unless it includes a lyric about Ross’ love of FOOD", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Many of Ross' best lyrics are about food:\n\n\n“Now I’m in the suites and I’m eatin' crab meats”\n“Order crab legs with the heavy butter”\n“Am I really just a narcissist, cause I wake up to a bowl of lobster bisque?”\n\n\n\nYou can check out a full list of every food Rozay has ever rapped about!", "annotation_id": "2875180", "url": "https://genius.com/2875180", "state": "verified", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
