{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mastermind Unfolds Like A True Crime: The Album’s Top Lyrics", "line": "Reebok", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Despite reportedly losing his endorsement deal with Reebok in 2013, Rick Ross maintains that he has a good relationship with Reebok and continues to wear and promote the brand on his Instagram page.\n\nOn his relationship with Reebok, Ross said:\n\nI’ll always be a supporter of Reebok. That’s a forever thing.", "annotation_id": "2875106", "url": "https://genius.com/2875106", "state": "verified", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mastermind Unfolds Like A True Crime: The Album’s Top Lyrics", "line": "Luc Belaire Rosé", "vault_lines": [", Luc Belaire Rosé"], "meaning": "Rick Ross was playfully nicknamed “Rozay” because of his affection for the champagne. Ross' favorite rosé is non other than Luc Belaire Rosé. He recently started a Black Bottle Boy faction consisting of artists, DJs, and other hip-hop personal and a Black Bottle Girl group consisting of models and other video vixens.", "annotation_id": "2875091", "url": "https://genius.com/2875091", "state": "verified", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
