{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mastermind Unfolds Like A True Crime: The Album’s Top Lyrics", "line": "Ross has made it a fixture to include numerous high profile features on his albums", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Over the years, Rozay has had guest features from:\n\n\nJAY Z\nKanye West\nDrake\nLil Wayne\nDr. Dre\nAndre 3000\nRaekwon\nScarface\n\n\n\nand many more!\n\nNot only is Ross one of the biggest names in the game, he can recruit virtually anybody he wants to be apart of his album.", "annotation_id": "2874854", "url": "https://genius.com/2874854", "state": "verified", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mastermind Unfolds Like A True Crime: The Album’s Top Lyrics", "line": "J.U.S.T.I.C.E. League", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Rick Ross and JUSTICE League have a long history of collaborating. Every Ross album since Trilla has featured extensive production from the legendary producer group. They produced the album’s outro, “Thug Cry”.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/JusticeLeague/status/439547210523361281\n\nShortly after Mastermind was released, JUSTICE League tweeted out that they’ve already begun work on Ross' seventh album.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/JusticeLeague/status/440354989177704448", "annotation_id": "2874837", "url": "https://genius.com/2874837", "state": "verified", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mastermind Unfolds Like A True Crime: The Album’s Top Lyrics", "line": "D-Rich", "vault_lines": ["The album features a slew of prominent producers including Scott Storch, D-Rich"], "meaning": "Ross and D-Rich have frequently collaborated recently. He produced the promo single, “Box Chevy” as well as the Mastermind cuts “BLK & WHT” and “Walkin On Air”.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=POwaPdAPyNs", "annotation_id": "2874826", "url": "https://genius.com/2874826", "state": "verified", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mastermind Unfolds Like A True Crime: The Album’s Top Lyrics", "line": "Rick Ross has released his highly anticipated sixth studio album, Mastermind.", "vault_lines": ["Rick Ross has released his highly anticipated sixth studio album, Mastermind."], "meaning": "AVAILABLE NOW ON iTUNES NOW!", "annotation_id": "2874809", "url": "https://genius.com/2874809", "state": "verified", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
