{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Maybach Dons", "line": "Put it on D’s like under this bitch T-shirt", "vault_lines": ["Put it on D's like under this bitch T-shirt"], "meaning": "Putting a car on D’s or throwing some D’s on it is slang for adding Dayton rims\n\n\n\n\n\n\nD-cup breasts are also called D’s for short\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKanye remixed “Throw Some D’s On It” to the latter meaning of D’s, buying a girl implants\nIn Ye’s remix he says:\n\n\n\nI mean, I ain’t really into rims and all that\nIf I'mma take, five, ten stacks of some D’s it’s gonna be some different kind of D’s", "annotation_id": "2562498", "url": "https://genius.com/2562498", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
