{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Maybach Dons", "line": "Still count my b’s", "vault_lines": ["Count my money, still count my b's"], "meaning": "Shout out to the Bloods, which is the gang that Game claims and also the logo and initial of Game’s own record label The Black Wall Street Records.\n\n\n\nThe logo of Game’s label.", "annotation_id": "409388", "url": "https://genius.com/409388", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
