{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Maybach Dons", "line": "Hailed as a boss, nailed to the cross Rose from the dead, that Rolls Royce cost", "vault_lines": ["Hailed as a boss, nailed to the cross", "Rose from the dead, that Rolls Royce cost"], "meaning": "He compares himself to Jesus, once again. He is hypothetically nailed to the cross and rises from the dead, just like Jesus, but to pay for the new Rolls Royce.\n\n\n\nRolls Royce Ghost.", "annotation_id": "409372", "url": "https://genius.com/409372", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
