{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mercy", "line": "Paid in full, bitch I think I’m Rico", "vault_lines": ["Paid in full, bitch I think I’m Rico"], "meaning": "Paid In Full is a 2002 action crime film, starring Cam'ron as lead. The movie is about a man named Rico, who built a drug empire during 80s crack epidemic. For Rick Ross, this concept is literal.", "annotation_id": "1171946", "url": "https://genius.com/1171946", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mercy", "line": "Hostile, mob style, Rothchild’s", "vault_lines": ["Hostile, mob style, Rothchild's"], "meaning": "Play on rough-childs, aka hard ass kids, and Rothchilds, a Jewish banking family known for their large wealth and goes with the Jewish theme of the mix tape.\n\n\n\nTheir bank is the shit.", "annotation_id": "1152385", "url": "https://genius.com/1152385", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mercy", "line": "I came to win, she’s just tryna kick it like it’s 4th and 10 Give it as she gon run it back", "vault_lines": ["I came to win, she’s just tryna kick it like it’s 4th and 10", "Give it as she gon run it back"], "meaning": "In football, there are two ways to score:\n1. Touchdown (6 points + pending PAT)) – scored by running or completing a pass into the end zone\n2. Field Goal (3 points) – scored by kicking the ball through the goal posts\n\nYou have 4 downs, or plays, in football to advance the ball forward 10 yards. Doing so resets the downs and you get another 4 chances, getting you closer to scoring.\n\nOn fourth down, if you do not convert a first down the ball goes to the other team. Therefore, the team has a few options as to what they want to do:\n1. Fourth Down Conversion (“Go for it”) – the team runs or passes the ball in attempt to get a first down\n2. Kick a field goal – if they are in field goal range (typically within 50 yards in the NFL) the team can attempt to kick the ball through the uprights/\n3. Punt – They kick the ball to the other team’s returner (who “runs it back”), ceding their possession and moving to defense.\n\nIf you want to win in football you go for the touchdown, or at least a field goal so you can earn points. His girl is punting and waiting to run it back like she is giving up.\n\nShe wants to “kick it”, aka chill with Rockie, just like you “kick it” (punt or kick a field goal) in football.", "annotation_id": "1136317", "url": "https://genius.com/1136317", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Mercy", "line": "Vacheron cost a Lambo, you niggas in debt", "vault_lines": ["Vacheron cost a Lambo, you niggas in debt"], "meaning": "Vacheron-Constantin is a Swiss luxury watch manufacturer known for being one of the oldest and most prestigious watchmakers in the world.\nA google search shows the extravagant prices of Vacheron-Constantin wristwatches, so Rozay’s claim that it costs a Lambo is not unfounded.", "annotation_id": "1124240", "url": "https://genius.com/1124240", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
