{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Midnight Hoes", "line": "Bitch so bad she a prize to a pimp Ain’t even gotta fuck to get paid by a simp", "vault_lines": ["Bitch so bad she a prize to a pimp", "Ain't even gotta fuck to get paid by a simp"], "meaning": "Simp = a foolish person, someone who that puts too much value on a female for no reason.\n\n\n\nThe girls pimp is proud of her and likes to shower off, because simp’s are dumb enough to pay large amounts of cash just to get a touch, in which the pimp gets paid.", "annotation_id": "3209526", "url": "https://genius.com/3209526", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
