{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Milly Rock (Remix)", "line": "I Milly Rock and I’m Diddy bopping", "vault_lines": ["I Milly Rock and I’m Diddy bopping"], "meaning": "As it is obvious as to why Ferg is Milly Rocking, (he is featured on the song) Ferg is also doing the Diddy Bop. This is a reference to Sean Comb’s infamous dance moves that have popped up in his music videos over the years:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe man’s got moves!", "annotation_id": "8621317", "url": "https://genius.com/8621317", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
