{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Milly Rock (Remix)", "line": "I be on my Rossfit, couple pears and a salad", "vault_lines": ["I be on my Rossfit, couple pears and a salad"], "meaning": "Rossfit is Rick Ross' take on the popular CrossFit fitness program, which the rapper embraced after suffering two seizures in 2011. In 2014, Ross was able to shed 100 pounds by embracing his new workout plan and diet.\n\nIn an interview with Tim Westwood, Renzel shouted out eating pears, which became a viral vine and led to U.S. pear farmers being thankful for his support.", "annotation_id": "8610900", "url": "https://genius.com/8610900", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
