{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Milly Rock (Remix)", "line": "Damn Ferg done made it I heard he working with Madonna", "vault_lines": ["Damn Ferg done made it", "I heard he working with Madonna"], "meaning": "Ferg spoke with  Revolt TV about how he collaborated with Madonna, Pharrell, and Missy Elliot on his upcoming album Always Strive and Prosper. He said, “They said oh, this is crazy. These are people that I look up to, so, if they say they like it, it means a lot.”", "annotation_id": "8598593", "url": "https://genius.com/8598593", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Milly Rock (Remix)", "line": "Last name and I say the biggest You fallin’ off like Philip Rivers", "vault_lines": ["Last name and I say the biggest", "You fallin’ off like Philip Rivers"], "meaning": "Rozay’s name is the biggest, while others are past their prime– a reference to San Diego (maybe?) Chargers quarterback Phillip Rivers. Rivers has long been among the NFL’s top quarterbacks, but in recent years he’s taken a step back form his previous form, the analogy Rick Ross uses to put you down.", "annotation_id": "8566123", "url": "https://genius.com/8566123", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Milly Rock (Remix)", "line": "I’ma hit it with another one, bouta call DJ Khaled", "vault_lines": ["I’ma hit it with another one, bouta call DJ Khaled"], "meaning": "Ferg has indeed found the keys to success, and he promises to deliver another hit album, calling on one of Miami’s DJ Khaled.", "annotation_id": "8566100", "url": "https://genius.com/8566100", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
