{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Minks In Miami", "line": "All my jewels on me like the legend, Rich Porter", "vault_lines": ["All my jewеls on me like the legend, Rich Porter"], "meaning": "Rich Porter was truly a legend. Richard Thomas Porter, born in 1964, was an American drug kingpin + gangster rising to prominence in New York City during the 1980s crack era. He began selling drugs at the age of TWELVE, and was always known for living a rich lifestyle.\n\n\n\nHe was murdered on January 3rd, 1990, with his body found somewhere around Orchard Beach in the Bronx. He was shot several times in the head and chest.", "annotation_id": "39689801", "url": "https://genius.com/39689801", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Minks In Miami", "line": "Jet to New Orleans, mansion in the French Quarter", "vault_lines": ["Jet to New Orleans, mansion in thе French Quarter"], "meaning": "The French Quarter is a historic neighborhood located in New Orleans, Louisiana. The Quarter is primarily known for its unique architecture, Creole cuisine, and the notorious Bourbon Street.", "annotation_id": "39676507", "url": "https://genius.com/39676507", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
