{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Money", "line": "Misfortunes of a rich nigga You watch BET while she look at the big picture", "vault_lines": ["Misfortunes of a rich nigga", "You watch BET while she look at the big picture"], "meaning": "He subtly uses the word “misfortunes” to imply the “missed fortunes” that occur when children and child support come in to the equation.\n\nWhilst you are looking to be the next big thing, and get a video on BET, this girl is plotting on ways to make your empire hers.", "annotation_id": "5116732", "url": "https://genius.com/5116732", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
