{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Money Make Me Come", "line": "She make moves on my behalf when I had no bond", "vault_lines": ["She make moves on my behalf when I had no bond"], "meaning": "This line can be interepreted in a few ways.\n\n\nRoss' girl sold dope (made moves) for him, when he had no money (bond).\nRoss' girl made moves to get him out of jail, when he was held without bond.", "annotation_id": "1488741", "url": "https://genius.com/1488741", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Money Make Me Come", "line": "Fuck the Aston Mar", "vault_lines": ["Fuck the Aston Mar"], "meaning": "Apparently in 2008 Ross didn’t like Aston Martins, but he did like them in 2010 after he decided to named his smash hit after the car.", "annotation_id": "1406955", "url": "https://genius.com/1406955", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
