{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Money and Powder", "line": "Took me down for questionin’ ain’t said a word in it First 48 I coulda had a role in it", "vault_lines": ["Took me down for questionin' ain't said a word in it", "First 48 I coulda had a role in it"], "meaning": "Feds took him to the precinct for questioning on a murder (First 48) but he didn’t say a word.\n\nFirst 48 is a TV show that tries to catch a victim’s killer within the first 48 hours of the murder.", "annotation_id": "7736600", "url": "https://genius.com/7736600", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
