{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "My nigga", "line": "They come right back like I’m A. Broner Come right back like I’m A. Broner Come right back like I’m A. Broner", "vault_lines": ["They come right back like I'm A. Broner", "Come right back like I'm A. Broner"], "meaning": "Referencin the American boxer, Adrien Broner.\n\nWhen everyone sees what Rozay has, they keep coming back because he has game, has cars, has women, everything good in life.", "annotation_id": "32801169", "url": "https://genius.com/32801169", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "My nigga", "line": "Park the money caller when it’s seven ???", "vault_lines": ["Park the money caller when it's seven ???"], "meaning": "Misheard lyrics..\n\nRozay sayin park the Monte Carlo and the Seven Trey.\n\nNow it’s an all white Phantom, we heavyweight.\n\nRozay spitting game about his whips. Started with a Monte Carlo and a ‘73 and now has an all white Rolls Royce Phantom.", "annotation_id": "32801158", "url": "https://genius.com/32801158", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
