{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "My nigga", "line": "Potted", "vault_lines": ["Quarter Key in back just like a beef potted"], "meaning": "A quarter key in the back like a beef patty, not potted.\n\nRozay is saying he’s got more weight than a hamburger patty.", "annotation_id": "32801145", "url": "https://genius.com/32801145", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
