{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Neighborhood Drug Dealer", "line": "Bail, helpin’ out my mama, been about mine", "vault_lines": ["Bail, helpin' out my mama, been about mine"], "meaning": "A luxury shopping mall in Ft. Lauderdale, FL. Ross can take his mama to shop at Bal Harbour because he’s been about his [money].", "annotation_id": "4468578", "url": "https://genius.com/4468578", "state": "accepted", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Neighborhood Drug Dealer", "line": "It’s your neighborhood drug dealer One, two, what it be? Michael Jordan, white bitch, 23", "vault_lines": ["One, two, what it be?", "Michael Jordan, white bitch, 23"], "meaning": "Michael Jordan wore the jersey number 23 and it was often white. Here MJ is used as a metaphor for marijuana (Marry Jane) – as well as comparing himself to the “greatest basketball player ever” and white as a metaphor for coke. 23k is about how much you’d expect to pay for a combination package: 1 kilo of coke, 1 kilo of pot. Basic hood starter package, better investment than a car.", "annotation_id": "4454080", "url": "https://genius.com/4454080", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Neighborhood Drug Dealer", "line": "Pussy niggas gossip, pray you die from gonorrhea Al Capone, where I’m from that Benzo bullet proof Neighborhood dope boy, you can get it too", "vault_lines": ["Al Capone, where I'm from that Benzo bullet proof", "Neighborhood dope boy, you can get it too"], "meaning": "Gonorrhea is a nasty sexually transmitted disease and without proper medication can be deadly. Al Capone is a well known American Gangster who rose to power during the prohibition era. Capone died from late stage syphilis, another STD.\n\nRoss draws parallels between himself and one of America’s greatest crime bosses – he runs a business like Capone, and no one will get in his way.", "annotation_id": "4453866", "url": "https://genius.com/4453866", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Neighborhood Drug Dealer", "line": "You a house nigga, so they let you get the mail We in the back whippin’ egg whites and crackin’ shells Robbin’ jeans for my team, pocket for the sale", "vault_lines": ["You a house nigga, so they let you get the mail", "We in the back whippin' egg whites and crackin' shells", "Robbin' jeans for my team, pocket for the sale"], "meaning": "A house nigga is like a weed carrier – the lowest rank within an organisation. While you’re checking the mail, Rozay is cookin' up crack in the kitchen ready to distribute. Robin jeans are a designer brand, known for their “flap pocket” – they’re great if you want to keep something safe.", "annotation_id": "4453848", "url": "https://genius.com/4453848", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Neighborhood Drug Dealer", "line": "Bet you hear my pipes rev when I tip the scale Rich forever, still a muscle and it never fails", "vault_lines": ["Bet you hear my pipes rev when I tip the scale", "Rich forever, still a muscle and it never fails"], "meaning": "As Ross weighs up his coke ready for distribution, you’ll hear the rev of the engine on his classic muscle car. Rich Forever is the name of Rozay’s 2012 classic mixtape, often considered one of the greatest mixtapes of all time.", "annotation_id": "4453835", "url": "https://genius.com/4453835", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Neighborhood Drug Dealer", "line": "Fuck them pussy niggas, catch they ass at Smoothie Kings Hundred missed calls after that new toolie rings", "vault_lines": ["Fuck them pussy niggas, catch they ass at Smoothie Kings", "Hundred missed calls after that new toolie rings"], "meaning": "Rick’s not shading the occasional smoothie, but he’s definitely not adorning those who can be reliably found buying smoothies with hood laurels –  Smoothie King regulars don’t strike fear into the heart of Rick Ross.\n\nAfter he shoots the bitches with smoothies, they’ll have a hundred missed calls due to them being dead.", "annotation_id": "4432102", "url": "https://genius.com/4432102", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
