{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Never Been, Pt. II", "line": "See what’s newest on Netflix, order another movie", "vault_lines": ["See what's newest on Netflix, order another movie"], "meaning": "Back when this song released for Netflix you had to either pay to stream a movie or rent a dvd.", "annotation_id": "32233652", "url": "https://genius.com/32233652", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Never Been, Pt. II", "line": "I stay on my job so you can see I’m up next", "vault_lines": ["I stay on my job so you can see I'm up next"], "meaning": "This is possibly a reference to Steve Jobs and his company, NeXT, which he started after he was forced out of Apple in 1985.", "annotation_id": "12728823", "url": "https://genius.com/12728823", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Never Been, Pt. II", "line": "But you can tell by how I spit it, nigga I be gettin’ dough Take her all the places that she never been befo’", "vault_lines": ["But you can tell by how I spit it, nigga I be gettin' dough", "Take her all the places that she never been befo'"], "meaning": "Wiz’s raps are great, you can tell by just hearing them that he is successful\n\nHe plans on taking that money from rapping and travelling the world, taking his woman (Amber) with him to places she has “never been”", "annotation_id": "638187", "url": "https://genius.com/638187", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Never Been, Pt. II", "line": "I probably won’t be up in there if I ain’t got an O", "vault_lines": ["I probably won't be up in there if I ain't got an O"], "meaning": "If Wiz can’t get his hands on an ounce of marijuana whether that’s through his own means or you providing it for him, then don’t expect him to show up at your club, concert, bat mitzvah, etc. .", "annotation_id": "637902", "url": "https://genius.com/637902", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Never Been, Pt. II", "line": "I’m in my Grand Natty, smokin’ on that granddaddy", "vault_lines": ["I'm in my Grand Natty, smokin' on that granddaddy"], "meaning": "Ross is cruising in his Buick Grand National, a sought after car for auto enthusiasts (notably seen in Fast and Furious), while smoking on grandaddy kush. .", "annotation_id": "637737", "url": "https://genius.com/637737", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
