{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Never personal", "line": "Tinted windows blowing smoke therefore you can’t notice (Huh) Ring on every finger, pushin’ the new Range Rover (Huh) Let the top down on the Maybach then I throw the piece (Boss) I’m the biggest in the South, they love me on the East", "vault_lines": ["Tinted windows blowing smoke therefore you can't notice (Huh)", "Ring on every finger, pushin' the new Range Rover (Huh)", "Let the top down on the Maybach then I throw the piece (Boss)", "I'm the biggest in the South, they love me on the East"], "meaning": "Ross is in a tinted Maybach smoking some marijuana and hence can’t notice the smoke in the car.", "annotation_id": "16915845", "url": "https://genius.com/16915845", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
