{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "New Agenda", "line": "Take your cape off, super sippin’, settle down", "vault_lines": ["Take your cape off, super sippin', settle down"], "meaning": "Basically, Krit is telling you to stop acting like a tough guy because when you’re under the influence of alcohol you start to act differently. He uses cape and super to reference Superman (which the person he’s addressing is the opposite of).", "annotation_id": "2936020", "url": "https://genius.com/2936020", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "New Agenda", "line": "Time and time again And time and time and time again I tried to tell these hoes Time and time again And time and time and time again I tried to tell these hoes", "vault_lines": ["Time and time again", "And time and time and time again", "I tried to tell these hoes"], "meaning": "KRIT has been telling everyone about his new agenda…and now its time for Cadillactica to prove himself.", "annotation_id": "2917918", "url": "https://genius.com/2917918", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
