{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "No Church in the Wild (Freestyle)", "line": "Peace! At the dealer, talking Bugatti talk (Maybach Music) You never heard it like ’Luminati talk (Maybach Music)", "vault_lines": ["Peace! At the dealer, talking Bugatti talk (Maybach Music)", "You never heard it like 'Luminati talk (Maybach Music)"], "meaning": "You never heard the Bugatti talk at the dealership ( cause obviously you can’t afford a Bugatti, wich price is 2 $ million circa )  like you have never heard Illuminati’s talks, playing on the fact that people cant’t hear the conversations of a secrete society.\n\n\n\nFastest and most expensive car in the world", "annotation_id": "1434686", "url": "https://genius.com/1434686", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "No Church in the Wild (Freestyle)", "line": "Where the love flow thin And the pain run deep ’cause it’s blood in the streets", "vault_lines": ["And the pain run deep 'cause it's blood in the streets"], "meaning": "On 2011 Philadelphia, Mill’s city, was the 1st with the coefficient population/murders with 21 killings every 100,000 people (Philly has 1,500,000 circa citizens).\nThe murder capital was New Orleans ( Yeah Weezy, you was right ) with 57 homicides and 350,000 people", "annotation_id": "1434260", "url": "https://genius.com/1434260", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
