{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "No Church in the Wild (Freestyle)", "line": "Thanksgiving with them birds, just drugs for a feast", "vault_lines": ["Thanksgiving with them birds, just drugs for a feast"], "meaning": "Meek uses instead of a  classic turkey another type of bird (even if\nyour mouth might go a bit numb from feasting on this)\n\n\n\nAlso retaking Jay’s line on the original song", "annotation_id": "518434", "url": "https://genius.com/518434", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "No Church in the Wild (Freestyle)", "line": "Cornered the game,", "vault_lines": ["For a nigga like me in the game so foul"], "meaning": "Can’t deny the fact that Ross has created a sort of monopoly in the rap game. If you ain’t cool with him, you’re assed out.", "annotation_id": "518307", "url": "https://genius.com/518307", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "No Church in the Wild (Freestyle)", "line": "Your informant’s correct Now give me enormous respect", "vault_lines": ["Now give me enormous respect"], "meaning": "Ross is confirming that the things that the devil has heard about him (from who ever is the liaison between earth and hell) are true.\n\n\n\nTherefore, he should earn the respect of everyone including Beelzebub.", "annotation_id": "518298", "url": "https://genius.com/518298", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "No Church in the Wild (Freestyle)", "line": "Paths cross, of course your life lost", "vault_lines": ["Paths cross, of course your life lost"], "meaning": "Keeping with the pious theme of his upcoming album ‘God Forgives…I Don’t’, Ross sets the scene for him conversing with the Devil in the first few lines of his verse.\n\n\n\nIf you encounter the Devil, you’re life is surely over already. Ross cleverly words the line to allude to his similarity. If you cross Ricky’s path, your fate is equally doomed.", "annotation_id": "518285", "url": "https://genius.com/518285", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "No Church in the Wild (Freestyle)", "line": "Record label on his chain", "vault_lines": ["record label on his chain"], "meaning": "He’s reppin Maybach Music Group through the charm on his chain.\n\n\n\nDouble meaning (similar to Cam'ron’s line): The worth of his or any other label is the equivalent of the amount he spent on his chain.", "annotation_id": "518002", "url": "https://genius.com/518002", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
