{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Noble", "status": "done", "targets": 0, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Dame-dolla-noble-lyrics", "genius_title": "Noble", "genius_id": 9434811, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Nobody", "line": "Momma’s tryna save me but she don’t know I’m tryna save her Man, them niggas tried to play me, man, ’til I got this paper", "vault_lines": ["Man, them niggas tried to play me, man, 'til I got this paper"], "meaning": "In the streets of NY/LA take your pick mothers are consistently trying to save their sons from being taken away by the streets. Here French is using the hook to express the reason he in the streets is to save his family.\n\nFrench who was attacked, shot and almost killed, he beat a murder charge due to the actions of the perpetrators it was deem self defense. French is showing the bullet wound in the back of his head due to a murder attempt, the people tried to set him up.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/kH01-QLruO4\n\nHe was on the news, and survived the attacked in this classic VLAD TV interview.", "annotation_id": "16545889", "url": "https://genius.com/16545889", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Nobody", "line": "Momma’s tryna save me but she don’t know I’m tryna save her Man, them niggas tried to play me, man, ’til I got this paper", "vault_lines": ["Man, them niggas tried to play me, man, 'til I got this paper"], "meaning": "In the streets of NY/LA take your pick mothers are consistently trying to save their sons from being taken away by the streets. Here French is using the hook to express the reason he in the streets is to save his family.\n\nFrench who was attacked, shot and almost killed, he beat a murder charge due to the actions of the perpetrators it was deem self defense. French is showing the bullet wound in the back of his head due to a murder attempt, the people tried to set him up.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/kH01-QLruO4\n\nHe was on the news, and survived the attacked in this classic VLAD TV interview.", "annotation_id": "16545887", "url": "https://genius.com/16545887", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Nobody", "line": "Momma’s tryna save me but she don’t know I’m tryna save her Man, them niggas tried to play me, man, ’til I got this paper", "vault_lines": ["Man, them niggas tried to play me, man, 'til I got this paper"], "meaning": "In the streets of NY/LA take your pick mothers are consistently trying to save their sons from being taken away by the streets. Here French is using the hook to express the reason he in the streets is to save his family.\n\nFrench who was attacked, shot and almost killed, he beat a murder charge due to the actions of the perpetrators it was deem self defense. French is showing the bullet wound in the back of his head due to a murder attempt, the people tried to set him up.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kH01-QLruO4\n\nHe was on the news, and survived the attacked in this classic VLAD TV interview.", "annotation_id": "16545613", "url": "https://genius.com/16545613", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Nobody", "line": "Gang signs, see ’em all", "vault_lines": ["Nothin' penetrates the steel doors, gang signs, see 'em all"], "meaning": "A reference to Ross’s rough hood past. When you live in a area where gangs fight and battle, you will see a lot of traumatizing stuff, like murder, betrayal, etc.  You always respect it but you also become hardened to it (like “steel”) over time because it’s part of daily life, so it doesn’t impact (“penetrate”) your psyche as much.", "annotation_id": "2919031", "url": "https://genius.com/2919031", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
