{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Nobody’s Favorite", "line": "Khaled told you pussy niggas all I do is win (Another one)", "vault_lines": ["Khaled told you pussy niggas all I do is win (Another one)"], "meaning": "Ross is referring to DJ Khaled’s 2010 hit single “All I Do Is Win”–which featured Ross himself as well as T-Pain, Ludacris & Snoop Dogg. Ross also uses Khaled’s iconic “Another One” adlib after the line.", "annotation_id": "17780093", "url": "https://genius.com/17780093", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
