{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Now That I’m Paid", "line": "Kids gon’ be alright ’cuz Daddy invested in wingstop Money and residuals comin’ like it’s a ritual", "vault_lines": ["Kids gon' be alright 'cuz Daddy invested in wingstop", "Money and residuals comin' like it's a ritual"], "meaning": "Game isn’t stupid, he knows that he needs to save some of his money for his children.\n\nSo, he makes smart investments with it, like investing in the Wing Stop fast food franchise – that way, money keeps coming in every day, so that it’s almost like it’s a ritual for his cash to grow by the week.", "annotation_id": "3207824", "url": "https://genius.com/3207824", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Now That I’m Paid", "line": "Parked the Chevy in that thing, glaze like Kris Kreme", "vault_lines": ["Parked the Chevy in that thing, glaze like Kris Kreme"], "meaning": "Ross is so rich, that he went out and had his old school Chevy glazed in new candy paint, just like the donut chain Krispy Kreme glazes their donuts with frosting.\n\n\n\nOf course, candy painted Chevys are a southern tradition.", "annotation_id": "3207818", "url": "https://genius.com/3207818", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Now That I’m Paid", "line": "Started with a crumb, and turned it to a brick They were calling me a bum, my turn, I’m the shit", "vault_lines": ["Started with a crumb, and turned it to a brick", "They were calling me a bum, my turn, I'm the shit"], "meaning": "Rick Ross started out in poverty, symbolized by a crumb, but then made it big, symbolized by a brick. This is a play on cocaine terms:\n\nRoss, of course, is also a drug kingpin. He started with only a crumb of cocaine to sell – but through Ambition and effort, he soon turned that into bricks of cocaine to sell (worth tens of thousands of dollars each).\n\nHe may have been poor (or a bum) in the past, but now he’s rich and everyone wants to be him.", "annotation_id": "3207806", "url": "https://genius.com/3207806", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Now That I’m Paid", "line": "Whip it in the kitchen before Hillary became a Clinton", "vault_lines": ["Whip it in the kitchen before Hillary became a Clinton"], "meaning": "Reference to Hillary Clinton, wife of former president, Bill Clinton:\n\nRick Ross has been involved in the drug game so long, that he was whipping up cocaine in the kitchen before Hillary married Bill, which was in 1975!\n\nOf course, this is impossible because Rick Ross wasn’t actually born until a year later, in 1976.", "annotation_id": "3207772", "url": "https://genius.com/3207772", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Now That I’m Paid", "line": "15 ounces at a time, pussy nigga, do the math", "vault_lines": ["15 ounces at a time, pussy nigga, do the math"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is smoking a shit ton of weed (almost a pound).\n\n\n\nHe cordially invites you to figure out how much that adds up to over time.", "annotation_id": "697729", "url": "https://genius.com/697729", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Now That I’m Paid", "line": "Wale in that Ferrari, but that Phantom on his ass", "vault_lines": ["Wale in that Ferrari, but that Phantom on his ass"], "meaning": "In typical Game fashion, he is name dropping fellow rapper Wale. He is talking about all of his fellow rappers being rich enough to afford expensive-ass cars like Ferraris and Rolls Royce Phantoms. Phantom is pun play between ghosts and the name of the car.", "annotation_id": "697725", "url": "https://genius.com/697725", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
