{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "When I make the wave, you ride it Ri-, ri-ri, ri-ri-ride the wave Ri-, ri-ri, ri-ri-ride the wave", "vault_lines": ["When I make the wave, you ride it", "Ri-, ri-, ri-ri-ride the wave", "Ri-, ri-ri, ri-ri-ride the wave"], "meaning": "Cassie’s music is the wave and the listeners are like surfers.\n\n\n\nThe listener feels her like a surfer feels a wave coming.", "annotation_id": "3120622", "url": "https://genius.com/3120622", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Insane", "vault_lines": ["If you insane and it's late in the night"], "meaning": "Cassie is baffled that it is so insane that she considers herself the “same”.", "annotation_id": "2275386", "url": "https://genius.com/2275386", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "I’m the same,", "vault_lines": ["Same bitch you shittin' on the only thing that'll last"], "meaning": "Equality, everyone should be treated the same. Cassie is the “same” in her own sense of fitting in this world.", "annotation_id": "2275382", "url": "https://genius.com/2275382", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "And that’s how you know I’ve been hunting the game Bang, bang and I hit it with impeccable aim Bang, bang and I blow it up, they don’t know what’s up", "vault_lines": ["And that's how you know I've been hunting the game", "Bang, bang and I hit it with impeccable aim"], "meaning": "Hunting the rap game, Cassie is climbing the hip-hop ladder and making money. Which helps her pay for things mentioned in the previous line:\n\nThe onomatopoeia “bang, bang” continues her wordplay and represents her killing it as an artist. The onomatopoeia can be used to represent the explosion of a bomb or the shots from a gun.\n\n\n\nCassie has improved and enhanced her style. She knows exactly where she wants to go in her career, right to the top, hitting the bulls eye.", "annotation_id": "2275356", "url": "https://genius.com/2275356", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Kobe Bryant money, nigga you ain’t gotta love him", "vault_lines": ["Kobe Bryant money, nigga you ain't gotta love him"], "meaning": "Kobe Bryant is worth an estimated $200 million dollars and is paid $25.2 million per year.", "annotation_id": "2178317", "url": "https://genius.com/2178317", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "[Intro: Cassie] I make music to numb your brain I make music to numb your brain Maybach Music Rock-a-bye baby Ri-, ri-, ri-ri-ride the wave", "vault_lines": ["Ri-, ri-, ri-ri-ride the wave"], "meaning": "Maybach Music Group (MMG) is a record label imprint founded by American rapper Rick Ross\n\n\n\nCassie sells music like a drug dealer sells drugs. She wants to get her fans high and addicted off her melodies and beats. “Ride the wave” is another way of saying “vibe with me.”", "annotation_id": "2116078", "url": "https://genius.com/2116078", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Went on world tours, paid in all cash Top floor views, my wall is all glass", "vault_lines": ["Went on world tours, paid in all cash", "Top floor views, my wall is all glass"], "meaning": "AKA the Penthouse\n\n\n\nThe apartment rooms at the top of the buildings or hotel, are fairly expensive. Since they are at the type, they are designed so their residents can enjoy the view with large glass windows.", "annotation_id": "1854099", "url": "https://genius.com/1854099", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Tell me that you numb if you not feeling this, Rick", "vault_lines": ["Tell me that you numb if you not feeling this, Rick"], "meaning": "If you can’t (emotionally) feel or even understand Rick’s verse, then you’re just numb to it all…music isn’t meant to dumb the brain & you should feel something.", "annotation_id": "1697878", "url": "https://genius.com/1697878", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Now it’s Philip Lim on them, no more 8-Balls", "vault_lines": ["Now it's Philip Lim on them, no more 8-Balls"], "meaning": "8Ball = 1/8th of an ounce of cocaine.\n\nRoss wants to go beyond the above (see the next line, where he says he wants to go “uncut”).\n\n\n\nPhillip Lim is known for moving onto the next thing – like how Lim went from his original line of fashion (just named after him) to now 3.1 Phillip Lim.", "annotation_id": "1697869", "url": "https://genius.com/1697869", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Yellow brick road, I’m told it’s just a cakewalk", "vault_lines": ["Yellow brick road, I'm told it's just a cakewalk"], "meaning": "Wordplay galore.\n\nYellow Brick Road is a reference to The Wizard Of Oz, where Dorothy and company just follow this road to meet The Wizard, so they can get what they desire.\n\n\n\nRoss talks extensively about cocaine & selling drugs. Hence the drug references with “brick” and “cake” in this sentence. He’s following the road of drug-dealing to reach his destiny of becoming richer and richer.", "annotation_id": "1697838", "url": "https://genius.com/1697838", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Triple Beam, hustling, that’s full of cheddar", "vault_lines": ["Triple Beam, hustling, that's full of cheddar"], "meaning": "“Triple beam” are the kind of scales usually used to weigh drugs:\n\nIf you cut it, call it Jam Master Jay\n\nHe’s selling drugs (“hustling”) to make lots of money (“cheddar”). Ro$$ often talks a lot about selling extensive amounts of cocaine in his rap songs.\n\nRoss pronounced “hustling” also like “hustle lean”, as if he’s also hustling “lean” (purple drank) to make some money, too.", "annotation_id": "1697816", "url": "https://genius.com/1697816", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Never made love, I had her coming from a distance", "vault_lines": ["Never made love, I had her coming from a distance"], "meaning": "Double-entendre:\n\n\nRick hasn’t made love to this girl, but he knows he has her in his sights and she is eyeing him from far away.\nEven though Rick never made love to this girl & hasn’t touched her sexually. It’s as if he did: she’s cumming from far away.", "annotation_id": "1697800", "url": "https://genius.com/1697800", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Yeah, bottle after bottle, I’m balling like Robert Griffin", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, bottle after bottle, I'm balling like Robert Griffin"], "meaning": "Ballin' is a slang term used in two ways by Rick her:\n\n\n\nSports-wise: Refers to any sport with a ball (used to be mainly basketball), in this case football. As he references RG3, the quarterback for the Washington Redskins.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMoney-wise: it means you spend a lot of dough on whatever you want to show out.", "annotation_id": "1691368", "url": "https://genius.com/1691368", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Un-cut, my love that’s all thug", "vault_lines": ["Un-cut, my love that's all thug"], "meaning": "Just like uncut cocaine, Ross comes is 100% pure with that thug love.", "annotation_id": "1677610", "url": "https://genius.com/1677610", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Said I was a mason, Martin Margiela", "vault_lines": ["Said I was a mason, Martin Margiela"], "meaning": "Possible reference to Jay-Z lines in Run This Town:\n\n\n\nI'm in MaisonAh, Martin Margiela― “Run This Town” by Jay Z\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMaison Martin Margiela is a high-end fashion brand. Rick is know to rock their footwear:\n\n\n\nHe’s playing on the homophone of Maison with mason – a skilled worker.", "annotation_id": "1676821", "url": "https://genius.com/1676821", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "If they think for a second that I do it for the fame, ’cause", "vault_lines": ["If they think for a second that I do it for the fame, 'cause"], "meaning": "Cassie makes music for people to vibe too. She wants everyone to listen to the pleasing ambiance that’ll put your mind in a trance.\n\n\n\nThey don’t know wassup\n\nBecause they think she does it only to be famous.", "annotation_id": "1656048", "url": "https://genius.com/1656048", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Numb", "line": "Fox hanging on my coat, rocks hanging on my chain", "vault_lines": ["Fox hanging on my coat, rocks hanging on my chain"], "meaning": "Cassie rocks fur coats and diamond chains.", "annotation_id": "1654859", "url": "https://genius.com/1654859", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
