{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "NumbNumb Juice Freestyle", "status": "done", "targets": 0, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Rick-ross-numbnumb-juice-freestyle-lyrics", "genius_title": "NumbNumb Juice Freestyle", "genius_id": 4667160, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "I send my female shooters {*mwah*}, that rock-a-bye baaay-baaay", "vault_lines": ["I send my female shooters {*mwah*}, that rock-a-bye baaay-baaay"], "meaning": "Much like Rick Ross earlier on the song, quoting\n\nI fucked my money up\n\nGucci interpolates Waka’s original lyrics and uses them as his own.\n\nThey gone lay yo ass out, rock you to sleep like a baby\n\nGucci is saying since he’s such a boss, he doesn’t have to get his hands dirty, and leaves it to the women instead.", "annotation_id": "33786979", "url": "https://genius.com/33786979", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "You heard Gucci was locked up, but that was just a rumor! (GUCCI!)", "vault_lines": ["You heard Gucci was locked up, but that was just a rumor! (GUCCI!)"], "meaning": "At the time of the music video release, Gucci Mane is not seen present in the video for whatever reason, but he is on the audio only remix.", "annotation_id": "33706164", "url": "https://genius.com/33706164", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "I’m countin cash in my office, sippin coffee with my feet up (Wooooow)", "vault_lines": ["I'm countin cash in my office, sippin coffee with my feet up (Wooooow)"], "meaning": "", "annotation_id": "33706145", "url": "https://genius.com/33706145", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": false, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "Bitch, I’m on my high horse, jewels I rock I die for Cause that shit that I bought,", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm on my high horse, jewels I rock I die for", "Cause that shit that I bought,"], "meaning": "Clearly, Rick Ross has money. He has enough money to go to Red Lobster on a date with his woman, afford lavish cars and expensive jewelry. He doesn’t have to pay for his girl’s friends if he doesn’t want to. There may be other items more worth it to him.", "annotation_id": "33706085", "url": "https://genius.com/33706085", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "Took my bitch to Red Lobster, I cain’t feed no friends, ho!", "vault_lines": ["Took my bitch to Red Lobster, I cain't feed no friends, ho!"], "meaning": "Red Lobster is a well respected chain restaurant that is seen as intermediary pricy for the average American. In the foodservice industry, lobster specifically is always expensive. Rick Ross has no problem driving his friends around or taking care of his girl, but not his girl and her friends.", "annotation_id": "33706048", "url": "https://genius.com/33706048", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "Flippin my lil’ C-notes, painted my new Benzo", "vault_lines": ["Flippin my lil' C-notes, painted my new Benzo"], "meaning": "This car cost a lot of money as well as the paint job. C-Notes is slang for 100 dollar bills, so it cost 100s of dollars (maybe 100s of 100s) to get the paint job done.", "annotation_id": "33706011", "url": "https://genius.com/33706011", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "BITCH, I think I’m Scarface, BITCH, I’m Al Pacino", "vault_lines": ["BITCH, I think I'm Scarface, BITCH, I'm Al Pacino"], "meaning": "Much like Diddy who compared himself to Paulie Castellano, Rick Ross compares himself to Scarface, played by Al Pacino.", "annotation_id": "33705990", "url": "https://genius.com/33705990", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "To pick my homies up... my top back like “Oh boy”", "vault_lines": ["To pick my homies up... my top back like \"Oh boy\""], "meaning": "This second Rolls Royce that Rick Ross bought was specifically to pick his homies up. When you buy new stuff and your friends see it, they may compliment you. He probably got compliments on the car being able to bring the top back.", "annotation_id": "33705935", "url": "https://genius.com/33705935", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "I fucked my money up... I bought another Rolls Royce", "vault_lines": ["I fucked my money up... I bought another Rolls Royce"], "meaning": "Often times in remixes of popular songs, guest artists restate the lyrics of the original song.\n\nI Fucked my money up\n\n-Waka Flocka Flame\n\nIt is not sure whether or not Rick Ross couldn’t recuperate afterwards, but we know he has more than one.\n\nhttps://www.bosshunting.com.au/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/izM8XxyLg9MD6py1ribxJw/www.bosshunting.com.au/2021/07/Rick-Ross-Car-Collection-No-Drivers-License.jpg/w=1200,h=675", "annotation_id": "33705876", "url": "https://genius.com/33705876", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "I’m-I’m hustlin out of Harlem, Paulie Castellano (Don’t stop)", "vault_lines": ["I'm-I'm hustlin out of Harlem, Paulie Castellano (Don't stop)"], "meaning": "Paulie Castellano is an American entrepreneur and alleged crime boss from NY, where Diddy is also from.", "annotation_id": "33705836", "url": "https://genius.com/33705836", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "Pictures of Christopher on my wall all in my condo", "vault_lines": ["Pictures of Christopher on my wall all in my condo"], "meaning": "This line may sound suspect at first, but all jokes aside, no diddy, no biggie. Diddy signed Biggie and knew him on a first name basis.", "annotation_id": "33534341", "url": "https://genius.com/33534341", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "Y’all must’ve forgot, I started this shit Yeah, check this out THIS -- IS -- THE REMIX", "vault_lines": ["Y'all must've forgot, I started this shit", "Yeah, check this out"], "meaning": "P. Diddy might be one of if not the first to sample songs that were already big and make them into hits once again. It could be fair to say he may of started a trend. For example, songs like “Missing You” which sample “Every Breath You Take”.", "annotation_id": "33531958", "url": "https://genius.com/33531958", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "Y’all ain’t expect me to fuck wit this one I see you, boy (Let’s turn the temperature up on these niggas again, nigga)", "vault_lines": ["I see you, boy (Let's turn the temperature up on these niggas again, nigga)"], "meaning": "P. Diddy being from NY might come as a surprise for a “real hip hop” aficionado to be embracing “southern style” rap. However, even though Waka Flocka Flame boldly reps Riverdale, GA, he was originally born in NY.\n\nI’m from Clayton County, Riverdale, but born in New York\nNorth side Queens, to be exact, Brick Squad, we a wolfpack", "annotation_id": "33531859", "url": "https://genius.com/33531859", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "I don’t fuck with fake hoes! All I touch is J-Lo’s", "vault_lines": ["I don't fuck with fake hoes! All I touch is J-Lo's"], "meaning": "Diddy and Jennifer Lopez (J.Lo) dated from 1999-2001 – a high-profile relationship. The line “I don’t fuck with fake hoes” references 2 J.Lo songs: I’m Real and I’m Real Remix, which is why he goes on to say he only touches J.Los – meaning real women. Also, referencing that he only messes with bad bitches like JLo.", "annotation_id": "11148582", "url": "https://genius.com/11148582", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "All I drink is my shit, Ciroc by the case load (Let’s go!)", "vault_lines": ["All I drink is my shit, Ciroc by the case load (Let's go!)"], "meaning": "Diddy Sean Combs owns 50% of Ciroc therefore it is reasonable that all he drinks is his own product. Which comes in “by the case load”", "annotation_id": "4069533", "url": "https://genius.com/4069533", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "{Ooh, L-Don}", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "L-Don is the producer who produced the original version of this song and the remix as well. Notice the play on words here, where Gucci Mane replaces the words “Let’s Do It” with “L-Don.” Also, note that ooh and o are both pronounced the same.", "annotation_id": "3258829", "url": "https://genius.com/3258829", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "80 million motherfuckin records!", "vault_lines": ["80 million motherfuckin records!"], "meaning": "Diddy’s label Bad Boy has sold around 80 million records worldwide, however the exact number is unknown.", "annotation_id": "3246041", "url": "https://genius.com/3246041", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "Bad Boy -", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Diddy’s record label, which he founded in 1993. Artists who are signed to it include Machine Gun Kelly, French Montana, Janelle Monae and more. The Notorious B.I.G. was signed to Bad Boy records from 1993-his death.", "annotation_id": "3245976", "url": "https://genius.com/3245976", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "{GUUCI!}", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "For those who can’t tell that it’s him on this track by his ab-lib or his flow, Gucci says his name to make sure that they know who they’re listening to.", "annotation_id": "3245422", "url": "https://genius.com/3245422", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "(Boss!)", "vault_lines": ["Ayo, ayo Waka (Boss!)"], "meaning": "Ross’s well known ab lib. He also has a song called “The Boss,” which features T-Pain and a song called “You The Boss,” which features Nicki Minaj", "annotation_id": "3245412", "url": "https://genius.com/3245412", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "That’s thirty-six a kilo, BITCH, I think I’m Nino", "vault_lines": ["That's thirty-six a kilo, BITCH, I think I'm Nino"], "meaning": "Rozay is referring to Nino Brown (played by Wesley Snipes), a drug dealer/crime lord in the movie “New Jack City”.", "annotation_id": "1889657", "url": "https://genius.com/1889657", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "Got lean", "vault_lines": ["Got purp, got pills, got lean"], "meaning": "Lean is a drink with Promethazine and Codeine syrup which is purple, it is usually mixed with sprite and jolly ranchers, but it can be mixed with other sodas or fruit punch.\n\nPromethazine w/Codeine is a purple prescription syrup and is the main ingredient in Lean. The codeine is mainly responsible for the euphoric feeling after drinking lean. Promethazine causes motor skill impairment, lethargy, extreme drowsiness, as well as a disassociative feeling from all other parts of the body, specifically the stomach and digestive system.", "annotation_id": "440069", "url": "https://genius.com/440069", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "O Let’s Do It (Remix)", "line": "Zone 6", "vault_lines": ["Now niggas claiming Zone 6"], "meaning": "Zone 6 is a zone that covers the Eastside of Atlanta.\n\nIts full name is Atlanta Patrol Zone 6.\n\nAreas, hoods and roads in Zone 6 include:\n\n\nBouldercrest\nCandler Park\nEast Atlanta\nEastland Heights\nEdgewood\nFlat Shoals Ave.\nGlenwood Dr.\nKirkwood\nMemorial Dr.\nMountain Park\nSun Valley\n… plus others.", "annotation_id": "323844", "url": "https://genius.com/323844", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
