{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Open Hand", "line": "I like ‘em Farrakhan (Farrakhan)", "vault_lines": ["Girl, you like a king, I like ‘em Farrakhan (Farrakhan)"], "meaning": "Rick Ross shouts out Louis Farrakhan who is the leader of the Hate Group The Nation Of Islam.\n\n The Southern Poverty Law Center describes Farrakhan as  “Louis Farrakhan heads the Nation of Islam, a group he has led since 1977 that is based on a somewhat bizarre and fundamentally anti-white theology. Farrakhan is an anti-Semite who routinely accuses Jews of manipulating the U.S. government and controlling the levers of world power.”", "annotation_id": "21205272", "url": "https://genius.com/21205272", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
