{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Options", "line": "And all I’m trying say is we got options Baby, all I’m saying is we got options", "vault_lines": ["And all I'm trying say is we got options", "Baby, all I'm saying is we got options"], "meaning": "Talking about abortion right here. He is telling the woman that they have the option of keeping or aborting their daughter, and they should weigh the options.", "annotation_id": "3442214", "url": "https://genius.com/3442214", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Options", "line": "Hanging from the shower rod, maybe we can skip that", "vault_lines": ["Hanging from the shower rod, maybe we can skip that"], "meaning": "Referring to Mimi and Nikko of Love & Hip Hop and their “leaked” sex tape.\n\nIt is also a play on the line above “life is shorter than a flick, maybe we should make a scene.”", "annotation_id": "3442085", "url": "https://genius.com/3442085", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Options", "line": "Cause I never been a fan of running Let’s fight the pain, and maybe we’ll see", "vault_lines": ["Cause I never been a fan of running", "Let's fight the pain, and maybe we'll see"], "meaning": "Luke doesn’t like running from problems he likes dealing with it even though its painful. Although it’s painful, the results are worth it.", "annotation_id": "3422664", "url": "https://genius.com/3422664", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
