{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Out Here Grindin’", "line": "I’m out here grindin’", "vault_lines": ["Homie, I gotta get me me (Cause I'm out here grindin)"], "meaning": "Alton Brown is the host of the recently ended Food Network show Good Eats. His reference to cake in the previous line is the fact that “cake” is street talk for money.\n\nAlso check out DJ Khaled’s remix of his song Welcome to My Hood (Remix) http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v5uunn_i6ds", "annotation_id": "1028577", "url": "https://genius.com/1028577", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Out Here Grindin’", "line": "You niggas flies—before, you was just maggots (Maggots)", "vault_lines": ["You niggas flies—before, you was just maggots (Maggots)"], "meaning": "These dudes around him are fly, kind of like the annoying house insect, but before these guys were just barely learning the ways and were “maggots” the infant form of flies", "annotation_id": "769649", "url": "https://genius.com/769649", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
