{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Outlawz", "line": "’Cause I’m stuck, stuck like glue ‘Cause I can’t, I can’t, I can’t stop lovin’ you", "vault_lines": ["'Cause I'm stuck, stuck like glue", "'Cause I can't, I can't, I can't stop lovin' you"], "meaning": "Sullivan uses the analogy of being stuck like glue (which is sticky) as they is deeply in love with their partner and cannot stop loving them.", "annotation_id": "30217362", "url": "https://genius.com/30217362", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
