{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Outlawz", "line": "Call my 9 Jada, she kissin’, nigga, D-block", "vault_lines": ["Call my 9 Jada, she kissin', nigga, D-block"], "meaning": "Here 21 claims his 9mm firearm lands shots on people, or ‘kisses’ them. Due to this, he calls his gun Jada, named after Jadakiss, a member of the rap trio The Lox, who launched ’D-Block Records' in 2002.", "annotation_id": "25834662", "url": "https://genius.com/25834662", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
