{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Hundred bottles, chicks stare, it’s Aristotle", "vault_lines": ["Hundred bottles, chicks stare, it's Aristotle"], "meaning": "If you’ve ever gotten bottle service to your section in the club, then you’ve experienced this feeling. When the girls bring the bottles to your section they’re surrounded with sparklers and are a sight to see. Sort of a celebration. Onlookers stare to try to figure out whose section the bottles are being delivered to and who the person is, to be admired. Like Aristotle.", "annotation_id": "4643288", "url": "https://genius.com/4643288", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
