{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "[Produced by Dav and Don]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "For this track, the production duo Dav Lawrence and Don Blaze delivered with a smooth, soulful sample that juxtaposed and complimented Rick Ross' rough, powerful voice. The sample comes from Cortex’s instrumental track, “Oh! Lord”\n\nhttp://youtu.be/WJFRFDmtheE?t=22s", "annotation_id": "2872770", "url": "https://genius.com/2872770", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Two women, Twin Towers, I’m hittin’ sour", "vault_lines": ["Two women, Twin Towers, I'm hittin' sour"], "meaning": "Ross is with two tall models. Because they’re so tall – Ross labels em as Twin Towers, a reference to the World Trade Center. He probably refers to the Twin Towers as they are going down on him, like the WTC went down on the infamous 9/11 terror attack.", "annotation_id": "2758483", "url": "https://genius.com/2758483", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
