{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Grape Swishers,", "vault_lines": ["Second innin', grape Swishers,"], "meaning": "A swisher sweet is a brand of cigarillo, however it’s better known for the use of the brown paper surrounding them for rolling blunts.\n\nThis entails the cigar being unsealed and the tobacco swapped out for weed. It’s used due to the variety of flavors the swishes come in – Rozay’s favorite being grape.", "annotation_id": "2756096", "url": "https://genius.com/2756096", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Err dollar, underneath my girl urr mattress", "vault_lines": ["Err dollar, underneath my girl urr mattress"], "meaning": "The word “every” is commonly pronounced as “err” in the Southern half of the USA.\n\nRozay is referencing his habit of keeping every dollar of his drug money underneath his girl’s inflatable air- pronounced here as urr- mattress.", "annotation_id": "2754614", "url": "https://genius.com/2754614", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
