{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "We big business Real niggas, gettin’ money, we splittin’ millions", "vault_lines": ["Real niggas, gettin' money, we splittin' millions"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is stressing that he goes large-scale or important on financial or commercial activities by getting large sums of money and to him that is the definition of a real nigga. He is loyal to his hustle and he spends those millions but money keeps on coming because he knows how to hustle and stay on his grind.", "annotation_id": "2753625", "url": "https://genius.com/2753625", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Presidential", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Continuing off the references to Rolex timepieces, this is also referring to the Rolex Presidential.\n\nRoss is a presidential figure in the rap game – he’s making his own decisions he has influence to push back or forward his decisions and plans, just like presidents.\n\nRoss is also living like a rich and powerful life, since he’s got an expensive yacht, helicopter and diamond chains just to mention part of his lavish lifestyle.", "annotation_id": "2753607", "url": "https://genius.com/2753607", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "In this game it’s all about timin’ It’s all about your movement Ours is oyster perpetual", "vault_lines": ["Ours is oyster perpetual"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is referring to his perfect timing, i.e. the release date of MasterMind and oyster perpetual is a reference to Rolex’s perpetual movements that can be seen on the dial of a Rolex.\n\nOnly Rolex-certified watchmakers are able to access it with their special tools. Yet, when it has the honor of being seen, this exquisite mechanism known the world over for its chronometric performance can truly be admired for what it is: a work of art. Ross thus predicts that Mastermind is going to be a masterpiece just like a Rolex.\n\nAnalogous to a Rolex’s perpetual movements that remains invisible to the wearer of the watch, the Boss is going to make invisible but great moves with the release of his forthcoming album.", "annotation_id": "2753596", "url": "https://genius.com/2753596", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "They Drake’s bitches But that’s my nigga, share bitches,", "vault_lines": ["But that's my nigga, share bitches,"], "meaning": "Ross is messing with Drake’s girls. Normally a problem would ensue, but since it’s his boy Drake, and they normally share their women with each other, there’s no hard feelings.\n\nRoss once noted that him and Meek shared bitches, too.", "annotation_id": "2753573", "url": "https://genius.com/2753573", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "As I money launder, laundromats on every corner Coin operated like them boys out in Vegas", "vault_lines": ["As I money launder, laundromats on every corner", "Coin operated like them boys out in Vegas"], "meaning": "Ross makes sure he covers his ass. He spends his illegally obtained money investing in Laundromats.\nMoney Laundering involves a process whereby large amounts of illegally obtained money (from drug trafficking, terrorist activity or other serious crimes) is given the appearance of having originated from a legitimate source by buying laundromats and puts them on every side to disguise his other ways of getting money.", "annotation_id": "2753569", "url": "https://genius.com/2753569", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Hermes house shoes,", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Ross is referring to shoes produced by the House of Hermes PARIS\n\n\n\nHermes produces classy shoes that are pretty expensive.", "annotation_id": "2753561", "url": "https://genius.com/2753561", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Streets are mine", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Rick Ross is claiming that he runs the streets and is the true image of a hustler from the streets. He still make moves that makes him keep his street cred and boss about being the street master through selling drugs and his rap. Its undeniable that he runs music too.\nAs he has stated in interviews, Ross wants to deliver an album for the streets with Mastermind:\n\nMaking sure the streets are overwhelmed with what I am doing is what is most important.", "annotation_id": "2753332", "url": "https://genius.com/2753332", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Double M See you real soon, niggas Hahaha", "vault_lines": ["See you real soon, niggas"], "meaning": "M-M-Maybach Music\n\nRoss is stressing that he is coming back with his new album soon and he is assuring all the listener its going to be a classic just by the way he sounds.\n\nWATCH OUT", "annotation_id": "2753316", "url": "https://genius.com/2753316", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
