{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Black bottle boys", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Black Bottle Boys is the name of the faction of the rappers, athletes, and DJs who endorse the Luc Belaire Rose champagne – which is Ross' favorite champagne.", "annotation_id": "2753280", "url": "https://genius.com/2753280", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "MasterMind, March 4th", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "After pushing back the release from its original drop date in December to March 4, 2014, Rick Ross allowed Revolt TV to make the formal release date announcement.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GKG9XBTdtzs", "annotation_id": "2753265", "url": "https://genius.com/2753265", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Pull the yachts out, Bel Air, Virginia Key", "vault_lines": ["Pull the yachts out, Bel Air, Virginia Key"], "meaning": "Ross takes his yatch to exotic destinations.\n\n\n\n Virginia Key was once accessible only by boat. It was established as the only public beach for the “exclusive use of Negroes” in Dade County.\n\n\n\nChâteau Villa Bel-Air is located in the Southern part of Graves, in the parish of Saint-Morillon, near La Brède. Villa Bel-Air’s buildings have been listed as part of France’s historical monuments and are a perfect illustration of the French Revolution period.", "annotation_id": "2753248", "url": "https://genius.com/2753248", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "I’m smokin’ to the face,", "vault_lines": ["I'm smokin' to the face,"], "meaning": "Instead of inhaling the smoke, Rick Ross puffs cigars and blows it to his face just to look like a bawse.Just blowing it around his face, no breathing or smelling it.", "annotation_id": "2753240", "url": "https://genius.com/2753240", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Swiss, so accurate", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Ross is talking about his time piece (Rolex) and he is trying to stress that time doesn’t lie and he keeps time for his plans to be successful.", "annotation_id": "2753230", "url": "https://genius.com/2753230", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "Get the big bread, so focused I’m bifocal", "vault_lines": ["Get the big bread, so focused I'm bifocal"], "meaning": "Ross loves the lavish lifestyle of driving fast cars, and wearing mink coats. He is always focused on getting that money.\n\nRoss compares his focus on the money, to how a pair of eye-glasses would help someone focus, and see something more clearly.", "annotation_id": "2753122", "url": "https://genius.com/2753122", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Oyster Perpetual Freestyle", "line": "I’m on err’ tackle, errwhere, Brian Urlacher", "vault_lines": ["I'm on err' tackle, errwhere, Brian Urlacher"], "meaning": "Brian Urlacher was a linebacker for the Chicago Bears and established himself as being one of the NFL’s most productive defensive players. He recently retired from the game in the 2012 season. He holds the Bears' franchise record for career tackles.\n\nHaving the franchise record, Urlacher recorded multiple tackles a game. Although playing a different game, Rozay also tackles (gets with) multiple females every night.", "annotation_id": "2753031", "url": "https://genius.com/2753031", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
