{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Panera Bread", "line": "Rockie keep tourin’,", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Rozay is probably referring to Rockie’s upcoming Electric Highway tour, starting this summer.", "annotation_id": "1683317", "url": "https://genius.com/1683317", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Panera Bread", "line": "See the young’n flexin’, I ain’t have to pull a muscle out", "vault_lines": ["See the young'n flexin', I ain't have to pull a muscle out"], "meaning": "Rockie doesn’t even have to strain the slightest muscle in order to display his superiority.  He’s an obvious boss from the jump:\n\n\n\nIn other words, he doesn’t have to win approval the Trinidad James way:", "annotation_id": "1683237", "url": "https://genius.com/1683237", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Panera Bread", "line": "She love to hit the beach and she love to watch Scandal", "vault_lines": ["She love to hit the beach and she love to watch Scandal"], "meaning": "Going to the beach you can make sand castles, sun bathe, swim, chill, bbq (within reason), do bonfires, workout and relax within the contours of your own skin.\n\nScandal is a American political thriller show that stars Kerry Washington and is created by Shonda Rhimes (creator of ABC network drama’s Private Practice and Grey’s Anatomy)", "annotation_id": "1683042", "url": "https://genius.com/1683042", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Panera Bread", "line": "Force shit, since a young’n, I would always be good", "vault_lines": ["Force shit, since a young'n, I would always be good"], "meaning": "Much like Anakin Skywalker on his Force grind, there was something special about Fresh from the very beginning. As far as rappers go, his midi-chlorian count is off the charts.", "annotation_id": "1683028", "url": "https://genius.com/1683028", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Panera Bread", "line": "The least that they can do is wash the dishes, take the garbage out", "vault_lines": ["The least that they can do is wash the dishes, take the garbage out"], "meaning": "These haters are often the type to just lounge about the house and criticise these successful people. They could at least do something productive with their lives and be useful.\n\nHelp your mother out!", "annotation_id": "1682995", "url": "https://genius.com/1682995", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
