{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Party Heart", "line": "Down South boy,", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "This lyric may have three meanings\n\n\nIn the previous line he was talking about being intimate with a woman. “Down south” could be a reference to giving oral sex to a woman.\nRick Ross is from Florida with is in Southern Florida. He sometimes calls himself a southern rapper.\nIn the following line he references the Devil, so calling himself a “Down south boy” means he is the Devil or in Hell.", "annotation_id": "657034", "url": "https://genius.com/657034", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Party Heart", "line": "Red carpet life", "vault_lines": ["Stars out tonight, red carpet life"], "meaning": "The Red Carpet is used at events with popular stars such as the Oscars and is associated with fame, success, and being VIP. .", "annotation_id": "657000", "url": "https://genius.com/657000", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Party Heart", "line": "Damn near got carpel tunnel trying to count this paper", "vault_lines": ["Damn near got carpel tunnel trying to count this paper"], "meaning": "2 Chainz counts so much money, he nearly has carpel tunnel syndrome. He might consider hiring an accountant! When you recieve payment from business dealings you count the money to make sure the amount is correct. Carpel tunnel develops over time due to the repeated acting bending the wrist. 2Chainz damn near got it,so his action stopped, unlike E-40 who was getting carpel tunnel in 06 per the track “Oh Yeah (Work)”:\n\nI’m gettin' carpel tunnel while I’m countin' all this bread", "annotation_id": "532953", "url": "https://genius.com/532953", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
