{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "Nigga, you could have died in the hand of another man, you know what I’m saying? Nigga, I’m the best thing that ever happen to you, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, you could have died in the hand of another man, you know what I’m saying?", "Nigga, I’m the best thing that ever happen to you, nigga"], "meaning": "PROPOSED SUGGESTION:\n\nT.I. Is referring to his former protege and bodyguard Alfamega, who was accused of snitching and T.I. subsequently kicked him out of Grand Hustle.", "annotation_id": "412680", "url": "https://genius.com/412680", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "Them lames out, G’s in squares out of season", "vault_lines": ["Them lames out, G's in squares out of season"], "meaning": "Correction: “Them lames out G’s in squares out of season.”\n\nAs in lames are out of fashion, gangsters are in fashion, and squares are yesterdays fashion.", "annotation_id": "14101656", "url": "https://genius.com/14101656", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "I ain’t in the game still, I’m a problem on the low Whip them thangs well, just know I know who got it for the low", "vault_lines": ["Whip them thangs well, just know I know who got it for the low"], "meaning": "He’s not in the dope-dealing game anymore, but he’s still an O.G. and you don’t fuck with him, period.  And he still knows who’s sellin dope for the best price.", "annotation_id": "14101650", "url": "https://genius.com/14101650", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "Hear that click clack roll, better get back fast", "vault_lines": ["Hear that click clack roll, better get back fast"], "meaning": "Correction:  “Hear that click-clack move better get back fast”\n\nT.I. is referring to the sound of a round being chambered, or a gun being cocked, or a safety being switched off, such as on a 9mm.", "annotation_id": "14101616", "url": "https://genius.com/14101616", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "Only time you make it rain – throwin’ change in a fountain", "vault_lines": ["Only time you make it rain – throwin' change in a fountain"], "meaning": "While T.I. can make it rain with his stacks of bills, only way you can make it rain is throwing pennies in a fountain… You don’t have the money to do it like he does.\n\nWell, while you are there throwing change in the foutain, why don’t you wish for his kind of cash?", "annotation_id": "1349049", "url": "https://genius.com/1349049", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "Nigga, you understand that, nigga? Say I’m lying, think it’s a game if you want to, partner", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, you understand that, nigga? Say I'm lying, think it's a game if you want to, partner"], "meaning": "T.I is a southern OG. T.I is more of a teacher than a rapper, while have gone through many experiences within his life and career. Make sure you listen to him as he will guide you and don’t take him for a fool", "annotation_id": "1259621", "url": "https://genius.com/1259621", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "While you lame trippin’ on that goofy stupid silly shit", "vault_lines": ["While you lame trippin' on that goofy stupid silly shit"], "meaning": "You’re out paying attention to dumbass wack rappers while T.I. is running shit!\n\nAlso, in the context of fashion, a lot of people now days are rocking some pretty silly outfits.", "annotation_id": "1259564", "url": "https://genius.com/1259564", "state": "accepted", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "On some Penthouse shit, rentin’ out chicks", "vault_lines": ["On some Penthouse shit, rentin' out chicks"], "meaning": "In addition to amassing money and dealing dope, Tip is moving women as well. And they’re all good enough to be in Penthouse Magazine. Need a girl? Tip deals ‘em out.", "annotation_id": "596106", "url": "https://genius.com/596106", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "End zone, off set, neck, wrist frostbit", "vault_lines": ["End zone, off set, neck, wrist frostbit"], "meaning": "The “Offset-I” is a football formation and T.I. is using it at the end zone. Meanwhile his neck and wrist are “frostbit”, aka icy, aka frozen, aka chilly, aka cold, aka snowy.", "annotation_id": "596098", "url": "https://genius.com/596098", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "And I love that new Bugatti, how that bitch be shifting gears", "vault_lines": ["And I love that new Bugatti, how that bitch be shifting gears"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is now a member of the “Bugatti Boyz,” a semi-official club in the rap world whose price of admission is $1.8 million, or the price of a brand-new Bugatti Veyron automobile.\n\n\n\nWhile Ross and Diddy have capitalized on the trend and released several singles under the Bugatti Boyz moniker, other unofficial members of the club include T-Pain, Lil Wayne, and Birdman.\n\nThe Bugatti has a 7 speed DSG transmission (Direct Shift Gearbox) consisting of a duel clutch system, shifting faster then any transmission in the world; it can switch gears in around 8 milliseconds.", "annotation_id": "229636", "url": "https://genius.com/229636", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "Brown bag of money, call me David Copperfield A bitch’ll disappear, Lord, the bitch will disappear", "vault_lines": ["Brown bag of money, call me David Copperfield", "A bitch'll disappear, Lord, the bitch will disappear"], "meaning": "Ross is comparing himself to David Copperfield in these lines in that he considers himself capable of making someone “disappear” efficiently enough that they would seem to have magically vanished. Also alluded to in this couplet are Copperfield’s financial success, as previously noted, and possibly the colors represented by the brown hue of the bag (copper) and the green money (a field).", "annotation_id": "215896", "url": "https://genius.com/215896", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pledge Allegiance", "line": "I’m the coolest in the city, bitch", "vault_lines": ["I'm the coolest in the city, bitch"], "meaning": "He says he’s the coolest in Atlanta, very subliminal diss to Shawty Lo (and maybe Ludacris)", "annotation_id": "130690", "url": "https://genius.com/130690", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
