{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pop That", "line": "I’m the life of the party, let’s get these hoes on the Molly", "vault_lines": ["I'm the life of the party, let's get these hoes on the Molly"], "meaning": "Molly is a Pure form of MDMA (ecstasy), usually a free powder or in capsules. Oftentimes MDMA is sold as molly. Should be white in color (when it’s pure) but is more often beige or yellow-brown, and sometimes brown or rarely gray.\n\nIronically, Ross would later get in serious trouble for rapping about giving a girl molly.", "annotation_id": "842998", "url": "https://genius.com/842998", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pop That", "line": "Don’t stop, pop that, don’t stop Pop that, pop that, pop that", "vault_lines": ["Pop that, pop that"], "meaning": "Here is where the sample came from: Uncle Luke – “I Wanna Rock (Doo Doo Brown).” Classic.\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jzHeR-PTVtY&feature=results_video&playnext=1&list=PL21B2E18688750B93", "annotation_id": "842483", "url": "https://genius.com/842483", "state": "accepted", "votes": 32, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
