{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Porsche GT3 - RS", "line": "KaySo daddy took the stand and told on his boy Nigga been a rat, another police on the force", "vault_lines": ["KaySo daddy took the stand and told on his boy", "Nigga been a rat, another police on the force"], "meaning": "2025, Jacksonville, FL, Ksoo’s dad, Abdul Robinson Sr. , pleaded guilty to accessory after the fact for helping suspects escape the murder of Charles “Lil Buck” McCormick Jr in 2020. He took the stand and identified his son as the shooter as part of a plea deal.", "annotation_id": "40685549", "url": "https://genius.com/40685549", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Porsche GT3 - RS", "status": "done", "targets": 2, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Rick-ross-porsche-gt3-rs-lyrics", "genius_title": "Porsche GT3 - RS", "genius_id": 13822326, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Port of Miami 2 Freestyle", "line": "Type of money bring Bill Cosby back A different world, nothin’ for my college cats", "vault_lines": ["Type of money bring Bill Cosby back", "A different world, nothin' for my college cats"], "meaning": "A Different World was an American sitcom that ran for six seasons from 1987 to 1993. The show was a spin-off of The Cosby Show.\n\nA Different World was inspired by student life at historically black colleges/universities and the show was set at Hillman College, a fictional historical black college in Virginia.\n\nBill Cosby was found guilty on April 26, 2018, of three counts of aggravated indecent assault against a Toronto woman, after a jury trial. On September 25, 2018, he was sentenced to three to ten years in state prison and a $25,000 fine plus court costs of both trials.", "annotation_id": "17254121", "url": "https://genius.com/17254121", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Port of Miami 2 Freestyle", "line": "Look at how I live, I barely sold records Look at what I build, I own the most Checkers", "vault_lines": ["Look at how I live, I barely sold records", "Look at what I build, I own the most Checkers"], "meaning": "Although he numbers amongst hip-hop’s most well-known entities, Rick Ross has never posted massive record sales. He has only one Platinum album to his name: 2006’s Port of Miami.\n\nDespite this fact, he has built a business empire that includes multiple franchise locations of the fast food chain Checkers/Rally’s.", "annotation_id": "17221345", "url": "https://genius.com/17221345", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
