{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pray For Me", "line": "Fab said you need a Kim if you gon’ do it big", "vault_lines": ["Fab said you need a Kim if you gon' do it big"], "meaning": "Lil' Kim is an untouchable icon and a huge force in Hip-Hop in general, and she was mentored by Notorious B.I.G.!\nIf you want greatness and if you want someone who can body a track like Biggie would do, you should call Lil' Kim.\n\nFabolous (Fab) said “You wanna do it big? You need a Lil' Kim” in his song Money Goes, Honey Stay (When the Money Goes Remix) [2009]\nhttps://genius.com/Fabolous-money-goes-honey-stay-when-the-money-goes-remix-lyrics", "annotation_id": "20878909", "url": "https://genius.com/20878909", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pray For Me", "line": "Coogi sweaters, Jesus pieces, gotta do it big", "vault_lines": ["Coogi sweaters, Jesus pieces, gotta do it big (Uh)"], "meaning": "Notorious B.I.G. was known for wearing coogi sweaters and using Jesus pieces.", "annotation_id": "20878892", "url": "https://genius.com/20878892", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pray For Me", "line": "Ride the beat like a Wraith But this is May-May-May-May-Maybach Music", "vault_lines": ["Ride the beat like a Wraith", "But this is May-May-May-May-Maybach Music"], "meaning": "Wraith is a model of Rolls Royce.\n\n\n\nKim uses this to play off the fact that Rick Ross' label is Maybach Music which is named after the luxury car manufacturer, Maybach.", "annotation_id": "18262010", "url": "https://genius.com/18262010", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
