{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pray For Me", "line": "Jesús hang around your neck like the noose May the Bishop pray for you ’cause you know I got the juice", "vault_lines": ["Jesús hang around your neck like the noose", "May the Bishop pray for you 'cause you know I got the juice"], "meaning": "Kim using the religious theme with “Jesús hang/Bishop/pray” as wordplay to reference the 1992 crime drama Juice which starred 2Pac playing the character, “Bishop”.", "annotation_id": "18224847", "url": "https://genius.com/18224847", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
