{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Presidential", "line": "Fishscale made me major profit margins I’m a prophet stuffin’ my pockets, you niggas starvin’", "vault_lines": ["Fishscale made me major profit margins", "I'm a prophet stuffin' my pockets, you niggas starvin'"], "meaning": "He made money off selling cocaine. “Fishscale” is a very pure form of cocaine. His net worth continues to grow while envious individuals barely have enough money to eat.", "annotation_id": "934368", "url": "https://genius.com/934368", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
