{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Proud of That", "line": "Six hundred Benz with them 4s on", "vault_lines": ["Six hundred Benz with them 4s on"], "meaning": "The 600 model is usually the top of the line of the Mercedes Models V12 outside the AMG models. Starting from the 600SEL the 600 Benz has come in S-Class – S600, SL-Class – SL600 and CL-Class – CL600.\n\nWale had a song inspired by the car – 600 Benz\n\nThe car has Vogue rims on it.", "annotation_id": "759687", "url": "https://genius.com/759687", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
