{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Prove Me Wrong", "line": "I got love for my bitches who be workin’ the pole", "vault_lines": ["I got love for my bitches who be workin' the pole"], "meaning": "Pole dancers need some love too right???\n\nRicky has cash to blow on these beautiful girls that are just trying to make a buck for their beauty. Can you blame him for wanting to tip girls with talents like this…", "annotation_id": "4178584", "url": "https://genius.com/4178584", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
