{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pull Up", "line": "Took the risk Rose-gold Patek on my wrist", "vault_lines": ["Rose-gold Patek on my wrist"], "meaning": "Patek Phillipe is a luxury watch brand, with many styles costing upwards of $100,000. Dropping out of college and venturing into the world of music turned out beneficial for Travis.", "annotation_id": "34603579", "url": "https://genius.com/34603579", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pull Up", "line": "You know I’m James in The Garden, I can’t miss", "vault_lines": ["You know I'm James in The Garden, I can't miss"], "meaning": "James Harden is a professional basketball player for the Houston Rockets, Travis' hometown team. The two are close friends and Harden received a shoutout in Travis' September 2016 track, “way back.”\n\nI need fake niggas to get way back\nJames Harden with the range on me nigga way back\n\nOn January 24, 2019, Harden scored a career high 61 points in his sole appearance at Madison Square Garden, the home of the New York Knicks. Harden ironically only shot forty-four percent from the field in that game, but tied a personal record with twenty-two made free throws, further highlighting his dominance.", "annotation_id": "18282674", "url": "https://genius.com/18282674", "state": "accepted", "votes": 26, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pull Up", "line": "Checks in my pocket and my kicks, kicks", "vault_lines": ["Checks in my pocket and my kicks, kicks"], "meaning": "Travis Scott talks about his collaboration with the well-known fashion brand Nike. In 2019, he released a pair of Air Jordan 1s with an original detail; the shoes have pockets in their inner liners. Here, Travis plays on having money in his pockets as well as a Nike tick on his shoes, and having the ability to hide his money within the shoes.", "annotation_id": "18185281", "url": "https://genius.com/18185281", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
