{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Push Em Over (50 Cent & Lloyd Banks Diss)", "line": "Damn you ratted Preme Damn near ratted on queens", "vault_lines": ["Damn you ratted Preme", "Damn near ratted on queens"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is accusing 50 Cent of ratting on Kenneth “Supreme” Mcgriff who was a kingpin in Queens in the 80s, who was also many feel responsible for having 50 Cent shot 9 times and his mother killed.", "annotation_id": "3252442", "url": "https://genius.com/3252442", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Push Em Over (50 Cent & Lloyd Banks Diss)", "line": "Not even respected as a Red Cafe You’re not half of Jay Z Not Nas fake Saigon maybe", "vault_lines": ["Not even respected as a Red Cafe", "You're not half of Jay Z", "Not Nas fake Saigon maybe"], "meaning": "Ross is saying 50 isn’t even Red Cafe, let alone the caliber of Jay and Nas, but maybe a wannabe Saigon", "annotation_id": "3252437", "url": "https://genius.com/3252437", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Push Em Over (50 Cent & Lloyd Banks Diss)", "line": "We da killas mufucka who you go get", "vault_lines": ["We da killas mufucka who you go get"], "meaning": "Ross and his Maybach crew are the people you would hire to kill people, so when they come for you, who are you going to hire?\n\nAlthough this is hard to believe given…", "annotation_id": "1602991", "url": "https://genius.com/1602991", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Push Em Over (50 Cent & Lloyd Banks Diss)", "line": "Sold ten mill still not in the 10 best", "vault_lines": ["Sold ten mill still not in the 10 best"], "meaning": "Despite the fact that Fif has sold 10,000,000 records, Ross still doesn’t consider him a great rapper.\n\nAlthough interesting fact: The sales of all five of Ross' albums aren’t even half of that.\nPort of Miami: 500,000\nTrilla: 700,000\nDeeper Than Rap: 438,000\nTeflon Don: 724,000\nGod Forgives, I Don’t: 438,000\n\nTotal? 2.8 million records.", "annotation_id": "1596593", "url": "https://genius.com/1596593", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Push Em Over (50 Cent & Lloyd Banks Diss)", "line": "And all you niggas look gay", "vault_lines": ["And all you niggas look gay"], "meaning": "A shot at G-Unit as a whole.\nOr less likely, taking a page from GZA’s book, a stab at 50’s cover on GQ.", "annotation_id": "1596586", "url": "https://genius.com/1596586", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Push Em Over (50 Cent & Lloyd Banks Diss)", "line": "We watching your empire crumble before your face", "vault_lines": ["We watching your empire crumble before your face"], "meaning": "On the contrary, 50 Cent has launched a film production company,a line of headphones, and lent his name to a line of Vitamin Water and a brand of energy shots. If anything, his empire has gotten bigger.", "annotation_id": "1595904", "url": "https://genius.com/1595904", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
