{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Pyrex Poppin", "line": "I keep the Pyrex poppin’ (Whip it), coffee pot droppin’ Trap line on fire and they won’t stop knockin’ (Who that?) No safety on the 40 ’cause that shit, that ain’t important (Nah) Got the J’s jumpin’ out the gym and I ain’t talkin’ Jordans", "vault_lines": ["Got the J's jumpin' out the gym and I ain't talkin' Jordans"], "meaning": "He’s using a Pyrex instrument and a coffee pot to cook crack cocaine. The junkies (J’s) keep coming in and out of the trap, and it gets dangerous, so he keeps his 40 caliber gun ready to go.", "annotation_id": "20180389", "url": "https://genius.com/20180389", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
