{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Quintessential", "line": "Caught a few cases in Texas nigga", "vault_lines": ["Caught a few cases in Texas nigga"], "meaning": "Snoop is referencing his January 7, 2012 arrest for possession of marijuana at the Sierra Blanca border patrol checkpoint in Texas.\n\nLuckily for Snoop and collaborator Willie Nelson, the patrol checkpoint’s sheriff has stated that they can no longer afford to pursue misdemeanor drug offenders.", "annotation_id": "13807701", "url": "https://genius.com/13807701", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Quintessential", "line": "Just got that G-Wagon, I’m just so innovative We came for the money bags, so fuck your invitations This calls for a celebration", "vault_lines": ["We came for the money bags, so fuck your invitations", "This calls for a celebration"], "meaning": "For the people who can afford\n\nG-Wagon is a SUV made by Mercedes-Benz\n\n\n\nRozay spends time making money and hanging out with rich people (you’re not invited).", "annotation_id": "4471767", "url": "https://genius.com/4471767", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Quintessential", "line": "(Haan) My whole life been based on that pimp shit (Haan) No movie, just money, real pimp shit (Haan) More cities, more bitches, real slick shit (Haan) My Maybach, it matches my outfit, that pimp shit", "vault_lines": ["(Haan) My whole life been based on that pimp shit", "(Haan) No movie, just money, real pimp shit", "(Haan) More cities, more bitches, real slick shit", "(Haan) My Maybach, it matches my outfit, that pimp shit"], "meaning": "Both Snoop & Rick partake on the hook and rap about their living a lifestyle similar to a pimp’s even though they’re far from it. Snoop Dogg claims that he used to operate as a pimp in 2003. He stated in an interview that he literally took the role of a pimp while on a tour and also claimed that he sold girls to athletes. Snoop said the reason for it was because the “fascination” of the lifestyle led him to take the role.", "annotation_id": "4407280", "url": "https://genius.com/4407280", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Quintessential", "line": "My paint wet, my bitch bad Straight mastermind, yo’ rich ass", "vault_lines": ["Straight mastermind, yo' rich ass"], "meaning": "Mastermind is the name of Rick Ross’s 6th studio album which was released on March 3, 2014.\n\n\n\nRoss sees himself to be a mastermind, a person with outstanding intellect and won’t hesitate to use that mental prowess to take your money.", "annotation_id": "4407245", "url": "https://genius.com/4407245", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Quintessential", "line": "My cup full, full of that pink shit", "vault_lines": ["My cup full, full of that pink shit"], "meaning": "Rozay indulges in lean with a bit more Sprite so that he has a fun time and doesn’t pass out.\n\nRicky was seen waving around his MMG style styrofoam cup in his “Bound 2 Freestyle” video.", "annotation_id": "4398217", "url": "https://genius.com/4398217", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
