{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rapper Estates", "line": "I’m really in the field, you just Skip Bayless", "vault_lines": ["I'm really in the field, you just Skip Bayless"], "meaning": "Skip Bayless is an American sports commentator and tv personality known for his appearance on sports talk show programs like “First Take” and “Skip and Shannon: undisputed”.\n\nUnlike many of his contemporaries like Shannon Sharpe, Bayless has no past as a professional athlete i.e hasn’t been in the field.\n\nBenny the Butcher really lives the things he raps about while the person he is addressing only talks about the gangster lifestyle without having actually experienced it similar to skip Bayless commenting on Basketball and Football despite never having played professionally.", "annotation_id": "31669848", "url": "https://genius.com/31669848", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rapper Estates", "line": "Just remember we the mob and regarded as a god", "vault_lines": ["Just remember we the mob and regarded as a god"], "meaning": "Ross is stating that although he makes music and may not be taken as seriously as those in the Mob, his whole team are affiliated with it and their Mob is known as a “God” (All Powerful).", "annotation_id": "26844521", "url": "https://genius.com/26844521", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
