{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rapper Estates", "line": "Dumb rappers never ownin’ the tapes Just tools and afterparties to make More beefs and dirty bitches to chase New shoes, expensive cars to race Big homes, just pay ’em off at a pace", "vault_lines": ["Dumb rappers never ownin' the tapes", "Just tools and afterparties to make", "More beefs and dirty bitches to chase", "New shoes, expensive cars to race"], "meaning": "Many rappers who get fame and fortune will quickly splash out, party, have beef with rappers for more clout, get girls, buy expensive cars and buy a mansion. Ross' advice is to pay them off slowly to make sure you don’t go broke.", "annotation_id": "26844494", "url": "https://genius.com/26844494", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
