{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Real Niggas", "line": "I know fuck niggas that told I know real niggas that didn’t I’m a real nigga that won’t", "vault_lines": ["I know fuck niggas that told", "I know real niggas that didn't", "I’m a real nigga that won’t"], "meaning": "Real niggas don’t snitch. Gunplay is a real nigga. Gunplay doesn’t snitch.\n\nIf A=B and B=C, A=C.", "annotation_id": "1066411", "url": "https://genius.com/1066411", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
