{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Realest Livin", "line": "Smoking like Harry Potter", "vault_lines": ["Smoking like Harry Potter"], "meaning": "In the movie Harry Potter, people teleport from place to place with a big cloud of smoke around them when they show up in the new place. Rick is saying he smokes so much that he is covered in smoke in the same way that Harry Potter and other wizards are when they teleport in the movie.", "annotation_id": "503362", "url": "https://genius.com/503362", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
