{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "RetroSuperFuture", "line": "Waiting for the day Bob rose from the dead In HD as I take an ounce to the head", "vault_lines": ["Waiting for the day Bob rose from the dead", "In HD as I take an ounce to the head"], "meaning": "Bob = Bob Marley\n\n\n\nSince this is a weed song, Ross is waiting on the resurrection of music’s/the world’s most famous pot connoisseur.\n\nAnd since he’s been smokin an entire ounce to his head (by himself), when Bob Marley comes back to life, it’ll be so vivid and realistic that it’ll appear to be in high defenition.\n(pun intended)", "annotation_id": "151222", "url": "https://genius.com/151222", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
