{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "RetroSuperFuture II", "line": "Fuck “Grey’s Anatomy” I’m getting Sasha Grey throat", "vault_lines": ["Fuck \"Grey's Anatomy\" I'm getting Sasha Grey throat"], "meaning": "Wale would rather get head from the crossover porn star than watch the popular ABC medical drama.  Who can blame him, especially after that terrible musical episode?\n\nAnatomy : parts of the body\n\n“Fuck Grey’s (as in Sasha Grey’s) Anatomy, I’m getting Sasha Grey’s throat (part of her body)”\n\nIn simpler terms, he said he’s fucking Sasha Grey’s throat.", "annotation_id": "162980", "url": "https://genius.com/162980", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
