{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rich Nigga Walk Thru’", "line": "His bezel frozen, Eric Boseman", "vault_lines": ["His bezel frozen, Eric Boseman"], "meaning": "Eric Boseman, an african american drummer watch him hit an awesome Drum Solo, After he hit that solo he must had to put some ice on his wrist to stop the swelling.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hhEWqZMORMA\n\nMeanwhile:\nSomeone Bezel is frozen with ice", "annotation_id": "4865617", "url": "https://genius.com/4865617", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rich Nigga Walk Thru’", "line": "Snatching snitches off the corner like I’m Wayne Williams Real Niggas feel pain of those slain children", "vault_lines": ["Snatching snitches off the corner like I'm Wayne Williams"], "meaning": "Rick will snatch/kidnap snitches like Wayne Williams. Before the line can become misconcieved or taken the wrong way he save’s himself by saying:\n\n“Real Niggas feel pain of those slain children”\n\nWhich means he doesn’t salute that Wayne Williams murderd children and everybody should feel for those children that are slain/dead\n\nRIP\n\nRead more at\n\nhttp://murderpedia.org/male.W/w/williams-wayne.htm", "annotation_id": "4865579", "url": "https://genius.com/4865579", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
