{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Richer Than I Ever Been", "line": "The richest than I ever been (Bitch)", "vault_lines": ["Richer than I ever been, the richest than I ever been (Bitch)"], "meaning": "The richest than I ever been ( Bitch )", "annotation_id": "37809206", "url": "https://genius.com/37809206", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Richer Than I Ever Been", "line": "I’ma build a mansion, sit it on Virginia Keys (You see it)", "vault_lines": ["I'ma build a mansion, sit it on Virginia Keys (You see it)"], "meaning": "Virginia Key is an 863-acre barrier island in Miami, FL in Biscayne Bay.\n\n\n\nVirginia Key Beach", "annotation_id": "24810562", "url": "https://genius.com/24810562", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Richer Than I Ever Been", "line": "Flooded all the Pateks and it came with all the features (Lil’ boy)", "vault_lines": ["Flooded all the Pateks and it came with all the features (Lil' boy)"], "meaning": "Ross, who is known to be a connoisseur on ultra-luxurious watches, is referencing Swiss brand Patek Philippe & Co. Watches range from $20,000 to $200,000 but can go even higher when “flooded” with “all the features” such as diamonds.\n\nRoss friend, producer, and fellow Miamian DJ Khaled is known to have a Patek estimated at over $300,000.", "annotation_id": "24810519", "url": "https://genius.com/24810519", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Richer Than I Ever Been", "line": "Then we got G-Wagons, just to sit ‘em on Adidas (Lil’ boy)", "vault_lines": ["Then we got G-Wagons, just to sit 'em on Adidas (Lil' boy)"], "meaning": "Ross upgraded from the two-seater coups (mentioned in the prior line) to the high-end Mercedes Benz G-Glass SUV popularly known as the G-Wagon.", "annotation_id": "24810440", "url": "https://genius.com/24810440", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Richer Than I Ever Been", "line": "Runnin’ through the city, I perform like Jackie Gleason (Lord)", "vault_lines": ["Runnin' through the city, I perform like Jackie Gleason (Lord)"], "meaning": "John Herbert “Jackie” Gleason was an American actor, comedian, writer, composer, and conductor known affectionately as “The Great One.”\n\n\n\nHe was host of The Jackie Gleason Show in Miami Beach for years and his name is instantly recognized in South Florida as the namesake of the eponymous Jackie Gleason Theatre – home of The Fillmore Miami Beach.\n\n\n\nRick Ross' South Florida’s Biggest Boss is comparing himself to “The Great One.”", "annotation_id": "24612392", "url": "https://genius.com/24612392", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
