{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Ride (Remix)", "line": "You my official lady, number one like McGrady Don’t do nobody favours", "vault_lines": ["You my official lady, number one like McGrady", "Don't do nobody favours"], "meaning": "McGrady was dealt to the Orlando Magic in a sign-and-trade deal for a first round pick. In Orlando, he played alongside Grant Hill, who8 had been acquired that summer in hope of bringing *Orlando back among the Eastern Conference’s elite teams. Number 1 on the shirt", "annotation_id": "1949236", "url": "https://genius.com/1949236", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
