{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Ring Around The Rolls", "line": "Look, flow so immaculate, you should see what I battle with I was in the back of a paddy wagon, shackled and shit", "vault_lines": ["Look, flow so immaculate, you should see what I battle with", "I was in the back of a paddy wagon, shackled and shit"], "meaning": "YFN Lucci highlights his personal obstacles, as he faced charges of felony murder, aggravated assault, gang activity, and possession of a firearm. He was indicted and was sentenced to 10 years in prison and 10 years of probation. He was released in January 2025.", "annotation_id": "41844207", "url": "https://genius.com/41844207", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Ring Around The Rolls", "line": "All these fuck niggas on the Epstein list When I just wanna get my whole team rich The bust down Cuban with the clean chips Gunplay actin’ like I ain’t mean shit", "vault_lines": ["All these fuck niggas on the Epstein list", "When I just wanna get my whole team rich", "The bust down Cuban with the clean chips", "Gunplay actin' like I ain't mean shit"], "meaning": "Ross is stating that he has done his all to help and support his team get rich (with as much morality and solidarity according to their code), including his artist Gunplay who claimed Ross abandoned him and his career. Ross is saying Gunplay was ungrateful despite his efforts.", "annotation_id": "40685259", "url": "https://genius.com/40685259", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
