{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rose Red (Remix)", "line": "On Suzukis, poppin’ wheelies with my nigga, Meek Milly", "vault_lines": ["On Suzukis, poppin' wheelies with my nigga, Meek Milly"], "meaning": "Meek Mill is also quite famous because he can do wheelies for a long amount of time on quads and motor bikes.\nHe posts him videos of him doing wheelies\n\nT.I. and Meek are good friends. At the time of this song he was signed to Grand Hustle which is T.I. label then he got arrested and did some jail time then signed to MMG", "annotation_id": "3154196", "url": "https://genius.com/3154196", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rose Red (Remix)", "line": "T.I.P., OG, I do it big, you do it lowercase", "vault_lines": ["T.I.P., OG, I do it big, you do it lowercase"], "meaning": "OG is a slang term used to reference an original gangster. T.I. still sees himself through the fame as a big gangster and wants people to know so.\n\n\n\nHe also uses word play in the sense that he is a BIG gangster and,because OG is spelled in all uppercase letters, knows that everyone is lowercase or not a threat to him.", "annotation_id": "2692381", "url": "https://genius.com/2692381", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
