{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rubber Bands", "line": "I got a P. Diddy swag and a Hugh Heffner life, bitch!", "vault_lines": ["I got a P. Diddy swag and a Hugh Heffner life, bitch!"], "meaning": "Juicy has the  money and fashion sense of Diddy, and the amount of women Hugh Hefner, the founder of men’s magazine Playboy, has.\n\nLike A$AP Rocky declared:\n\nPussy, money, weed\nThat’s all a nigga need", "annotation_id": "5103997", "url": "https://genius.com/5103997", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rubber Bands", "line": "In Magic City, strippers call me Mr. Hand Out", "vault_lines": ["In Magic City, strippers call me Mr. Hand Out"], "meaning": "Later he would prove his gratitude in the video to “Bandz A Make Her Dance (Remix)”, which explains his popularity among strippers.", "annotation_id": "5103969", "url": "https://genius.com/5103969", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rubber Bands", "line": "And I been runnin’ them dollars like I’m Mayweather the boxer", "vault_lines": ["And I been runnin' them dollars like I'm Mayweather the boxer"], "meaning": "Floyd Mayweather doesn’t have the nickname “Money Mayweather” for no reason:\nhttps://instagram.com/p/vXEyhrR3YT/?taken-by=floydmayweather\nComparing to him seems to be a reach, but with a networth of 15 million dollars he also has a big fortune.", "annotation_id": "5103562", "url": "https://genius.com/5103562", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Rubber Bands", "line": "And I been winnin’ like Khaled way before I won my Oscar", "vault_lines": ["And I been winnin' like Khaled way before I won my Oscar"], "meaning": "DJ Khaled’s song “All I Do Is Win”, seems to be Paul’s current soundtrack, but would also suit his accomplishments before he won an Oscar for “It’s Hard Out Here For A Pimp”.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pipTwjwrQYQ", "annotation_id": "5103511", "url": "https://genius.com/5103511", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
