{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "SHAQ & KOBE", "line": "I never thought I’d make the Forbes before I make the news (Never)", "vault_lines": ["I never thought I'd make the Forbes before I make the news (Never)"], "meaning": "Meek mill made the Forbes list, he never thought he would be on the Forbes list before he made the news, possibly referring to killing someone or multiple people and it ending up on the news", "annotation_id": "31052904", "url": "https://genius.com/31052904", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "SHAQ & KOBE", "line": "Ha, what is this? Maybach Music I like this Maybach Music Sweet Right, hahahahaha", "vault_lines": ["Ha, what is this?"], "meaning": "The intro, recorded by Jessica Gomes in 2008 and becoming the signature sound of the Maybach Music label. Gomes explained how she got involved on Ross’ “Maybach Music” record.\n\n“It was at the beginning of the [‘Maybach Music’] track. It was another girl talking and then she says, ‘What is this?’ and I say ‘It’s Maybach music’ and then we both say ‘I like this Maybach music.’ And we both go ‘Sweet,‘” she explained in an interview. “We were just hanging out with friends in the studio and then it just happened. We got behind the mic, started talking and that was it, really. They decided to put it in their song and nothing came about.”\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4vOExWDh9KQ&t=8s", "annotation_id": "30068608", "url": "https://genius.com/30068608", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "SHAQ & KOBE", "line": "Lobos", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Lobos 1707 is a Mexican tequila and mezcal company. It was founded by Diego Osorio and Mally Nognum in 2020.", "annotation_id": "30068440", "url": "https://genius.com/30068440", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "SHAQ & KOBE", "line": "Homicide on another case Mouth wide, gold teeth with a pale face (Bang)", "vault_lines": ["Homicide on another case", "Mouth wide, gold teeth with a pale face (Bang)"], "meaning": "possibly a reference to The joker ,‘king of Gotham’ and on the song Purple Lamborghini with Skrillex ,and knowing he proclaims himself The joker of Maimi ‘The king(king pin) of Miami’", "annotation_id": "30062242", "url": "https://genius.com/30062242", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "SHAQ & KOBE", "line": "I left a team of niggas in the red tape (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["I left a team of niggas in the red tape (Huh)"], "meaning": "When your ‘boss’ hates your guts or envies your smarts that he requires you to go through an oppressively time-consuming sequence of procedures before you can get approval to do something, especially when you are filing for a vacation leave.\n\nclosest to the message of the Song , n Rick Ross alias ‘Boss’ ,this fits in together", "annotation_id": "30062211", "url": "https://genius.com/30062211", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "SHAQ & KOBE", "line": "Makin", "vault_lines": ["Niggas wanna see you lose when you're makin"], "meaning": "Niggas wanna see you lose when you’re makin' moves (Moves)\nWe bringin' tools in any rooms, we tryna break the rules (Rules)\nNiggas is haters, they ain’t goons, we tryna make a fool (Fool)\nI never thought I’d make the Forbes before I make the news (Never)\nHavin' a threesome with some bitches, it’s still ain’t amusin' (I ain’t)\nI pick and choose, put on my jewels, it’s like I lit the fuse\n\nMeek mill made a reference to his third verse on save me ,now saying all he said in save me, in a winners perspective", "annotation_id": "30048742", "url": "https://genius.com/30048742", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "SHAQ & KOBE", "line": "Niggas is haters, they ain’t goons, we tryna make a fool (Fool)", "vault_lines": ["Niggas is haters, they ain't goons, we tryna make a fool (Fool)"], "meaning": "Success is the only prove to people who are busy wishing you failure, your winning or wealth can make the feel like they’re fool because haters never know the reality of a hustler", "annotation_id": "29700497", "url": "https://genius.com/29700497", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
