{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Saturday Night Special", "line": "Keep your jokes to a minimum when wifey is around", "vault_lines": ["Keep your jokes to a minimum when wifey is around"], "meaning": "Many people think the turning point in the Kendrick-Drake beef was when Drake referenced Whitney Alford, Kendrick’s longtime significant other, whom he has two children with.\n\n\nI be with some bodyguards like Whitney― Drake – Push Ups\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAt that point, what could have been a simple battle for rap supremacy devolved into a flurry of personal attacks and salacious accusations from both sides.", "annotation_id": "33629339", "url": "https://genius.com/33629339", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
