{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Saturday Night Special", "line": "Been bodyin’ shit, big boy hearses Stain careers like windows in the churches Brought the yay to the trap, this Sunday Service", "vault_lines": ["Been bodyin' shit, big boy hearses", "Stain careers like windows in the churches", "Brought the yay to the trap, this Sunday Service"], "meaning": "Fat Joe uses church imagery as hearses typically show up at churches for a funeral (as the result of someone being bodied), churches usually contain stained glass windows, and churches typically hold Sunday services with Fat Joe bringing dope material like Kanye West did with his Sunday Service performances.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=06xMWNXTeSE", "annotation_id": "32085345", "url": "https://genius.com/32085345", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
