{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Save The Best For Last", "line": "I wanted a million like Aaliyah, I wish that she never crashed", "vault_lines": ["I wanted a million like Aaliyah, I wish that she never crashed"], "meaning": "One in a Million is the second studio album by American singer Aaliyah and she released her lead single “One In a Million” in 1996,12 November and she died in 2001 in a plane Crash\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KKSz4NE6PwY", "annotation_id": "32116111", "url": "https://genius.com/32116111", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Save The Best For Last", "line": "“Start From Scratch” part two Nas got the part, so I went and got the part too", "vault_lines": ["Nas got the part, so I went and got the part too"], "meaning": "The Game released “Start From Scratch” (Remix) in 2007 Featuring Tupac & Nas.\nIn 2022 he released “Start From Scratch II” track Number 14 on his Latest Album “DRILLMATIC heart vs Mind”\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Rd52BuL1Fk", "annotation_id": "32115647", "url": "https://genius.com/32115647", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Save The Best For Last", "line": "Cause even Nikki Giovanni had James Baldwin to talk to", "vault_lines": ["'Cause even Nikki Giovanni had James Baldwin to talk to"], "meaning": "In 1971 there was a poetry writer named Nicki Giovanni she was 28 years when she met James Baldwin at London. Baldwin was 46, they had a great conversation about Justice and Freedom..\n\nhttps://www.themelaninproject.org/tmpblog/2020/12/23/wqp58x2aur67y2uibrvpvbahijbf4c", "annotation_id": "32111225", "url": "https://genius.com/32111225", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Save The Best For Last", "line": "And on my dark days, I walk inside a dark booth Speak what’s on my mind but they ain’t ready for the hard truth", "vault_lines": ["And on my dark days, I walk inside a dark booth", "Speak what's on my mind but they ain't ready for the hard truth"], "meaning": "In this line The game here said it otherwise instead of “when days are dark friends are few” and made clear to understand that he was recording even on hard days and Night being true to himself, telling the truth about what people aren’t ready for, meaning his story he had are so much frightening even people won’t want to be around him\n\nThere is an article wrote by Rachel Moorefield “In my Dark Place” people go through hard times and people don’t understand until you tell your story.. that’s how The Game tried to tell us about his hard life he went through\n\nhttps://www.nami.org/personal-stories/my-dark-place/", "annotation_id": "32111030", "url": "https://genius.com/32111030", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
