{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Scientology", "line": "Scientology", "vault_lines": ["Welcome to the Scientology"], "meaning": "Interesting enough, there is a scientologist named Rick Ross as well:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/CMzGbNPCMaw", "annotation_id": "20602862", "url": "https://genius.com/20602862", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Scientology", "line": "They’ve been robbin’ for years, no fear to blow out your noodles Lookin’ at B.I.G and Pac, imaginin’ all the profits Afeni sittin’ at home", "vault_lines": ["They've been robbin' for years, no fear to blow out your noodles", "Lookin' at B.I.G and Pac, imaginin' all the profits", "Afeni sittin' at home"], "meaning": "Labels have been robbing artists for years, especially in the early to middle 90’s. Rozay is thinking how much profit B.I.G. and Pac generated, but still Afeni Shakur (Tupac’s mother) is sitting at home without any royalties.", "annotation_id": "17382610", "url": "https://genius.com/17382610", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Scientology", "line": "You niggas is stupid thinkin’ Craig Kallman won’t send his shooters", "vault_lines": ["You niggas is stupid thinkin' Craig Kallman won't send his shooters"], "meaning": "Craig Kallman is the chairman and CEO OF Atlantic Records. He is a powerful man and it’s probably not far-fetched that he would have “shooters.”\n\n\n\nHis label, Big Beat records was purchased by Atlantic records. With the artists being integrated into the label, with Lil' Kim and Junior Mafia through the Undeas label, which was under Big Beat records.\n\nThe line could also be a play on the last name, Kallman, as in he could call his men; shooters.", "annotation_id": "11585537", "url": "https://genius.com/11585537", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Scientology", "line": "Picture Me Rollin knockin’ No royalties in her pocket", "vault_lines": [", Picture Me Rollin knockin'", "No royalties in her pocket"], "meaning": "This is a continuation of the Tupac references in the last few lines. “Picture Me Rollin'' was a song from his classic, All Eyez On Me. Ross has a history of interpolating Tupac; in the hook for the song “Tupac Back”, Ross says:\n\nAll eyes on me, better Picture Me Rollin'\n\nRoss plays on the title mocking the thought of him not getting paid any royalties especially with all the hits and features he put out throughout his career.", "annotation_id": "11565464", "url": "https://genius.com/11565464", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Scientology", "line": "Smokin’ that Mike Dean until my lungs collapse", "vault_lines": ["Smokin' that Mike Dean until my lungs collapse"], "meaning": "Mike Dean is a very famous producer who has worked with various artists throughout the music industry, and is most known for his work with Kanye West.\n\nMike Dean smokes a lot of weed, and often posts pictures and videos of himself doing so.", "annotation_id": "11542745", "url": "https://genius.com/11542745", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Scientology", "line": "Bun B and Action Bronson, I’m seein’ no colors If you with me you with me, I’ma ride for my brother", "vault_lines": ["Bun B and Action Bronson, I'm seein' no colors", "If you with me you with me, I'ma ride for my brother"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is simply saying it does’t matter if you’re black or white but as long as you’re with him he’s down to ride for you.\nBun B who is part of the southern rap duo UGK is a black man while Action Bronson is white man with Arab roots.\n\nBun B and Rick Ross collaborated on “You’re Everything.”\n\nAction Bronson and Rick Ross have also collaborated on “9-24-7000”", "annotation_id": "11540894", "url": "https://genius.com/11540894", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Scientology", "line": "This must have been God’s wishes ’cause all my friends went to prison Nothin’ like Bryan Williams, but when they come home, I kiss ’em", "vault_lines": ["This must have been God's wishes 'cause all my friends went to prison", "Nothin' like Bryan Williams, but when they come home, I kiss 'em"], "meaning": "Here’s another shot a Bryan “Birdman” Williams.\n\nAround 2006 a photo Birdman kissing his star Cash Money artist Lil Wayne. The  picture spurred on rumors about their relationship.\n\n\n\nIn defense, Bird explained to New Orleans' radio station Q93 that he saw Wayne as his son and the affection he showed was fatherly and not sexual.\n\nThat’s my life, that’s my love and that’s my thing. That’s my lil’ son. I love him to death\n\nRoss still pokes fun at the situation, when describing how he greets his friends love when they come home from prison.", "annotation_id": "11529919", "url": "https://genius.com/11529919", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Scientology", "line": "Know a crooked attorney, last name Sedlmayr", "vault_lines": ["Know a crooked attorney, last name Sedlmayr"], "meaning": "Theo Sedlmayr is an entertainment lawyer who made his name after taking on Eminem as a client.\n\nThroughout points in his career, Sedlmayr has represented Drake, 50 Cent, Just Blaze and Rick Ross. Sounds like things between Theo and Rozay didn’t end very well.", "annotation_id": "11525553", "url": "https://genius.com/11525553", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
