{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Season Ticket Holder", "line": "Three rings on his finger, yeah, that boy was a winner (Winner)", "vault_lines": ["Three rings on his finger, yeah, that boy was a winner (Winner)"], "meaning": "For all his 16 years in NBA Wade won 3 championships: 2006, 2012 and 2013", "annotation_id": "34069965", "url": "https://genius.com/34069965", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Season Ticket Holder", "line": "Showin’ love to the season ticket holders (Woo) Showin’ love to the season ticket holders (Woo) Showin’ love to the season ticket holders (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["Showin' love to the season ticket holders (Woo)"], "meaning": "Contrary to Mr. Ross’s assertion, neither he or his team, Maybach Music Group (also known as MMG), show any sorts of love to the season ticket holders. Not in any way, shape, or form. By no definition of the word does Mr. Ross show “love” to the season ticket holders. I condemn, denounce, censure Mr. Ross’s words and actions as they are predicated on lies. I have been a season ticket holder for years, and I have not been shown an ounce of love by Mr. Ross or any of his peers.", "annotation_id": "22744356", "url": "https://genius.com/22744356", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Season Ticket Holder", "line": "Mister 305 (Yessir)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Haslem has acquired the nickname of “Mr. 305,” a testament to his enduring connection with the Miami community. Born and raised in Miami, U.D has played for the Florida Gators and is the Heat’s all time leading rebounder.", "annotation_id": "19157831", "url": "https://genius.com/19157831", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Season Ticket Holder", "line": "Pockets gettin’ fatter (Uh) Nigga we gettin’ bread", "vault_lines": ["Nigga we gettin' bread"], "meaning": "Long time friends and business partners, Dwyane Wade and Udonis Haslem have invested their money and teamed up to open a branch of West Coast concept  800° Woodfired Kitchen in Aventura at 2956 Aventura Boulevard, Suite C-3. So, besides their ‘fat’ NBA player paychecks, this championship duo keeps earning ‘bread’ off the court.", "annotation_id": "19157800", "url": "https://genius.com/19157800", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Season Ticket Holder", "line": "Nigga I got my own county Listen, the love of the city has been crazy, man, I appreciate it all Thanks for giving my own county", "vault_lines": ["Nigga I got my own county", "Listen, the love of the city has been crazy, man, I appreciate it all", "Thanks for giving my own county"], "meaning": "In 2010 the Miami-Dade County Board of Commissioners voted unanimously to change the name of the South Florida county for an entire week to “Miami-Wade County” in honor of the basketball legend.", "annotation_id": "19108206", "url": "https://genius.com/19108206", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Season Ticket Holder", "line": "I want two hunnid Checkers", "vault_lines": ["Serve him like Boris Becker, I want two hunnid Checkers"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is a huge fan of the fast food restaurant Checkers. He loves it so much, he has been buying franchises in his hometown of Carol City.", "annotation_id": "19108172", "url": "https://genius.com/19108172", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Season Ticket Holder", "line": "Shawty checkin’ my page, she follow my fashion", "vault_lines": ["Shawty checkin' my page, she follow my fashion"], "meaning": "Dwyane Wade is best known as a basketball superstar, however, he is also a fashion icon and owns the eponymous Way of Wade sports shoe brand in partnership with Li-Ning.", "annotation_id": "19108098", "url": "https://genius.com/19108098", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
