{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She Fell in Love (Remix)", "line": "Balenciagas, Murciélagos, know a nigga got it You know I got it", "vault_lines": ["Balenciagas, Murciélagos, know a nigga got it", "You know I got it"], "meaning": "From Balenciaga shoes that cost anywhere from $500-$800 to Lamborghini Murcielagos that cost around $250,000. You have to know Ricky Rozay has it all.\n\nAlso a reference to his hook on the Jay-Z song “FuckWithMeYouKnowIGotIt”.", "annotation_id": "3460247", "url": "https://genius.com/3460247", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
