{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She Wanna Fuck", "line": "Bel Air bottles like a boss, penthouse at the Trump", "vault_lines": ["Bel Air bottles like a boss, penthouse at the Trump"], "meaning": "Belaire is an expensive brand of French wine. Bel Air is a rich neighborhood in Los Angeles, and the main setting of the popular show, The Fresh Prince of Bel Air, which is about a ghetto kid visiting his Uncle’s rich estate. Rick Ross is using wordplay on all three, showing us that he started from the bottom, but is growing in success. Donald Trump is an American billionaire who has his own towers. Ross is so rich that he has appealed to the likes of Trump, allowing him to have his own penthouse inside his tower.\nhttp://i57.tinypic.com/14smle.jpg%22height=250", "annotation_id": "8512699", "url": "https://genius.com/8512699", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She Wanna Fuck", "line": "[Produced by: Kennedy Rothchild]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "The track samples “I Gotcha” by Joe Tex.\nhttps://youtu.be/L7DSBfqirMc\nAnd “Think (About It)” by Lyn Collins\nhttps://youtu.be/Jiqxkdhzi_M", "annotation_id": "7762506", "url": "https://genius.com/7762506", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She Wanna Fuck", "line": "Blowin’ trees out the window loopin’ J Dilla", "vault_lines": ["Blowin' trees out the window loopin' J Dilla"], "meaning": "Rozay loves to smoke weed and chill, listening to J Dilla. J Dilla, the “Mozart of Hip-Hop”, is a music producer and rapper who is best known for Donuts, a sample filled hip-hop album.\n\n\n\nApparently Rick Ross is a fan of J Dilla and The Pharcyde (mentioned in the previous line), as this is not the first time he has mentioned them recently.", "annotation_id": "7745216", "url": "https://genius.com/7745216", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She Wanna Fuck", "line": "Bring me breakfast in bed and I’ll handle the brunch", "vault_lines": ["Bring me breakfast in bed and I'll handle the brunch"], "meaning": "Rick Ross, as we all know, loves eating. He’ll have breakfast, as well as brunch.", "annotation_id": "7745210", "url": "https://genius.com/7745210", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She Wanna Fuck", "line": "Maybe kiss a couple spots, I know it tempts you You should bring your best friend, that’s what you’re into", "vault_lines": ["Maybe kiss a couple spots, I know it tempts you", "You should bring your best friend, that's what you're into"], "meaning": "Coming back to point before that Rick Ross knows how to get girls to like him through his money mostly, but he has a couple other tricks up his sleeves.", "annotation_id": "7745205", "url": "https://genius.com/7745205", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She Wanna Fuck", "line": "Locked myself in a room and it’s time to elevate Let me play with your mind and I know another way I’m talkin’ paper and stacks, givin’ shorty the facts", "vault_lines": ["Locked myself in a room and it's time to elevate", "Let me play with your mind and I know another way", "I'm talkin' paper and stacks, givin' shorty the facts"], "meaning": "Rick Ross creates the idea that he is very good with girls and getting them to have sex with him. The main factor of this is because of his money, which he uses to do this. After all, his net worth is approximately $28 million.", "annotation_id": "7745196", "url": "https://genius.com/7745196", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She Wanna Fuck", "line": "Give it here Don’t say nothin’, just give it here Don’t hold back, just give it here Don’t say nothin’, just give it here Don’t hold back, yeah, give it here Don’t say nothin’, just give it here Don’t hold back, just give it here Don’t say nothin’, just give it here", "vault_lines": ["Don't hold back, yeah, give it here"], "meaning": "August begins the vibe of the song, the main message of sex, in the intro with the repetition of “just give it here” creating this vibe.", "annotation_id": "7745188", "url": "https://genius.com/7745188", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She Wanna Fuck", "line": "She looks so good and she acts so bad She like to have fun and I’m with all that We can get down cause I know what’s up She don’t wanna fall in love, she just wanna fuck She just wanna fuck, she just wanna fuck She just wanna fuck, she just wanna fuck", "vault_lines": ["She looks so good and she acts so bad", "She like to have fun and I'm with all that", "We can get down cause I know what's up", "She don't wanna fall in love, she just wanna fuck", "She just wanna fuck, she just wanna fuck"], "meaning": "August is saying that this girl is amazing and beautiful, but all she wants to do is fuck him, nothing more, nothing less. This continues on with the vibe and idea of the song, talking mostly about sex and women.", "annotation_id": "7745186", "url": "https://genius.com/7745186", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She Wanna Fuck", "line": "I see your stock rise, only counter clockwise You in reverse, outer verse from the far side", "vault_lines": ["I see your stock rise, only counter clockwise", "You in reverse, outer verse from the far side"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is saying he sees your stock rise the opposite way which would mean it’s going backwards which is explained in the next verse, “you in reverse”", "annotation_id": "7742117", "url": "https://genius.com/7742117", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
