{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She on My Dick", "line": "Double M the label with the most pesos", "vault_lines": ["Double M the label with the most pesos"], "meaning": "The Maybach music group is rick ross label with two ms in the artwork.\n\n\n\nand Pesos is the currency of Mexico. Modern peso and dollar currencies have a common origin in the 15th–19th century-Spanish dollar, most continuing to use its sign, “$”\n\n\n\nRoss states that the maybach music group (Meek mill, wale, omarion etc) have many pesos as mexico starts with an M like maybach music.", "annotation_id": "15536280", "url": "https://genius.com/15536280", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She on My Dick", "line": "Walk up on ’em with the forty and the case closed", "vault_lines": ["Walk up on 'em with the forty and the case closed"], "meaning": "The AK-47 or AK also known as the Kalashnikov, is a gas-operated, 7.62×39mm assault rifle, developed in the Soviet Union by Mikhail Kalashnikov. It is the originating firearm of the AK family.\n\n\n\nThe phrase A case is closed is specifically, a police investigation or similar is resolved.\n\nRozay states that he’ll kill you with the gun and close the case of possibly haters or a rival drug dealer.", "annotation_id": "15536243", "url": "https://genius.com/15536243", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She on My Dick", "line": "Red bottoms, all white just to shoot dice", "vault_lines": ["Red bottoms, all white just to shoot dice"], "meaning": "“Red Bottoms” are referring to Christian Louboutin which is a French fashion designer whose high-end stiletto footwear incorporates shiny, red-lacquered soles that have become his signature. Initially a freelance designer for fashion houses, he started his own shoe salon in Paris, with his shoes finding favor with celebrity clientele. He has partnered with other organizations for creative projects including limited edition pieces, gallery exhibits, and even a custom bar. His company has since branched out into men’s footwear, handbags, fragrances and makeup.\n\nhttp://www.gazetadita.al/pse-kepucet-christian-louboutin-jane-te-kuqe-poshte/\n\nShooting dice, also known as street craps, is a slightly simplified version of traditional Casino Craps, and is a classic hustle. You can also learn to play Mexican drinking dice, Farkle, and other games that only require you to know a few rules and get a few dice in a cup.\nhttp://channel.nationalgeographic.com/u/kdmEeKfo2hAxeBoVSCApUyKnJKZmlu9C0eJ-zWcz3fobN8zvUSC94iizYoTR5ZtEOoA-EM1Fz87i/", "annotation_id": "14850601", "url": "https://genius.com/14850601", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She on My Dick", "line": "Pork n’ bean projects is where the killers be", "vault_lines": ["Pork n' bean projects is where the killers be"], "meaning": "Pork & Beans is a reference to the Liberty Square which is a 753-unit Miami-Dade public housing apartment complex in the Liberty City neighborhood of Miami, Florida. It is bordered at Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard/North 62nd Street to the south, North 67th Street to the north, State Road 933 (Northwest 12th Avenue) to the east, and Northwest 15th Avenue to the west. Constructed as a part of the New Deal by the Public Works Administration and opening in 1937, it was the first public housing project for blacks in the Southern United States.\n\nhttps://images.genius.com/q=pork+and+beans+neighborhood+miami&hl=en-", "annotation_id": "14850315", "url": "https://genius.com/14850315", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She on My Dick", "line": "And like the Chargers I’m about to move the team", "vault_lines": ["And like the Chargers I'm about to move the team"], "meaning": "This line is a reference to the San Diego Chargers, who recently announced that they were going to move to Los Angeles for the start of the 2017 season.", "annotation_id": "11528252", "url": "https://genius.com/11528252", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "She on My Dick", "line": "Bill Belichick, I just got another ring", "vault_lines": ["Bill Belichick, I just got another ring"], "meaning": "In reference to the Patriots superbowl win over the Atlanta falcons in superbowl 51 in which Coach Bill Belichick and his team led an amazing 25 point comeback over the Atlanta Falcons.\n\nAtlanta blew a 25 point lead", "annotation_id": "11524403", "url": "https://genius.com/11524403", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
