{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shhh (Freestyle)", "line": "Tell a bitch keep counting till she get the count right When a bitch finish might purchase her a flight", "vault_lines": ["Tell a bitch keep counting till she get the count right", "When a bitch finish might purchase her a flight"], "meaning": "Trek gave a woman some revenue for her to account. The amount she quoted is not the amount he believes that he’s given her. Under the impression she has stolen he tells her count again until the count is correct.", "annotation_id": "37740287", "url": "https://genius.com/37740287", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
