{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shhh (Freestyle)", "line": "All I ever wanted was a kilo Till they my little nigga with the rico", "vault_lines": ["Till they my little nigga with the rico"], "meaning": "Every drug dealer starting out aspires to build up to a kilogram of product. Ross then retracts this aspiration because a younger dealer he knows gotten indicted by the rico law (Racketeer Influenced and Corrupt Organizations Act)", "annotation_id": "37740162", "url": "https://genius.com/37740162", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shhh (Freestyle)", "line": "I’m rollin’ through my city in a new Rolls Royce Chief Keef 300 for the Wraith nigga", "vault_lines": ["I'm rollin' through my city in a new Rolls Royce", "Chief Keef 300 for the Wraith nigga"], "meaning": "Meek is rolling through his hometown, Philly in his Rolls Royce Wraith which costed him 300,000 dollars.\n\n\n\nChief Keef had a hit single called “3hunna”, which is also the amount of money Meek’s car costed.\n\nMeek seems to have an obsession with Rolls Royce’s, he frequently talks about the Ghost model.", "annotation_id": "2538452", "url": "https://genius.com/2538452", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shhh (Freestyle)", "line": "Master P money I could pull up in a tank", "vault_lines": ["Master P money I could pull up in a tank"], "meaning": "Master P is a succesful rapper, CEO, and actor. As you can probably tell by his titles, he is very rich.\n\nRick Ross believes he too has that type of cash. He is also a CEO, and a rapper. You can see him pull up in anything like his Maybach, his Bentley,  his Lambo, or maybe even his tank.\n\n\n\nHe probably has the money to do so.\n\nAlso the tank-image is a reference to Master P’s record label No Limit Forever Records, which logo is a tank:", "annotation_id": "2538391", "url": "https://genius.com/2538391", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
