{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shoot (Remix)", "line": "Body count, bitch, Gleesh the Son of Sam", "vault_lines": ["Body count, bitch, Gleesh the Son of Sam"], "meaning": "David Berkowitz was a serial killer who was known as the “Son of Sam”. He had killed at least six people and wounded seven others.\n\nBecause Fat Trel’s body count is as high as Berkowitz’s, Rozay has dubbed him as the second coming of the Son of Sam.", "annotation_id": "3288164", "url": "https://genius.com/3288164", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shoot (Remix)", "line": "Say, “Hello, to my little friend!”", "vault_lines": ["Say, \"Hello, to my little friend!\""], "meaning": "In the previous line, Rozay speaks on his grenade. He then says the very popular line from the movie Scarface when Tony Montana pulls out his M203 Grenade Launcher and shouts, “Say hello to my little friend!”", "annotation_id": "3014504", "url": "https://genius.com/3014504", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
