{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shot Caller (Remix)", "line": "Wanna be with a baller shot caller", "vault_lines": ["Wanna be with a baller shot caller"], "meaning": "This is an homage to P-Diddy; during his Puff Daddy days when he said the same line on Biggie’s single, “All About the Benjamins”.", "annotation_id": "625004", "url": "https://genius.com/625004", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shot Caller (Remix)", "line": "Double M Genius, even the band playing", "vault_lines": ["Double M Genius, even the band playing"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is the founder of MMG, Maybach Music Group. So in essence, he’s the genius behind it! Double M Genius (MMG) can also be seen as a backronym for the label’s name.", "annotation_id": "612020", "url": "https://genius.com/612020", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
