{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shot Caller (Remix)", "line": "Dipping in the Phantom, thought they seen a Ghost", "vault_lines": ["Dipping in the Phantom, thought they seen a Ghost"], "meaning": "French Monatanas doing some good ol' chew in a Rolls-Royce Phantom, the top of the line Rolls-Royce. Haters thought he’d only be ridin' in a Rolls-Royce Ghost, because they look very similar and a Ghost is not as expensive as a Phantom.", "annotation_id": "612007", "url": "https://genius.com/612007", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
