{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shot Caller (Remix)", "line": "Boxing niggas all I ever did was mob and weave Now the crib eight mil, that’s on everything", "vault_lines": ["Boxing niggas all I ever did was mob and weave", "Now the crib eight mil, that's on everything"], "meaning": "Ross compares his history of hustling and grinding to the infamous boxing technique.\n\n\n\nIt’s payed off, since he’s got a mansion. Word to the wise: stay grindin'.", "annotation_id": "601528", "url": "https://genius.com/601528", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shot Caller (Remix)", "line": "Top down, praying to my Lord and savior", "vault_lines": ["Top down, praying to my Lord and savior"], "meaning": "Ross is drivin' with his convertible top down\n\n\n\nRoss has had some well-known run-ins with God.\n\nHe knockin' on the door, don’t let the devil in!\n\nAlso:\n\nTouch ‘em with the Holy Ghost, can you hear me, Father?", "annotation_id": "601481", "url": "https://genius.com/601481", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shot Caller (Remix)", "line": "Put the coupe on a pair of Chuck Taylors", "vault_lines": ["Put the coupe on a pair of Chuck Taylors"], "meaning": "Ross put his sports car on some bitchin' rims (shoes). That he uses Chucks might suggest that the rims aren’t too flashy.\n\nAlso, see here to see Ross put some Nikes on his whip.", "annotation_id": "601346", "url": "https://genius.com/601346", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shot Caller (Remix)", "line": "My new deal sweeter than Peach Ciroc", "vault_lines": ["My new deal sweeter than Peach Ciroc"], "meaning": "French Montana signed with Diddy’s Bad Boy Records back in 2011. So his deal with Diddy is more sweeter then the famous vodka Ciroc.", "annotation_id": "583573", "url": "https://genius.com/583573", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
