{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shots Fired (Skit)", "line": "Slow down I just heard a bunch of gunshots go off -- my server just left on her bike to go -- Oh my God, they’re turning around and coming back Okay I’m hanging up, I’m hiding, bye-- Okay, m’am, how many shots did you hear? I don’t know, I don’t know, but they’re coming back. I’m hiding “We’re being told by people here on the scenes, specifically the manager that a famous rapper was riding in that car when someone opened fire shooting at that car, that car crashing into that building. Police cleaning up the shell-casing markings that were here just a few moments ago. This is still under investigation” “There was a rapidfire 9 or 10, 9 or 10 shots. You know, rapidfire with rapid succession and odd enough it wasn’t a handgun, it was some kind of a rifle.”", "vault_lines": ["I'm hanging up, I'm hiding, bye--", "Okay, m'am, how many shots did you hear?", "I don't know, I don't know, but they're coming back. I'm hiding"], "meaning": "The beginning of the track is a recording from a 911 call taken place after the shooting of Rozay’s silver Rolls Royce. Rozay and another person were in the car as it was sprayed with bullets. Approx. 9 or 10 shots were fired\n\nDailymail covered this story", "annotation_id": "8519946", "url": "https://genius.com/8519946", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shots Fired (Skit)", "line": "“Police have leads, but no strong description of the shooter or the shooters who appeard to have targetted South Florida based rapper Rick Ross as he drove down the street”", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "On January 27, 2013, while celebrating his 37th birthday, Ross and his girlfriend were the targets of a drive-by shooting in Fort Lauderdale, Florida. Neither Ross nor his girlfriend were hurt but they ended up crashing into an apartment\nRick Ross spoke about the shooting\n\n50 Cent also spoke about the shooting being staged for publicity", "annotation_id": "2853190", "url": "https://genius.com/2853190", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Shots Fired (Skit)", "status": "done", "targets": 2, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Rick-ross-shots-fired-skit-lyrics", "genius_title": "Shots Fired (Skit)", "genius_id": 370760, "source": "api"}
