{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "We know you pussies, so you got my niggas masturbating", "vault_lines": ["We know you pussies, so you got my niggas masturbating"], "meaning": "They’re “pussies” and they’re snitching which gets people into prison which is  a l l   m e n  so they’re masturbating", "annotation_id": "18917213", "url": "https://genius.com/18917213", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "To get a verse from me, you gotta be initiated To get a purse from me, she gotta be sophisticated", "vault_lines": ["To get a purse from me, she gotta be sophisticated"], "meaning": "It’s not easy to collaborate and start a relationship with the Teflon Don. Ross is saying you gotta be signed to MMG if you want to collab and a girl needs to be hella fine in order to cop his merch.", "annotation_id": "18699392", "url": "https://genius.com/18699392", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "I ain’t never had shit but I grab shit and I cashed out on that ounce", "vault_lines": ["I ain't never had shit but I grab shit and I cashed out on that ounce"], "meaning": "Back in the day Meek never had anything growing up. He would snatch, grab, rob, hustle any money up he could and cash it in on a Ounce of coke—and flip it to a whole thang (whole Kilo) with arm and hammer baking soda.", "annotation_id": "2608085", "url": "https://genius.com/2608085", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Gave all my niggas an occupation", "vault_lines": ["gave all my niggas an occupation"], "meaning": "Ross isn’t joking about this. In his Rolling Stone cover story, he revealed that Duece Poppi aka Whole Slab is his official blunt roller & hype man at MMG shows.", "annotation_id": "1329115", "url": "https://genius.com/1329115", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "And I flipped that to a bird and bounced back like word", "vault_lines": ["And I flipped that to a bird and bounced back like word"], "meaning": "https://players.brightcove.net/4863540648001/HklmClHkx_default/index.html?videoId=5237789099001", "annotation_id": "1135814", "url": "https://genius.com/1135814", "state": "verified", "votes": 28, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Time to lay down these niggas who still be masquerading", "vault_lines": ["Time to lay down these niggas who still be masquerading"], "meaning": "At masquerade parties, party-goers wear masks, concealing their identity.\n\n\n\nSnitches and fakes are always hiding, like people disguising their faces at masquerade balls. Rozay is ready to take out (“lay down”) the rest of his competition.", "annotation_id": "1106794", "url": "https://genius.com/1106794", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "We going hard, run it back just like it’s Walter Payton The game sweet,", "vault_lines": ["We going hard, run it back just like it's Walter Payton"], "meaning": "Walter Payton was a Hall of Fame running back for the NFL’s Chicago Bears. His nickname, which Ross alludes to here, was “Sweetness”.", "annotation_id": "956947", "url": "https://genius.com/956947", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Put yo dick in the dirt, now you decapitated", "vault_lines": ["Put yo dick in the dirt, now you decapitated"], "meaning": "Putting someone’s “dick in the dirt” is a saying meaning to knock out or kill them. Although the wording of this line makes it seem as if Ross' is chopping someone’s junk off, he most likely is just referring to murdering them.\n\nA play on words: the dead man does not have a head on his shoulders or his dick.", "annotation_id": "946792", "url": "https://genius.com/946792", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Hundred millionaires, bitch we made it (Ugh!)", "vault_lines": ["Hundred millionaires, bitch we made it (Ugh!)"], "meaning": "Rick Ross’s “mob” is referencing his label MMG and that they have status and superiority over everyone. Those who are “Sophisticated” have good taste and great wisdom. With them being Sophisticated, they are finally millionaires which is what they been trying to accomplish.", "annotation_id": "849611", "url": "https://genius.com/849611", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Shitting on these haters, ball hard D Waiters", "vault_lines": ["Shitting on these haters, ball hard D Waiters"], "meaning": "Dion Waiters who played college basketball at Syracuse University, now plays in the NBA.\n\nMeek Mill played at midnight madness for the Syracuse basketball team. Meek and Dion are both from Philly.", "annotation_id": "795720", "url": "https://genius.com/795720", "state": "accepted", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Smoking weed, busting open Dom and liquor later", "vault_lines": ["Smoking weed, busting open Dom and liquor later"], "meaning": "“Dom” as in Dom Perignon, famous and expensive champagne.\n\n\n\nTHC is Rozay’s drug of choice—alcohol only leads to bad deceptions and an ill mind and body. Smoke, breath, rap.", "annotation_id": "795623", "url": "https://genius.com/795623", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "My neck so frosty, you frauding, yo shit refrigerator Boy you an imitator", "vault_lines": ["Boy you an imitator"], "meaning": "This line is highly metaphorical.\n\nIce is frosty—and ice is slang for diamonds. A frosty neck indicates diamond necklaces and chains. The haters or poor ass bitches (me) got fake ass shit.\n\nIce is water at a solid state—but it melts if its not at the right temperature (32deg F/0deg C). The haters got ice in the refrigerator, which would melt or break apart (38deg F/4deg C)—fake ass imitation shit.", "annotation_id": "794311", "url": "https://genius.com/794311", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "And these niggas so mad it’s my turn now", "vault_lines": ["And these niggas so mad it's my turn now"], "meaning": "Other dudes want a chance, but they’re mad because Meek climbed the very narrow ladder that is mainstream Hip-Hop.\n\nBut really, he’s been in the underground for quite some time.\nThis video is back in ‘06 when he was still Meek Mill(z).\n\nAt this time, rappers like Drake were still being young and in love.", "annotation_id": "794267", "url": "https://genius.com/794267", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Tatted on my stomach, rich forever, Makaveli (Babyyy)", "vault_lines": ["Tatted on my stomach, rich forever, Makaveli (Babyyy)"], "meaning": "Tupac had Thug Life tatted on his stomach\n\n\n\nMakaveli was another name Tupac went by—a reference to the 15th-16th century political philosopher Niccolo Machiavelli.\n\nIt’s interesting to note that Ross adlibs “Babyyy” after this line, which was a famous Biggie adlib, even though Ross is shouting out 2Pac.\n\n“Rich Forever” is also a Ross song and mixtape.", "annotation_id": "794239", "url": "https://genius.com/794239", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "I just hit a lick, I’m telling you this shit amazing", "vault_lines": ["I just hit a lick, I'm telling you this shit amazing"], "meaning": "“Hit a lick” is a term for gaining large amount of money in a short time.", "annotation_id": "794215", "url": "https://genius.com/794215", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Breaking news and we still get them for ten a key", "vault_lines": ["Breaking news and we still get them for ten a key"], "meaning": "Even when Ross has heat on him he still gets a killer deal. $10k for a kilo. It can seriously run at around 25-30k. He makes a total killer especially when he makes it come back even harder than before.", "annotation_id": "794206", "url": "https://genius.com/794206", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Pull out the stick and spray that bitch just like it’s activator", "vault_lines": ["Pull out the stick and spray that bitch just like it’s activator"], "meaning": "In Miami they call their AK-47s “sticks” because of the wood its made from.\n\n\n\nOr he’s referring to “the stick” as his penis, and “spray that bitch” as cumming on her. In other words—he could be talking about firing shots from the AK-47, or cumshots from the 4.7″.\n\nActivator is often cream-based, so Rick is most likely referring to option #2.", "annotation_id": "794130", "url": "https://genius.com/794130", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "I’m the hottest and these other niggas cooling, ain’t it", "vault_lines": ["I'm the hottest and these other niggas cooling, ain't it"], "meaning": "Notice the “hot”/“cool” wordplay here.  This line likely refers to him being named MTV’s hottest MC in the game in 2011.", "annotation_id": "794109", "url": "https://genius.com/794109", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Round of applause ’cause them choppers be so captivating", "vault_lines": ["Round of applause 'cause them choppers be so captivating"], "meaning": "To captivate is to interest a person which would require applause. The shots from an AK-47 is seen as “clapping”, a term used to describe shooting. Round of applause gives us a nice indication on the amount of “claps” they’re about to give out.", "annotation_id": "794103", "url": "https://genius.com/794103", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "Sipping purple and that motherfucker concentrated", "vault_lines": ["Sipping purple and that motherfucker concentrated"], "meaning": "Cough syrup with promethazine & codeine act as the solute (the liquid being dissolved) and the soda acts as a solvent (the liquid that will dissolve the solute)—the more you put in, less concentration of the solute exists.\n\nMore concentration of the sizzurp = more fucked up. The darker the color indicates more sizzurp and less sprite:\n\n\n\nPretty light\n\n\n\nDarker\n\n\n\nPure syrup", "annotation_id": "794081", "url": "https://genius.com/794081", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "So Sophisticated", "line": "My Lil’ Haiti shooters will have yo ass on TMZ", "vault_lines": ["My Lil' Haiti shooters will have yo ass on TMZ"], "meaning": "Ross is most likely referring to the dead body that was found in front of a Miami home that was registered in his name. TMZ reported on the incident because it was Ross' house. Little Haiti is a rough area in Ross' hometown.\n\nThe house where the body was found:", "annotation_id": "794069", "url": "https://genius.com/794069", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
