{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Soft", "line": "I’m like Ice-T with that white girl, still gettin’ money off Coco", "vault_lines": ["I’m like Ice-T with that white girl, still gettin’ money off Coco"], "meaning": "Ice-T is married to white supermodel Coco Austin and two stay relevant due to each other’s popularity. In fact, the two are stars of Ice Loves Coco, their own reality show. Like Ice-T loves Coco, Santana loves dealing cocaine (white), which is what keeps his cash flow up.", "annotation_id": "1395157", "url": "https://genius.com/1395157", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
