{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Speedin’", "line": "E-Class, I think somebody followin’ me", "vault_lines": ["E-Class, I think somebody followin' me"], "meaning": "“E-Class, I think somebody followin' me”, referring to Ross' ex-manager Elric “E-Class” Prince.\n\nhttps://allhiphop.com/news/rick-ross-manager-claims-rapper-owes-1-million-feared-for-his-life-due-to-threats-ZKDX9dgKekuvTtGXzCj4Sg", "annotation_id": "20431755", "url": "https://genius.com/20431755", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
