{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Star Island", "line": "Jokić and Murray, you know we determined", "vault_lines": ["Jokić and Murray, you know we determined"], "meaning": "Rick Ross and Meek Mill reference NBA players Nikola Jokić and Jamal Murray to highlight their own determination and success. Jokić and Murray, teammates for the Denver Nuggets, are known for their relentless work ethic and have led the team to significant achievements. By invoking their names, the artists draw a parallel between the players' commitment on the court and their own dedication in the music industry, emphasizing their drive and ambition. https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/734356-rick-ross-meek-mill-star-island?utm_source=chatgpt.com", "annotation_id": "33707308", "url": "https://genius.com/33707308", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Star Island", "line": "I just sniped a famous bitch and cut her like she OJ", "vault_lines": ["I just sniped a famous bitch and cut her like she OJ"], "meaning": "The term “sniped” suggests successfully pursuing someone, while “cut her like she OJ” alludes to O.J. Simpson’s infamous murder trial, in which he was famously acquitted on all charges\nhttps://www.nytimes.com/2024/04/11/us/oj-simpson-timeline.html", "annotation_id": "33707253", "url": "https://genius.com/33707253", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
