{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Super High (Sativa Remix)", "line": "Super high, from the free throw line, I’m Drexler status,", "vault_lines": ["Super high, from the free throw line, I'm"], "meaning": "“Clyde Austin Drexler” aka “Clyde ‘the Glide” is an American former professional basketball player who Dunked from the free-throw line in a game verse the LA Lakers.\n\nEspionage – The practice of spying or of using spies, typically by governments to obtain political and military information.", "annotation_id": "24156973", "url": "https://genius.com/24156973", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Super High (Sativa Remix)", "line": "My pain never went in vain, it’s all over my body", "vault_lines": ["My pain never went in vain, it's all over my body"], "meaning": "Rick Ross has many tattoos all over his body – when he was getting them it hurt (ouch!) but he was brave! Each and every one of his tats has some kind of personal significance\n\nPlus, he did not suffer “in vain” (purposelessly) – he has all these pretty tattoos:", "annotation_id": "27611", "url": "https://genius.com/27611", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Super High (Sativa Remix)", "line": "Trees get twisted up like fingers in gang signs", "vault_lines": ["Trees get twisted up like fingers in gang signs"], "meaning": "“Twisting trees” is slang for rolling a joint\n\nHand signs representing gang-affiliation also get rather twisty:", "annotation_id": "27610", "url": "https://genius.com/27610", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Super High (Sativa Remix)", "line": "Huh, Taylor Gang is what we bleed about Jet setters in places you only read about", "vault_lines": ["Huh, Taylor Gang is what we bleed about", "Jet setters in places you only read about"], "meaning": "“Taylor Gang” is Wiz' crew (known for wearing Chuck Taylors on their feet, and the Converse star as tattoos)\n\n“The Jets” is Curren$y’s crew", "annotation_id": "22985", "url": "https://genius.com/22985", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Super High (Sativa Remix)", "line": "I think I’m Paul Pierce,", "vault_lines": ["I think I'm Paul Pierce,"], "meaning": "Spitta refers to Pierce and Rondo because they wear green (his prefered color of weed)\n\n\n\nThey also wear headbands, which gives a little more meaning to the next line", "annotation_id": "20792", "url": "https://genius.com/20792", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Super High (Sativa Remix)", "line": "It hurt to see me shine,", "vault_lines": ["It hurt to see me shine,"], "meaning": "Well it does hurt to look into the sun.  Shine means to do well or succeed", "annotation_id": "20779", "url": "https://genius.com/20779", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
