{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Take Advantage", "line": "Three kidnapping charges, DA denied me my bail Two million in cash, the property totaled for six", "vault_lines": ["Three kidnapping charges, DA denied me my bail", "Two million in cash, the property totaled for six"], "meaning": "Ross talks about how he caught kidnapping charges in GA after being previously arrested that same month for marijauna related charges. In order to post bond he had to put up 2m in cash and 6 properties to walk. GA is notorious for strict drug enforcement.", "annotation_id": "7816096", "url": "https://genius.com/7816096", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
