{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Take Advantage", "line": "Come with me and stay the night and you won’t regret it Dinner dates, what I do for you is all brand new to me I’m goin’ to court, my baby mama tryin’ suin’ me And I’m tryna take it off my mind, with you", "vault_lines": ["Come with me and stay the night and you won't regret it", "Dinner dates, what I do for you is all brand new to me", "I'm goin' to court, my baby mama tryin' suin' me", "And I'm tryna take it off my mind, with you"], "meaning": "Future promises that a night with him won’t be one you will want to forget anytime soon. His previous partner with whom he has a child with is draining him of his funds and energy through long strained out court battles and so anything outside of such nonsense is well met by Future. He’s really just looking to spend some time to wine and dine you because it helps him forget about the saddening baby mama struggles.", "annotation_id": "7751978", "url": "https://genius.com/7751978", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Take Advantage", "line": "I get money just to stand around, it’s hard, trust me", "vault_lines": ["I get money just to stand around, it's hard, trust me"], "meaning": "When you’re famous you get paid to make appearances at clubs and etc. As awesome as that sounds it comes with it’s hardships as well. The future hendrix lifestyle is not one to be toiled with by the faint hearted.", "annotation_id": "7751950", "url": "https://genius.com/7751950", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Take Advantage", "line": "Since we spendin’ some times you might as well suck it I can’t hold your hand now, I’m countin’ money", "vault_lines": ["Since we spendin' some times you might as well suck it", "I can't hold your hand now, I'm countin' money"], "meaning": "In other words if were in this together for the long while then Future is going to have to take advantage and call for the favour of getting oral sex from his partner. He’s the man in the relationship putting money on the table and with that comes the responsibility to be busy and working hard. He doesn’t have time to be present and affectionate with his girl.", "annotation_id": "7751889", "url": "https://genius.com/7751889", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
