{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Tats on My Arm", "line": "My mates calling me gifted", "vault_lines": ["My mates calling me gifted"], "meaning": "Wale’s friends know how talented he is and let him know it too, so he can stay motivated.\n\nAbout a year and a half later, Wale would name his third studio album The Gifted.", "annotation_id": "5132659", "url": "https://genius.com/5132659", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Tats on My Arm", "line": "Follow me", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Follow Rick Ross into “the mindset”, and the life of an ambitious person. It takes much ambition to become an artist like Wale and Rick Ross. It did not happen overnight.", "annotation_id": "1925047", "url": "https://genius.com/1925047", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Tats on My Arm", "line": "See money talk and these days You thought that shorty wasn’t listening?", "vault_lines": ["See money talk and these days", "You thought that shorty wasn't listening?"], "meaning": "A play on words, “money talks” is a popular phrase meaning that with enough money you can get anything done. Wale is using clever wordplay to say that these girls want him because of his money and his fame.", "annotation_id": "385322", "url": "https://genius.com/385322", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Tats on My Arm", "line": "‘Le Folarin be trippin’", "vault_lines": ["'Le Folarin be trippin'"], "meaning": "He’s speaking of hiself, Olubowale Victor Akintimehin is his full name (I didn’t try to pronounce it either). ‘Le would be a nickname.", "annotation_id": "382607", "url": "https://genius.com/382607", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Tats on My Arm", "line": "3M’s on my New Balance I’m here to shine when I’m tracking", "vault_lines": ["3M's on my New Balance", "I'm here to shine when I'm tracking"], "meaning": "New Balance has used 3M reflective material on many of their shoes, including “Pinnacle”, made partially of gold.\n\n\n\nWale could also be referring to his bank account which now has 3 million.\n\nIt also is reference to the Belgian fashion house Maison Martin Margiela (3 M’s). His Maison Martin Margiela jeans/pants are sitting on New Balance sneakers.", "annotation_id": "382482", "url": "https://genius.com/382482", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Tats on My Arm", "line": "I got a green bag with them blue strands Man I smoke that Marjorie Simpson", "vault_lines": ["I got a green bag with them blue strands", "Man I smoke that Marjorie Simpson"], "meaning": "Referring to his weed which has blue streaks and Marj Simpson from the Simpsons who has blue hair.", "annotation_id": "382072", "url": "https://genius.com/382072", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Tats on My Arm", "line": "And I don’t reply to most BBMs So when you see an ”R”, don’t be trippin!", "vault_lines": ["And I don't reply to most BBMs", "So when you see an \"R\", don't be trippin!"], "meaning": "On Blackberrys, when BBMing, if the person you BBMed reads your message, it shows an “R” on your side meaning they’ve read it. Wale is saying that most of the time he reads the BBM and doesn’t respond, so some girls get frustrated.", "annotation_id": "381837", "url": "https://genius.com/381837", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Tats on My Arm", "line": "Okay, tats all on my arm, these dreads all in my eyes", "vault_lines": ["Okay, tats all on my arm, these dreads all in my eyes"], "meaning": "As you can see in this picture:\n\n\n\nHe’s got dreads that hang over his eyes and tats on both his arms as well as his chest.", "annotation_id": "381826", "url": "https://genius.com/381826", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Tats on My Arm", "line": "February cold as my heart That’s why your date is probably missin’", "vault_lines": ["February cold as my heart", "That's why your date is probably missin'"], "meaning": "February is in the cold winter and February 29th only comes once every 4 years, so it’s always missing like your girl! Wale doesn’t feel bad when he steals your date.", "annotation_id": "381730", "url": "https://genius.com/381730", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Tats on My Arm", "line": "It’s my ambition, nigga It’s my ambition, nigga I’m just so gifted Look where that shit get ya", "vault_lines": ["It's my ambition, nigga", "I'm just so gifted", "Look where that shit get ya"], "meaning": "Desire + Talent = Success\n\nUsing his skills as a rapper, and using his craving for success, Wale has been able to reach fame and fortune\n\nAmbition is also Wale’s upcoming album", "annotation_id": "381691", "url": "https://genius.com/381691", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
