{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That Way", "line": "She say she from Seattle,", "vault_lines": ["She say she from Seattle,"], "meaning": "The Emerald City of course\n\n\n\nAlso, Wale’s love interest/girlfriend Chloe Alexis Jourdan (@calexisj) is originally from Seattle. Now living in Chicago (which is referenced later in this verse). Main female from Wale’s “Diary” video.", "annotation_id": "507004", "url": "https://genius.com/507004", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That Way", "line": "Gotta get back to the D, you know we finally famous", "vault_lines": ["Gotta get back to the D, you know we finally famous"], "meaning": "He loves her city but he has to get back home to the DMV (DC/Maryland/Virginia).\n\nThis is also a reference to rapper Big Sean. It’s well known that Big Sean is from Detroit and his crew/debut album is called Finally Famous.", "annotation_id": "395781", "url": "https://genius.com/395781", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That Way", "line": "Then I’m back up on my plane, Chi-town O’Hare", "vault_lines": ["Then I'm back up on my plane, Chi-town O'Hare"], "meaning": "Chicago’s International Airport.", "annotation_id": "260984", "url": "https://genius.com/260984", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That Way", "line": "She my Billie Jean, we menage with Mary Jane", "vault_lines": ["She my Billie Jean, we menage with Mary Jane"], "meaning": "A reference to the Michael Jackson classic “Billie Jean”\n\nSo, this chick will never replace Rick’s main squeeze (sweet sweet marijuana), but they can still get high, have sex, and have a “menage a trois” with Mary Jane", "annotation_id": "252723", "url": "https://genius.com/252723", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That Way", "line": "Driver drop me off at Dulles, I’m headed to some money", "vault_lines": ["Driver drop me off at Dulles, I'm headed to some money"], "meaning": "Dulles is Dulles International Airport, one of 3 airports in Wale’s hometown of Washington D.C.", "annotation_id": "245795", "url": "https://genius.com/245795", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That Way", "line": "Before I get to T.I.A, I’m sure to make her rain", "vault_lines": ["Before I get to T.I.A, I'm sure to make her rain"], "meaning": "Before he gets to the airport, he’s going to get her “wet” (stimulate her). TIA = Tacoma International Airport (Seattle).\n\nSeattle is also known as the “Rain City”, reference to the girl’s location.", "annotation_id": "216154", "url": "https://genius.com/216154", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
