{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That’s a Check", "line": "I got the choppers so don’t make me get deported (woah)", "vault_lines": ["I got the choppers so don't make me get deported (woah)"], "meaning": "While Rosay is using a double entendre as in the line; “I got the choppers so don’t make me get deported.” He’s talking about his “choppers,” or large guns. When stating “Don’t make me get deported,” He’s saying “dont test me” because if you do, Ross is strapped and he isn’t afraid to use his weapons, but when he does, he’ll be deported for his crimes.\n\nThe double entendre here is that “choppers” or helicopters are also a means of transportation which could be used to physically deport people.", "annotation_id": "11788731", "url": "https://genius.com/11788731", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That’s a Check", "line": "Pluto!", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "“Pluto” is the name of Future’s debut album, and he often uses it as an ad-lib in songs.", "annotation_id": "11123156", "url": "https://genius.com/11123156", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That’s a Check", "line": "On leather seats, and I’m on Promethazine", "vault_lines": ["On leather seats, and I'm on Promethazine"], "meaning": "Promethazine is one of the main ingredients of cough syrup apart from codeine. It is mixed with soda to create the popular lean drink.", "annotation_id": "11093881", "url": "https://genius.com/11093881", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That’s a Check", "line": "Black bottles or you know we sipping lean", "vault_lines": ["Black bottles or you know we sipping lean"], "meaning": "Luc Belaire is a French producer of wine, there are two variaties available of the wine; a Rare Brut and the Rare Rosé. Ross often calls himself Rozay on his tracks in which he refers to the Rosé  wine as it is pronounced the same way. The company was franchised by Ross back in 2013.\n\n\n\nLean is a purple drink (same color as the wine) which is made from cough syrup that contains codeine and promethazine, mixed with soda. It gives the user an euphoric feeling.", "annotation_id": "11093867", "url": "https://genius.com/11093867", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That’s a Check", "line": "Hundred room mansion, now I think I’m Scarface (boss)", "vault_lines": ["Hundred room mansion, now I think I'm Scarface (boss)"], "meaning": "A reference to the big mansion in the movie Scarface where crime boss, Tony Montana, lived.", "annotation_id": "11093843", "url": "https://genius.com/11093843", "state": "accepted", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That’s a Check", "line": "Bloody Goyard that’s a checky", "vault_lines": ["Bloody Goyard that's a checky"], "meaning": "Maison Goyard is a luxury designer brand located in Paris, France. The brand is known for making leather goods, bags and suitcases.", "annotation_id": "11093832", "url": "https://genius.com/11093832", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That’s a Check", "line": "This bad Ethiopian gave me Becky (I swear to god)", "vault_lines": ["This bad Ethiopian gave me Becky (I swear to god)"], "meaning": "Future uses the common trope of foreign women in rap like he did before on several occassions, for example on “Low Life”:\n\n Got some bitch from Follies with us (‘scuse me, 'scuse me)\nShe gonna fuck the squad, what else? (I swear)\nI'ma fuck her broads, what else? (Get, get!)\nBitch from Pakistan, what up? (Foreign!)\n\n“Becky” is a slang for fellatio, popularized by Plies and was also used by Young Thug on “With Them”.", "annotation_id": "11093722", "url": "https://genius.com/11093722", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "That’s a Check", "line": "I told you from the jump its one thou", "vault_lines": ["I told you from the jump its one thou"], "meaning": "A reference to Future’s debut mixtape 1000\n\nA play on keeping it 💯, Future keeps it 1000.", "annotation_id": "11092357", "url": "https://genius.com/11092357", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
