{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Algorithm", "line": "You know, those are the two key factors I would say That is gon’ separate, you know, the good from the great and the successes from the failures How much you can, you can walk in faith and how much you can exercise discipline You know what I mean? Because with new levels is new devils So even as you make your progress, you gon’ need the discipline to keep you from backtracking And keeping you from, you know, sabotaging the success as it happens And then you need faith to make it through them dark spots when it’s, it’s not What you see in front of you does not represent what you, what you believe is gonna happen It might be completely opposite, but you keep walking forward because you got faith So, you know, without those two qualities, you gon’ fold, even if you got the best intentions Without the discipline and the faith, it’s gon’ be next to impossible to get it done", "vault_lines": ["You know, those are the two key factors I would say", "That is gon' separate, you know, the good from the great and the successes from the failures"], "meaning": "Progresso", "annotation_id": "41468585", "url": "https://genius.com/41468585", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Algorithm", "line": "R.I.P. out to Poppa, time to get it back to poppin’", "vault_lines": ["R.I.P. out to Poppa, time to get it back to poppin'"], "meaning": "Rick Ross paid homage to late rapper Janarious ‘Lil Poppa’ Wheeler after his untimely death on February 18, 2026, at the age of 25.", "annotation_id": "40758457", "url": "https://genius.com/40758457", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Algorithm", "line": "Baby, let’s just fuck the world And run away Let us just leave this Earth And go to Mars Baby, let’s just fuck the world (The algorithm) (The avatar) And run away (Your bitch favorite wallpaper) Let us just leave this Earth (Uh) (Yo) And go to Mars", "vault_lines": ["And go to Mars"], "meaning": "The original song is a sample by The Blindside in their sample pack “Children Choir Vol.4” released on House of Waves.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GmKR8eDRXNA&list=RDGmKR8eDRXNA", "annotation_id": "40697619", "url": "https://genius.com/40697619", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
