{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Boss", "line": "Plus I got a Chevy wit a fo’-fifty-fo’ in the hood", "vault_lines": ["Plus I got a Chevy wit a fo'-fifty-fo' in the hood"], "meaning": "A 454 is a 7.4 liter big block engine from Chevrolet that pumps a lot of power when tuned right\nHe is also saying that for a big gangster he needs a big engine", "annotation_id": "29329336", "url": "https://genius.com/29329336", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
