{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Devil Is a Lie", "line": "Got that Barney’s floor lookin’ like a VIM Black hoodie, black skully", "vault_lines": ["Got that Barney's floor lookin' like a VIM", "Black hoodie, black skully"], "meaning": "Hov took a bad situation, didnt run from the racial profiling issue with Barney amd affect change. Now  Barney’s a high end fashion retail store looks more like a VIM a Jeans a Sneaker store in Brooklyn which caters to the Black and Latino communities.", "annotation_id": "16539207", "url": "https://genius.com/16539207", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Devil Is a Lie", "line": "Four stacks for the heels on my bitch feet", "vault_lines": ["Four stacks for the heels on my bitch feet"], "meaning": "Four stacks is about $4,000. And as a rapper, he is bragging about what he can buy. So, he is saying he spent $4k on his girl’s heels.\nLike some nice louis vuitton or another designer brand heels.", "annotation_id": "14406188", "url": "https://genius.com/14406188", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Devil Is a Lie", "line": "Sippin’ Bordeaux out in Bordeaux", "vault_lines": ["Sippin' Bordeaux out in Bordeaux"], "meaning": "Bordeaux, a city in France, is popular for its expensive features and its place in the famed wine growing region. Bordeaux, produced in that same area, is one of the most well known and regarded foreign liquors.\n\n\n\nRick Ross is a very wealthy and luxurious man and not only can he afford to be sipping on one of the most high priced wines, he goes one step further into the experience.\n\nBordeaux has also been referenced by the Roc himself, on his 2013 track “Tom Ford”;\n\nPiss Bordeaux and Burgundies, flush out a Riesling", "annotation_id": "13748008", "url": "https://genius.com/13748008", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
