{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Realist Livin’", "line": "Angel of death, I could hit her on the cell Speed dial", "vault_lines": ["Angel of death, I could hit her on the cell"], "meaning": "This is a metaphor that he can call death to come and nab you. He’s saying he can do it so fast, its like having someone’s number on speed dial", "annotation_id": "821844", "url": "https://genius.com/821844", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
