{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Show", "line": "All my money coming in plural far as the women love", "vault_lines": ["All my money coming in plural far as the women love"], "meaning": "Plural : Plural forms of nouns typically denote a quantity other than the default quantity represented by a noun, which is generally one.. In other words Wale gots his money right, and sometimes thats all the women love/need/want in a man.", "annotation_id": "1356717", "url": "https://genius.com/1356717", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Show", "line": "Got niggas in black hoodies homicide celebrated", "vault_lines": ["Got niggas in black hoodies homicide celebrated"], "meaning": "Young black men are killed just for wearing hoodies, and murder is unpunished and glorified.\n\nThis is an allusion to the murder of Trayvon Martin and both the alleged racism/hoodie bias that surrounded it and the following protests in which youth wore hoodies like his.", "annotation_id": "1356330", "url": "https://genius.com/1356330", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Show", "line": "Can’t stimulate me mentally, then we should never be However we can meet, it’s something from you I need", "vault_lines": ["Can't stimulate me mentally, then we should never be", "However we can meet, it's something from you I need"], "meaning": "Wale could never have a meaningful relationship with someone that he cannot relate to intellectually. However, like most men, he cannot resist the temptation of sex, and ends up having meaningless relationships with women.\n\nJ. Cole explores a similar concept in Lights Please.", "annotation_id": "1349412", "url": "https://genius.com/1349412", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Show", "line": "My these coons’ is maricons", "vault_lines": ["Minus the arrogance, my these coons' is maricons"], "meaning": "Maricon is the spanish word for “faggot”.\n\nThis continues the Spanish theme from he last line", "annotation_id": "1345855", "url": "https://genius.com/1345855", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Show", "line": "I’m hospitable, blowing on that medical", "vault_lines": ["I'm hospitable, blowing on that medical"], "meaning": "Hospitable – Friendly and welcoming to strangers and guests\n\nNote the relation between hospitable (kinda like hospital) and medical.\n\nMedical? Riiiiiight…", "annotation_id": "1345063", "url": "https://genius.com/1345063", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Show", "line": "And I wish that Channel 2 would give a nigga better news", "vault_lines": ["And I wish that Channel 2 would give a nigga better news"], "meaning": "ABC Channel 2 is a station in Baltimore.\n\n\n\nWale has always been one for uniting the DMV rather than separating it as has been done in the past (especially with beef between D.C. and Baltimore). Wale has spoke about his frustrations in many songs including “The Bmore Club Slam”", "annotation_id": "1345059", "url": "https://genius.com/1345059", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Show", "line": "Forgive me, I’m flawed,", "vault_lines": ["Forgive me, I'm flawed,"], "meaning": "Ross knows he’s flawed. Judging by his most album title, God will forgive him for his sins.", "annotation_id": "1345022", "url": "https://genius.com/1345022", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Show", "line": "Real checks is all a nigga sees", "vault_lines": ["Real checks is all a nigga sees"], "meaning": "All he talks about his money, cuz that’s all he knows.\n\nAs opposed to the checks on Nikes talked about in the previous line.", "annotation_id": "1345020", "url": "https://genius.com/1345020", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Show", "line": "I pray to the Lord as I’m holding on the sword", "vault_lines": ["I pray to the Lord as I'm holding on the sword"], "meaning": "Sword could be Bible, meaning that he uses the Lord’s words as a weapon against his foes\n\nI wonder what caused him to downgrade to a sword from his chopper?", "annotation_id": "1345016", "url": "https://genius.com/1345016", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Show", "line": "Nike, and I upgraded the Ree’s", "vault_lines": ["Nike, and I upgraded the Ree's"], "meaning": "Ross once had an endorsement deal with Nike.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OJtIvpY6BW4\n\nBut now has an endorsement deal with Reebok.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Og7OpRb_LBY", "annotation_id": "1345010", "url": "https://genius.com/1345010", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
