{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Times And Life of Shawn Carter", "line": "[Idris Elba] First off, I wanna thank my connect, dude", "vault_lines": ["First off, I wanna thank my connect, dude"], "meaning": "Very coincidental for Idris to say this opening line of JAY-Z’s hit single “Roc Boys (And the Winner Is…)” because not only was Idris Elba involved in the cast of the stellar movie “American Gangster”, he was also the voice on the intro of JAY-Z’s album inspired by the film itself!", "annotation_id": "24527196", "url": "https://genius.com/24527196", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
