{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Transporter", "line": "Audemar was designed by Swizz Beatz/ Black face, black band, orange stitching, it’s a beast/", "vault_lines": ["Audemar was designed by Swizz Beatz/", "Black face, black band, orange stitching, it's a beast/"], "meaning": "Swizz Beatz is actually on the board and design team of Audemars Piguet and has helped design a black watch with orange stitching.  It’s cold!", "annotation_id": "356928", "url": "https://genius.com/356928", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Transporter", "line": "Niggas major, tailored suits, the newest gators/", "vault_lines": ["Niggas major, tailored suits, the newest gators/"], "meaning": "My business partners partners and myself, who happen to be black, are major executives in the drug game and we therefore dress accordingly.\n\nSide note: In the crack game, alligator skin shoes are considered appropriate business attire. If you don’t aspire to be a drug lord, please wear a more traditional shoe in the workplace.", "annotation_id": "356870", "url": "https://genius.com/356870", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Transporter", "line": "Transporter I bought it myself/", "vault_lines": ["Transporter I bought it myself/"], "meaning": "I’ve positioned myself as an executive in this game by purchasing raw materials (cocaine) directly from the manufacturer and managing the delivery of these materials to their target markets.\n\nThis is the same model Frank Lucas used to elevate himself to the pinnacle of the drug business in Harlem in the late 60’s & early 70’s.  He cut out middle men in the drug trade by buying heroin directly from his source in the Golden Triangle.", "annotation_id": "356860", "url": "https://genius.com/356860", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Transporter", "line": "Two times for the boys thats bubblin’ rock", "vault_lines": ["Two times for the boys thats bubblin’ rock"], "meaning": "Ross shows little more respect to the middle managers of the crack game. These critical cogs in the wheel purchase moderate amounts of raw cocaine and process it to make the crack sold by the worker’s bees of the game referenced in the previous line.", "annotation_id": "356850", "url": "https://genius.com/356850", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
