{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Weather", "line": "So now they wanna Biggie me", "vault_lines": ["So now they wanna Biggie me"], "meaning": "Ending his rapper compare and contrast rhyme scheme he feels that those who don’t want to see all the accomplishments that he has gotten want to see his movie end like the life of The Notorious B.I.G. also known as Biggie. Biggie was gunned down by unknown assailants in 1997\n\nhttps://images.app.goo.gl/TvZY8C4KNKfCgLjw5", "annotation_id": "16876488", "url": "https://genius.com/16876488", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Weather", "line": "No longer cruising with the windows down Hand on the pistol anticipating the riddle sound", "vault_lines": ["Hand on the pistol anticipating the riddle sound"], "meaning": "As a precursor to rappers who in Rick Ross’ perspective have survived “The Weather he references the 1996 shooting of 2Pac, and says that times are different because he’s got a gun of his own for a shooter coming to riddle his car with bullets\n\nhttps://images.app.goo.gl/wp3sPQagPQVCbQqs6\nhttps://images.app.goo.gl/W7novCSTuXAJ94Bh8", "annotation_id": "16876054", "url": "https://genius.com/16876054", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Weather", "line": "Couple times, a nigga almost got popped by Ross", "vault_lines": ["Couple times, a nigga almost got popped by Ross"], "meaning": "To play from the earlier line, “Young nigga used to shop at Ross,” Nipsey also mentions almost getting popped, meaning shot by Ross in Los Angeles. Once again, this is also clever wordplay seeing as though he has Rick Ross featured on the track.", "annotation_id": "13883447", "url": "https://genius.com/13883447", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Weather", "line": "Young nigga used to shop at Ross", "vault_lines": ["Young nigga used to shop at Ross"], "meaning": "Nipsey used to have to shop at Ross before he got the money to be able to afford expensive clothes. He also used the word play seeing as though he’s featuring Rick Ross on the track.", "annotation_id": "13883424", "url": "https://genius.com/13883424", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
