{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Zenith", "line": "Gold Rollie, most hoes gon’ know me", "vault_lines": ["Gold Rollie, most hoes gon' know me"], "meaning": "Having a gold Rolex watch is a sign of success. Not everybody can afford a non-necessity, for that price.\n\n\n\nThese watches go from 10,000 dollars and up depending on the karats and such. Chances are, if you have a “gold Rollie”, most hoes will want to know you too!", "annotation_id": "1991386", "url": "https://genius.com/1991386", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "The Zenith", "line": "1.7 for these VSs on my collar", "vault_lines": ["1.7 for these VSs on my collar"], "meaning": "While not quite the $1.7 million claimed here, Ross was caught on video spending $600,000 on some jewels that maybe weren’t all they seem", "annotation_id": "866078", "url": "https://genius.com/866078", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
