{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Think About It (Rich As In Spirit)", "line": "Turner Field might be gone but I’m still brave nigga (say what)", "vault_lines": ["Turner Field might be gone but I'm still brave nigga (say what)"], "meaning": "Turner Field was a baseball stadium in Atlanta which closed in 2016. Quan’s wordplay here is based on the fact that the stadium was home to the Atlanta Braves.", "annotation_id": "14219387", "url": "https://genius.com/14219387", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
