{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "This Is The Life", "line": "Hold the bottles up, we standin’ tall fam", "vault_lines": ["Hold the bottles up, we standin' tall fam"], "meaning": "While Ross has long been known for holding up bottles, recently its been Belaire Rosé that he’s been holding up because of his endorsement deal with the company.\n\n\n\nPrior to his deal with Belaire, he was associated with Ciroc Boys. Diddy, a longtime friend of Ross, is a co-owner of Ciroc Vodka .", "annotation_id": "4525219", "url": "https://genius.com/4525219", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "This Is The Life", "line": "I’m in Trump Towers, amongst earners", "vault_lines": ["I'm in Trump Towers, amongst earners"], "meaning": "Trump Tower is a 58-story mixed-use skyscraper developed by Donald Trump. Some of its tenants include Donald Trump, Beyonce & Jay-Z, and Janet Jackson who are all known to have earned a large amount of money and Ross is amongst these moguls.", "annotation_id": "1427251", "url": "https://genius.com/1427251", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "This Is The Life", "line": "But I define success, I sell well", "vault_lines": ["But I define success, I sell well"], "meaning": "Despite never earning a platinum plaque (yet), four of Ross' albums have been certified gold, and four of his albums have debuted at No. 1 on the charts.", "annotation_id": "1427229", "url": "https://genius.com/1427229", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "This Is The Life", "line": "I’m campin’ in the Hamptons", "vault_lines": ["I'm campin' in the Hamptons"], "meaning": "The Hamptons are a group of villages in Long Island, New York. The Hamptons form a popular seaside resort, one of the historical summer colonies of the American Northeast. They have some of the most expensive residential properties in the U.S.", "annotation_id": "1427220", "url": "https://genius.com/1427220", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "This Is The Life", "line": "Started with a biscuit, now I got a loaf", "vault_lines": ["Started with a biscuit, now I got a loaf"], "meaning": "Great food metaphor: Ross started with a little (a small biscuit), but ended up with a lot (a whole loaf of bread). He’s of course talking about money.", "annotation_id": "1427209", "url": "https://genius.com/1427209", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "This Is The Life", "line": "Fine escorts for the GFE", "vault_lines": ["Fine escorts for the GFE"], "meaning": "The girlfriend experience (commonly known as GFE) is a type of service a female sex worker offers which includes acting like a girlfriend to the client. GFE includes french kissing, hugging, talking, and eating a meal together. Ross' got the hottest prostitutes taking part in this GFE.", "annotation_id": "889519", "url": "https://genius.com/889519", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
