{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Thumbin’", "line": "I let her see some cake, I know I’m out of sight", "vault_lines": ["I let her see some cake, I know I'm out of sight"], "meaning": "Rick Ross throws many dollars at the pole dancer for her actions, so much so that Rick Ross is no longer visible, obstructed by the dollars falling from the sky–at least from the stripper’s perspective.\n\n\n\nHe is also saying that he his lifestyle is out of the sight of his competition because he is so far ahead of them.", "annotation_id": "1136767", "url": "https://genius.com/1136767", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Thumbin’", "line": "She in love with my hustle, the Lamborghini, the ’Rari I put TVs in the back.. Sega, Dreamcast, and Atari", "vault_lines": ["I put TVs in the back.. Sega, Dreamcast, and Atari"], "meaning": "Rick Ross simply has a more lavish lifestyle. He has customized cars with gaming consoles in the back seat.\n\n\n\nIts worthing noting that you can’t put TVs in the back of a Ferrari or Lamborghini because they have no back seat.", "annotation_id": "1136765", "url": "https://genius.com/1136765", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
