{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Til We Die", "line": "Presence fresh, Gillette razor sharp, Tom Ford", "vault_lines": ["Presence fresh, Gillette razor sharp, Tom Ford"], "meaning": "Thomas Carlyle “Tom” Ford, an American fashion designer who owns this famous Gucci fashion brand. so busta rhymes is saying. He Wears Tom Ford sharp linen suits and apparently they are much much expensive that these other brands.\n\n\n\n And almost forgot. The suits are sharp like Gillette razors", "annotation_id": "1901447", "url": "https://genius.com/1901447", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
