{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "Balling like a gymnast, slamming like a heavy door", "vault_lines": ["Balling like a gymnast, slamming like a heavy door"], "meaning": "A gymnast is good with the ball, because that is what he does for a living. So Celeb is “balling” like a gymnast. He slams like a heavy door, we all know how loud and powerful a heavy door slams.", "annotation_id": "307878", "url": "https://genius.com/307878", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
