{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "Haters don’t need Best Cuts, that’s what we got machetes for!", "vault_lines": ["Haters don't need Best Cuts, that's what we got machetes for!"], "meaning": "If one of Celeb’s haters needs a haircut, they don’t need to go to a hairdresser, they can just come to Celeb to get a proper cutting from a machete!", "annotation_id": "307551", "url": "https://genius.com/307551", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "Bitches tell me, ”You’re fucking outrageous”, UFO", "vault_lines": ["Bitches tell me, \"You're fucking outrageous\", UFO"], "meaning": "Double entendre here:\n\nFor one, it is effing outrageous for someone to say they saw a UFO, because THEY AREN’T REAL, and Celeb is comparing his own outrageousness to that of a UFO.\n\nAnd secondly, UFO is an acronym here, for “Ur Effing Outrageous”.", "annotation_id": "307545", "url": "https://genius.com/307545", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "Charlie’s Angels, uh, Drew Barrymore", "vault_lines": ["Charlie's Angels, uh, Drew Barrymore"], "meaning": "Drew Barrymore played one of the angel’s in the classic film series Charlie’s Angels, and is pretty fine too.", "annotation_id": "307544", "url": "https://genius.com/307544", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "Eating good here, y’all some Ramen Noodle bowl", "vault_lines": ["Eating good here, y'all some Ramen Noodle bowl"], "meaning": "Ramen Noodles are a quick snack fixed in a bowl when you don’t have much time to cook.\n\n\n\nAnd although they are relatively tasty, and despite what many college students think, eating Ramen Noodles is NOT eating good.", "annotation_id": "307543", "url": "https://genius.com/307543", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "King James shit, you a prince, no Cyhi", "vault_lines": ["King James shit, you a prince, no Cyhi"], "meaning": "King > Prince. Duh.\n\nAlso references to Cyhi Da Prynce and LeBron James.", "annotation_id": "307539", "url": "https://genius.com/307539", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "But you was willing to do anything to get your own Traffic in the cabinet, even get the kitchen going Other niggas scared, you the one they snitching on", "vault_lines": ["But you was willing to do anything to get your own", "Traffic in the cabinet, even get the kitchen going", "Other niggas scared, you the one they snitching on"], "meaning": "As opposed to Ross' usual approach to talking about drugs in his music, he’s not the one trafficking/ cooking up the drugs in this one, it’s the girl he’s talking about.\n\nAs she was growing up, apparently her family wasn’t very well off, and she had to hide drugs in her cabinet and make drugs to make her own money. The guys in her hood were scared, though, because if the cops found out that drugs were coming from that hood, that have the guys as suspects, not the girls, so they told the cops it was her.", "annotation_id": "307537", "url": "https://genius.com/307537", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "I was raised to eat, you had to get your own", "vault_lines": ["I was raised to eat, you had to get your own"], "meaning": "No, this isn’t a fat joke Rozay made on himself, believe it or not. It is about the difference between these two’s upbringings.\n\nRoss was raised in a nice neighborhood, near Miami, and graduated college at the HBCU ALbany State without any major financial problems. This girl, however, as he explains later in the verse, pretty much had to do whatever she could to get money", "annotation_id": "307536", "url": "https://genius.com/307536", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "I plan to build a home,", "vault_lines": ["I plan to build a home,"], "meaning": "Rozay better use all that body he has to build something for his future wife…", "annotation_id": "307535", "url": "https://genius.com/307535", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "All I wear is Loui shit, classic Roman Numerals", "vault_lines": ["All I wear is Loui shit, classic Roman Numerals"], "meaning": "By Louis he means Louis Vuitton, a high-end fashion brand. The abbreviation/logo is LV, which are both Roman Numerals (adds up to 55)", "annotation_id": "307341", "url": "https://genius.com/307341", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Timeless", "line": "I’m busy, you free most of the time, nigga, wi-fi", "vault_lines": ["I'm busy, you free most of the time, nigga, wi-fi"], "meaning": "Wi-fi internet is often free of charge – at McDonalds, Starbucks, etc. – and also very shitty\n\nIn short, Celeb considers himself the iPhone to your Zune..", "annotation_id": "307319", "url": "https://genius.com/307319", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
