{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Trap House 3", "line": "I call that boy Eggbeater Fat I cook good, but he cook way better", "vault_lines": ["I call that boy Eggbeater Fat", "I cook good, but he cook way better"], "meaning": "Gucci calls his crack cook ‘Eggbeater Fat’ because he whips the crack better than Gucci", "annotation_id": "27140541", "url": "https://genius.com/27140541", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Trap House 3", "line": "I told partner bring the presser, huh Apply some pressure to the jack, yeah I got a thousand keys uncut, nigga", "vault_lines": ["I told partner bring the presser, huh", "Apply some pressure to the jack, yeah", "I got a thousand keys uncut, nigga"], "meaning": "Gucci asks his partner in crime to bring a press to help reform the cut cocaine into kilo bricks. Applying pressure to the jack refers to a homemade press made with a carjack. He has 1000 kilos of uncut cocaine that he needs to press", "annotation_id": "27140532", "url": "https://genius.com/27140532", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
