{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Turnpike Ike", "line": "Map fout ou deyo, they all know the spirits when I be aroused", "vault_lines": ["Map fout ou deyo, they all know the spirits when I be aroused"], "meaning": "“Map fout ou deyo” means “I’m kicking you out” in Haitian Creole.", "annotation_id": "30921789", "url": "https://genius.com/30921789", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Turnpike Ike", "line": "Made it to Star Island, started with a nickel rock", "vault_lines": ["Made it to Star Island, started with a nickel rock"], "meaning": "Star Island is a neighborhood in Miami Beach with luxurious mansions where many celebrities reside. Growing up in the inner city of Miami, Ross probably always dreamed about living there.", "annotation_id": "24051050", "url": "https://genius.com/24051050", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Turnpike Ike", "line": "Gil Green, the way I capture the moment with words", "vault_lines": ["Gil Green, the way I capture the moment with words"], "meaning": "Gil Green is a famous music video director. He is from Miami, Florida, like Ross, and has directed the music vides for some of his biggest hits, including:\n\n-Hustlin'\n\n-Speedin'\n\n-Aston Martin Music", "annotation_id": "24051048", "url": "https://genius.com/24051048", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Turnpike Ike", "line": "Then walked into the church just like the boy Mase (Lord)", "vault_lines": ["Then walked into the church just like the boy Mase (Lord)"], "meaning": "Ma$e is a rapper from New York who temporarily retired from music to become an ordained minister.", "annotation_id": "24051041", "url": "https://genius.com/24051041", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Turnpike Ike", "line": "Turnpike, real earner, Ted Turner (Me)", "vault_lines": ["Turnpike, real earner, Ted Turner (Me)"], "meaning": "Ted Turner is a media mogul, philanthropist, and billionaire. He founded CNN and TBS, and is worth $2.3 billion.", "annotation_id": "24051038", "url": "https://genius.com/24051038", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Turnpike Ike", "line": "Fuck you think this is? Turnpike Ike nigga Isaac Hicks, rest in peace OG", "vault_lines": ["Fuck you think this is? Turnpike Ike nigga", "Isaac Hicks, rest in peace OG"], "meaning": "A notorious name in Miami during the 1980’s, Isaac “Big Ike” Hicks was a drug kingpin who also went under the alias “Turnpike Ike.”\n\nRoss throughout his career has referenced notorious drug barrons in his music, and even named his fourth studio album Tefflon Don after the alias of Gambino crime family member, John Gotti.\n\nSpeaking to Genius' Rob Markman on an episode of For the Record, Ross spoke about Hicks, saying:\n\nIsaac Hicks, one of the biggest hustlers that ever came from my city and my yayo – the cocaine capital, and Turnpike of course was you know – the big vein leaving Miami going through Florida, taking you North and that was the way all the hustlers took to work.", "annotation_id": "17832413", "url": "https://genius.com/17832413", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Turnpike Ike", "line": "Sadow", "vault_lines": ["Indictment on the way, got Sadow"], "meaning": "Steven H. Sadow is a high profile criminal defense attorney based in Atlanta, GA\n\nhttp://swtlaw.com/steven-h-sadow\n\nExample of his work.\n\nhttps://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/ty-dolla-igns-drug-case-163448367.html", "annotation_id": "17787709", "url": "https://genius.com/17787709", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Turnpike Ike", "status": "done", "targets": 7, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Rick-ross-turnpike-ike-lyrics", "genius_title": "Turnpike Ike", "genius_id": 4747317, "source": "api"}
