{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "U Ain’t Him", "line": "I hear a lot of that I did this I hear a lot of that I did that It’s funny when he go to the stand and point at his man like “he did that”", "vault_lines": ["I hear a lot of that I did this", "I hear a lot of that I did that", "It's funny when he go to the stand and point at his man like \"he did that\""], "meaning": "Nelly Hears him boasting about all the Ganster stuff that he has done but when he is before a judge and under oath he lies and says his buddy did the things he claimed to do before\n\n(Snitching is frowned upon in the ganster world)", "annotation_id": "2969835", "url": "https://genius.com/2969835", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
