{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "U Ain’t Him", "line": "That shit that’ll run ya down and take Forensic files to come and solve that case", "vault_lines": ["That shit that'll run ya down and take Forensic files to come and solve that case"], "meaning": "They’re gonna need forensics teams to solve what happened to you when he’s done", "annotation_id": "2783488", "url": "https://genius.com/2783488", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "U Ain’t Him", "line": "And I ain’t talking bout no mace I’m talking that shit that chase", "vault_lines": ["And I ain't talking bout no mace", "I'm talking that shit that chase"], "meaning": "When he shoots you it’s not gonna be with Mace (pepper spray), it’s gonna be a gun. ‘Hot in your face’ Means he’s packing heat\n\n\n\nAlso, this line is a play on words using the rapper turned preacher’s name, Ma$e. He is saying that he’s not about that positive life, he’ll cap you on sight.", "annotation_id": "2783475", "url": "https://genius.com/2783475", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "U Ain’t Him", "line": "Running up on the wrong nigga and the wrong time might get you something hot in your face", "vault_lines": ["Running up on the wrong nigga and the wrong time might get you something hot in your face"], "meaning": "If you run up on nelly the wrong way he gonna’s gonna shoot you", "annotation_id": "2783472", "url": "https://genius.com/2783472", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
