{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "My stomach hurtin’, palms itchin’ with a snotty nose Comin’ through your curtains, guns spittin’ aimin’ high and low", "vault_lines": ["My stomach hurtin', palms itchin' with a snotty nose", "Comin' through your curtains, guns spittin' aimin' high and low"], "meaning": "Many users of cocaine and illegal distributors have been known to cut cocaine with laxatives inducing users to go relieve their bowels.\n\nWayne despite his hunger for cocaine and firearm baring itchy palm is focused on invading your home violently.", "annotation_id": "15461356", "url": "https://genius.com/15461356", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "Neighborhood jump like Geronimo", "vault_lines": ["Neighborhood jump like Geronimo"], "meaning": "Wayne makes the neighborhood “jump” with his music like they’re at a club listening to a club-jumper. Basically, they love him.\n\n“Thanks to a 1939 movie about Geronimo, US paratroopers traditionally shout \"Geronimo” to show they have no fear of jumping out of an airplane.“ - Wikipedia", "annotation_id": "6350792", "url": "https://genius.com/6350792", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "It’s YM , that’s my team, nigga, vámonos", "vault_lines": ["It's YM , that's my team, nigga, vámonos"], "meaning": "YM stands for Young Money which Lil' Wayne is the leader of, not to be confused with Cash Money Records. Young Money is a branch of Cash Money that includes Drake and Nicki Minaj. Cash money was started by Birdman and his brother, and now him and his “fellow label member, Lil' Wayne have beef because Birdman keeps delaying the drop of Lil' Wayne’s Tha Carter V. Wayne is probably going to sue Birdman for doing this and even went as far as to make his fans a mixtape apologizing for the wait on his album. Lil' Wayne says Young Money is his team in this song instead of Young Money Cash Money because he wants to leave Cash Money and Bring all Young Money members with him, and start his own label.\n\n\nHe also mentions a similar line here", "annotation_id": "5781881", "url": "https://genius.com/5781881", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "All I know is racks like Sabrina", "vault_lines": ["All I know is racks like Sabrina"], "meaning": "Triz is referring to a Sabrina type coat rack. Rack is also another term for women’s boobs. He is an expert on breasts.", "annotation_id": "5778388", "url": "https://genius.com/5778388", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
