{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "They tell its the codeine, I say “how you know?”", "vault_lines": ["They tell its the codeine, I say \"how you know?\""], "meaning": "Playing off the previously line, Wayne’s codeine consumption could be impairing him to function quicker than usual because of drug’s function slowing side effects.\n\nThis could be the main reason why Mr. Carter’s been getting those tickets as of late.", "annotation_id": "5469188", "url": "https://genius.com/5469188", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "My bitch pussy taste like Häagen-Dazs", "vault_lines": ["My bitch pussy taste like Häagen-Dazs"], "meaning": "Häagen-Dazs is an ice cream brand, established in 1961.\n\n\n\nSupposedly, Wayne’s girl tastes similar to ice cream during cunnilingus to which we could only imagine to be quite delightful!", "annotation_id": "5469162", "url": "https://genius.com/5469162", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "Get the drank in the double cup, tryna drink it while it’s cold", "vault_lines": ["Get the drank in the double cup, tryna drink it while it's cold"], "meaning": "Wayne’s sippin' on some Lean – a Huston born drink that involves components such as Promethazine with Codeine, Sprite soda, and (for extra flavor) Jolly Rancher candy, which is usually found and sipped from stacked cups.", "annotation_id": "5469123", "url": "https://genius.com/5469123", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "And cops givin’ niggas tickets just for drivin’ slow", "vault_lines": ["And cops givin' niggas tickets just for drivin' slow"], "meaning": "Black Man vs Police\n\nWayne touches on the subject of unjust Police prosecution of African Americans, like a lot of other rappers these days. Ecpecially prosecuting them when they are doing nothing wrong, like driving to slow which isn’t a crime.\n\n\n\nIts also relates to the next bar’s mention of Codeine, Wayne’s favorite anesthetic. Codeine makes you slow.", "annotation_id": "5469026", "url": "https://genius.com/5469026", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "Ballin’ since 94, feelin’ like a pot of gold", "vault_lines": ["Ballin' since 94, feelin' like a pot of gold"], "meaning": "Wayne has been in this game for a very longtime, he feels lucky to still be ballin after all these years in the Rap game. A pot of gold is a sign of luck, but also a sign of sudden wealth and success. His success has been going on for over 20 years.", "annotation_id": "5468987", "url": "https://genius.com/5468987", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
