{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vegas Residency", "line": "2000 on the seats, a hunnid G’s just for the verse", "vault_lines": ["2000 on the seats, a hunnid G's just for the verse"], "meaning": "Ross claims to pay $2,000 for a haircut, which in contrast he charges other people $100,000 for the thoughts inside his head. A Caesar is a style of cut named after Roman Emperor Julius Caesar\n\nEssentially his hair only cost 2% of what he could make at any given moment.", "annotation_id": "18020863", "url": "https://genius.com/18020863", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Vegas Residency", "line": "I really needed Doctor Sebi dealin’ with these seizures", "vault_lines": ["I really needed Doctor Sebi dealin' with these seizures"], "meaning": "Honduran herbalist and self proclaimed healer of all diseases Alfredo “Dr. Sebi” Bowman is highly known of recent times for his practices. Ross feels if he was aware of him during his times of bad health he would’ve been able to help heal him faster. Unfortunately Dr. Sebi died August 6, 2016.\n\n[url]https://images.app.goo.gl/bQErRCGPWaqohkKC8[\\url]", "annotation_id": "18020829", "url": "https://genius.com/18020829", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
