{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "We Takin’ Over", "line": "I spit crack, every verse a key", "vault_lines": ["I spit crack, every verse a key"], "meaning": "Spitting is slang for rapping, and crack is slang for cocaine. A key is referring to a kilogram of cocaine, which is usually found in brick form.", "annotation_id": "39157155", "url": "https://genius.com/39157155", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "We Takin’ Over", "line": "Like the MAC got a EZ pass", "vault_lines": ["Like the MAC got a EZ pass"], "meaning": "You better duck, but it’s probably too late, since the MAC (MAC-10, a compact, fully automatic submachine gun) has an E-ZPass (a toll transponder used in the Eastern U.S.) so it goes especially fast.", "annotation_id": "38270751", "url": "https://genius.com/38270751", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "We Takin’ Over", "line": "And my wrist-wear Chopard but the Müller’s cooler", "vault_lines": ["And my wrist-wear Chopard but the Müller's cooler"], "meaning": "Of course this is a luxury wristwatch flex, since both Chopard and Müller are well-known Swiss watchmakers. Chopard watches have a stronger reputation, but Müller watches are known for more cutting-edge design.\n\nSo this line also reasserts Weezy’s identity. By recognizing Müller as “cooler,” he shows his understanding and appreciation for design. More importantly, he wears the Chopard, which is known for technical excellence and stronger roots, both of which are demonstrated in this verse.\n\nALSO, Birdman gave him a $1mil Chopard watch for his 27th birthday, sooo…", "annotation_id": "38270435", "url": "https://genius.com/38270435", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "We Takin’ Over", "line": "Stop your rumors", "vault_lines": ["Red light, red light, stop your rumors"], "meaning": "This is another time Lil Wayne talks about people spreading rumors about him, another instance is him saying stop spreading rumors about him on this song below https://genius.com/Lil-wayne-gossip-lyrics", "annotation_id": "35645193", "url": "https://genius.com/35645193", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
