{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "We’re Going Home (Remix)", "line": "Just got back from Dubai", "vault_lines": ["Just got back from Dubai"], "meaning": "Rick Ross is referring to his concert in Dubai, that he just got back from. His performance was on the 4th of October, and it was also his first in the Middle East.", "annotation_id": "2334401", "url": "https://genius.com/2334401", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "We’re Going Home (Remix)", "line": "Fuck the radio, this just a nigga tempo", "vault_lines": ["Fuck the radio, this just a nigga tempo"], "meaning": "Mainstream artists/rappers make a lot of songs that are radio-friendly, so that they get radio plays, and as a result; More fame, money etc.\nHowever, Rozay is throwing his middle finger up at this and making some straight rap, because he’s already got all the fame and money he needs.", "annotation_id": "2304648", "url": "https://genius.com/2304648", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "We’re Going Home (Remix)", "line": "We the Knights of the Templar", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "The Knights of the Templar was a group of wealthy, powerful Christians who lived in the middle ages.  Rick Ross and the crew are the modern version of the Knights – Rick is living well, very rich, and a strong believer in God.", "annotation_id": "2304008", "url": "https://genius.com/2304008", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "We’re Going Home (Remix)", "line": "Started at the bottom now she rolled on top", "vault_lines": ["Started at the bottom now she rolled on top"], "meaning": "Rozay plays on the hit Drake song “Started From The Bottom” to describe how that while him and his girl were in bed, they were having fun with her on the bottom of the two of them, and she worked her way up to the top. We all know he wouldn’t mind that, letting her do all of the work.", "annotation_id": "2303437", "url": "https://genius.com/2303437", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
