{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "What It Is", "line": "Puerto Rico, sí gordito", "vault_lines": ["Master P done with the kilo, Puerto Rico, sí gordito"], "meaning": "Once the drugs have been sold, he will take off for a vacation in Puerto Rico, hence why Spanish is used in the 2nd half of the line.\nSi Gordito means Yes, Fat Boy in Spanish.", "annotation_id": "1229603", "url": "https://genius.com/1229603", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "What It Is", "line": "Bunch of ganstas like Sopranos like keys, like pianos", "vault_lines": ["Bunch of ganstas like Sopranos like keys, like pianos"], "meaning": "Sopranos was a HBO Television Program focusing in on the Mob Family of Tony Soprano.\n\nKeys is slang for kilos of cocaine, and keys are also on pianos.", "annotation_id": "1229536", "url": "https://genius.com/1229536", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "What It Is", "line": "Boy you better hold your nose ’cause I’m shitting, hold your nose", "vault_lines": ["Boy you better hold your nose 'cause I'm shitting, hold your nose"], "meaning": "He’s out here shitting on the dope game, so bad in fact that it actually smells and it would be in your best interest to hold your nose.\nAlso, sniffing cocaine is done with your nose.", "annotation_id": "1229517", "url": "https://genius.com/1229517", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "What It Is", "line": "Get a Louis bag for what? Bitch I been had swag I got fifty thou cash in a brown Kroger bag", "vault_lines": ["Get a Louis bag for what? Bitch I been had swag", "I got fifty thou cash in a brown Kroger bag"], "meaning": "Just because you bought an expensive Louis Vutton bag does not mean you have swag in his eyes.\nIf he wanted he knows he could spend that much money but he choose to do it in a brown grocery bag.", "annotation_id": "1229501", "url": "https://genius.com/1229501", "state": "accepted", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "What It Is", "line": "Quarter milli worth of jewelry like that boy can’t even care", "vault_lines": ["Quarter milli worth of jewelry like that boy can't even care"], "meaning": "Wearing $250,000 worth of jewelry right now, and money is such a non-issue to him that he could care less about spending that much money on something like jewelry.", "annotation_id": "1229490", "url": "https://genius.com/1229490", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "What It Is", "line": "I’m speaking the facts, it’s Deeper Than Rap", "vault_lines": ["I'm speaking the facts, it's Deeper Than Rap"], "meaning": "Deeper Than Rap was Rick Ross' most recent studio album release at the time of this recording.\nRoss wants every to know that his words are the facts", "annotation_id": "1229473", "url": "https://genius.com/1229473", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
