{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "What It Is", "line": "Putting mileage on my Pyrex, yeah, we call that baking off", "vault_lines": ["Putting mileage on my Pyrex, yeah, we call that baking off"], "meaning": "Pyrex is referencing the process of turning pure cocaine into crack rock, which involves using Pyrex Pot.\nBaking off refers to baking soda & also the cooking off of the excess water during the crack process.", "annotation_id": "1229429", "url": "https://genius.com/1229429", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "What It Is", "line": "Twenty rubber bands you can get yourself a pigeon", "vault_lines": ["Twenty rubber bands you can get yourself a pigeon"], "meaning": "For 20 Rubber Bands ($20,000 Cash) you can get a pigeon (which is a bird, a kilo of cocaine).", "annotation_id": "1229414", "url": "https://genius.com/1229414", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "What It Is", "line": "If I bust that package open, you would think I started booin’", "vault_lines": ["If I bust that package open, you would think I started booin'"], "meaning": "The package is as he states above, Purple Urkle weed.\nThere is so much weed and it stinks so much that when he opens the package his face scrunches up due to the smell, making you think he does not like something or is booing.", "annotation_id": "831544", "url": "https://genius.com/831544", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "What It Is", "line": "Urkel purple pants are cushioned, straight from Oakland they just flew in", "vault_lines": ["Urkel purple pants are cushioned, straight from Oakland they just flew in"], "meaning": "He gets Purple Urkel weed straight from Oakland, California which is known to produce some of the finest medical marijuana in the world.\nHis shipments seem to be hidden in boxes of pants.", "annotation_id": "831538", "url": "https://genius.com/831538", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
