{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "White Girl (Remix)", "line": "Say the Feds still watchin’? Well I’mma give ‘em somethin’ Check billboards, Number 1 album in the country The radio ban, the snow video play Guess what, fuck nigga - we still talkin’ yay", "vault_lines": ["Say the Feds still watchin'? Well I'mma give 'em somethin'", "Check billboards, Number 1 album in the country", "The radio ban, the snow video play", "Guess what, fuck nigga - we still talkin' yay"], "meaning": "Although the Feds want to knock Blood Raw for selling drugs, he has an alibi, he is a top rapper! Who cares if they wont say “snowman” on the radio, the video is on BET!", "annotation_id": "101741", "url": "https://genius.com/101741", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "White Girl (Remix)", "line": "Jungle Fever", "vault_lines": ["Love that white girl, I got Jungle Fever"], "meaning": "Being in love with someone of the opposite race. Fab is a black man in love with cocaine (his white girl), therefore he has jungle fever.", "annotation_id": "101736", "url": "https://genius.com/101736", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
