{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Wiggle", "line": "Got ‘em takin’ off they clothes like it’s The Luke Show (Luke Show) I’m the new king of Miami, even Luke know", "vault_lines": ["Got 'em takin' off they clothes like it's The Luke Show (Luke Show)", "I'm the new king of Miami, even Luke know"], "meaning": "Luther Roderick Campbell, also known as Luke Skyywalker, Uncle Luke and simply Luke, is a Miami rapper, promoter, record executive, and actor. He has a long-running channel on YouTube called The Luke Show.\n\nUncle Luke is a Miami icon, referenced by many South Florida rappers, including Travis Scott in the hit SICKO MODE.\n\nhttps://genius.com/15113996", "annotation_id": "24612346", "url": "https://genius.com/24612346", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
