{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work", "line": "Shooting banana clips, we ain’t never scared", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "He continues his last lines sticking with the food theme. They shoot banana clips, which are magazines for AK-47’s that look like bananas.\n\n\n\nNotice how the clips are curved like bananas?", "annotation_id": "493027", "url": "https://genius.com/493027", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
