{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work", "line": "Velcro shorty, we strapped and they strapped", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Velcro Shawty is just a nickname he was given because he always stays strapped(always has a gun on him) like velcro.\n\nVelcro is used to fasten, or strap, items such as clothing together.", "annotation_id": "470509", "url": "https://genius.com/470509", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work", "line": "Ship em up to Philly, Milly living like he Gorbachev Not the Reagen Era but a nigga making cheddar", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Ross ships the coke up to Meek Mill in Philadelphia, PA. Mikhail Gorbachev was the leader of the Soviet Union. Ross is saying Meek is the boss of Philly! It is his home town after all.\n\nWhen President Reagan was in office drugs, especially crack cocaine, were said to be rampant. The cheddar line was meant to be a continued reference to Gorbachev. Gorbachev did a few ads after he left power.\n\n http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C9lvzzH0STw", "annotation_id": "434448", "url": "https://genius.com/434448", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work", "line": "Then go home and break a brick and break it down to bacon bits", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "He will take a brick of cocaine and break it down to sell it in individual pieces to make more profit, because buying in bulk is cheaper.\n\n“Bacon” is slang for money, like the saying “bringing home the bacon”.", "annotation_id": "424727", "url": "https://genius.com/424727", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work", "line": "I might go yellow Presi on her, just to make her pissed", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Another watch reference, presi is short for Presidental which is a type of Rolex.\n\n\n\n“Make her pissed” is also a reference to the fact that the watch is yellow, like the color of piss.\n\nMeek uses the same piss diamonds reference in “Bout That Life”:\n\nStill young, reckless, and rich nigga, yellow diamonds like piss nigga", "annotation_id": "418007", "url": "https://genius.com/418007", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
