{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work Remix", "line": "He double M, he rich for life", "vault_lines": ["He double M, he rich for life"], "meaning": "Rick Ross saying someone is “double M” means they are part of his label, Maybach Music. Ross implies that being on his team will make you a lot of money so you’ll be “rich for life”.", "annotation_id": "7959484", "url": "https://genius.com/7959484", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work Remix", "line": "I’m rich forever, hella real estate", "vault_lines": ["I'm rich forever, hella real estate"], "meaning": "Not only his Instagram name, Ross is actually Rich forever, and he’s sure of it.\n\nWith this wealth he’s acquired for himself, he’s bought multiple properties.\n\nOne of many of Rozay’s estates, this one in Miami, FL", "annotation_id": "2664914", "url": "https://genius.com/2664914", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
