{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work Remix", "line": "Mastermind", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Mastermind is the title of his sixth album due out in 2014.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3GcUDvIxh6Q", "annotation_id": "2597976", "url": "https://genius.com/2597976", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work Remix", "line": "Your head got a price, don’t make me pay the fee Don’t make me pay the fee, don’t make me pay the fee Your head got a price, don’t make me pay the fee", "vault_lines": ["Your head got a price, don't make me pay the fee", "Don't make me pay the fee, don't make me pay the fee"], "meaning": "No matter how rich you are, there will always be someone willing to kill  you. The only question is how high the price is. Either way, if you’re annoying Ross or a problem to him, he’s willing to pay the price to have you killed.\n\nHe also repeats the line here for emphasis and so you don’t forget his threat.", "annotation_id": "2597964", "url": "https://genius.com/2597964", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work Remix", "line": "I play for keep so don’t you play with me", "vault_lines": ["I play for keep so don't you play with me"], "meaning": "Rozay plays No Games and he’s serious with everything he does.\n\nHe also recently won a Million dollars off Diddy in a dice game!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/rickyrozay/statuses/378809192133324800", "annotation_id": "2597949", "url": "https://genius.com/2597949", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work Remix", "line": "[Verse 2: A$AP.Ferg] A lot of niggas die, due to these streets A lot of mamas cry, due to this beef Purple kush got me high, don’t wanna leave See my daddy in heaven, he be the realest G And your bitch I got her, she like my Tommy boxers Nigga I ain’t no boxer, I let that Tommy box ’em Make ’em say ugh, Silkk the Shocker Very rare Vesace, I bet my silk will shock her [Hook: A$AP.Ferg] Put in work, put ’em in the dirt Semi gon’ squirt, damn he got murked Who got that work? He got that work She pop that pussy, she make it twerk A couple model bitches, thought I balled for the Lakers All they know is suck and fuck and speak a different language She like that cocaina, she sniff it off my banger She like to blow my nine, I think she’s going brainless [Verse 3: A$AP.Ferg] All my Dominican niggas, got me speaking Spanglish Now that I’m rapping, I’m fucking different singers Celine Dion, Mariah Carey I got them Nick Cannons, if you coming at me Couple of them skinny niggas, that be trigger happy Feel them candy girls, make them do the Laffy Taffy They pop a pill, then they pop a bullet Man, fucking with this nigga like playing Russian Roulette I ain’t wanna pull it, but I had to do it I be out tomorrow, my lawyer’s Jewish He work hard, he put in work He put in work, got these niggas going bezerk Riding music, I see you riding to it Bang ’em over the head, nigga that for talking foolish Nigga, work hard, put in work Put in work, got these niggas going berserk", "vault_lines": ["A lot of niggas die, due to these streets", "A lot of mamas cry, due to this beef", "Purple kush got me high, don't wanna leave"], "meaning": "Original Work lyrics can be found here!", "annotation_id": "2597934", "url": "https://genius.com/2597934", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work Remix", "line": "I got that white, I got that white", "vault_lines": ["I got that white, I got that white"], "meaning": "‘White’ is another name for Cocaine, Rozay is bragging about how much cocaine he has.", "annotation_id": "2597928", "url": "https://genius.com/2597928", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work Remix", "line": "Boycott Louie Vuitton, fuck no, I like Louie", "vault_lines": ["Boycott Louie Vuitton, fuck no, I like Louie"], "meaning": "Referring to Kanye West who urged everyone to boycott Louie Vuitton because they turned him down.\n\nSpeaking on 92.3 NOW radio, he said: “I was made for this moment. What happened was while I was out in Paris I wanted to meet with the head of Louis Vuitton, he said I don’t understand why we need to meet with you.”\n\n“Everybody in New York City right now don’t buy any Louis Vuitton until after January.”\n\n“Now do you want to meet with me? Now do you want to meet with me? Influence. They think that I don’t realise my power.”\n\nKanye is hoping his rant will stop fans splashing out on the French brand’s luggage and handbags, which range in price from £300 and £8,000.\n\nHere’s Kanye in Louie V", "annotation_id": "2597907", "url": "https://genius.com/2597907", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
