{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "Work Remix", "line": "Bitches talking ’bout me, this dick the bomb", "vault_lines": ["Bitches talking 'bout me, this dick the bomb"], "meaning": "Women brag about their association with Ross. Here Ross also brags about his good his ‘dick game’ is.\n\nRoss has been linked to several women:\n\nShateria Moragne-el\n\n\n\nChristelle Blanche\n\n\n\n\n\nElise Neal", "annotation_id": "2597890", "url": "https://genius.com/2597890", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
