{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "You A Lie Remix", "line": "See the jewels and they try to play Cam Tell ‘em they can dip if they ain’t running with the set", "vault_lines": ["Tell ‘em they can dip if they ain’t running with the set"], "meaning": "Wordplay on Juelz Santana and Cam'ron following up with the label “Dipset”, saying people see his jewelery then they try to be buddy buddy but they can leave if they ain’t part of his crew.", "annotation_id": "923990", "url": "https://genius.com/923990", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
