{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "You Can Tell How I Walk", "line": "You talk too much, you soft as fuck Your type I’ve seen it all too much", "vault_lines": ["You talk too much, you soft as fuck", "Your type I've seen it all too much"], "meaning": "Soft refers to pussy ass niggas who are on the feminine side. Niggas who like pillow talkin' and cuddling and so on\nTip has seen a lot of yall throughout his prolonged time in the game.", "annotation_id": "4395679", "url": "https://genius.com/4395679", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
