{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "You The Boss", "line": "I watch, you play (What you sayin’ baby?) And I’ll do whatever you say (Boss) Oh, I watch, you play And I’ll do whatever you say", "vault_lines": ["I watch, you play (What you sayin' baby?)", "And I'll do whatever you say (Boss)", "Oh, I watch, you play"], "meaning": "Nicki Minaj says ‘I watch, you play’ she is referring to Rick Ross playing basketball and Nicki is watching him. ‘And I’ll do whatever you say’ shows that she wants to be an ‘NBA wife’ who watches her husband play and all she has to do is what he says.", "annotation_id": "31916108", "url": "https://genius.com/31916108", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "You The Boss", "line": "Rozay a born stunner,", "vault_lines": ["Rozay a born stunner,"], "meaning": "Rick Ross' nickname, also an expensive French Rose Wine. Hes saying hes stuntin' (covered in diamonds).\n\nHe did a song with Birdman (with Nicki Minaj on the remix) entitled Born Stunna.", "annotation_id": "512676", "url": "https://genius.com/512676", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
