{"type": "line", "artist": "Rick Ross", "song": "You The Boss", "line": "Double MG winnin’ and the streets is lovin’ it (Mayback Music)", "vault_lines": ["Double MG winnin' and the streets is lovin' it (Mayback Music)"], "meaning": "Maybach Music Group is Ross' label, to which he has signed artists including Wale, Pill, and Meek Mill.  See a complete list here", "annotation_id": "387707", "url": "https://genius.com/387707", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
